window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Super Kindergarten System","paragraphs":["In a corner of a third-tier private university, a beautiful girl named Shen Wei was daydreaming.","She was a senior about to graduate this year, and a campus celebrity - after all, she was the daughter of the school director.","People at the school were jealous of her good fortune, with her family having become wealthy from property acquisition.","That money would take an ordinary person a lifetime to spend.","The school director only had this one precious daughter, and over the past four years of university, countless affluent men had tried to attach themselves to her, hoping to reach the top in one step and save twenty years of struggling.","At this moment, Shen Wei sat in the corner, having just shooed away a few people who tried to chat her up.","It was her senior year, and if these wealthy men didn't seize the chance now, it would be difficult for them to get close to her after graduation.","Shen Wei was frowning deeply, deterring anyone else from approaching her.","Little did they know that at this moment, a mechanical voice was echoing incessantly in Shen Wei's mind, driving her crazy.","\"Shen Wei, please bind to the System.\"","The mechanical voice repeated.","Shen Wei was also a prominent figure at school. After graduating, she would directly inherit her family's assets and become a petty landlord, living a wonderful life.","But now this System had suddenly appeared, telling her that she was actually a side character in a novel, and that the real female lead was her cousin Shen Qingqing.","The book was called \"The Cruel CEO's Sweet Little Tender Wife.\"","Shen Qingqing would become the arrogant CEO's lover after overcoming many difficulties, and eventually get together with him in a sugar-coated romance.","Meanwhile, Shen Wei was just a random person constantly clashing with Shen Qingqing.","Before long, she would be coldly discarded, her chastity insulted, and ultimately doomed to commit suicide by jumping into a river.","Her parents, unable to bear the humiliation, would also fall gravely ill and pass away, with their assets conveniently falling into Shen Qingqing's hands!","This was outrageous.","Shen Wei was fuming. Shen Qingqing was just a nobody relying on their family.","According to the novel's progression, it wouldn't be long before she encountered this arrogant CEO and their love-hate relationship began.","In other words, Shen Wei didn't have much time left.","Anyone would be in a foul mood after falling from heaven's favor to such a miserable fate.","At this moment, ten thousand wild horses were raging in Shen Wei's heart.","After a long pause, she finally responded to the System.","\"What will happen if I don't bind to the System?\"","The System's cold electronic voice replied: \"If you do not bind, the System will proceed according to the original storyline and enter a cycle of rebirth.\"","\"Ordinary people cannot escape the control of fate.\"","Shen Wei understood the System's implication - only by binding to the System could she save herself.","After a moment of silence, she finally said: \"Bind to the System!\"","Instantly, the System's voice became more lively: \"Loading for you now. You have bound to the Super Kindergarten System.\"","\"Huh? What system?\"","\"The Kindergarten System. Because many villains in the original world had traumatic childhoods, rescuing these future world-destroyers preserves the safety of the smaller world.\"","\"Protecting children is protecting the world.\"","\"After rescuing the villains, the System will reward you by correcting your life.\"","The System then transmitted information about a few villains to her.","In an instant, a flood of complex information surged into her mind. It took her a long time to process it all.","Though it only lasted a few seconds, it felt like she had lived through the villains' entire lives.","Even Shen Wei couldn't help but curse at them - these villains were simply too pitiful.","The future computer genius He Lingfeng, who could break through national and international network blockades through self-study, should have become a brilliant gem in the field of technology.","Yet due to being abused by his father from a young age, he developed an extreme and stubborn personality, ultimately walking down the wrong path.","The future world-renowned painter suffered sexual assault, developing autism as a result.","And one of the highly intelligent criminal masterminds had to fight dogs for scraps of food as a child.","Without exception, their lives flashed brilliantly for but an instant before plunging into permanent darkness.","If not for those tragic childhoods, perhaps many things would not have happened.","And now, these future world-destroying villains were all under the age of 5 on average.","There was no reason to hesitate. Shen Wei immediately called her family to say she would not inherit their assets and instead pursue her own entrepreneurial path.","Shen Wei was a woman of her word. She immediately moved to acquire a kindergarten, using her considerable allowance as the daughter of a wealthy family.","With money in hand, she had no worries.","Now that she had bound to the System, they were comrades-in-arms. As a state-of-the-art AI, the System was exceptionally capable at collecting big data!","In less than a minute, it had scanned over twenty kindergartens that were up for sale.","These days, kindergartens were highly competitive.","Some focused on developing special talents, others on bilingual education, and still others on various forms of early intellectual development.","The best kindergarten in the city was the Noble Academy Kindergarten, which covered all these areas!","It was considered the pinnacle for kindergartens by locals.","To get into this kindergarten, you had to book at least a year in advance, and the parents had to go through individual interviews.","Rumor had it the parents at this kindergarten were among the top elite in the province.","The stricter the rules, the more people flocked to it.","Securing a spot at the Noble Academy Kindergarten was a huge status symbol.","This was the main reason why most other kindergartens in the province had a shortage of students.","Shen Wei inquired around and found that at least ten kindergartens were willing to sell.","She chose the largest one, occupying over 10,000 square meters of land.","The campus even had its own custom-built slide kindergarten, as the original owner had grand ambitions.","But upon realizing it was impossible to compete, they had no choice but to put the lavishly decorated kindergarten on clearance sale.","After half a year with no buyers, Shen Wei's offer of less than one-tenth the price finally landed her the once luxurious kindergarten.","In a blatant attempt to ride on the Noble Academy Kindergarten's popularity, this kindergarten had previously changed its name to the Noble Academy Kindergarten.","A single character difference, easily causing confusion, but it couldn't replicate the essence of its namesake and went out of business shortly after.","After acquiring the kindergarten, the first thing Shen Wei did was change its name to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","\"When together, a brilliant blaze; when scattered, a starry sky.\"","After renaming it, she quickly got people to put up the new signboard.","With the System's help, all the transfer procedures were completed online almost effortlessly.","The new signboard was up before evening.","Shen Wei's mind was filled with the System's reward chime.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully establishing Starry Sky Kindergarten. System reward: 1 million yuan, 10 jin of beef, 100 eggs, 2 jin each of vegetables and fruit.\"","\"Initial reward of 1,000 points. When points reach 500,000, the store will be unlocked.\"","\"Next task released. Quickly recruit a premium team for the kindergarten.\"","\"One head chef with Level 1 certification.\"","\"One school bus driver with over 10 years of experience.\"","\"One top-tier preschool teacher.\"","\"One early childhood education expert.\"","\"One full-time custodian.\"","Shen Wei was dumbfounded by these requirements.","The System demanded recruiting industry veterans and experts to fill these roles for her unheralded kindergarten. The difficulty was astronomical."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Little Villain's Abusive Father","paragraphs":["Shen Wei initially thought the system was generous, offering 1 million yuan right off the bat.","Now looking at the system's requirements, she realized why it gave 1 million yuan - it was afraid these people wouldn't be able to satisfy the demands even with 1 million yuan.","While Shen Wei was worrying, she noticed the rewarded beef, eggs, and two pounds of Shine Muscat grapes by her side.","She didn't know if it was just her impression, but these ingredients seemed fresher than what she had seen before.","She casually picked up a Shine Muscat grape, washed it, and put it in her mouth. \"Wow,\" the floral aroma was accompanied by a sweet fruity fragrance.","The thick, sweet flesh filled her mouth with juicy sweetness, refreshingly quenching her thirst. One grape was not enough.","Shen Wei had eaten many Shine Muscat grapes before, but never had she tasted ones so refreshingly sweet. After finishing them, she felt extraordinarily energized.","While eating, the intense feeling of happiness washed over her again.","She now understood - the rewards from the system were the best of the best, no wonder the requirements for the teaching staff were also high.","After finishing the two pounds of Shine Muscat grapes, Shen Wei put the other ingredients in the fridge, and then proceeded to officially take over the kindergarten.","Now Shen Wei was in full command, ready to be ordered around by the system.","\"Can you provide some candidate recommendations?\" Shen Wei consulted the system.","As a recent college graduate, she didn't know any of these elites.","The system immediately started processing and soon locked in candidates for each category.","Shen Wei was speechless after seeing them - the chef candidate recommended was the head chef of the prestigious Jiangbei Grand Restaurant.","How could a top chef from such a luxurious hotel possibly settle for their small establishment?","Shen Wei just thought that.","Then she heard the system say, \"Host, don't lose heart, everything is possible with effort.\"","Shen Wei realized the system's generosity with rewards meant she could use money to attract them.","\"Let me see how much they're currently earning per month.\"","The system then showed her their current salaries.","The monthly pay wasn't very high.","It seems earning money is not easy these days.","Shen Wei immediately regained confidence.","\"System. Double their salaries and immediately send out invitations to them.\"","\"Got it, host.\" The system responded swiftly.","Shen Wei found this system secretary quite handy.","But for now, she had an even more important task at hand.","The system inbox sent a reminder - one of her future resources, the future computer genius He Lingfeng, was less than 5 kilometers away from her.","Rescuing He Lingfeng from domestic violence early would help him escape suffering sooner.","He Lingfeng's information had already reached Shen Wei.","It was so pitiful - he was just over a year old when his mother, unable to bear the domestic violence, ran away.","Leaving him behind with an alcoholic father who blamed him for his mother's departure, verbally and physically abusing him since he was little. Now he was 5 years old.","The information showed little He Lingfeng was very cute, innocent and adorable.","He would definitely grow up to be an extremely handsome man.","Following the system's navigation, Shen Wei hurried to the area where He Lingfeng was located.","This was a slum area.","At least Shen Wei had never seen such dilapidated houses in her life.","The old-style buildings had external staircases, and the walls looked grimy, as if the plaster could crumble off at any moment.","These houses were at least forty or fifty years old.","The three-story buildings didn't have toilets - there was only a public restroom outside.","Bedsheets and undergarments were hanging on the railings of the outer corridors, and sewage was everywhere.","Shen Wei frowned before even getting close, as the system made a beeping sound, detecting that He Lingfeng was less than 50 meters away.","Shen Wei looked closely and saw a little boy squatting on the ground playing.","He was dressed in tattered rags, his clothes clearly hadn't been washed for who knows how long, looking like a little mud child. \"What's your name?\"","The little boy's large eyes almost covered half his face, and he timidly said, \"He Lingfeng.\"","Even his voice was faint like a mosquito's whine.","Wearing only a small vest and shorts, his body was crisscrossed with wounds.","Although Shen Wei had known about his suffering beforehand, seeing so many wounds on a child of his age still made her furious.","The child's stomach growled hungrily.","Shen Wei was startled. \"You haven't eaten?\"","The child nodded and pressed his hands against his belly to muffle the sounds.","But the system told Shen Wei that the child hadn't eaten for three consecutive meals since last night.","He's father wasn't around, and the neighbors were all out making a living, unable to look after even their own children, let alone others'.","Only occasionally would a kind-hearted elderly woman notice He Lingfeng hadn't eaten and call him over for a meal.","Shen Wei said, \"Let me take you to have some porridge.\"","Children's stomachs are delicate, and after not eating for so long, he couldn't immediately have greasy foods.","But to her surprise, He Lingfeng hesitated. \"Thank you, sister, but it's okay.\"","Then he tried to run away.","Shen Wei chased after him. \"What's wrong? I'm not a bad person.\" She gave him a piece of candy.","This was He Lingfeng's first time having milk candy.","He was stunned, never having imagined something so sweet existed in this world. He didn't want to eat it, only lightly licking it with his small tongue.","Although he knew it wasn't good to take things from others, he couldn't resist the sweet temptation and gave it a lick.","Just one piece of candy brought him such happiness.","Shen Wei's eyes turned slightly red. \"Wait here, I'll go buy you something to eat.\"","She saw there was a steamed bun shop not far away, probably where locals in this old street area often ate.","That piece of candy had let down his guard. \"Thank you, sister. Let's go together.\"","He had grown up reading people's expressions since young, and although he didn't know Shen Wei, he could sense her kindness.","The two went to the steamed bun shop together, and Shen Wei bought him a small bowl of millet porridge and some small steamed buns.","The child wolfed them down, while Shen Wei gently said, \"Slow down, they're all for you.\"","But how could the little wolf cub resist when faced with delicious food?","Shen Wei said, \"I'll bring you tasty food from now on, okay?\"","He Lingfeng replied, \"But I don't know how to repay you.\"","It was surprising for a 5-year-old to say such things.","Shen Wei felt a pang in her heart. \"You don't need to repay me.\"","\"No, I owe you this. When I grow up, I'll repay you.\" The child said solemnly.","Shen Wei didn't want to brush off his sincerity, so she agreed for the time being.","As they were talking, a gloomy gust of wind blew over.","They looked in the direction it came from and saw an unkempt man with a scraggly beard, eyeing them greedily.","In that split second of eye contact, Shen Wei felt He Lingfeng's body tremble slightly.","Shen Wei's heart sank - this must be He Lingfeng's abusive father.","And now he had spotted them."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Dealing With the Villain's cheating womanizing man Father.","paragraphs":["He's father had always coveted the kindness people showed towards his son.","He himself was just a scumbag in society, with no ability to earn money.","Add to that his fondness for heavy drinking, and he could only resort to petty theft.","Whenever he discovered someone being kind to his son, he would immediately try to extort a few hundred yuan from them.","All the people living in this area were from the slums. How much money could they possibly have on them? That's why He's father kept hounding them repeatedly. Whenever people saw He Lingfeng, they avoided him like the plague.","They were afraid of being leeched off by his shameless father.","That's why the computer prodigy's life kept getting worse.","The type He's father loved targeting the most were kind, compassionate young girls like Shen Wei. With just a glint in his eye, his malicious intent would arise.","\"What are you feeding my son? My son has gastritis, and you're going to make it worse. If my son's stomach gets messed up, you'll have to pay for it.\" He's father's bloodshot eyes flashed with cunning.","The baker next door was displeased upon hearing this: \"Pay for what? Our buns are made cleanly and hygienically. You're crazy to claim our buns could give your son gastritis.\"","He Lingfeng trembled uncontrollably, but still worried about Shen Wei, whispering as he tugged at her hand, \"Sister, please leave quickly, or he'll ask you for money again.\"","He Lingfeng didn't understand before why everyone avoided him!","Gradually, he came to understand, having heard others' opinions about his father. These two were a matched pair of swindlers, weren't they?","The child didn't know what a \"swindler\" meant, but he knew deep down it was definitely not a good thing.","He was nervous and upset, afraid this kind sister would also be bullied by his father.","Shen Wei told him, \"Don't worry, I'm not afraid of him.\"","Before Shen Wei could take action, the baker's wife had already chased He's father away.","\"What kind of person is that?\" the baker's wife muttered.","Although she didn't know what had happened, it was rare to see such a frail child like He Lingfeng in this day and age.","What a sin, for such a person to raise a child.","Shen Wei asked He Lingfeng, \"Do you like your father?\"","He Lingfeng shook his head.","Shen Wei carefully said, \"Then would you like to go to a place without your father, to study there, and have some friends?\"","He Lingfeng's large eyes lit up: \"Sister, are you going to take me to an orphanage?\"","Shen Wei was surprised: \"You even know about orphanages?\"","The system's electronic voice supplemented in Shen Wei's mind: \"In the past, a few people had tried to help him by asking his father to place the child in a welfare institution, but his father demanded 50,000 yuan from them, scaring the kind-hearted people away.\"","Even Shen Wei was stunned - He's father really did treat his child like a cash cow.","Shen Wei then took He Lingfeng away.","They had only walked a few steps when they saw He's father appear from around a corner, glaring at them viciously.","The baker's wife earlier was stout and sturdy - clearly not an easy person to deal with.","Although He's father was a man, the alcohol had drained his body, leaving him as frail as a chicken, not daring to confront others directly.","So he waited nearby, and sure enough, soon Shen Wei came out with his son.","He's father looked at Shen Wei: \"You must think this stinking brat is pitiful too. It's simple if you want to take it away - give me 100,000 yuan!\"","Shen Wei said, \"But buying and selling children is illegal.\"","\"Moreover, you're not just buying - it also involves abandonment and child abuse.\"","He's father had thought Shen Wei was just a fresh college graduate, easy to bully, but he didn't expect her to accuse him of breaking the law!","He's father acted tough: \"Stop talking nonsense, he's my son.\"","\"If you dare say another word, you'll see if I don't hit you!\" He reached out to strike Shen Wei.","But with the system's protection, how could He's father succeed?","The moment He's father touched Shen Wei, the system within her body unleashed 100,000 volts of electricity.","He's father immediately let out a loud wail!","Shen Wei immediately took He Lingfeng and ran to the police station to report the case.","In this old urban area of slums, people still had rather traditional mindsets. Although He's father beating He Lingfeng was unacceptable, they considered it a domestic matter.","These old residents would at most advise and intervene, but rarely called the police for help.","Shen Wei's report immediately drew attention.","When the police saw the crisscrossing wounds on He Lingfeng's body, they gasped in shock. Even a vicious beast wouldn't devour its own child.","For such a thing to still happen in this day and age.","It was fortunate that Shen Wei had reported the case first. If someone had posted it online, the whole nation's netizens would have demanded action. The police station quickly formed a special investigation team.","They went to He Lingfeng's residence to investigate the matter.","Domestic violence against men had long been prevalent in the slums.","As soon as they saw police officers coming to investigate, the residents spilled everything they knew, like a burst of beans.","Very quickly, the details of the abuse charges were shocking to the heart.","Although He Lingfeng was already 5 years old, he looked like a child of just 2 or 3 years old.","Moreover, many of the scars on his body were old injuries. One didn't need to look closely to know what he had gone through before.","The police station immediately filed a report. Prosecuting He's father for child abuse was a given - he would serve at least 5 years.","The police station expedited this case, but deciding what to do with He Lingfeng next was a tricky issue.","Where would this child go? This was now a problem.","Shen Wei immediately said, \"Can I adopt him and become his guardian until he turns 18?\"","\"You?\" The police officer didn't doubt her kindness, but Shen Wei was too young.","Adopting a child wasn't a simple matter - she had just graduated from university.","Shen Wei immediately showed the officer information on her phone.","The officer was dumbfounded - at such a young age, Shen Wei already owned a registered kindergarten, and it wasn't a small one either.","In view of this, he asked He Lingfeng, \"Would you be willing to live with this sister from now on?\"","He Lingfeng hesitated, afraid of burdening others.","\"But what if my father causes trouble? How do we deal with that?\" He wanted to go with her but dared not say it aloud.","This 5-year-old child could think so much already.","\"You don't need to worry about that. Your father did something wrong, so he'll be arrested and properly educated. For a period of time, he won't be able to bother you.\"","He Lingfeng nodded slowly. The officer then had Shen Wei sign some documents before finally taking He Lingfeng home!","He Lingfeng said to Shen Wei, \"Sister, don't worry, I'll definitely earn a lot of money for you in the future! I won't freeload.\"","Shen Wei smiled slightly: \"Okay.\"","The cold electronic voice spoke in Shen Wei's mind.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully adopting Villain #1. System reward: 5 catties of beef, 10 catties of spare ribs, 5 tomato seeds, 1 million yuan in cash. 10,000 bonus points.\"","For a main mission, the system was quite generous, awarding 10,000 points all at once. Shen Wei then checked the offers she had sent out earlier.","All were read but unanswered.","No one had contacted her yet.","Now that Villain #1 had been brought back, but the logistics support team was still unassembled. Shen Wei was a little frustrated - what was going on?"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: A Chef Looking for a Job","paragraphs":["At the end unseen by Shen Wei, those who received the offer were not as calm as Shen Wei had imagined.","Take Liu Master Chef for example, he was a top-level chef at the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant, having worked here for half his life.","He had trained countless apprentices and disciples.","In the past, he could only learn the secret family recipes by formally kowtowing and accepting a master.","Cooking requires an innate talent, a slight deviation can lead to vast differences.","With the same ingredients and amounts, some people can create delicious dishes, while others always miss the mark.","Ordinary people may not taste the difference, but the seasoned gourmets who dine at the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant have tongues more precise than measurement units.","They spend at least four figures for a single meal here.","But this year, as consumption declined, hardly anyone came out for dinner.","Rumors circulated within the hotel that the owner planned to lay off staff.","When you think about it, such a large restaurant has four to five hundred service staff and seventy to eighty kitchen staff.","This round of layoffs would be no small number, at least two-thirds would be let go.","Everyone felt insecure.","They didn't know what to do if they got laid off. Start their own business? But the market isn't great now. But if they don't start a business, there are no jobs nearby.","Some familiar chefs began inquiring around in the kitchen, seeing if anyone was going somewhere else. It would be best to band together, even take a job with meals and accommodation elsewhere.","For some settled family men, the situation became difficult. With elders and children to support, they couldn't just leave for a good opportunity elsewhere.","They all sighed, \"Ah, if only someone would poach us.\"","\"You're just dreaming. What kind of person would be poached? At least someone like Liu Master Chef.\"","\"Come to think of it, I heard Liu Master Chef really was poached. The offer was 50,000 yuan per month.\"","50,000?","Everyone gasped in shock at this number!","For a moment, they felt a bitter envy, and the news soon spread throughout the kitchen.","Even the HR manager found out.","As soon as Liu Master Chef came to work, he was summoned to the office.","The HR manager said, \"Master Liu, you've worked hard here for half your life. You know our current business situation - the hotel may be sold in the future.\"","Liu Master Chef had indeed weathered wind and rain with the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant over the years. Stunned by these words, he looked at the HR manager and said, \"What do you mean?\"","The HR manager then let out a dry laugh, \"I don't mean anything. I just heard someone is trying to poach you, offering 50,000 yuan which is quite good. As your personal advice, if there really is such a good opportunity, you might as well take it.\"","Liu Master Chef frowned, realizing this was intended to let him go.","He immediately replied that he would think it over.","Without even changing out of his chef's uniform, he turned and left!","Liu Master Chef went straight home that morning. His wife immediately came over, \"What's wrong? What happened?\"","Liu Master Chef then recounted how he was stopped as soon as he arrived, and what the HR department had said.","His wife chimed in, \"Wasn't it a kindergarten trying to poach you? But didn't you agree not to go at the time?\"","Although the 50,000 yuan salary far exceeded his current income, who knew how long he could last out there? Here was a stable iron rice bowl.","So at the time, he had no intention of leaving.","His wife nagged, \"You have a loose mouth. What do we do now?\" The HR manager had even talked to him about it.","Liu Master Chef protested innocently, \"But I didn't tell anyone about this.\"","As the words left his mouth, Liu Master Chef and his wife simultaneously turned pale.","They suddenly realized there was only one person who knew - his apprentice, Liu Ming.","The two shared a hometown and surname.","Although an apprentice, Liu Ming was raised like a son.","He used to eat and live at their house, so Liu Master Chef hadn't hidden this matter from him, never expecting to be stabbed in the back by his disciple.","Liu Master Chef felt a chill run through his body, then said, \"I never expected it would be him.\"","His wife said, \"With the poor business, every company is laying off. If you leave here, he might become the Master Chef. When interests are involved, even father and son can have conflicts, let alone a master and disciple.\"","As she spoke, they both fell silent.","Although they understood the reasoning, years of affection made it unpleasant.","\"So what do we do now?\"","Two paths lay ahead. One was to return to work, apologize, and with his experience, get a small position by humbling himself.","The other was to leave this environment altogether. See what this 50,000 yuan job was about?","After a moment's thought, Liu Master Chef decided to visit this kindergarten that had made him an offer.","When his wife learned of his decision, she was supportive, \"A kindergarten is great, just little kids. And in three months, our little granddaughter will be starting kindergarten too, so it will be convenient.\"","Liu Master Chef's resignation was submitted that afternoon.","The HR manager was highly praised by the boss, able to dismiss a high-salaried master chef without paying any compensation, saving the owner a considerable sum.","The boss also instructed over the phone to immediately promote Liu Master Chef's apprentice, Liu Ming.","For the first time donning the Master Chef's hat, Liu Ming was overexcited, not knowing what to say.","But on his very first stint at the stove, a dish was sent back. An old gourmet customer insisted his stir-fried tomato and egg wasn't authentic.","Though just a simple dish, it left him red-faced. Liu Ming wished he could pull out the customer's tongue.","So much fuss over a tomato and egg stir-fry? He felt mocked by the entire kitchen staff.","But what did it matter?","He was now the Master Chef, while his skilled former master had gone to cook for some kindergarten. Liu Ming felt rather smug.","At that moment, Liu Master Chef had just arrived at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He had never been to a kindergarten before and didn't expect them to be so luxuriously built these days.","The outer walls were covered in all sorts of children's drawings, with a playground and amusement park inside.","There was only Shen Wei present. Liu Master Chef had never felt so restrained in his life, \"Hello, I'm here for the job application!\"","A simple sentence, but it took several awkward attempts to get it out."]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: The Chef Is Here to Join Us","paragraphs":["Shen Wei directly welcomed him and then led him into the kitchen.","This side used to be a kindergarten, the kitchen counter was very large.","Don't look at Liu Master Chef being a bit nervous, but once he entered the kitchen, his whole demeanor changed - after all, he had been crawling on the stove for decades!","Once he was on his home turf, everything was different.","Shen Wei took food ingredients directly from the fridge, including beef, tomatoes, and eggs. She didn't go out to buy them, they were all rewards from the system.","Liu Master Chef took a look at the ingredients and decided to make a scrambled egg with tomatoes and a braised beef dish.","With no preparation time, he could only choose from these few available items.","Liu Master Chef poured oil and heated the wok, his movements as smooth as flowing clouds, carrying an air of a master chef who had conquered kitchens everywhere.","Soon, an indescribable aroma wafted up. Clack, the eggs were cracked into the wok and quickly spread into a disc. In a deft motion, the hefty iron spatula flicked the wok, tumbling the eggs.","After frying the eggs first, he stir-fried the tomatoes, then covered the eggs over them and tossed everything together a few times. He added a pinch of salt, then had Shen Wei taste it.","The flavor was excellent.","Shen Wei and He Lingfeng had never tasted anything so fragrant. Next, the aroma of the braised beef also escaped from the edge of the wok.","Soon, the second dish was served. Shen Wei had Liu Master Chef try it as well.","As soon as Liu Master Chef smelled the aroma, he knew this dish would be flawless.","But when he actually tasted it, he was still surprised.","The beef was tender with a milky fragrance, and the tomatoes were perfectly tart and sweet.","It tasted better than anything he had ever made before.","Not only were his culinary skills superb, but these ingredients were also exceptionally good.","For a chef of Liu Master Chef's caliber, his thinking was extremely pure and simple - as long as he could make delicious food, he was satisfied.","The three of them finished both dishes completely.","After eating, everyone felt a sense of happiness and contentment.","\"Liu Master Chef, the team has just been assembled. Can you cook meals for dozens of people by yourself?\"","In the past, Liu Master Chef always had assistants to help with prep work while he focused on the cooking. It had been a long time since he had handled these miscellaneous tasks like washing vegetables.","However, he had just been betrayed by his own disciple. He felt reluctant to promote any of his former colleagues.","Plus, Shen Wei's salary offer was so generous that he was happy to take on these minor chores himself.","Liu Master Chef replied readily: \"I can do it!\"","Shen Wei was overjoyed.","The system was also delighted.","In Shen Wei's mind, it set off fireworks: \"Congratulations to the host for successfully inviting Chef Liu. Now apply for reward distribution. 5 lbs of bamboo shoots, 5 lbs of sunflowers, 5 lbs of eggs, 5 lbs of cucumbers, 5 lbs of beef, plus a bonus of 1 million yuan and 10,000 points.\"","Shen Wei had checked the marketplace before and there were still many items that were locked.","However, 500,000 points were needed to unlock the next marketplace level, so her current 31,000 points didn't amount to much yet.","But the system was quite generous with money.","She liked dealing with such a generous system.","Before coming here, Liu Master Chef saw the spacious grounds and the generous salary offer, and thought this must be a particularly grand kindergarten.","But upon arrival, he found there was only one employee - himself, and one student.","Liu Master Chef was also a grandfather. When he saw how skinny the child was, he couldn't accept it. A chef's greatest dream was to make everyone plump and well-fed.","He immediately took it upon himself to provide He Lingfeng's three meals a day and fatten her up in the shortest time possible.","As for other duties, Shen Wei told Liu Master Chef that they were still in the initial stages, so he would be responsible for gate duty and accounting as well.","Liu Master Chef had always stayed in the back kitchen before and had never imagined a day when he would wear so many hats.","Fortunately, Shen Wei was generous, and he didn't know where Shen Wei purchased the ingredients, but they were all exceptionally delicious.","This reassured Liu Master Chef's concerns for the time being.","When Liu Master Chef returned home that evening, his wife had been waiting for a long time: \"How did it go? Did you get the job?\"","Liu Master Chef was afraid of saying too much and worrying his wife, so he simply said: \"It's all good.\"","The next day, he went to the kindergarten early. As soon as he arrived in the kitchen, he saw cucumbers and first stir-fried some cucumber slices. The aroma of the fried cucumbers wafted ten meters away.","Liu Master Chef had thought he was dreaming yesterday, but today he realized it wasn't a dream.","The food he cooked here really did taste better than elsewhere.","In the morning, Shen Wei and He Lingfeng were once again stuffed full.","Inviting Liu Master Chef to join was truly Shen Wei's most correct decision."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: The bus driver's coming right now.","paragraphs":["The driver Zhang Daming also received an employment offer from Shen Wei.","His current job was mainly driving for the leaders, a temporary position within the system.","Zhang Daming's driving skills were renowned throughout the entire unit.","For those leaders who got carsick, they would ride with Zhang Daming and not feel nauseous.","He drove steadily.","Especially when it came to reverse parking, it was so smooth that it left people in awe.","When he first received the offer, he thought it was a scam. These days, there were too many scams, often touting high salaries.","He didn't take it seriously at all.","He was on duty when his wife called him, telling him to hurry home as there was a major incident!","Since there was no need for a vehicle in the unit, Zhang Daming simply notified the leader.","He was inexplicably anxious, unsure of what this \"major incident\" his usually composed wife spoke of.","The moment he returned home, he was dumbfounded—the familiar corridor had been splashed with paint.","The fresh red paint looked like blood, a shocking sight.","Zhang Daming's heart tightened. He hadn't offended anyone at work; he was just a driver and hadn't done anything earth-shattering, so why this?","His hands trembled as he took out his keys. As soon as he entered, he saw that his wife's eyes were already red from crying.","\"What happened?\" Zhang Daming asked.","His wife said nothing, but her chest was heaving up and down.","Zhang Daming felt a tightness in his chest. \"Should we call the police?\"","\"No, we can't call the police!\" his wife said trembling.","Finally, she pointed, and Zhang Daming realized that their son, who was supposed to be in school, was kneeling on the floor.","They had strictly adhered to the one-child policy.","This son was their only child, cherished like a treasure.","Although the couple didn't have much money, they had always doted on their son.","The kid was quite promising, having scored over 500 points to get into a second-tier university in the province.","After graduating, finding a job shouldn't be a problem.","But now, seeing his son kneeling on the floor, Zhang Daming's mind went blank. \"What happened?\"","His son had been crying for who knows how long, his eyes red and lips trembling.","Although his wife was angry, seeing their son like this, she couldn't bear it either. \"He owes money from online loans.\"","Online loans?","\"How much does he owe?\" Zhang Daming almost shouted.","\"800,000 yuan.\"","Zhang Daming felt lightheaded.","Immediately, his wife and son rushed over to support him. \"Daming, don't scare us. You're the pillar of our family. If you can't hold it together, we're all finished.\"","It took Zhang Daming a long time to recover.","800,000 yuan—a sense of despair welled up inside him.","Their entire life's savings amounted to just 100,000 yuan.","Even if they sold this old house, it would only fetch 300,000 yuan.","With his salary of just over 2,000 yuan per month, and his wife not working, where could they come up with the remaining 400,000 yuan?","Even if they didn't eat or drink, they couldn't earn that much.","Zhang Daming flew into a rage, then took off his belt and mercilessly whipped his son.","His son's cries and his wife's shrieks echoed back and forth.","But Zhang Daming was like an enraged bull. Neither of them could escape.","It wasn't until he was too tired to continue that he finally stopped. Zhang Daming felt drained, as if his vigor had been whipped away. He sat on the floor, his mind fixated on the 800,000 yuan debt.","Their relatives were all in similar financial situations. These days, earning money wasn't easy, and everyone guarded their hard-earned savings more preciously than their own eyes.","If someone tried to take even a small portion of that from them, it would be like taking their life.","Borrowing money was out of the question.","As for exactly how much their son owed, they only found out after a thorough interrogation.","Ever since entering university, their son had let himself go. Add to that the stark wealth disparities among his roommates, with a few wealthy ones.","In order to keep up appearances with these rich classmates, he gradually developed the bad habit of treating others and chasing luxury brands.","But with his parents only giving him 1,500 yuan per month for living expenses, how could he afford such extravagance?","Not to mention that he had also gotten a girlfriend in college, and it was quite convenient to take out loans with the campus card.","Little by little, he had spent over 100,000 yuan.","Later, he became addicted to spending money and borrowed even more from unregulated online lenders.","According to him, he had only borrowed over 300,000 yuan initially.","But when he couldn't pay it back, the interest compounded until it reached over 800,000 yuan.","This time when he returned home, he was initially terrified, but after being beaten by his father, he immediately felt that the matter was resolved.","Zhang Daming and his wife had lived honest, modest lives. Where could they possibly get that much money?","His wife suggested to Zhang Daming, \"Why don't you try out that kindergarten that offered you 20,000 yuan per month?\"","Previously, they had thought the 20,000 yuan monthly salary offer was a scam.","But now, the pressure of repaying the debt felt like a knife at their throats.","Not to mention the aggressive debt collection efforts from the online lenders.","After all, he was their own child. No matter how fierce the beating, they still felt pity afterward.","Zhang Daming composed himself and finally told his wife, \"Here's what we'll do. Let's find a lawyer first and see which debts are legal. For the legal ones, we'll negotiate repayment. As for the illegal ones, we'll forget about suing.\"","\"Keep a close eye on this wretched son. If necessary, have him take a leave of absence from school. We can't let him dig himself into an even deeper hole.\"","As the head of the household, Zhang Daming had made his decision, and his wife immediately felt a sense of reassurance.","As for Zhang Daming himself, he decided to check out the kindergarten first. If the 20,000 yuan monthly salary was indeed real, he would work there for a few months to earn some quick money before making any other plans.","He then went to report for duty at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The middle-aged man who received him didn't even conduct an interview—he simply had Zhang Daming sign the employment contract right then and there.","Was it really that casual?","In Zhang Daming's eyes, Starry Sky Kindergarten seemed increasingly like a scam.","But the lure of 20,000 yuan hooked him, so despite his doubts, he had to swallow them.","What if it wasn't a scam?","He resigned from his unit.","As a result, his former leader pulled him aside for a heart-to-heart talk that lasted nearly half an hour.","Seeing that Zhang Daming was determined to resign, the leader had no choice but to reluctantly let him go.","After all, that's how the system worked—no matter how capable you were, you could never earn as much as in the private sector.","While processing his resignation, Liu Master Chef mentioned this incident to Shen Wei, who had just returned from purchasing supplies.","He also felt that the hiring process was a bit too casual. \"Are you sure we don't need to do another review?\"","\"No need,\" Shen Wei said enigmatically.","These were all people recommended by the system, which had already thoroughly investigated their backgrounds and character.","Anyone who passed the system's verification had at least a guaranteed level of character and ability.","The school bus driver issue was resolved.","The electronic voice in Shen Wei's mind repeated: \"Congratulations on recruiting the school bus driver.\"","\"System reward: 20 pounds of beef, 100 eggs, 2 pounds each of vegetables and fruit, 3 cherry seedlings. 1 million yuan cash. 10,000 points.\"","Shen Wei received a generous reward.","She immediately told Liu Master Chef, \"Can you farm?\"","Liu Master Chef perked up at the mention of this. \"Of course!\"","Back when he was a youth sent to the countryside, he had farmed before.","He had even told his wife before: Once we have money, we'll find a piece of land in the countryside and live a good life farming.","Little did he expect that while working here, he would be able to realize that dream early. The two of them found an unoccupied plot of land in a corner.","The area was quite large.","It had been used for growing flowers before, but now it lay vacant. It was a waste to grow flowers there, so they decided to plant vegetables instead.","Liu Master Chef tilled the soil and leveled the land, finally preparing a large plot. After sowing the seeds, Shen Wei planted the three cherry seedlings, as well as the tomato seeds rewarded by the system.","In the vegetable garden, Liu Master Chef was more attentive than anyone else.","He almost wanted to water the plants three times a day.","Now he could feel the benefits of working at the kindergarten—he had ample free time.","Getting paid to live a pastoral lifestyle—who would believe it if he told them?"]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Seeds of Systematic Rewards","paragraphs":["Shen Wei had just planted the seeds, and she didn't know if it was her imagination, but she felt a faint glow when the tomato seeds rewarded by the system were planted in the ground!","The cherry seedlings looked even more obvious; as soon as they were planted, the leaves turned greener.","The rewards from the system were all good stuff.","Who knew what they would look like after the harvest?","While she was planting, her phone suddenly rang. Shen Wei answered it—it was a clear, mellow female voice on the other end.","\"Hello, is this Starry Sky Kindergarten? I'm Teacher Tang from the kindergarten. I received the offer from you last time and wanted to inquire about the specifics. Are you free now?\"","Shen Wei immediately perked up, \"Yes, I'm free!\" She then arranged to meet Teacher Tang at a nearby café.","In less than half an hour, a woman in her early 30s arrived. She had a standard oval face with a gentle, curved gaze. Although she wasn't conventionally attractive, she exuded a particularly soothing aura.","Before coming, Teacher Tang had researched Starry Sky Kindergarten.","However, it was just a new kindergarten without much information, and she hadn't heard of it in the industry.","Yet the salary they offered Teacher Tang was very high—20,000 yuan per month.","But money wasn't the final deciding factor that drew Teacher Tang here.","She mainly wanted to investigate what else was on offer besides the money.","On the phone, Teacher Tang had felt that Shen Wei sounded very young.","But when they met in person, she was taken aback.","She hadn't expected Shen Wei to be so young.","She looked like a fresh college graduate.","Could someone so young really make such big decisions?","Although Teacher Tang had some doubts, her years of work experience had honed her emotional intelligence, so she kept her questions to herself, planning to inquire slowly.","Before Teacher Tang could even start asking, she received a phone call.","With some embarrassment, she said to Shen Wei, \"Sorry, let me take this call.\"","\"No problem, go ahead,\" Shen Wei replied readily.","As soon as Teacher Tang answered, she heard the person on the other end cursing loudly: \"You think the world stops turning just because you left, Tang? Go ahead and leave, I'll still make money on this end. Don't forget who got Ning Fubao a tuition reduction.\"","\"Not an ounce of gratitude, getting cocky and wanting to leave now that your wings have hardened.\"","\"If you want to leave, then leave. I'm telling you, you won't get a single cent of this month's salary, and I'll tell everyone in the industry that you're an ungrateful wretch. Let's see who will hire you then?\"","The person's voice was extremely loud, so clear that even Shen Wei sitting opposite could hear every word.","Teacher Tang was trembling with anger and immediately hung up.","Gone was her gentle demeanor from before, replaced by incoherent rage.","Seeing Shen Wei's concerned gaze, Teacher Tang let out a bitter laugh, \"I have no reason to hide anything from you. That was my former employer on the phone just now.\"","\"I worked there for 10 years, and the kids always liked me a lot.\"","\"Later, I went and studied children's education and psychology, things like that. At the time, everyone was afraid of the difficulties and didn't want to study, but I persevered. I used my own time and money to complete the studies—I was the only one who succeeded. The boss was afraid she couldn't keep me under control.\"","So at every meeting, they would criticize and suppress Teacher Tang, even arranging for fresh graduates to substitute her classes. They adjusted her schedule to the worst classes.","Teacher Tang's eyes grew dim as she spoke, but for the children's sake, she had endured and held her tongue, especially for the student she mentioned earlier, Ning Fubao.","Ning Fubao had no parents, only a grandmother who collected scraps for a living.","If the school hadn't reduced her tuition, she wouldn't have been able to attend at all. Teacher Tang paid special attention to this child.","That immediately gave her former employer leverage to threaten her using Ning Fubao.","Now it had gone too far—they were quietly deducting her salary without a word.","A brand new teacher could earn around 4,000 yuan per month, but she could only get a little over 2,000.","Earning so little, yet receiving no respect or understanding at work. Anyone else would have quit long ago.","Teacher Tang had reached her limit too, which was why she had come out looking for a job today after a big argument with the principal.","She had happened to remember the place that had sent her an offer before and thought she would come take a look.","But it seemed her former kindergarten had guessed she was out job hunting and immediately fired her, on top of saying many unpleasant things.","After hearing all this, even Shen Wei was angered. \"Teacher Tang, we truly want to hire you here!\"","\"But I think what you need more is legal assistance. Here's what we'll do—you go file a labor arbitration case. I'll fully support you, and once you've resolved these matters, come join us.\"","Teacher Tang hadn't expected Shen Wei to directly suggest labor arbitration.","Generally, once an employer heard a job seeker had a labor dispute with their previous company, they would assume there was something wrong with that person, no matter the issue.","Shen Wei said, \"You have to fight for your rights in this world! Are you going to let them bully you? Starry Sky Kindergarten supports you.\"","\"If you're having any financial difficulties, I can advance you one month's salary.\"","Teacher Tang had endured enough suppression from her former employer. Hearing Shen Wei's words, her eyes reddened. \"Thank you! Thank you.\"","There was one more thing Teacher Tang wanted to add, \"I will join you. But I want to bring a student along to our kindergarten—the Ning Fubao I mentioned before.\"","With her 20,000 yuan per month salary, Teacher Tang thought she could cover Ning Fubao's tuition fees. Otherwise, based on her former employer's behavior, Ning Fubao would eventually be driven out if she wasn't there.","It was better to have her under Teacher Tang's care.","Before Teacher Tang could finish, Shen Wei immediately said, \"As for Ning Fubao, I'll also waive her tuition fees. You can come now.\"","Teacher Tang felt embarrassed, \"Then please deduct that portion from my salary?\"","Shen Wei said, \"The kindergarten can afford to cover the tuition fees, not just for Ning Fubao, but for any students like her who need it in the future, we'll waive their fees.\" She still had several antagonists left to help. This was also laying the foundation for that.","Teacher Tang tightly grasped Shen Wei's hand, the most emotional she had been since their meeting. \"Thank you, thank you.\"","Their goals were aligned.","Teacher Tang had been able to work at the grassroots level for so many years because of her kind heart.","From the moment she met Shen Wei today, she felt an inexplicable sense of closeness.","Perhaps this was how bonds between people were forged in an instant.","All the questions she had wanted to ask had disappeared. She decided to sign the contract right then and there. Only when she was leaving did she remember her questions, but the contract was already signed, so she didn't feel right bringing them up!","Plus, she had an important matter to attend to now—she was determined to file a labor arbitration case against her former employer.","Just as Shen Wei said, one had to fight for one's rights."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: All of a sudden, the class is up.","paragraphs":["Early Childhood Education Experts, doctors and full-time cleaners were all in high demand for hiring.","Shen Wei offered a salary of 20,000 yuan per month.","While the title \"Early Childhood Education Expert\" sounded fancy,","she had also obtained a highly coveted certification in the country.","But only well-known kindergartens could afford to hire Early Childhood Education Experts.","Those kindergartens already had dedicated education experts and wouldn't let a newcomer in hastily.","So it was difficult to find a job.","Unexpectedly, a kindergarten took the initiative to offer them positions.","As for the full-time cleaners and doctors, there's no need to mention them.","The medical profession was also highly competitive, especially for frontline clinical doctors who had to endure grueling work and deal with unusual situations.","Doctor Lu who joined them had quit his job at a major hospital's pediatrics department.","Doctor Lu, being human, had health issues after working with such high intensity.","Previously, Doctor Lu had planned to return to his hometown after leaving the major hospital to recuperate in a serene mountainous area.","But he had achieved quite a feat by getting his PhD from the village, yet ended up with little money and poor health! Returning would invite ridicule, and it was at this time that Starry Sky Kindergarten extended him an offer.","The school doctor position was essentially a retirement job for him, getting paid for doing next to nothing - an opportunity that was hard to come by.","Within a week, Shen Wei had all the positions filled.","Once the staff arrived, they briefly introduced themselves in the conference room. Shen Wei also described the current state of the kindergarten.","Everyone present was dumbfounded.","Although they didn't know each other's salaries, they knew their own.","Being hired by such a large kindergarten, they had been excited before coming.","But upon arrival, they found that there were currently only two little friends, and classes hadn't started yet. Moreover, one of the children was adopted by Shen Wei, and the other was a free student brought by Teacher Tang.","Everyone looked at Shen Wei, clearly a wealthy heir playing around.","Could this last?","Especially someone like Zhang Daming, who had quit his established job.","When the month ends, would they be able to receive their salaries?","Everyone had doubts, but soon realized that such a large kindergarten couldn't be easily established by just anyone. Having invested so much money, they must be aiming for something big. They decided to take it one step at a time.","For now, with no students, everyone had to multitask.","Except for Liu Master Chef, everyone else had to double as the admissions counselor.","Shen Wei first showed them the staff dormitories, with accommodations comparable to a hotel for two people per room.","Since they were all locals, only Doctor Lu needed the dormitory, while the others didn't.","Such a large kindergarten must have cost a fortune just for the renovations, not to mention their salaries, putting some pressure on the few of them.","This pressure wasn't from Shen Wei, but rather self-imposed.","Shen Wei handed them the printed admissions brochures.","Upon seeing them, everyone was speechless. Three meals a day plus fruits, and shuttle buses. But the monthly fee was only 260 yuan.","This price was almost the lowest in the entire city.","Kindergartens at such prices could hardly be called kindergartens.","They were essentially just daycare centers.","The food was subpar, the facilities were cramped, some even located within residential buildings.","For their well-equipped kindergarten to charge such a low fee, it wouldn't even cover the employees' salaries?","\"Let's first enroll 10 students to form a class, and we'll discuss further plans later.\"","What? Only 10 students?","Teacher Tang immediately said, \"Leave this to me.\"","She then made a few phone calls and quickly filled the spots.","With her years of experience in the field, she knew which parents had financial difficulties.","For these children to attend kindergarten, the cheapest option was usually 700 to 800 yuan per month!","If they learned about a 260 yuan per month kindergarten, they would definitely choose it first.","Before anyone else could act, Teacher Tang had secured the 10 spots on her own.","Liu Master Chef said to Shen Wei, \"What if more people want to enroll?\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Each of you has two additional spots, so you can recruit some students to join the class.\"","Initially, everyone didn't think much of it.","But when Shen Wei brought back the kindergarten's school bus, even the staff were shocked on a small scale.","It was the best yellow school bus, with bulletproof specifications. Just this one bus cost over 2 million yuan.","The 260 yuan monthly tuition was practically a welfare price!","Who didn't have a few relatives?","Those present immediately spread the word far and wide.","In less than two hours, the student count increased from 10 to 15.","As the parents arrived and were satisfied with the environment, following Teacher Tang's advice, they were told that this was just an opening promotion for the new kindergarten, an opportunity not to be missed.","They were also informed that classes would start the following Monday.","With the core team established and student enrollment completed,","the most important tasks were resolved. Liu Master Chef decided to celebrate by cooking a full table of dishes with the ingredients from the fridge.","Even before the meal started, everyone was craning their necks towards the kitchen, enticed by the aroma: \"What's Liu Master Chef cooking that smells so good?\"","\"I heard from Teacher Tang that Liu Master Chef used to be the head chef at Jiangbei International Hotel,\" Doctor Lu said.","Everyone present was stunned. Wow, they now had someone of such caliber cooking for them!","They were all eagerly anticipating the meal.","When the dishes were ready, everyone took out their bowls and chopsticks. As they passed by the food, their stomachs growled incessantly.","Their reddened faces betrayed their usual composure, as their stomachs were more honest than themselves when confronted with such delectable food.","Before the meal, Shen Wei poured them small drinks: \"From now on, we're a family.\"","With the staff assembled, the system awarded her another round of bonuses. She was now a little wealthy lady, with several hundred thousand yuan remaining after her spending spree.","Shen Wei said, \"You are all my great contributors. Together, we'll build this kindergarten into the best and largest in the city.\"","Although her words sounded childish, the passion of youth could inspire everyone.","Those present suddenly had high expectations for this job.","Moreover, after learning about their colleagues, they were all elite professionals in their respective fields.","A kindergarten run by such a team was bound to succeed. Everyone raised their glasses: \"Cheers, we'll definitely become the best kindergarten in the city.\"","After putting down their glasses and starting to eat,","everyone quickly reached for the dishes closest to them.","The braised beef melted in the mouth.","The tomato soup was a perfect balance of sweet and sour.","The stir-fried vegetables were exceptionally fresh and crisp.","Was this the skill of a master chef? Those present showered Liu Master Chef with praises.","Liu Master Chef had cooked for others in the past, but this time, cooking for everyone to share, he could hear so much praise, and nothing felt more gratifying.","Liu Master Chef said, \"The credit isn't mine, the ingredients Shen Wei procured were just exceptionally delicious!\"","Everyone thought he was just being modest, but only Shen Wei knew Liu Master Chef was telling the truth.","Liu Master Chef prepared 10 dishes in total, and the men and women present ate as if they hadn't had a proper meal in days, clearing every plate without leaving a single scrap.","After the hearty meal, Doctor Lu said to Shen Wei, \"I'd be willing to work here for free just for meals like this.\"","Everyone else echoed their agreement.","Knowing that they would be provided three meals a day, their enthusiasm for work immediately soared.","What kind of VIP treatment was this, to be able to eat the same food as the guests of Jiangbei International Hotel?"]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: The First Parent Is a Dream.","paragraphs":["Elder Sister Xu, the saleswoman on the second floor of the clothing department, was feeling a bit upset.","She had been glum all day long.","Even when the supervisor passed by, she went out of her way to avoid her.","Li, a fellow saleswoman, came over and asked Elder Sister Xu, \"What's wrong with you?\"","Elder Sister Xu had been upset for a long time, and finally someone asked about it, so she couldn't hold back her words.","\"My Mother-in-law just loves to cut corners and get a bargain. We argued again about sending the child to kindergarten. She found some cheap kindergarten from who knows where and directly enrolled the child, I heard the fees were already paid!\"","Elder Sister Xu is 36 years old and had to undergo several rounds of IVF before having a child.","She dotes on the child.","Elder Sister Xu's Mother-in-law is quite a famous character, always looking to save a few bucks. She either attends a class here or a lecture there.","Every time, she manages to bring back rice, flour, oil, and even snags free trips.","In the eyes of the younger generation, her Mother-in-law is a god.","According to Elder Sister Xu, they haven't bought eggs all year round, they're all from the ones her Mother-in-law queued up for and brought back from various places!","But other things aside.","When it comes to a child's education, it's of utmost importance. Although Elder Sister Xu doesn't have much money, she's willing to spend a high fee to send her child to a good kindergarten.","260 yuan per month, what kind of kindergarten is that?","But she can't get through to the elderly woman, and her Mother-in-law, who is so stingy, has already paid the 260 yuan fee. This matter is set in stone.","Li immediately said, \"That's not right, a child's education is crucial. You can't skimp on that just because you're poor.\"","\"My cousin's family bought a house near the Noble Kindergarten in our area just so they could try to get their child enrolled early. I heard the couple is actively preparing for the parent interview.\"","When Elder Sister Xu heard this, a hint of envy flashed in her eyes.","She had heard of the Noble Kindergarten, but her family's child could never attend.","Rumor has it that they require a minimum asset value of 500,000 yuan.","Back when she was trying to have a child, she had already spent 500,000 yuan, so now they only have an average financial status.","Elder Sister Xu said, \"I don't want to find such a prestigious kindergarten, but I should at least find a decent one, around 2,400 yuan per month would be fine.\"","Her monthly salary is only 3,500 yuan, so the fact that she can afford to spend that much on her child's kindergarten shows how doted on the baby is in their family.","When Li heard this figure, he was shocked, \"How has kindergarten become so expensive for a child these days?\"","Elder Sister Xu said, \"It's true, a child is like a millionaire in debt!\"","The two chatted without reaching a conclusion. At the time, Elder Sister Xu decided that she would just compensate her Mother-in-law for the 260 yuan fee, after all, she had to send her child to a good kindergarten.","She went home still fuming, but when she got there, she saw her Mother-in-law playing with her daughter Meng Meng.","That's right, she had given birth to a cute little girl who always wore beautiful dresses and was dolled up like a little doll.","Elder Sister Xu's heart softened. She had given birth later than most.","So her Mother-in-law was also older than most grandmothers.","Just the fact that she could help take care of the child was already difficult.","Otherwise, if she didn't go to work, the family couldn't function at all.","But when it came to matters concerning her own child, she still cared a lot.","\"Mom!\" Elder Sister Xu decided to have a proper talk with her Mother-in-law.","\"Hey, do you know who recommended that 260 yuan per month kindergarten to me? It was Teacher Tang.\"","\"Really her?\" Elder Sister Xu exclaimed.","Teacher Tang was the one at the kindergarten that charged 2,400 yuan per month that she had previously consulted with a few times.","The teaching quality in Teacher Tang's class was the highest. But she doesn't teach classes much anymore.","So even though they had exchanged WeChat contacts, their conversations had been sporadic.","Teacher Tang has quite a reputation, and she's famously loving towards children.","Ning Fubao used to be in her class. She didn't charge tuition fees. As a fellow parent, everyone was quite touched.","Moreover, Teacher Tang is warm and gentle, speaking softly and slowly to everyone, and all the children adore her.","When Elder Sister Xu heard that it was recommended by Teacher Tang, she said, \"Really? How can it be that cheap?\"","She was already half convinced.","Her Mother-in-law immediately said, \"You wouldn't know this, but it's a newly opened kindergarten. According to market rates, it should cost at least 3,000 yuan. How much do you and your husband earn in total? You're still young, save up some money. There will be more places to spend money when raising a child in the future. It doesn't matter which kindergarten they go to, it's the same. Besides, I've inquired, and Teacher Tang is at this kindergarten.\"","Her Mother-in-law felt like she had scored a bargain. If Teacher Tang was really at this kindergarten, then wouldn't it be the same as sending the child to a 2,000 yuan kindergarten?","Elder Sister Xu was still not at ease, \"Tomorrow, I'll ask my supervisor for a day off and go with the child to the kindergarten to see the actual situation.\"","Her Mother-in-law agreed.","That night, Elder Sister Xu still felt uneasy.","She couldn't sleep in the middle of the night and kept looking up information about kindergarten fees and all sorts of things.","If it was truly Teacher Tang teaching for 260 yuan, that would be fantastic.","She could save 2,000 yuan on kindergarten fees each month and add some nutritional supplements for the child.","But how could there be such a bargain falling from the sky? As she kept thinking about it, she noticed it was almost 3 a.m.","The sky was getting bright. Elder Sister Xu hurriedly tried to get some sleep.","The next day, she came to drop off her child at kindergarten with dark circles under her eyes.","As soon as she turned the corner, she saw a shiny school bus.","Many parents from the surrounding neighborhood were there to pick up and drop off their children. One look at the luxurious school bus, and it was written \"Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","Several parents were envious, \"That school bus must be expensive.\"","\"Of course, I heard that school bus cost over 2 million yuan. Only a noble school could afford it!\"","\"Oh my god, does our neighborhood have students from a noble school?\"","\"Impossible, those who can afford to go to a noble school wouldn't live in our neighborhood. At least they'd live in the villas next door.\" Everyone was chattering.","After a while, the school bus steadily stopped at the entrance of their neighborhood.","It was the first day for picking up and dropping off children, so Teacher Tang came along with the bus. She opened the door and called out Meng Meng's name.","Elder Sister Xu was dazed as the two of them boarded the school bus.","The other parents were in shock. How much did this cost? They had never heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten before.","They immediately took out their phones to search online, but there wasn't much information.","After Elder Sister Xu got on the bus, she immediately struck up a conversation with Teacher Tang, \"So you're really teaching here? That's great! Let me ask one more thing, is the tuition fee really 260 yuan per month? My Mother-in-law isn't old and hard of hearing, is she? Did she miss a zero and it's actually 2,600 yuan?\"","She couldn't believe that a kindergarten that could afford such an expensive school bus would only charge such a low tuition fee. Did her Mother-in-law get the number wrong?","Teacher Tang said, \"It's 260 yuan. You can rest assured leaving the child with me. The teaching staff is also quite good!\"","She then introduced the qualifications of her colleagues.","Elder Sister Xu praised the kindergarten profusely, but such things require seeing it with one's own eyes to believe.","In the end, Elder Sister Xu arrived at the kindergarten. It occupied 10,000 square meters of land with an entire building.","There were various recreational facilities. It was Meng Meng's first day at kindergarten, but she didn't cry. Her eyes were fixated on the merry-go-rounds and other amusements.","Elder Sister Xu asked, \"Do you want to study here?\"","Seeing her precious daughter nod vigorously.","Then her little hand took Elder Sister Xu's hand on its own accord.","Elder Sister Xu suddenly remembered, \"I haven't bought her any food this morning. Let me go buy her some bread and milk.\"","Teacher Tang said, \"No need, we have a cafeteria here. She can eat with us!\"","She then settled the child in the cafeteria and asked an education specialist to look after her. Teacher Tang still needed to pick up and drop off other children.","It was the first day of school, so there would likely be many unsettled parents like Elder Sister Xu.","Afterwards, Elder Sister Xu was brought to the dining hall. Surprisingly, it was a self-service breakfast, with milk, eggs, steamed buns, pastries, soy milk and fried dough sticks. Some were made by the chef, while others were purchased fresh.","Meng Meng would probably spend around 200 yuan for a month's worth of breakfast here.","Is this really profitable?","Elder Sister Xu suddenly felt a bit grateful for her Mother-in-law's thrifty nature. Indeed, if it were her, she might have missed out on this.","An education expert said, \"You haven't eaten breakfast either, right? Go ahead and eat here. Our Master Chef used to be the head chef at the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant. Especially today's thousand-layer crispy pastry, he made it himself.\"","Upon hearing this, Elder Sister Xu immediately swallowed. She had eaten at a wedding banquet at the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant before. It was said that a table cost 5,000 yuan, and every dish was truly delicious.","She never expected that they would invite the head chef from there to the Noble Kindergarten. Elder Sister Xu was instantly excited. As long as her daughter could eat well, she felt even better than eating it herself.","She couldn't resist and ate a thousand-layer crispy pastry. It was full of buttery fragrance, not too sweet or greasy. Unexpectedly delicious, and the little pickled vegetables were also made by Liu Master Chef.","Especially the cucumber sticks, how could they be so refreshingly crisp? After just one bite, Elder Sister Xu felt it was worth it!","Moreover, the small table card had already listed the dishes to be served for lunch today. Eight dishes and one soup, plus a fruit platter."]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: What more is required for 260","paragraphs":["Volume 1: Chapter 10, No More Requirements","The fruits were all imported varieties like mangosteen and cherries. The pineapples were foreign golden pineapples, exuding a strong fruity aroma.","Elder Sister Xu felt like she was dreaming after leaving there. Her heart was pounding.","How could she ever have imagined that her child would be able to attend such a wonderful kindergarten?","...","All morning long, there was a constant stream of parents coming and going at the kindergarten.","Attracted by the price of 260, they never expected the kindergarten to be so good. Parents who came with doubts were left gaping in astonishment, as if in a dream. It was as if a pie had fallen from the sky right at their feet, too good to be true.","Not only were the school bus and food high-class.","Especially for those parents who were not fully assured, they had lunch with the children. A single meal was enough to convince them.","Some even shared the Starry Sky Kindergarten's menu in the mommy groups.","The groups erupted in heated discussion, as they couldn't believe the kids were eating so well.","\"It's really just 260? The fruit they have is so premium.\"","At current prices, they couldn't even afford to buy such fruit for themselves.","\"Not just the fruit, even the chef here is the head chef from Jiangbei Grand Restaurant.\"","\"Quick, someone send me Teacher Tang's number.\"","\"The owner must be running a charity at 260.\"","Some understood clearly, immediately pointing out: \"Hey, that's just for the first few days, wait till 5 days are up and they'll revert to normal.\"","But they were immediately refuted by other parents: \"What more can you ask for at 260?\"","The person trying to stir things up was almost successful, but then everyone was brought back to their senses by the 260 price tag. That's right, 260.","Even if it was just for a few days, it was still worth it.","\"Teacher Tang is here too!\" Teacher Tang had a great reputation in the kindergarten world.","The little group went wild, but the feeling was especially profound for some of the mothers.","Everyone knows a child is a mother's heart and soul.","The business knew this too, using the child to make demands like a sovereign.","Constantly asking for money for this and that, all sorts of idiot taxes, but the mothers dared not refuse for the sake of their children.","In reality, however, those with money were in the minority, most were ordinary families.","Seeing this conscience of the industry at 260, they were all moved to tears.","But there were still few mothers with children of the right age in the groups, most were still pregnant. They all remembered the name Starry Sky Kindergarten. When their children were born, they would send them there too.","Some joked: \"I haven't even eaten food made by the Jiangbei Grand chef. The kids are eating better than us, not to mention their school bus cost over 2 million.\"","A few people couldn't contain their excitement and directly posted about Starry Sky Kindergarten on the local forums!","The price of 260 sparked a small craze on the local forums.","Everyone knew about the competition for kindergarten spots, but if the competition could be eased on the price front, it would be an enormous benefit for mothers.","So in less than a day.","The system in Shen Wei's mind burst into bloom.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for gaining reputation value, exchanged for 36,000 points.\"","It was Shen Wei's first encounter with reputation value, so she immediately asked the system: \"What is reputation value?\"","The system replied: \"As long as you have fame and reputation, it will be converted into points.\"","Shen Wei's eyes lit up. It was the first time the system had given her so many points. She would have to find a way to expand her reputation value."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Boutique Class","paragraphs":["Volume 1: The Elite Small Class by Default","Chapter 11","Teacher Tang has been feeling a bit overheated recently.","There are simply too few students in the kindergarten.","Such a large campus, with so many employees hired, the daily expenses are not small.","Now there is only one class with 15 children, which is not feasible.","At her previous workplace, a class of forty students was considered too few, and they were constantly given enrollment tasks by her, afraid of losing money.","In Teacher Tang's mind, the other colleagues were all new to the kindergarten industry, without any experience in running a kindergarten.","So she, as a former core member, automatically took on the responsibility.","A large blister had formed at the corner of her mouth.","As soon as Shen Wei arrived at work, she noticed it and thought something was wrong.","After inquiring, she found out that Teacher Tang was under too much pressure.","Shen Wei felt touched: \"Today, since everyone is here, I'll call a meeting.\" It's better to discuss things together, instead of relaying messages back and forth.","This is the first meeting held at Starry Sky Kindergarten since the start of the semester.","Everyone arrived at the conference room early.","Each person had a serious and solemn expression on their face.","People like Liu Master Chef, the school bus driver Zhang Daming, Doctor Lu, and education expert Weng Lan had a feeling of 'it's here, it's finally here'.","Having worked here for a few days, this place felt like a paradise on earth.","Every morning, they would go and pick up the children, listening to their laughter and chatter.","A chef from a grand hotel would personally prepare three meals a day for them, living in bliss without a care in the world.","After work, they would tend to Shen Wei's little vegetable garden.","This kind of life, it's like a paid agritourism program.","Yet, they're provided this for free.","Not to mention the extremely high monthly salary.","It's great, but the money doesn't feel legitimate, as if there's no such thing as a free lunch.","Ultimately, upon hearing that Shen Wei was calling a meeting, they all perked up.","In front of the conference table, Shen Wei said, \"I know everyone is a bit worried about our enrollment situation, but don't worry, I still have some money.\"","\"We don't need a lot of people, we'll just run an elite small class, and gradually build up our reputation.\"","\"Apart from Teacher Tang who has previous experience working in a kindergarten, the other colleagues will need to adapt together.\"","\"Let's start with this elite small class.\"","\"You really don't need to feel too much pressure.\"","\"Rest assured, I'll be your safety net, there won't be any problems.\"","Those present listened with respect after hearing her words.","They had previously thought Shen Wei was young, but didn't expect her to be so efficient in handling matters.","She was steady and stable, even more patient than them, who had experience in the working world.","People like Zhang Daming and Doctor Lu, who had worked in other units before, felt indescribably complex upon hearing Shen Wei's words \"I'll be your safety net.\"","In their previous workplaces, leaders would always pass the buck, and others would have to take the blame for the leaders.","But here, the youngest boss was shouldering everything, which truly touched them.","Everyone became pensive.","Teacher Tang also felt that half of the burden on her shoulders had been lifted thanks to Shen Wei's words.","She had a newfound understanding of Shen Wei.","Everyone had to prepare for their respective work.","A busy day was about to begin.","Liu Master Chef intentionally avoided Shen Wei, and secretly told everyone to come to the conference room 10 minutes before lunchtime, as he had something to say.","Everyone quickly agreed.","At the appointed time for lunch, while Shen Wei was still busy in the vegetable garden, the others went to the conference room in tacit agreement.","Seeing that everyone was present, Liu Master Chef said, \"I'll keep it short. I'm the first employee to join our kindergarten. If nothing unexpected happens, this will be my last job before retirement.\"","Everyone looked up at him.","Liu Master Chef continued, \"Shen Wei is young and may not understand some things, but I'm willing to take on more. This is what I think: we've fortunately found such a great workplace, we must work hard to make it successful.\"","Before anyone could respond, Doctor Lu spoke first, \"I really like this job. I'm not too busy on my end, so feel free to give me instructions whenever you need me, don't hesitate.\"","Education expert Weng Lan said, \"I will do my best, and I hope everyone can point out any mistakes I make.\"","Zhang Daming also felt a surge of heroic spirit. In his previous workplace, he was just a driver, but now, he had become a respected elder who could contribute ideas.","Zhang Daming couldn't help but say, \"I don't believe it, we're all elites from various industries, how could we not succeed? I'm definitely going to give it my all.\"","Everyone expressed similar sentiments.","\"Alright, let's work hard! Meeting adjourned.\" Liu Master Chef was afraid of being discovered, so he ended the meeting after a few words.","School bus driver Zhang Daming felt somewhat pensive.","These were all simple-hearted people. If they had encountered seasoned office veterans, such statements would have been made in front of the young boss.","But they intentionally avoided Shen Wei, harboring a determination to do their best. The beautiful young boss wasn't being overly eager, but they were.","He didn't believe they couldn't run the kindergarten well.","This feeling was truly quite peculiar.","It was especially reminiscent of the past, when they were part of a large collective, without any personal agenda.","Nowadays, workplaces were filled with infighting and scheming, he had even heard of people forming cliques of three against four.","Unlike them, they had secretly held a small meeting, leaving the young boss aside, pondering how to make this kindergarten better.","With this mindset alone, the kindergarten's future was assured.","Initially, Teacher Tang had notified many students' parents about the kindergarten's enrollment.","The price of 260 was indeed very attractive.","But many were cautious, wanting to observe further.","They were worried about various potential traps.","It's understandable, as low prices often come with hidden pitfalls these days. After being burned before, people tend to avoid deals, not wanting to be taken advantage of.","However, those parents who didn't enroll could still see Teacher Tang's moments on WeChat.","Teacher Tang would post about the kindergarten's food and drinks.","As well as short clips from each day.","This was a habit Teacher Tang had developed from her previous job at the kindergarten.","Her moments were like a window, allowing more people to see how good Starry Sky Kindergarten was.","As a result, some came to inquire with Teacher Tang about enrollment.","But the small class here had already been in session for half a month.","Teacher Tang apologetically replied on WeChat: \"I'm sorry, dear parents, we are not accepting transfer students at the moment.\"","The parents, communicating through WeChat, paused and responded: \"But I see there aren't many people in your kindergarten!\"","Some even had conspiracy theories: \"Could it be that the 260 price is gone? How much are you charging now?\"","Teacher Tang said, \"It's not about the price.\"","\"We're running an elite small class now, and if there are plans for more enrollment in the future, I'll post about it on my moments.\"","The parents were perplexed: \"You have such a large place but only one class running, with so many people serving these dozen or so children? Isn't that a pipe dream? Don't you want to make money anymore?\"","Teacher Tang felt apologetic.","Originally, the parents could enroll or not.","The price of 260 was good, but they still felt there might be other catch.","Seeing the limited spots, the parents immediately became eager.","They pestered Teacher Tang all morning, and seeing that she didn't budge, they became even more distressed.","The parents regretted not enrolling earlier, complaining in the parents' group chat: \"I wish I had known better. She was the first one to tell me about it! Back then, I didn't plan for my child to attend, but now that I want to, there's no opportunity.\"","A rare gem of a kindergarten, isn't this exactly the dream kindergarten for everyone?","What parent doesn't wish for teachers to devote all their attention to their child?","But with many children in a kindergarten, teachers can't provide enough care, and parents can only accept it.","Yet now, they've missed out on such a great kindergarten.","The feeling was simply like losing a billion dollars.","Another parent in the group lamented even more: \"Don't share expired deals anymore, share them earlier next time.\"","What was that called? Starry Sky Kindergarten, we should pay close attention to that."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Keep Up with the Joneses","paragraphs":["Volume 1: The Default Chapter 12, Everyone Has a Heart for Comparison","Ever since the shop colleagues learned that the saleswoman Elder Sister Xu's darling daughter had actually enrolled in a kindergarten costing 260 per month, they suddenly became very interested!","Everyone knew how Elder Sister Xu doted on her precious daughter, earning 3,500 a month but willing to spend 4,500 on her daughter.","For someone who pampered her daughter so much, to choose such a kindergarten, everyone was quite curious.","\"Elder Sister Xu, how's that kindergarten?\"","Elder Sister Xu beamed: \"It's great!\" Then she shared her emotional journey over this period, having been anxious the whole way.","Elder Sister Xu had thought her Mother-in-law was being scammed.","Little did she expect that while they went for Teacher Tang, it was the environment that won them over.","The Starry Sky Kindergarten had surprisingly luxurious school buses, and the kindergarten meals were also impressively delicious.","She had lunch there once and almost wanted to pay to attend the kindergarten just to enjoy the food.","After all, these days, there really are adults who pay to eat at children's small tables.","But then she thought it would be too embarrassing.","At 260 a month, she was already fleecing the kindergarten's wool enough.","If the parents were to go eat there too, it would be going too far. Her daughter was her heart and soul, as long as the child ate well, that was enough.","Recently, her little Meng Meng has also come to love the kindergarten food, even saying she'll eat less in the evening so she can eat more there.","Even her Mother-in-law became proud, saying they chose the right kindergarten.","Now she addresses her Mother-in-law affectionately as 'Mom', which also contains an apology for her earlier suspicions.","Her Mother-in-law is showing off these days, but Elder Sister Xu doesn't mind, flattering her Mother-in-law with compliments every day in different ways.","As a mother, as long as her daughter is comfortable, she is comfortable.","Now their mother-daughter-in-law relationship is well-known in the community. Her Mother-in-law gains a lot of face.","As Elder Sister Xu chatted animatedly, a few unmarried young ladies listened in amazement.","\"Wow, there's such a great kindergarten?\"","\"The kindergartens we went to as kids can't compare to this one.\"","\"Kindergarten fees should be at this level. How much can working folks afford?\"","\"If all kindergartens charged this much, people would dare to have kids.\"","The main thing is that the cost of raising children has become lower.","Everyone discussed it with relish when suddenly a scornful voice interrupted.","\"I thought it was someone else. It turns out to be Elder Sister Xu. Didn't you used to say you really loved your child? But now it seems not so much, putting her in such a poor kindergarten.\"","\"260 a month, even pet boarding places charge a few thousand a month. Oh, this poor child, how pitiful to have followed you!\"","When everyone heard her words, they were struck dumb, until someone realized it was the female purchasing officer.","These two were sworn enemies.","Elder Sister Xu's husband used to date that purchasing officer, but it didn't work out, and later she became Elder Sister Xu's husband.","This wasn't a secret in the mall.","Previously the two didn't talk much, but recently perhaps because Elder Sister Xu was so excited about the 260 fee and momentarily the talk of the town, the purchasing officer came over to mock her.","The others, hearing those words, didn't dare breathe loudly, joking about a mother's child being no small matter. If it provoked someone to rage, it would be disastrous.","Elder Sister Xu remained calm: \"Your tone is quite arrogant. I wonder what kindergarten you send your daughter to?\"","The bystanders, seeing a confrontation brewing, hurried to find the manager, worried the two might start fighting and be unstoppable.","The purchasing officer said: \"I found her an ordinary kindergarten too, but it's 3,800 a month!\"","She spoke with a smug air, implying that the kindergarten her daughter attended cost more than Elder Sister Xu's monthly salary.","Elder Sister Xu let out an \"Oh\": \"Then do they have 2 million yuan school buses, chefs from Jiangbei Hotel cooking for you, hire drivers from government institutions, with the kindergarten doctor being the pediatric attending physician from the municipal hospital?\"","Elder Sister Xu's words made everyone present gasp in astonishment.","Good heavens, what kind of celestial kindergarten is this?","If Elder Sister Xu had said it was a noble kindergarten, everyone could have accepted it.","After all, to enroll in that kindergarten, you need to have your assets verified, queue up in advance, and parents must undergo interviews.","But for a kindergarten costing only 260 a month to have such facilities?","Sure enough, as Elder Sister Xu spoke, the purchasing officer's face flushed red.","The purchasing officer snorted: \"You must be imagining all that, how is it possible?\"","Elder Sister Xu said: \"If you don't believe me, tomorrow I'll post a video of me sending my daughter to kindergarten in the group chat.\"","This was even more humiliating than slapping the purchasing officer.","Elder Sister Xu pressed her advantage: \"Word is there are people who want to enroll in the kindergarten too, but went too late and couldn't get in. What a pity, they can only go to the 3,800 one then.\"","The purchasing officer's face instantly drained of color. In fact, she had married an ordinary man.","Sending her daughter to such an expensive kindergarten meant she had argued with her family, having to strain themselves financially.","Originally she just wanted the best for her child. But now hearing this, it seemed like she was some pitiful fool.","Not only did she gain no advantage in the argument, she was seen as incompetent.","The purchasing officer let out a cold snort and slunk away in dejection.","The next day, true to her word, Elder Sister Xu posted a video of sending her daughter to kindergarten in the group chat.","The bright yellow school bus was the most expensive 2 million yuan armored model.","This bus was only used by the elite classes at the Noble Kindergarten.","When the Noble Kindergarten did its massive publicity campaign back then, everyone learned about the price of this bus model.","Parents of students had hearts for comparison too.","The purchasing officer immediately saved this video and forwarded it to the admissions officer at her child's kindergarten.","She bluntly asked why others who paid only 260 a month had such great school buses, while she paid 3,800 but their bus was just ordinary, demanding an explanation.","The admissions officer, usually very polite, evaded the issue: \"The faculty at our kindergarten is very strong!\"","The purchasing officer said: \"Their teacher is Teacher Tang.\"","The admissions officer continued listing her kindergarten's advantages: \"We have a dedicated school doctor! If any student gets hurt, you don't need to worry.\"","The purchasing officer asked: \"Is your doctor also from the pediatrics department of the municipal hospital?\"","The admissions officer, starting to get flustered: \"The food at our place is quite good.\"","The purchasing officer: \"Is your head chef also from Jiangbei Hotel?\"","The other side sent six ellipses.","The admissions officer was truly exasperated.","Finally, she said somewhat rudely: \"You're only paying 3,800, without adding an extra zero at the end. If your demands are really so high, then I suggest you make a lateral move and choose elsewhere!\"","The implication being, if you're going to talk like that, we won't serve you anymore.","The purchasing officer immediately got angry. Her tuition fees were over ten times more than Elder Sister Xu's.","Not only did she not get equivalent service, she was even given attitude.","She was furious, but didn't dare say much more.","After all, her child was still in their hands, worried that if she argued with the teachers, they might take it out on her daughter.","The next day, the purchasing officer wore a long face all day.","But no one paid her any attention, as the Starry Sky Kindergarten was too popular.","One by one, they all pulled Elder Sister Xu aside to ask how to enroll in that kindergarten.","Even if they didn't have children of the right age at home, relatives would certainly have some.","Rather than sending them to other kindergartens to be fleeced, it would be better to go to this Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Of course, the purchasing officer's relationship with Elder Sister Xu was too poor for her to directly ask.","But she walked by Elder Sister Xu's side nearly 10 times, each time straining her ears to catch some information.","With some piecing together, she also learned about the situation of the Starry Sky Kindergarten. She wanted to transfer her daughter there, but was afraid that Elder Sister Xu would hear about it and scoff or mock her, which made her even angrier for a while."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Get a Teacher for a Computer Genius","paragraphs":["Volume 1: Chapter 13 - Hiring a Tutor for the Computer Prodigy by Default","Shen Wei didn't know who helped promote her again.","Now, every day she could see in her mind that she had gained new prestige points, which could be exchanged for over 10,000 credits.","The system immediately rewarded her with 1 million credits, 5 pounds of beef, 5 pounds of vegetables, and 40 cucumber seeds!","Shen Wei was even more motivated now.","Every day spent with the children, listening to their childish chatter, and smelling the milky scent of the kids.","The sounds of children running, jumping, and laughing were truly healing.","Not just her, even Liu Chef enjoyed watching the children play on the playground when he had free time.","He said working here was very relaxing.","But the education expert Weng Lan approached Shen Wei to discuss something with her.","Shen Wei asked, \"What's the matter?\"","Weng Lan then took out a small notebook containing her work records and handed it to Shen Wei.","During this period, she had done a great deal of desk work.","She had observed every child thoroughly.","Including the children's living habits, growth experiences, and their favorite things.","In just a few short days, even Shen Wei was amazed.","The more Shen Wei read, the more impressed she became, feeling that hiring Weng Lan was truly worthwhile.","An education expert not only needs to have a rich theoretical foundation but also enough patience and attention to detail.","Indeed, professionals do professional work.","Weng Lan, blushing at Shen Wei's unending praise, did not forget her purpose.","This time, she came to report on her work: \"Look at He Lingfeng's case!\"","Weng Lan said, \"This child is always a bit unsocial and solitary. He rarely smiles and has a rather serious psychological defense.\"","She knew that Shen Wei had adopted He Lingfeng and was aware of what the child had gone through, feeling sorry for his ordeal.","But for a child so young to already show some psychological issues, intervention was needed promptly.","Once severe psychological problems form, they could affect his entire adolescence or even his whole life.","Such words would be shocking for ordinary student parents, and they might even be mocked, but Shen Wei was clearly exceptional.","Shen Wei said, \"I understand.\"","Weng Lan was a bit curious, not knowing what Shen Wei understood. After reporting her work, she left.","Shen Wei called He Lingfeng over and asked, \"How are you doing here?\"","He Lingfeng, the future computer genius, very cautiously said, \"I'm doing really well here.\"","\"I have a task for you. Can you complete it properly?\"","For a child, a task is a very important thing.","Quickly, his gaze became determined. \"I can,\" He Lingfeng said loudly.","Shen Wei nodded in satisfaction.","Then, she found him a university student tutor online, offering a salary of 200 yuan per hour.","Of course, Shen Wei knew why He Lingfeng was unsocial.","He was a genius, and putting a genius among ordinary people would indeed be difficult for him.","His future path was broader, and Shen Wei planned to build him a platform.","As soon as Shen Wei posted the tutoring job on the platform, the order was immediately snatched up on the computer end.","Shen Wei checked the qualifications of the person who grabbed the order. The tutor had a 99% positive rating for home tutoring.","They were a top student from a 985 Project University and even attached their high school exam score of over 600 points.","Meanwhile, Shen Wei's requirement was only for tutoring starting from elementary school level.","...","Shen Wei had no idea that by casually posting a tutoring order, she had caused an uproar in the official group of the tutoring platform.","In the group, people immediately started chattering: \"Wow, did you all see that big order just now? Who has the lightning-fast hands to snatch it?\"","\"That must be the hand speed of someone single for 20 years. I didn't even get a chance to look before it was taken down.\"","\"Seriously, 200 yuan per hour?\"","\"I wish I could earn that kind of money too.\"","On this platform, many university students took tutoring jobs as a good side gig. Many people scrambled for orders.","The rates were set by the posters themselves, with most being around 30 yuan per hour.","50 yuan per hour was already quite difficult, and 100 yuan per hour was very rare. But now there was a 200 yuan per hour order!","And it was for elementary tutoring, practically like earning free money.","Afterward, someone with the ID Su Jun appeared and said, \"Sorry, that order has been snatched by yours truly!\" He then showed his order record.","Everyone became even more sour seeing that.","Why had they never encountered such good luck?","Hearing the sour remarks from tutors in the group, Su Jun in his university dorm couldn't help but laugh. He even told his roommate that he would treat them to a meal tonight since he was about to earn some money.","Upon hearing that Su Jun would tutor an elementary student for the high rate of 200 yuan per hour, his roommate felt both envious and jealous, saying he would thoroughly mooch a big meal off him!","Su Jun said, \"No problem!\" Then he took out the lesson materials he had prepared to review.","Since the parents were willing to pay 200 yuan per hour as the tutor rate, their expectations must be quite high.","He had to prepare in advance, though elementary material was very simple.","The next day, he arrived at the appointed time and discovered it was a place called Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As soon as he entered, he smelled an extraordinary aroma.","Even though he had eaten in the dorm, upon smelling that scent, his stomach growled hungrily.","Shen Wei had been waiting for ten minutes. \"Hello, you must be Teacher Su Jun.\"","Su Jun immediately nodded politely, \"Yes, it's me!\"","Shen Wei said, \"I'm the one who posted the order on the website. Please help tutor my student.\"","\"No problem.\"","As he walked inside, Su Jun's heart sank with a vague realization.","No wonder the rate was 200 yuan per hour. The order must not have clearly stated that the tutoring was for a kindergarten student, so it wasn't really a high salary.","He wanted to ask about it but didn't know how.","The aroma grew stronger as they went deeper inside.","Shen Wei said, \"You haven't had lunch yet, have you? Our kitchen operates as a self-service cafeteria. Feel free to have a meal here if you don't mind.\"","Su Jun immediately agreed, \"Sure, I'll have a bite then.\"","Upon entering, he could hardly believe his eyes.","There were exotic fruits like mangosteen, pineapple, cherries, and even durian that had just been peeled - expensive items he couldn't afford to buy.","Yet they were provided for free.","He loved durian and wondered if it would be too much to take a piece.","He didn't want to take some first, only to be criticized online later for \"Tutor ate my family's durian\" - how embarrassing that would be!","Su Jun restrained himself, but when he saw the dishes, he couldn't hold back anymore.","There was braised beef tendon with a touch of red and green chili peppers - it would be amazing with rice.","Tomato and egg soup.","Grilled potato slices.","Steamed fish.","Plus other stir-fried vegetables, a total of eight dishes and one soup. Each dish emanated a tantalizing aroma.","They were all his favorite dishes, and coupled with the fruits, a sense of inexplicable bliss washed over him.","He then grabbed a plate and took a few bites.","The first bite left him in a daze from the aroma.","He never expected that the best meal he would have this year would be at a kindergarten cafeteria.","In the end, he wolfed it all down ravenously.","Before swallowing the food in his mouth, he had already stuffed in the next bite. No, it was too delicious - missing even a bite was a huge loss.","After finishing everything, he remembered he hadn't posted on his social media yet.","If his dorm mates saw this, they would be drooling with envy.","But the \"clean plate\" operation was too successful.","By the time he thought of it, he had already finished eating.","In the end, he took two pineapple slices and two mangosteens on his way out.","He still couldn't resist, extending his sinful hands towards the durian area. Thoughtfully, they provided mouthwash and breath mints for eating durian.","He took a bite, the texture soft and sweet.","Just this one all-you-can-eat meal alone was worth 200 yuan.","Su Jun decided that after finishing, he planned to give a lesson to a class of kids. He didn't mind anymore, after all, he was eating their food.","Having eaten and drunk his fill, Su Jun radiated a sense of bliss.","He couldn't help but want to submit his resume here. If he could work like this every day, he would be more than willing. He wondered if they would hire him."]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Talent to Scare the Hell Out of You","paragraphs":["Volume 1: Chapter 14 - A Terrifying Talent","After eating, Su Jun realized he had eaten five bowls of rice.","He felt a little embarrassed.","He decided that later in class, he would definitely work hard and make sure to teach every student, no matter how poor their grades.","Then he found Shen Wei and said, \"Can I go see my student now?\"","Shen Wei took him to a separate classroom where He Lingfeng was waiting.","Su Jun was quite surprised, \"Just one student?\"","Shen Wei said, \"Yes.\"","It was the first time Su Jun felt a little embarrassed to take the 200 yuan fee.","He felt the meal he just ate could almost cover the tuition!","This was a kindergarten, with a blackboard, computers, tablets, and other learning tools. Su Jun immediately understood that they wanted him to use modern computer-aided teaching methods.","He then asked about his student's learning level and was stunned. He Lingfeng had attended kindergarten for a few days.","He was supposed to start from elementary school, but in reality, he needed to learn 1+1 for math.","For Chinese, he needed to learn initials, finals, and writing characters.","For English, he needed to start from A, B, C, D.","For someone who had been in the top three in his high school, teaching elementary school was a bit like using a sledgehammer to crack a nut, but he still planned to teach wholeheartedly.","He found this little kid was quite smart and could quickly grasp what he taught.","In just one hour.","They had gone from first grade to third grade in all three subjects.","Su Jun didn't know if he was lecturing too fast, as he had never taught such young children before.","After each lesson, he would give a test.","These were all from extra-curricular workbooks, with no questions beyond the curriculum.","He had originally planned to teach ten lessons, but he finished everything in one lesson.","The five-year-old He Lingfeng absorbed learning like a sponge, no matter how much he taught, he could take it all in, which delighted Su Jun.","Su Jun didn't want to dwell on 1+1 over and over.","Especially since he had seen jokes online about parents getting so frustrated with this problem that they had a breakdown.","Fortunately, he encountered a smart child.","With the child's intelligence, combined with Su Jun being a true scholar, the two studied at a breakneck pace.","He enjoyed teaching, and the child enjoyed learning.","In just one hour, he already felt extremely tired because he was teaching three subjects simultaneously.","Even he, the teacher, felt exhausted, let alone the child being able to keep going.","When he heard his phone ringing, the hour was over. Su Jun said, \"I'll leave you some worksheets. Do them whenever you have time.\"","\"Also, practice writing. You know the content now, but writing well doesn't happen overnight.\" He then gave him some copybooks to trace characters.","He would come back next week.","Planning to check his homework then.","He assigned him 10 copybook pages and one set of worksheets per day.","Seeing He Lingfeng obediently nodded, even Su Jun couldn't help but pat the little kid's head, thinking this kid was quite adorable!","As he was leaving, he told Shen Wei, then left, making an appointment for next week.","He then successfully received his 200 yuan hourly wage.","Before coming, he thought this salary was very high.","Many people would envy it, but after actually doing it, teaching three subjects up to third grade simultaneously was too much.","His one hour of talking almost equaled a week's worth.","If going by the pace, this 200 yuan was an absolute bargain.","But he was willing to do it.","The first student was smart, and second, the kindergarten food was too delicious. College students all have this principle: if you treat me well, I'll definitely treat you even better in return.","After returning, he told his roommates about the food he ate again, successfully making them drool uncontrollably.","Seeing his roommates' envious, ravenous expressions was so satisfying.","By the second week, he had prepared more course materials and materials.","After all, he might as well make use of the advanced computer equipment if it was available.","The first thing he did was, of course, to enjoy a hearty meal at the cafeteria.","Today's dishes were different, with large greasy meat buns, made the old-fashioned way, fist-sized, and made with quality ingredients and delicious.","A variety of dishes vied for attention, this was not kindergarten fare, it would be more than enough to serve leaders.","After eating here, he could barely stand the food at his university for a week.","The difference between the food here and there was too great.","Eating here made him feel alive, so after eating, he first went to grade the homework, which didn't take up tutoring time.","When Su Jun opened it, he saw the child's writing was a bit childish at first, but gradually became neater, and in just one week, his writing became very upright.","This was very good for a five-year-old child.","Even he was very satisfied, realizing this was the joy of being a teacher, the tremendous sense of achievement when a child makes progress.","This feeling couldn't be experienced elsewhere.","Looking further, the math was all correct, English all correct, characters all correct.","He used a teaching method for adults on this young child.","Su Jun was completely unaware of how terrifying this teaching method was, because Chinese required writing practice, math required calculation, and English required recitation practice.","The three were completely different modes.","And he was dealing with just a five-year-old child.","They were both new, Su Jun was teaching such a young child for the first time, and He Lingfeng was having a private tutor for the first time.","The two boldly taught and boldly learned.","Forcibly achieving a very harmonious feeling.","He Lingfeng's genius was revealed, but Su Jun was still unaware of the seriousness of the issue at this point.","The previous lesson went from first to third grade for the three subjects of Chinese, math, and English.","Today, using just one hour, he covered fourth to sixth grade for all of them.","Although it was only elementary school material, he was dealing with a five-year-old child.","The math curriculum had already started covering algebraic equations.","Each time he gave a question, the other party answered it quickly. Sometimes he didn't believe it and would intentionally ask questions slightly beyond the curriculum, but unexpectedly the other party could still answer.","Even Su Jun, who wasn't very sensitive, found it terrifying.","At this rate, he would soon have nothing left to teach.","After all, he was only a first-year university student this year.","The other party used two hours to catch up on six years of curriculum, what kind of monster was this? He was dumbfounded.","When leaving, Shen Wei still gave him the money.","Su Jun had a feeling of wanting to say something but holding back.","Shen Wei asked, \"What's wrong? Is he not learning well?\"","Su Jun said, \"No, no, he's quite capable.\"","Shen Wei said, \"You're also quite capable!\"","She knew he was a top student. That's why she felt reassured leaving the child with him.","Moreover, this learning pace was comfortable for He Lingfeng.","If a genius was treated as an ordinary child, that kind of constant cramming education would make him weary.","After all, He Lingfeng was certified as a genius by the system."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Intellectual Curiosity","paragraphs":["For an ordinary person, the middle school curriculum already had some difficulty.","Fortunately, this slowed down He Lingfeng's learning pace.","He Lingfeng's progress was adjusted to complete one semester's worth of coursework in a single subject within an hour.","Shen Wei noticed that He Lingfeng was in a period of explosive desire for knowledge.","In addition to encountering suitable teachers, she also changed her approach, having Su Jun tutor him for an hour every day.","At the age of five, He Lingfeng exhibited an extraordinary learning ability, even having a feeling of discomfort if he didn't study.","Su Jun was under immense pressure.","These days, after returning to the dorm room from his own university courses, he was constantly preparing lessons.","He studied late into the night every day, prompting his roommates to tease him, \"What are you doing? Are you preparing for a second college entrance exam?\"","Generally, only high school seniors worked that hard, right?","University students looked down on those who studied so intensely, as if recalling the hellish days of their senior year of high school.","Su Jun simply said he was preparing lessons.","He didn't explain further.","His roommates thought he had gone crazy again.","They had heard that being a private tutor wasn't that easy of a job.","If one encountered a student who didn't learn well, various methods had to be employed to improve their grades.","Often, teaching was laborious, and the student's improvement was not always obvious. They assumed Su Jun was facing a similar situation.","Their eyes held a hint of sympathy.","Little did they know, Su Jun was being crushed by a sense of crisis.","As a teacher, facing the explosive thirst for knowledge from the five-year-old He Lingfeng, he couldn't afford to be unable to answer any questions.","One hour to complete one semester's worth of middle school coursework.","They had already covered up to the second year of middle school.","During the second year, physics was added, and chemistry was added in the third year, which could be challenging for a child to accept.","So he planned to use some small experiments to pique He Lingfeng's interest.","But during the actual practice, he realized he was being overshadowed by the child.","Someone like He Lingfeng, is he even human?","No matter what he studied, he could grasp it quickly.","He was like a born learning machine, never feeling tired.","Whenever encountering a new topic or difficulty, his eyes lit up with excitement, like a wolf spotting meat!","But Su Jun felt drained, his face haggard from preparing lessons late into the night every day.","During his school days, teachers and parents called Su Jun a genius.","He believed it until he met He Lingfeng and realized what a true genius was.","Such a person was too formidable!","Su Jun earned over 2,000 yuan in tutoring fees. He had to sacrifice half his life for that 2,000 yuan.","It was nothing like the relaxed experience his friends in the tutoring group had imagined.","Finally, he completed the third year of middle school curriculum.","Afterward, he gave He Lingfeng some in-class quizzes, using real questions from this year's middle school entrance exams.","The result? He Lingfeng had already reached the admission line for a key high school.","This was a five-year-old child? Terrifying!","Now, there was a problem. This kid would soon be facing the high school curriculum.","Su Jun's scalp tingled as he requested to resign from Shen Wei, \"I'm sorry, my abilities are limited. I'm afraid I can't teach him the high school courses!\"","After nearly half a month of interaction, he realized that being a teacher was not an easy task.","His previous ease stemmed from encountering students of average aptitude.","Who would have thought he'd meet a prodigy this time?","Being a teacher is like this: one must have a full bucket of water to scoop out a ladle for the student.","Because students often think outside the box, teachers must explain from multiple perspectives.","If he encountered a student who followed the textbook, he could continue teaching high school subjects. But clearly, he was not dealing with an ordinary person.","Once they moved to the high school curriculum, there would be many topics beyond the standard curriculum.","He would need to understand and digest those as well.","For now, he could only teach by the book, but he was facing a true genius. He didn't want to ruin the child!","Shen Wei said, \"Do you know anyone you could introduce to teach him?\" She still wanted someone like Su Jun to teach He Lingfeng the high school curriculum.","If they encountered a mediocre teacher, it could be a significant setback and blow for He Lingfeng, who was currently thirsting for knowledge.","Shen Wei and Su Jun both understood this principle.","Su Jun thought for a moment and said, \"I can recommend my high school senior. He had excellent grades and was the top student back then.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Okay, if he can come, I can increase the pay to 1,000 yuan per hour.\"","Su Jun said he would ask.","He no longer felt that 1,000 yuan per hour was too much.","Only after teaching He Lingfeng did he realize how difficult it was to earn that money.","The next day, he approached his senior.","Coincidentally, his senior had just won a national math competition.","With training over, he had free time. The offer of 1,000 yuan per hour was quite attractive, so he agreed.","Su Jun repeatedly assured him that this student was not a slow learner and recounted He Lingfeng's terrifying learning ability.","The senior said he understood.","Su Jun felt relieved, though bittersweet and pensive.","Su Jun, once praised as a gifted child, had finally experienced being overshadowed by a student.","For the first time, he felt chased by his own student.","He constantly felt like he was falling behind, and the prospect of not teaching was actually quite relieving.","But he also missed the delicious food there. Oh, a mix of joy and sorrow.","Su Jun deeply remembered Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He had always heard others talk about geniuses, but only after encountering one did he realize how formidable they could be.","What is a genius? Someone who doesn't need to be taught, just given a slight nudge, and they understand everything clearly.","He finally understood those who scored well enough to attend prestigious universities like Peking or Tsinghua, only to drop out after a year because they couldn't handle it. The gap between geniuses and ordinary people spanned a galaxy.","Su Jun taught He Lingfeng for half a month, while his senior, who was slightly better, taught for a month. The senior also requested to resign, saying he couldn't teach He Lingfeng anymore. Shen Wei had paid 30,000 yuan in tuition fees.","The senior tested He Lingfeng with a college entrance exam paper, and the five-year-old child scored high enough to be admitted to a top university."]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: The Group Pet of Kindergarten","paragraphs":["The rapid progress of He Lingfeng's studies was noticed by all the teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They were both astonished and delighted.","Those who had taken jobs at this kindergarten were once outstanding professionals in their respective fields. Seeing a child excel in learning brought them immense joy, more than anything else.","Doctor Lu, who was once an academic prodigy capable of gaining admission to an eight-year integrated medical program, volunteering to check the assignments of the five-year-old He Lingfeng. He was truly a gifted individual in his youth.","Ever since Su Jun resigned, He Lingfeng had been in review mode. This child had learned at an extraordinarily rapid pace previously, so Doctor Lu was concerned that he might have been merely cramming information. Now, He Lingfeng did extra practice problems and worksheets daily to solidify his knowledge.","Doctor Lu understood the importance of a solid foundation, especially for a potential genius like He Lingfeng who could go far in the future. Without a strong base, all efforts would be in vain.","Although He Lingfeng still resided at the kindergarten, he had completely transcended the scope of kindergarten education.","He had become everyone's darling, and whenever they had time, they would teach him.","Doctor Lu had recently ordered an exercise workbook online using his own funds.","Despite his young age, He Lingfeng genuinely loved learning. As soon as he began working on problems, he became fully immersed, exhibiting a state of complete absorption.","He had just finished a set of worksheets, with Doctor Lu supervising, when the educational expert Weng Lan approached them quietly and asked Doctor Lu in a low voice, \"How long has this child been writing?\"","Doctor Lu replied, \"He has been writing for over an hour.\"","Seeing He Lingfeng complete a page, Weng Lan gently said to him, \"Good boy, go rest and play for a while. Otherwise, your eyes won't be able to take it!\"","He Lingfeng looked up and said in his soft, childlike voice, \"Teacher Weng, but I want to keep writing for a bit longer!\" At only five years old, his voice was so endearing that it was difficult to refuse him.","However, Weng Lan insisted, \"Good boy, go out and run around or jump rope for a while. Learning isn't achieved overnight!\"","He Lingfeng let out an \"Oh\" and reluctantly closed his workbook, discouraged at having his studies interrupted. He carefully picked up his jump rope and went outside.","Other children were naturally active, but he preferred working on problems.","This was no ordinary child; even adults lacked such concentration.","Weng Lan couldn't help but remark, \"I initially thought he had suffered some psychological trauma, but I never expected him to be a little genius. No wonder he couldn't play with the other children.\"","As an educator and researcher, she had never encountered such a case before, and it was worthy of writing a research paper on.","Doctor Lu flipped through He Lingfeng's worksheets. Although the handwriting was still childlike, it was evident that the little one had written diligently, carefully forming each stroke. Moreover, all the answers were correct.","Doctor Lu was deeply impressed. Despite having seen many children in his clinic before, he had never encountered such a prodigy.","For someone with such a gift to come from that kind of family background, it was fortunate that Shen Wei had discovered him in time. Otherwise, this talent would have been wasted.","Doctor Lu joked, \"This is a high school sophomore-level math worksheet, and he got a perfect score. If high school students knew it was done by a five-year-old, wouldn't they be deeply shaken?\"","As they were talking, Liu Chef came over carrying a lunchbox and peeked into the classroom, saying, \"Oh, it's just you two.\"","Doctor Lu and Weng Lan immediately stood up and greeted him, \"Why have you come here?\"","Liu Chef replied, \"That child studies so hard, I made some delicious food for him.\"","In this day and age, everyone understood the importance of education!","In reality, whenever a family had a child who excelled in academics, neighbors would shower endless praise upon that child.","Liu Chef didn't have such an outstanding student in his own family, but seeing He Lingfeng as a promising seedling, he doted on him as if he were his own child.","He was afraid that He Lingfeng's nutrition might not be sufficient.","Especially when the child first arrived, he was as thin as a little chick. Having previously suffered from malnutrition, Liu Chef tried various ways to supplement his diet.","While he couldn't help in other areas, he was determined to take charge of providing nutritional support.","Thus, he voluntarily took on the responsibility of supplementing He Lingfeng's nutrition.","When Doctor Lu heard that Liu Chef had prepared a special meal for He Lingfeng, he couldn't help but ask, \"What did you make?\"","\"Pork brain stewed with wild ginseng. This dish is highly nourishing. You wouldn't know, but I had a friend specially procure this wild ginseng from its place of origin. It's amazing!\" Liu Chef explained.","Even Doctor Lu was taken aback, as this dish was typically used to nourish adults rather than children.","Liu Chef continued, \"But don't worry, the dosage is not high. The portions for children are different from adults. By the way, Doctor Lu, weren't you a doctor before? Do you have any good recipes to share with me? I'll follow them next time. Shen Wei has allocated a separate food budget for He Lingfeng, so his nutrition needs are of utmost importance.\"","Liu Chef's demeanor showed that he took this matter very seriously.","Doctor Lu felt a bit awkward and said, \"Let me look into it further.\"","His medical training was in Western medicine, so he wasn't very familiar with nutrition science. Now that he had ample free time, having voluntarily taken on the role of a security guard at the kindergarten, he could explore this area.","Doctor Lu added, \"Perhaps I should get a certification in nutrition.\"","Such certifications were once popular but later lost their value due to unscrupulous training providers. However, Doctor Lu wasn't interested for career purposes but rather to genuinely learn and help the malnourished children at the kindergarten.","Weng Lan immediately responded, \"Let me know when you sign up. I'll join you!\"","After a while, they saw He Lingfeng return, sweating and with flushed cheeks from the exercise.","Upon seeing him, Liu Chef exclaimed happily, \"That's right, children should exercise often. Grandpa Liu has made some delicious food for you. Come and eat.\"","From a young age, He Lingfeng had lived in a hostile environment, so he was very sensitive. Here, he could truly feel everyone's deep affection.","The little one's face turned even redder, and he grew shy, moving with an adorable clumsiness.","Liu Chef told him, \"If you ever want to eat something in the future, just let Grandpa Liu know, and I'll make it for you.\"","As a former hotel executive chef, Liu Chef would only voluntarily cook for these few children at the kindergarten, an honor he bestowed upon no one else.","He Lingfeng said, \"Thank you, Grandpa Liu. I love the food you make!\"","\"As long as you enjoy it...\" Liu Chef smiled, his face creasing with wrinkles.","When he first came here to cook for the children, he felt that it was a waste of his culinary skills he had honed over the years.","But now, his mindset had completely transformed. Seeing the children's delight in his food filled him with immense satisfaction.","What more could one hope for in life than happiness?","He looked forward to going to work every day, humming tunes, even catching the attention of his wife.","At his previous workplace, he had to deal with constant scheming and infighting. Here, things were simple, with the lively and innocent children, a vegetable garden, and a fulfilling job. Liu Chef couldn't ask for more!","When Shen Wei arrived, everyone surrounded He Lingfeng, chatting with him.","But as soon as He Lingfeng saw Shen Wei, he expressed his desire to study.","Shen Wei patted his head and let him go inside.","The others praised He Lingfeng enthusiastically.","\"I've never seen such a smart child before.\"","\"This must be a genius! He's even more remarkable than the child prodigies I've seen on TV!\"","Shen Wei advised everyone, \"Let's not discuss He Lingfeng's situation online to avoid upsetting his parents.\"","Everyone immediately agreed, \"Yes, yes, it's all destiny. Since he's come to our kindergarten, we must take good care of him. His healthy growth is paramount.\"","They quickly reached a consensus to keep this matter strictly confidential.","In recent years, the internet had become obsessed with sensationalizing child prodigies.","Once the fame of a child prodigy spread, reporters would come knocking one after another for interviews.","They would directly bring the parents and child into the realm of fame and fortune.","The child would inexplicably bear the expectations of many people.","If they didn't perform well, cold ridicule and scorn would come out.","The internet is full of spectators, people enjoy witnessing the birth of a genius, and also the downfall of one.","He Lingfeng's childhood was already not good.","If reporters were to dig up more about him, it would be unimaginable.","For now, everyone just wants to provide logistics support for He Lingfeng.","Doctor Lu, being a top student himself, personally selects textbooks and exercise workbooks for him, cultivating his calligraphy practice!","Weng Lan is responsible for chatting with him every day, ensuring his mental health.","As for Liu Chef, needless to say, he prepares exquisite meals every day.","The only one feeling pressured is Shen Wei.","Even Su Jun, her senior, couldn't teach him, and He Lingfeng is progressing too quickly, so she must find him a higher-level teacher, but where can she find such an advanced teacher?","Generally, those with a reputation are either out-of-town or in research institutions.","For teachers of that caliber, money alone may not be enough to attract them.","As she was worrying about this, the system's voice sounded in Shen Wei's head: \"Host, would you consider university professors?\"","Shen Wei was suddenly enlightened by the system's suggestion: \"That's right, universities have many outstanding teachers!\" Especially her alma mater.","Although her school was a third-tier university, it was an experimental joint-venture institution at the time, modeled after prestigious international universities.","It was an ambitious attempt to break the monopoly of public schools by establishing private schools.","However, the student quality was truly not as expected.","And with its short history, it eventually failed.","But even a skinny camel is bigger than a horse - those who could become lecturers at their university were no ordinary people.","Moreover, third-tier universities are quite relaxed. Outsiders could sneak in to teach classes, and as the daughter of a board member, she had even more convenient access.","She had originally planned to spend a large sum of money, but now she wouldn't need to spend a penny to find top-notch teachers.","Shen Wei was immediately excited.","She obtained a student ID card from her father, granting her access to the campus.","From then on, not only could she study, but she could also use the meal card and visit the library."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Professor Liu Fights Children","paragraphs":["At the university advanced calculus class, Professor Liu was passionately lecturing.","However, the classroom atmosphere was poor. Some students were dozing off, others were playing on their phones, and still others were engrossed in conversation.","They thought the professor at the podium couldn't see them.","Professor Liu felt an indescribable pain in his heart. He was born in the 1950s and was nearing 70 years old this year. He was a re-hired retiree.","His students, when compared individually, were more accomplished than him. The most brilliant ones had even become academicians.","Some had even led major national research projects.","Yet after nurturing so many outstanding disciples, he now found himself teaching at a Third-tier University.","The old man wasn't short on money!","Initially, he was tricked by the president of the Third-tier University, who said these students lacked educational resources and hoped he could give the underachievers an opportunity.","And so, the old man came.","But after arriving, he realized these kids had given up on themselves.","Their grades were already lagging, and by not putting in effort, they were essentially deteriorating.","When students give up, no matter how hard the teacher tries, they can't be saved.","The girls were secretly applying makeup during class. The boys were playing games.","Could things really continue like this?","Professor Liu was truly angered.","He had come from an impoverished era and knew how fortunate it was to be able to study.","Moreover, the tuition at a Third-tier University was not cheap.","To make it in life, they needed to work harder than others.","But these students were letting him down.","Professor Liu was truly furious! He slammed his lecture notes down on the podium with a bang. In the large tiered classroom, where there had been some scattered noises, silence fell instantly.","Professor Liu said, \"You came here to study. If you don't want to study, leave immediately. All daily attendance will be marked as zero.\"","\"Your families sent you here to learn, so you should conduct yourselves like students. Look at how you're behaving.\"","\"University students used to be the pillars of the nation, serving the people. But can you be called pillars in your current state?\"","\"I don't even care to comment on each of you. If you can study, then study. If you can't, then leave. Don't occupy good seats here.\"","\"From now on, I'll take attendance again. Anyone not present today will be marked as failing the course.\"","The students present inwardly groaned.","They hurriedly messaged those who were absent: \"Hurry, hurry, Professor Liu is angry.\"","The advanced calculus final exam had lax proctoring, to the point where cheating was possible.","But most students didn't even know whose work to cheat from because they didn't understand the material.","Failing the course would be disastrous.","While Professor Liu was venting his anger, the students trickled in one by one.","For the next hour, everyone listened to the lecture.","But in each person's eyes shone a clear expression of stupidity, conveying, \"I'm listening to you lecture, but I don't understand.\"","Their main purpose was to show respect and be present.","Witnessing this gave Professor Liu a headache.","He had never taught such poor students before. It felt like he wasn't lecturing to students but rather talking to a herd of cattle.","After class, the office staff heard that Professor Liu had lost his temper that day and quickly advised him, \"Professor Liu, you need to take care of your own health. These students have already given up on themselves. Don't get so angry over them.\"","He also had some inexplicable perseverance that didn't fit in at a Third-tier University.","He understood this reasoning - he had been a teacher for 50 years.","But the older he got, the more stubborn he became, muttering, \"I don't believe it. Out of so many people, there can't be not a single one interested in mathematics. Mathematics is such a fascinating subject.\"","The other teachers didn't dare advise him further.","But after they left, Professor Liu took out all his heart medication and swallowed two pills.","For the second class, Professor Liu carefully prepared again and brought a water cup to the large classroom.","This time, the tiered classroom had even more people. Everyone was afraid of angering Professor Liu and ending up failing his course.","But this time, the attendees were different. In the front row, there were two new faces - Shen Wei and a 5-year-old boy named He Lingfeng.","A child attending a university lecture,","and sitting in the front row!","Several girls wanted to sneak photos because they thought it was so adorable.","He Lingfeng was a good-looking boy. Previously thin, but thanks to the efforts of Shen Wei and the staff at his kindergarten, his cheeks had filled out, making him look chubby and cute!","The Third-tier University didn't prohibit outsiders from auditing classes.","But usually, outsiders audited classes like outdoor volleyball or film appreciation,","not advanced calculus! The university students looked on in admiration.","Even before the professor arrived, the classroom was buzzing with excitement over the child's presence, only gradually subsiding when Professor Liu entered.","But someone had already posted about it on the campus forum, saying a child had come to attend Professor Liu's class. Other absent students left comments in mock mourning.","\"To think of attending Professor Liu's class at such a young age.\"","\"Professor Liu's temper has been flaring up lately. What if the child cries, and he gets angry at the kid?\"","\"Why would a child come? I heard some graduate students bring their pregnant bellies and babies to class.\"","\"Impossible, the one who brought the child is the campus belle, Shen Wei!\"","Shen Wei had just graduated. Over the four years of university, everyone had witnessed that there was no way she could have had a child.","In the end, the consensus was that it was probably a relative's child with no one to look after them, so they just brought the kid to class.","The post quickly garnered over 2,000 replies as people camped out to see whether the child or Professor Liu would crack first.","Some even started a poll, causing the otherwise ordinary post to become a minor sensation.","At this moment, the two at the center of the topic were completely unaware of the small frenzy they had caused on the campus forum.","Professor Liu had never taught such a young child before and couldn't help but glance at them a few times.","Although He Lingfeng didn't attend many classes, he knew to respect the teacher. Whenever Professor Liu's gaze fell on him, he would straighten up, looking every bit the studious child - unaware that he was melting the hearts of many older students.","Professor Liu must have been thinking something, as he didn't dismiss the two of them. Instead, he began lecturing properly.","He taught various formulas, theories, and problem-solving approaches.","Most people found this part rather dry and boring. Although everyone was present, their minds soon wandered - some played on their phones, others napped at their desks.","They say sleeping in math class is more restful than other classes.","As long as you don't snore and disturb others, it's fine.","As Professor Liu lectured, he realized no one was listening.","In the 120-seat tiered classroom, nearly every seat was occupied.","But everyone was busy with their own affairs.","Professor Liu paused, wanting to get angry, but he noticed someone was actually listening to his lecture - the 5-year-old child, whose gaze was intently following his thought process.","Professor Liu had stopped lecturing, but the others hadn't noticed, continuing to sleep, play, or do their own thing.","Professor Liu continued and started explaining the problem again.","Professor Liu's lectures were quite good, to be fair.","He explained in-depth yet straightforwardly, seamlessly integrating various previously learned concepts.","Although he taught university-level mathematics, he intentionally incorporated many high school-level concepts, explaining them in a more accessible way to help students better understand.","However, he hadn't expected his efforts to be in vain.","But regardless, he was a teacher. As long as he stood at the podium, he had to do justice to those seated below.","By breaking it down and explaining in such detail, it was extremely helpful for He Lingfeng.","It was a period of rapid knowledge acquisition for him. Suddenly, he found himself understanding what the teacher was lecturing, and his enthusiasm immediately soared. The state of mind between those who studied and those who didn't was vastly different.","Professor Liu suddenly felt a bit amused.","The only one who seemed to be listening attentively to his lecture was that 5-year-old child.","He chuckled with a tinge of curiosity, wondering if the child could truly comprehend his words.","Regardless, this child was a very well-behaved one.","He couldn't help but want to know how much the child had absorbed, so he promptly called upon the child and asked what he had just lectured about.","In truth, he just wanted to know if the child, who appeared attentive, had actually been listening intently.","He did not expect an actual answer.","Upon hearing the professor call upon the child, the others in attendance immediately perked up.","There were even mischievous individuals who posted the occurrence on the campus discussion board, with the caption: \"Here it comes, Old Liu is about to battle it out with a kid.\"","The students, though struggling with their studies, were never too dull for some juicy gossip.","He Lingfeng stood up, repeated Professor Liu's question, and then used his childlike language to give his answer.","Professor Liu initially nodded and smiled, but after hearing the child's response, he furrowed his brow. How could this be? The child had given the correct answer, which he hadn't even lectured on yet."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: The Civilized Man's Way","paragraphs":["This must be fake!","Even Professor Liu was somewhat dazed, and then asked the child in detail about his thought process for solving the problem.","He Lingfeng felt a bit nervous, especially when he stood up and all eyes were on him.","This added to his nervousness.","But he saw Shen Wei's encouraging gaze, which gave him motivation.","He Lingfeng spoke in a childish voice, explaining his thought process for solving the problem.","As Professor Liu listened, his eyes grew brighter.","\"Sit down.\"","It was truly as he had wished, to have someone attending his class, and at such a young age.","He Lingfeng's small display of ability instantly dispelled Professor Liu's gloom.","Soon, the dismissal bell rang, and everyone looked at each other in bewilderment.","Those present didn't know if the child's answer was right or wrong, as Professor Liu didn't give him a hard time. They hurriedly posted about it online.","But after class, Professor Liu called He Lingfeng and Shen Wei into his office.","He was solely curious about the child: \"How old are you this year?\"","\"I'm 5 years old.\"","\"Have you studied math before?\"","The child nodded.","Professor Liu asked, \"Do you like math?\"","The child's eyes lit up as he nodded, and then Professor Liu gave him a problem.","It was a junior high school math problem, but the child solved it smoothly, writing the steps clearly.","Professor Liu was astonished.","If he hadn't seen the child do it with his own eyes, he would have thought he was seeing things.","Then he posed a more difficult problem, covering high school knowledge, and the child wrote the correct steps again, leaving Professor Liu even more amazed!","Shen Wei said from the side, \"He's just interested in math. So I brought him to attend your lecture. I hope I didn't disturb you.\"","Then she showed Professor Liu her student ID.","Professor Liu looked at the child's eyes, shining brightly, and said, \"Good, you can come to all my classes from now on.\"","\"Really? Thank you, Grandpa,\" the child said sweetly.","Professor Liu said, \"Study hard. If those older students can't keep up with you, let's see if they're embarrassed!\"","He suddenly found motivation to keep teaching.","A 5-year-old prodigy!","Studying math well is nurturing talent for the nation.","He Lingfeng had gained Professor Liu's favor.","Shen Wei was also delighted, as she could have a professor-level teacher teaching He Lingfeng for free.","What made her even happier was the computer voice from the system constantly ringing.","\"Congratulations, He Lingfeng has reached the knowledge level of first grade in elementary school. Reward: 10,000 points, 1 million yuan, 5 pounds of beef, 10 pounds of vegetables, 50 grams of pineapple seeds.\"","\"Congratulations, He Lingfeng has reached the knowledge level of second grade in elementary school. Reward: ...\"","The system gave huge stage-based rewards, from first grade all the way to senior year of high school.","Just in points, it rewarded 120,000, with 1.2 million yuan in cash rewards, and 12 times the amount of beef and vegetables.","In other words, He Lingfeng was a potential asset, and as long as he made progress, the system would reward Shen Wei.","Shen Wei felt like the child she had adopted was taking off!","With He Lingfeng's efforts, plus the Starry Sky Kindergarten already taking shape, Shen Wei now had an astonishing 320,000 points in contributions and points!","Just 180,000 more points and she could unlock the mall.","The system said there would be even better things then.","Shen Wei excitedly pulled He Lingfeng over and kissed his cheek. She saw the child's face instantly turn red. \"Sister.\"","He Lingfeng was an adorable little handsome boy.","He was truly too lovable!","Shen Wei had intended to give the child just one kiss, but his skin was so soft like jelly that she couldn't help but kiss him several more times, making his cheeks even redder. Only then did she stop!","Shen Wei took him to the cafeteria for a meal. As someone who had been through hard times, no matter how bad the cafeteria food tasted, he would clean his plate.","But after spending time with Shen Wei, he would occasionally express his opinion: \"It's not as delicious as what Grandfather Liu makes!\"","Shen Wei laughed, \"Tell that to Grandfather Liu, and he'll be delighted!\"","The chef Liu really adored He Lingfeng.","He Lingfeng said, \"Okay, I'll definitely tell Grandfather Liu next time.\"","After they finished eating, they copied a course schedule, agreeing to bring him to any of Professor Liu's classes.","Shen Wei also wanted to take the child to explore the beautiful campus further.","Although the third-tier university lacked student resources compared to other universities,","it wasn't short on money.","The campus was exquisitely developed.","As the two of them were strolling around, the system suddenly issued an alert telling Shen Wei to hurry back, as the Starry Sky Kindergarten was under attack!","Hearing this, Shen Wei wasted no time, quickly taking a taxi with the child to head back.","As soon as they returned, they saw a middle-aged woman wearing 8cm high rain boots, cursing loudly at the entrance of the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This woman looked rather attractive, but there was something about her that gave off an unpleasant vibe, like she wasn't a good person.","At that moment, the middle-aged woman was berating Teacher Tang with harsh words: \"You vixen, who did you seduce? Was it your lover who opened this Starry Sky Kindergarten?\"","\"No wonder you were so halfhearted when you worked at our kindergarten, you had already found your next place!\" She spoke with a strange, menacing tone.","Teacher Tang's face flushed red. \"Don't just spew insults like that.\"","Having been a kindergarten teacher for so many years, Teacher Tang naturally exuded a kind of warmth.","As a teacher dealing with children, she never used foul language, so even when insulted, she could only tell the other person to be quiet!","The other kindergarten staff wanted to help, but they were all civilized people.","Today, they were confronted by an unruly woman, a female colleague no less, leaving them at a loss.","This middle-aged woman was like a rolling blade of meat, and seeing Teacher Tang's reaction only inflamed her arrogance further.","\"What did I think this was? Just some trashy kindergarten. No wonder you can't make any money. You even dared to sue me! Fine, I'll make sure you don't get a single cent. I have connections above!\"","\"Recruiting with just a 260 yuan tuition fee, attracting a bunch of poor people. What good is that?\"","Although she said that, the 260 yuan tuition had still dealt a significant blow to her own kindergarten.","Previously, they charged 2,800 to 3,500 yuan in tuition. Many people had enrolled, but now many were starting to wait and see.","This was affecting her income stream, making the middle-aged woman increasingly angry. She went over directly, knowing full well Teacher Tang's gentle nature and that she wouldn't fight back.","Shen Wei was furious. \"This is no place for you to throw a tantrum. If you keep this up, I'll call the police. Teacher Tang has already settled the lawsuit with you. Continuing to insult her is defamation of character.\"","But foul-mouthed shrews were always ready to kick up a fuss, not caring about things like character.","Without warning, little Ning Fubao ran out, just a baby himself, but still trying to support Teacher Tang in his own way: \"Teacher Tang isn't what you say she is.\" Then he cried piteously.","Teacher Tang felt a pang of sympathy and hugged Fubao, the poor child's crying growing hoarse.","This further emboldened the shrew. Just then, a bucket of slop water was dumped on her from above, a mix of rotten eggs, vegetable leaves, and greasy dishwater, sticky and foul.","The one who poured it was He Lingfeng.","He pulled Ning Fubao aside and said, \"Don't cry anymore, we have to fight back!\"","He had been skipping rope and such recently, going from a weakling to a sturdy child, so dumping a bucket of water was no problem!","The situation had been too chaotic, and Shen Wei was so busy arguing with the shrew that she hadn't noticed He Lingfeng at all.","But she had to admit, that bucket of water really packed a punch.","The shrew was completely stunned.","At that moment, Doctor Lu said, \"I've recorded the threatening words you just said. You'll be paying compensation for sure when we go to arbitration.\" Civilized people have civilized methods.","The shrewish woman claimed not to care, but in truth, she had never been to the arbitration bureau.","Legal matters can't be taken lightly. She even wanted to throw a tantrum and roll around on the ground.","Hearing He Lingfeng's words, Ning Fubao immediately wanted to go with the little kid to get some dishwater.","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh through her tears. He Lingfeng was indeed true to his villainous role.","Although he was still a child, his villainous character was already showing. He never let himself be bullied and had strong persuasive powers, even leading the obedient Ning Fubao astray.","The shrewish woman didn't want to be doused with another basin of water.","If it were an adult doing it, she could still try to extort money, but now she just felt too ashamed to show her face, with her makeup smeared all over.","Although there weren't many people around, she could feel everyone staring.","She had never been so humiliated before.","The shrewish woman left with a cold warning, \"You'll all be sorry!\" before slinking away.","Everyone went to console Teacher Tang, \"Don't mind what that beast said.\"","Teacher Tang's eyes were red-rimmed as she thanked her colleagues.","But Shen Wei was thinking about something else.","The gatekeeper had to get back to his post right away, there was no time to waste.","It seemed that the atmosphere at Starry Sky Kindergarten had recently taken a turn for the worse, stirring up trouble for some people. She had to take preventive measures."]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: The Lame Soldier","paragraphs":["In a cramped and dim room, a lame man named Li Yi sat hunched over at a table, with his empty pant leg dangling. His wooden prosthetic leg lay nearby.","The prosthetic leg was old and worn; it should have been replaced long ago. With advancements in medical technology, prosthetics can now utilize biomimetic principles. With enough money, prosthetics can take on various forms and offer improved comfort for the wearer.","But the wooden prosthetic clearly lacked any comfort.","In the courtyard, a family was embroiled in an argument. Li Yi could hear his sister-in-law shouting, \"Li the Second, listen to me. If you keep supporting that useless burden, I'll divorce you.\"","\"But what can I do? He's my brother,\" came the reply.","Their parents chimed in, \"Oh, come on, you're family. No need to make such a fuss.\"","\"I used to let it slide, but it's been so many years now. If we keep supporting him, will our son and daughter have to support this burden too? We're better off getting divorced than being weighed down like this.\" The sister-in-law's voice was shrill.","Everyone joined in the cacophony, a cheap double act.","Their voices carried loudly into the room, meant for Li Yi to hear.","Li Yi, now 40 years old, wore a slight mocking smile. So now they're starting to resent him for being disabled?","Before his discharge, he had been a warrior among soldiers.","A later accident led to his discharge.","But the accident resulted in compensation from his unit of over 500,000 yuan.","Combined with his years of retirement pay, he had over 1 million yuan.","Enough to cover his medical expenses.","But back then, his parents had pressured him to use the money to help his younger brother get married.","They then gradually swindled the money away with various sob stories.","Now Li Yi had no money left, receiving only a few hundred yuan in monthly assistance. And the family started finding ways to resent him!","Before, they did it discreetly. Now, they were bringing it out into the open.","His parents didn't intervene.","His brother's words sounded good, but without his consent, how could this matter be so openly raised?","In truth, they were all using this to pressure Li Yi to leave the family.","The world is callous, human sentiments are fickle.","These were his own parents and brother.","When he was strong and able, they took pride in him. Now everything had changed.","Parents and siblings are equally opportunistic.","This was the home he had lived in for over 40 years, yet each of them wanted to drive him out.","Although disabled and aged, he still had his pride.","He strapped on his uncomfortable wooden prosthetic leg and hobbled out the door.","The courtyard erupted in argument, but everyone fell silent when they saw him.","Li Yi declared, \"I'll leave. From now on, you can act like you never had this older brother, this son.\"","Their previous bickering had deeply hurt him.","The more than 1 million yuan he had earned with his life was meant to repay his parents' kindness.","It had severed his bonds of brotherhood with his parents and siblings in this life.","Still, he had repaid his debt to his motherland and family!","His brother and parents had forced this confrontation, compelling the eldest son to take a stand.","But now that he had, they felt uneasy. His father said, \"What kind of talk is that? How can your brother show his face in public after this?\"","Li Yi scoffed at his father. \"A few words from me, and he can't take it? Fine, then I'll take back what I said, and we'll all go back to how things were!\" He turned to go back inside.","His father sputtered, flustered. \"You're talking back to me now?\"","\"Nothing, I'm just telling you that from now on, I'm not your son.\"","His younger brother had always felt superior, but for a moment, he felt a twinge of panic, as if his beloved older brother might truly disappear!","At that point, his sister-in-law spoke up again. \"Oh, so you really mean what you say? Just don't come crawling back to us for support later on.\"","Li Yi was truly angered now. \"Enough! I mean what I say. From now on, my parents are your responsibility too. Don't ever come looking for me again.\"","\"Why would we look for you? You can't even support yourself. Fine, since you've decided to leave, we'll hold you to it. After all, you lost your leg for the country, so the country will surely support us without your help!\" The sister-in-law was relentless.","Then she added, \"Since you've decided to go, we'd like to keep this room for Little Wei.\" Little Wei was their son's name.","They treated their dilapidated house like a treasure, afraid he would occupy it.","Li Yi's heart sank further. \"Don't worry, I won't take up even an inch of your space. Since everything is over, write me a deed of separation, and I'll leave immediately.\"","The sister-in-law urged from the side, \"Write it for him.\"","Afraid to miss this opportunity. They then wrote the deed of separation, each putting their handprint on it, even calling in witnesses!","The old neighbors outside sighed, \"It's all about money.\"","Some even blamed Li Yi's father. \"You're truly foolish, treating your accomplished eldest son so heartlessly, while indulging your unfilial younger son. Aren't you afraid of karmic retribution?\"","People in this urban village spoke bluntly.","Li Yi's father turned pale. \"This is a family matter. No need for you to concern yourself.\"","He had known his eldest son was impressive, but now he was down on his luck, wasn't he?","Just over 40 years old, unable to work or earn money, living off the family's support day after day - who could tolerate that?","Moreover, they had received news that in a few years, the houses in this area would be demolished for redevelopment, potentially netting them 1.8 million yuan. With one less person, they could all get a larger share.","So, with the village chief as witness, they formalized the deed of separation. Li Yi turned to leave.","Even the village chief felt uncomfortable witnessing this. \"Where will you go? If you have nowhere, stay at my place for a few days.\"","Li Yi replied, \"If my own parents can't keep me, then I won't stay here any longer.\"","No one said anything more.","At that moment, Li Yi received a call. His cheap old flip phone couldn't even run WeChat.","A durable, inexpensive phone.","Most importantly, it had a loud speaker. Even the old village men had stopped using such phones.","But Li Yi still used one, a sign of his difficult circumstances in recent years, having not spent a single cent of the money he had risked his life to earn.","The reasonable people in the village felt angry on his behalf.","But he didn't care.","Li Yi answered the call.","The voice on the other end said, \"Hello, this is Starry Sky Kindergarten. Can you come work for us as soon as possible? We'll provide room and board, and pay you 20,000 yuan per month. What do you think?\" The speaker was Shen Wei.","Ever since that shrewish woman had caused a scene, Shen Wei had been eager to find someone suitable. The System had recommended Li Yi.","Although he had lost a leg, as a former warrior, his combat prowess was likely unmatched by 10 ordinary men.","Shen Wei needed someone who appeared ordinary but was truly formidable. Money was no object, so she offered the highest possible salary!","The System had already called Li Yi once before, and he had agreed, just not for the current date.","But with Shen Wei's urgent request, and his current family situation, Li Yi immediately replied, \"Okay. I'll be there soon.\"","After hanging up, everyone looked at him differently.","In this urban village, life was quite difficult.","With the prospect of redevelopment dangling before them like a carrot, in reality, these people couldn't even earn 2,000 yuan a month working outside.","Hearing that Li Yi could earn 20,000 yuan a month at a kindergarten, their eyes lit up with envy.","Afterwards, Li Yi's relatives also looked at him with strange expressions.","Li Yi's younger brother reacted strongly: \"Brother, what's going on? You've never mentioned this before.\"","Li Yi said indifferently: \"Let me tell you, you've taken even this little money!\"","His younger brother's face alternated between red and white.","His sister-in-law mocked him from the side: \"As if you could earn 20,000. Even people who work on their feet don't necessarily earn that much, so you can just brag.\"","Li Yi said: \"Whether I earn 20,000 a month or not has nothing to do with you. Just keep dreaming your big beautiful dream about that house of yours!\"","Others didn't know, but Li Yi had some incredibly capable war buddies.","These buddies knew he lived here, and they had specifically told him inside information. The subway line was being rerouted, so there was no way this area could be demolished for redevelopment.","The fairy tale of getting rich overnight through demolition and redevelopment only existed in the past.","Those people clinging to the dream of redevelopment, driving him out, would regret it sooner or later."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: The original book is a demon.","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's kindergarten, Starry Sky Kindergarten, was flourishing and thriving.","Shen Qingqing had heard about Shen Wei starting a kindergarten and almost laughed herself to death!","The two were relatives, around the same age.","Shen Qingqing felt she was better than Shen Wei, but just didn't have her family background.","Both had graduated from university, but Shen Qingqing was still job hunting. College graduates were everywhere these days, and she was just an ordinary university graduate, making it extremely difficult for her to find a job.","She paid extra attention to where Shen Wei was working.","Then she heard from relatives that Shen Wei wasn't looking for a job - she had started her own kindergarten.","At first, Shen Qingqing mocked her.","What kindergarten could someone who didn't study well open? Wouldn't that just mislead the children?","But after the mocking came envy.","It was just that Shen Wei's family was wealthy, so she could do whatever she wanted.","This was a condition many lacked.","And they had started from the same line, but Shen Wei was ahead.","How unfair was that?","Especially recently, when Shen Qingqing's parents went to visit her aunt and uncle and lavishly praised how excellent Shen Wei was.","Shen Qingqing was infuriated.","Why was Shen Wei so much better than others just because of her good family background?","People used to say Shen Wei was just lucky.","Having a wealthy dad, but now the comments gradually changed to: \"She's made it!\" Everyone's comments were positive.","Shen Qingqing felt panicked, fearing she would be crushed by Shen Wei if this continued.","Then an evil plan formed in her mind!","At 8pm in a popular livestreamer's channel with usually 300,000 concurrent viewers, where gifting 500 yuan could get you 3 minutes of voice connection.","She gifted a carnival.","Soon the streamer contacted her.","\"Hello, how can I help you?\" The streamer's voice came through as the livestream chat scrolled endlessly.","Shen Qingqing's voice came through the mic: \"There's something I don't know if I should leak, but I can't bear the guilt anymore!\"","\"I have a cousin sister who used to be a really poor student. She also disliked children, but for some reason she's now in education and around kids every day!\"","\"Honestly, I'm concerned for those children's mental health. If their parents knew what kind of person my cousin used to be, they definitely wouldn't leave their kids with her.\"","\"But I don't know how to say it, since we're relatives after all.\"","As Shen Qingqing finished, the livestream exploded. The information she leaked was too much.","Although she didn't say her sister did anything specific.","But her evasive attitude made people feel inexplicably horrified.","Could it be child abuse?","The streamer's channel was usually for emotional call-ins, this was the first time dealing with something like this.","The streamer immediately became cautious.","Child abuse and campus violence frequently trended recently.","This could be a huge trending topic.","The streamer immediately probed: \"Can you share more specific details?\"","But that one question seemed to scare the girl on voice connection, and she immediately went offline.","This made everyone in the livestream feel something was off.","What a kind girl, she must have had reservations.","Otherwise, as a relative, how could she just openly attack like that?","She must have crossed a line.","Exposing this was right - who knew what kind of people were running kindergartens? What if they were evil teachers? For the children, that would be a lifelong trauma.","Adding to that the recent horrific child abuse incidents and frequent campus violence made everyone more vigilant, and opinions flooded in.","\"It's unimaginable that someone in education could lack love for children. How can such a person be a teacher? Isn't there oversight from regulators?\"","\"The girl who leaked it was so brave, I wouldn't have the guts. She dared to make it public, hope no one tries to dig into her identity, otherwise no one will speak up about these things again.\"","\"Oh my god, I'm so worried about those kids, what exactly happened? Someone spill it quickly, I'm dying here.\"","Shen Qingqing went offline but didn't leave, listening to everyone's comments.","The streamer immediately reported it to the police.","Others started digging into Shen Qingqing's ID to find her city.","Then they began searching government registration platforms one by one to find information on the kindergarten.","Shen Qingqing had said two important things: the person in charge was young and female, running a newly opened kindergarten.","With this information, it was easy to pinpoint.","The power of netizens was immense - it took less than an hour to identify Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The initially praised 260 yuan tuition fee was now a target of criticism.","\"I checked their website, their renovations are top-notch. With such nice renovations, charging only 260 yuan for admission, there must be a sinister motive.\"","\"Oh my god, could it be using low prices to attract people, then starting horrific child abuse? After all, parents lured by low prices probably don't have much ability to fight back if something is discovered. Just thinking about it is terrifying, guys.\"","\"Isn't anyone managing this?\"","Calls were made to tag the local education bureau, business administration, tax authorities, police stations, and more.","Some even called the city's reporting hotline overnight.","Saying this incident must be investigated thoroughly, children can't fall into the hands of demons.","The incident was sudden but had a huge impact, especially occurring on such a popular livestream. Many people couldn't sleep that night.","Shen Wei had a system monitoring public opinion.","Within a short time, the system summarized all the details for Shen Wei.","Including many other kindergartens secretly trying to ride this hype.","That the leaker was Shen Qingqing, and more.","Under the system's intense scrutiny, these people had nowhere to hide.","Teacher Tang and Doctor Lu called Shen Wei overnight, wanting to come up with a solution quickly.","Once the rumor formed, it would be hard to dispel.","Shen Wei released a video response overnight: \"First, thank you to everyone for the oversight.\"","\"Our kindergarten aims to provide boutique small classes. As a new startup, our fees are low. I welcome supervision from society. If any wrongdoing occurs, I'm willing to take full responsibility.\"","The video caused ripples online, some believed it, some didn't.","But with Shen Wei's direct clarification, the previously one-sided situation started to shift slightly.","\"This is my senior from university, she was always very kind, even feeding stray cats. Definitely not like what everyone said.\"","\"Who exactly is spreading these rumors? Over 500 reposts is enough for criminal charges.\"","At this point, Shen Wei replied to this comment: \"I will sue the rumor spreader. This spread qualifies for at least 10 years in prison. Wait for the court summons.\"","Sitting by her computer and watching, Shen Qingqing didn't expect that not only would Shen Wei's kindergarten not fall into her trap from the malicious attack, Shen Wei would use legal means to protect herself.","And even threaten to sue, it made Shen Qingqing panic suddenly."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Things Keep Brewing","paragraphs":["This incident continued to ferment online, showing signs of escalating further.","Netizens had all sorts of opinions on the matter.","\"What exactly is going on here? Can anyone sensible explain this to me?\"","\"Oh my, I'm a parent, and I can't imagine if my child was subjected to violence at school. How awful that would be!\"","\"I used to watch foreign films of this type, but couldn't bear to finish them. Please investigate this quickly.\"","\"There's no smoke without fire. If someone is saying this, then there must be some truth to it.\"","\"Yes, and she's even a relative, so she must know some inside details that we don't. Don't be afraid, young lady. If anything happens, we'll all protect you.\"","\"These wealthy people are the best at putting up false fronts. Who knows what crooked schemes they're hatching behind the scenes?\"","\"The more I think about it, the 260 yuan fee seems like it could be a lure.\"","\"For such a great school, how could it be just 260 yuan? That wouldn't even cover the costs.\"","\"This can't be some kind of playground for the rich, can it? Do you remember that orphanage incident from before where they selected pretty young boys and girls...\"","The whole night saw discussions escalating further and further.","Even short video sites had repeatedly tried to lower the heat on this issue, but the discussions still shot to the top of their trending lists.","The next day, many staff members at Starry Sky Kindergarten arrived before dawn.","Doctor Lu, Weng Lan, and others had dark circles under their eyes from a sleepless night.","Liu Master Chef doesn't go online much, but he heard about this incident after arriving and was absolutely furious!","\"It's nothing like what they're saying at all. How can doing good deeds still lead to misunderstandings these days?\"","Others might not know, but he knew exactly what ingredients went into the meals every day and what nutritional standards were followed.","All the fruits were imported, and he went over the order lists daily.","You could say the freshness of the ingredients here surpassed even the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant!","It really was a case of making a mountain out of a molehill.","Not to mention, just look at the children's condition - where do they seem abused or oppressed?","Liu Master Chef was indignant: \"What do they know? They're just talking nonsense. Doctor Lu, you're the most educated person here. You can't let them spread rumors!\"","Doctor Lu sighed: \"There are people online stirring up trouble and muddying the waters. Yesterday we kept explaining, but no one was listening.\"","\"Some people don't want to know the truth. They only believe what they want to believe.\"","\"Our 260 yuan tuition fee has already upset many people, especially our competitors!\" Weng Lan added.","Those competitors were just looking for an opportunity to cause trouble, and now this incident has them overjoyed!","Doctor Lu said: \"Yesterday I asked a friend who works at a video site, and he said this video had many people boosting its heat, investing anywhere from 1,000 to tens of thousands of yuan.\"","\"So they came prepared, huh? What do we do now?\" Liu Master Chef was incensed.","The drivers like Zhang Daming and others looked worried too.","They were just ordinary employees, having never faced such an onslaught before.","In this Internet age, many things are hard to understand, but everyone knew how terrifying the negative energy from public opinion could be.","Liu Master Chef felt especially disheartened: \"Isn't this a case of no good deed going unpunished?\"","If even a hardworking employee like himself felt hurt hearing such accusations, it was no wonder Shen Wei felt even worse.","She was just a young entrepreneur, so this must be really upsetting for her.","Teacher Tang came early today too, hoping to work out a counterstrategy with everyone.","They couldn't just stand by and let others slander them, after all.","Even before work hours began, everyone had serious expressions: \"Stay calm. Isn't this exactly what they want - for us to lose our composure? Let's just keep working diligently.\"","\"Right, as long as the officials present their investigation findings, that will speak louder than any explanation.\"","After a brief analysis, everyone went about their tasks. It seemed they had a tough battle ahead of them today.","Teacher Tang went to find Doctor Lu and Weng Lan, both being relatively younger and more knowledgeable about online media matters, hoping to help share Shen Wei's burden.","Having found such a great job, he was determined to work twice as hard to prevent this company from failing.","Shen Wei also arrived early.","Seeing everyone's obvious dark circles, she said: \"I know who's behind this incident. Everyone should just carry on with their duties. There may be inspectors coming soon.\"","After such a huge incident, the authorities were bound to respond.","No sooner had she finished speaking than several law enforcement vehicles pulled up outside.","Many people in uniform with body cameras arrived, representing multiple agencies and even some reporters.","Outside the Starry Sky Kindergarten gate, there were also some influencers live streaming with their equipment.","This was currently the biggest issue online, so whoever got first-hand footage would gain the most traffic.","Shen Wei didn't chase them away, only asking them to remain outside the gates for their live streams.","First, she let the inspection team and official media in.","This was a surprise inspection, with all the joint inspection members only being notified at the last minute late last night after the incident blew up. They arrived this morning with no chance for the kindergarten to prepare at all.","The higher-ups had issued strict orders. Since this had already caused such a huge impact online, if any violations were found, they would face severe punishment.","Everyone understood the gravity of the situation, so the inspection was extremely thorough.","But during the inspection process, they were left dumbfounded.","There were no violations whatsoever here.","The kitchen was hygienic, the offices were spacious, and there were even surveillance cameras installed.","The accounts were clean and clear, with all the paperwork properly filed by Shen Wei's team.","Not only were there no violations, but many aspects even exceeded the bureau's standards.","The fruit section of the kitchen was particularly eye-catching.","The blueberries had a thick frosting, and the grapes looked dewy and fresh.","There were indoor and outdoor children's entertainment facilities, all made from eco-friendly materials.","The cameramen were constantly looking to film something else, noticing that all the produce here was organic.","The prices for these organic vegetables were four to five times higher than regular ones since they were pesticide-free - only health-conscious households would buy them.","When the interviewer asked Shen Wei about this, she said: \"I treat this place like my own home, so I only purchase things I would eat myself.\"","The host continued: \"But why are people saying such things happened here?\"","Shen Wei replied: \"I don't know what mindset those people have for making such claims. It's easy to spread rumors, but setting the record straight is an uphill battle.\"","\"Initially setting the 260 yuan tuition was just to make it more affordable for everyone since I was just starting this kindergarten. To be honest, I'm not short on money either.\"","\"I never expected it to cause such a misunderstanding,\" Shen Wei said with a sincere gaze.","The host and cameramen, having met all kinds of people before, could tell from Shen Wei's manner of speaking that she seemed about 80% credible to them.","The cameraman inwardly mused that this kindergarten must have disrupted someone else's profits.","After multiple rounds of thorough inspections, even involving the fire department, it was clear that everything here was completely legal and compliant.","As they were leaving, one young woman from the inspection team even asked: \"Are you still enrolling students here?\"","Shen Wei replied: \"Not for now, given the current situation online that you're aware of.\"","The young woman seemed regretful, as she had a child and was looking for a kindergarten.","Now, seeing such a great kindergarten with such affordable fees, she was truly tempted.","Looking at the school buses, the faculty and staff, and the food here, everything is so good that one gets the urge to enroll their child in this place.","When Shen Wei said this, one felt a bit resentful: \"Such a great place, yet there are people badmouthing it. How unreasonable!\""]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Let the Bullets Fly","paragraphs":["There were 15 students in total at the kindergarten, including He Lingfeng.","He Lingfeng lived at the kindergarten, so the school bus driver Zhang Daming only needed to pick up and drop off 14 children every day.","But today, he only brought back 13 students.","While on the bus, Teacher Tang called Shen Wei to say that Yuan Yuan didn't come and didn't ask for leave.","This kind of thing, everyone knew in their hearts.","With so many scolding voices appearing online, there were definitely parents offline who knew about it too.","When Zhang Daming slowly drove the school bus into Starry Sky Kindergarten, he realized something was off.","Outside, there were many internet celebrities holding selfie sticks, livestreaming right at the entrance of the kindergarten.","Among those livestreaming here, the main host with the largest presence was Xu Doudou.","She had 200,000 followers online.","The others just had a few or tens of thousands of followers, completely just trying to ride the wave of popularity.","No matter if they were big or small hosts, they were happy when they saw people joining their livestream.","Host Xu Doudou was the one who secured the front spot. Her hands were steady, and the quality of her livestream was high, so many people watched hers.","Her livestream captured the clearest footage.","In the livestream chat, viewers were saying all sorts of things:","\"Today I really want to see what this is all about.\"","\"Wow, this bright yellow school bus costs over 2 million!\"","\"This one is bulletproof! The safety rating is exceptionally high.\"","\"I have to say, the financial strength of this kindergarten is quite strong.\"","The children went inside, and the inspection team came out.","Many people saw the officials and started speaking up: \"How is it in there?\"","The officials haven't issued an official statement yet, so they said they couldn't disclose anything personally, but there would be a statement later, and they hoped everyone would pay attention.","As soon as they left, others wanted to sneak in and fish in troubled waters.","But the lame security guard at the kindergarten had eyes like a hawk. He held a bamboo staff, and no matter who tried to sneak in, he would horizontally strike them with the staff.","So far, no one had successfully sneaked in.","An enraged small host who was struck yelled, \"Why won't you let me in? I'm representing the people now, I need to expose you.\"","The lame security guard Liu Yi snorted coldly, \"There are rules to follow. What if you scare the children by going in?\"","His words rang with righteous rhetoric, and others couldn't find a way to refute him, only able to sheepishly ask, \"So what's going on over there?\"","Liu Yi said, \"It's a great kindergarten!\"","He used to be a war king and had learned reconnaissance techniques. If the situation was really as described online, he could single-handedly blow the whole thing open.","But now, it was just people online smearing them with dirty water.","The small host snorted, \"This is your workplace, of course you'll say it's good!\"","Viewers in the livestream commented below, \"The host is basically speaking for me.\"","Liu Yi said, \"I used to be a soldier. I'll stake my honor that everything here is fine.\"","As soon as he said this, sharp-eyed viewers in the livestream noticed a small badge on his clothes.","\"Ah ah ah, that's the award only given to former regional war kings!\"","\"What?\"","\"...\"","Viewers instantly did a 180-degree turn: \"I believe him.\"","\"I believe him too, someone from the organization wouldn't lie to us!\"","\"I'm a military family member, I know they wouldn't just say this casually! This is staking their entire being to say this.\"","\"Maybe there was just a misunderstanding about this matter.\"","Just as the livestream chat was heating up, a sudden scream rang out: \"Teacher Tang, come out and refund me, I want my child to leave this garbage kindergarten.\"","The dozens of hosts on scene were startled, and immediately aimed their cameras precisely at the source of the sound.","A woman had appeared here, standing there and yelling for a refund.","Seeing so many phones pointed at her, she wasn't afraid at all, and instead became more energized: \"Good! If I hadn't gone online, I wouldn't have known how shady this kindergarten is!\"","\"I was wondering why my child didn't want to eat after coming home. Is it because you abused them here? Just you wait, I'll sue you.\"","She kept rattling on.","A host asked, \"Does your child study here?\"","The woman immediately put on a performance: \"Oh, I didn't know it was like this either. My mother-in-law just signed up for this school because it was cheap. If I had known it was like this, we absolutely wouldn't have come.\"","\"They said they feed the kids imported fruits and organic vegetables, how could you afford that, you must be lying!\"","The livestream chat had just believed that there were no issues with the kindergarten.","But seeing a parent of a child, they didn't leave any comments. At this point, they were truly confused about what was really going on. Concerning children, no one dared easily take sides.","\"Let the bullet fly for a bit.\"","Shen Wei came out together with Teacher Tang.","Shen Wei said, \"You're Yuan Yuan's parent, right?\"","All the hosts' cameras unanimously turned towards Shen Wei.","The livestream was briefly stunned.","They had heard before that Shen Wei was the school beauty, but didn't feel anything. But through the camera, she really was beautiful, as if a special filter was applied just for her.","Shen Wei looked more beautiful in others' livestreams than in her own clarification video.","Everyone was just eating the drama, but suddenly seeing such a beautiful girl, their hearts weren't prepared.","Even the normally constantly scrolling stream of comments froze for a moment!","Yuan Yuan's parent immediately said, \"Yes, I'm a parent. After studying here, my child doesn't even want to eat at night when they get home.\"","The students who could afford to study here generally came from well-off families. With this incident happening, quite a few people wanted to take advantage of the troubled waters.","Yuan Yuan's parent was one of them, having been bribed by Teacher Tang's former employer."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Grass Nursery","paragraphs":["\"Let her make a fuss, give her 5,000 yuan directly, let her daughter drop out of school, go to the kindergarten over there, and not spend a single penny!\"","This made Yuan Yuan's parents tempted, 5,000 yuan, enough for her to attend classes for two months.","After all, their child Yuan Yuan was just a little kid, it doesn't matter where she goes to school.","So they made a fuss.","Shen Wei said: \"I can refund you, but our kindergarten has a mutual selection process, if you withdraw, you won't be able to come back later.\"","Yuan Yuan's parent said: \"Don't worry, I definitely won't come back.\"","Shen Wei said: \"And you said your child has some problems. Now, in front of so many people, I'll go with you to the hospital and give the child a full-body check-up. If any problems are found, I'll cover the check-up fees and give the child a red envelope as a gift. But if there are no problems at all, you will have to bear all the costs. Do you accept?\"","A refund of just over 200 yuan was a small matter, but she couldn't allow these people to continue to slander them.","Yuan Yuan's parent said: \"Why should I bear the costs? It should be you who bear them, it's all because of you that the child doesn't eat.\"","Weng Lan really couldn't stand it anymore: \"The child doesn't eat, have you tried taking him to KFC for an experiment?\"","She was an education expert and often communicated with children.","Yuan Yuan had mentioned before that their family only ate once every two or three days. Towards the end, the new and old dishes were all mixed together.","The child naturally didn't like to eat.","When the viewers in the live broadcast room heard Weng Lan's words, they immediately gave her a thumbs up: \"Medical genius!\"","A hint of unnaturalness flashed across Yuan Yuan's parent's face: \"Forget it, forget it, just refund the fees. I won't come to this crappy kindergarten again in the future!\"","She wouldn't take the child for a check-up.","When she received the 280 yuan, the expression on Yuan Yuan's parent's face immediately turned into a smile.","That smug look, she couldn't hide it at all.","The viewers' eyes were wide open.","The people in the live broadcast room couldn't bear to watch anymore, this matter seemed more complicated than they had imagined.","The ones who wanted the check-up and the ones who caused the ruckus had all left.","The anchors at the door couldn't figure out what was going on. Shen Wei said, \"I can take you inside to have a look.\"","The anchors present were all pleasantly surprised.","They had previously participated in the filming of hot news topics.","They were often driven away and cursed, or had their cameras destroyed.","But they had never been given the opportunity to go inside and film before, and they felt a touch of emotion for some reason.","From the beginning, they were also suspicious, but were shocked by the open and aboveboard attitude of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","No one said a word, and they followed Shen Wei into the kindergarten.","As soon as they went in, there was a very large sports field and lawn.","It was lush and green, and they all felt like lying on it would be very comfortable.","Walking further, they reached what should be the area that all the children love the most.","A large outdoor playground, with a small train, Ferris wheel, and various inflatable castles, as well as a carousel and swing.","There were also balls of various colors.","Even the adult viewers in the live broadcast room were envious: \"I didn't have such fun things when I was little.\"","\"I can't even imagine how happy my nephew would be if he saw this.\"","\"This side is really good, the equipment is very new, and I heard they let the children play for free!\"","Upon hearing the word \"free\", the families in the live broadcast room became excited.","\"I used to take my son to the shopping mall, and the ball pool downstairs wasn't as good as this, and it was extremely expensive, with a membership card costing several thousand.\"","\"Being able to play for free here, the children must be eager to come to this kindergarten.\"","The anchors walked forward on their own, their eyes dazzled, not knowing where to point the camera.","The outdoor playground just now was already shocking enough, but they didn't expect an indoor playground as well.","The children's nap beds even had logos, and a knowledgeable parent in the live broadcast room said: \"Those are Nordic-style beds, each one costs 7,000 to 8,000 yuan.\"","The people in the live broadcast room were really shocked.","Not to mention the 260 yuan, many of them said their children's kindergartens that cost 3,000 yuan a month didn't even have such good facilities.","And everyone could see that Shen Wei had taken them there on a whim, not pre-arranged.","The children at the kindergarten were playing games under the guidance of Teacher Tang, with joyful smiles on their faces, not at all like abused and timid children.","And the children's families were generally not wealthy, their clothes looked ordinary.","But in this place, everyone was very happy, and their happy faces could not be faked.","The people in the live broadcast room were originally trying to expose a villain, but ended up being impressed by this kindergarten.","Somehow, the camera lens scanned across Doctor Lu.","\"Is that Doctor Lu? I've been looking for him for a long time, he's the doctor at the city hospital's pediatric department, and his medical skills have always been highly regarded! After that, I don't know what happened, he quit his job, and I didn't expect to see him here in the live broadcast!\"","Many people said that when Doctor Lu treated their children in the past, he was very patient and responsible, and they were grateful to him.","First, the security guard had served in the military, using his own honor as a guarantee.","And with Doctor Lu's medical ethics on display, the kindergarten they were in definitely would not be a place that abused children.","Ultimately, this was a commercial war, not an entertainment circle.","There were no online trolls or anything like that.","Suddenly, the public opinion began to turn around.","Other kindergartens secretly added fuel to the fire, but the reversal of public opinion was too fast, leaving them caught off guard.","They had spent thousands of yuan for this kind of thing.","What was going on with Starry Sky Kindergarten?","Why had they raised the standards so high?","If everyone got used to this standard, how would the other kindergartens survive? Wasn't this just causing trouble?","They originally wanted to smear the reputation of Starry Sky Kindergarten with one fell swoop.","Afraid that Starry Sky would use the 260 yuan price to sweep the market, but it seems they had the opposite effect.","Not only did they not succeed in ruining their reputation, but instead, everyone discovered the excellent teaching staff and superior environment here.","It was noon, and Shen Wei directly invited the anchors to have a taste.","These online celebrities had heard that the food here was good, but they didn't believe it.","The Jiangbei Grand Restaurant, what kind of level was that?","How could the chef come to a kindergarten?","But when they arrived at the cafeteria, they no longer said that.","The aroma was really thick.","The fruit area had fresh fruit slices, watermelon, mangosteen, pineapple, and so on.","The children finished eating first, and then they ate.","The tomato-braised beef was so beautifully colored.","Scooping a spoonful and mixing it with the rice, the sourness of the tomatoes and the softness of the beef with a hint of tendons, eating it with the rice was simply amazing.","And even the small pickles here were particularly crisp and fresh.","The stir-fried greens were refreshingly delicious.","There were also special rolled pancakes with roast duck, served with a scallion and sweet bean sauce, enhancing the flavor.","One bite and it was pure satisfaction.","It was incredibly delicious.","Actually, the temporary lunch was not that much.","Chef Liu didn't expect so many people to come, so he was afraid it wouldn't be enough, and added some noodles to the broth to supplement it.","These people ate an average of three bowls of noodles each, like they hadn't eaten in three days.","The main reason was the handmade noodles paired with the fresh and tender broth, along with the crisp and refreshing side dishes.","The braised beef was added at will, as much as they wanted.","The people present were truly impressed by this meal.","They ate so well that the people in the live broadcast room were left in awe.","\"Tantalizing to the point of death.\"","\"I just ordered a bunch of takeout!\"","\"I suggest you all start a mukbang channel. You're too talented, my boxed lunch suddenly doesn't seem appetizing anymore.\"","What these anchors ate at the kindergarten was more delicious than anything they had ever tasted before.","Looking at how quickly they cleared their plates, you can tell how delicious this dish is.","In the end, there were only a few slices of beef left, and everyone was about to start fighting over them, each person eating with great satisfaction and saying, \"This is so delicious.\"","Doctor Lu said, \"Of course, this was made by the former head chef of the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant.\"","The livestreamers all nodded in agreement.","After finishing the main dish, they moved on to eating fruit.","They all wish they could work here, and say that even just coming here for a meal is worth it. Who would have thought this Starry Sky Kindergarten is so amazing?","At such low prices, with this level of service.","Following the most common phrase used in the livestream, this is truly a welfare benefit for the family!","The people in the livestream, at first they were speaking up for justice, but later they became influencers."]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: The Old Lady","paragraphs":["The unexpected reversal at Starry Sky Kindergarten was something no one could have imagined.","Shen Wei did not forget the one who started the trouble, Shen Qingqing. She directly found a lawyer and took the fast track, first suing over the video to obtain Shen Qingqing's identity information, and immediately filed a lawsuit.","Shen Wei acted as the full authorized agent.","She did not need to go out, as the lawyer would take care of everything.","That day, Shen Qingqing received a text message notification that there was a court summons. She became afraid.","But Shen Wei's treatment of her did not stop there. Since she liked acting, Shen Wei immediately hired someone online to post threads.","Soon someone claiming to be Shen Wei's close friend spoke up.","\"I'm really fed up with this. Ever since they were young, my friend's sister has always tried to compete with my friend! It was fine when they were young, but now that my friend has opened a very successful kindergarten, she can't stand it and directly started slandering her! I'm really grateful to my buddy for bringing this wave of attention! The slanderer will definitely not have a good ending. My friend has already sued her, so let's wait and see.\"","It was originally just an ordinary rant.","But the two pieces of information involved were too crucial - one about the kindergarten, and the other about the sisters quarreling.","Netizens commented: \"Although it's not explicitly stated, I feel like I know what's going on.\"","\"I thought it was a child abuse case, but it turns out to be a green tea bitch acting. What do you take us for, monkeys for entertainment?\"","\"This kind of person deserves to have a miserable life.\"","\"When I listened to the playback earlier, I felt she was stammering, and I thought she had a guilty conscience and dared not tell the truth. Now I realize she was just crafting a persona. Stupid fool.\"","Netizens vented all their anger on Shen Qingqing.","When Shen Qingqing had previously deceived the public, she had acted so pitifully. Little did she expect the winds to turn, and now everyone's fury was focused on her.","She could not take it anymore. Her private messages were full of insults, and being called a \"green tea bitch\" was considered mild.","There were also those spouting vulgar language and all kinds of curses.","It was now a real-name system. Soon, her phone number was also exposed.","In just one afternoon, she received three or four abusive phone calls, making her anxious whenever the phone rang.","Shen Qingqing never expected things to turn out this way, and she burst into tears.","Just as she was about to fall into despair, she received a phone call: \"Hello, is this Shen Qingqing? This is the HR manager of the Lu Group. When would be a good time for you to start work?\"","The Lu Group was a listed company! She had been submitting resumes recently, and while some small companies had rejected her, she never expected to receive an offer from a major group.","Lu Qingqing was afraid the opportunity would slip away: \"I can start work immediately!\"","The HR manager said, \"No need to be so hasty. How about this – report for duty next Monday? I'll send you the offer letter later.\"","Before Lu Qingqing could finish celebrating, the HR manager pointedly commented: \"I've been trying to call you for a long time, and you kept not answering. This is the last time I'll call. If you don't answer, this job will go to someone else.\"","Shen Qingqing said with trepidation, \"You can rest assured, I will work hard!\"","After hanging up, before she could share the good news with her parents, another call came in. Lu Qingqing answered, and it was another torrent of insults: \"You wretched green tea bitch...\" Before the person could finish, she hung up, her expression terrible.","Now that Lu Qingqing had been accepted by the Lu Group, she could not behave like before! She had to resolve this embarrassing lawsuit quickly.","Even Shen Qingqing could not help choking up, as some things were truly difficult to say.","But she had no choice. If she could not say it, she still had to say it.","So she went to her parents with a dejected look.","Shen Qingqing's parents never expected their daughter to harm their niece.","And to make matters worse, it had caused a huge commotion, and now she was being sued.","They wanted to scold her, but seeing her red eyes, they held back. They only said she had brought this misfortune upon herself.","Afterwards, they took her to Shen Wei's parents' home to apologize and make amends, in the hope that they could persuade Shen Wei to withdraw the lawsuit.","The three of them visited Shen Wei's parents.","Shen Wei's parents did not know what had happened. They listened as the three of them haltingly told the story. By the end, Shen Wei's mother was quite angry.","Shen Wei's mother said angrily, \"Shen Qingqing, we have never treated you poorly all these years. We have never skimped on providing you with food, clothing, daily necessities, or New Year's money. Why would you do this to your sister?\"","\"Auntie, I really made a mistake!\" Shen Qingqing's tears streamed down. \"I was momentarily foolish.\"","Shen Qingqing's mother also said from the side, \"Sister-in-law. The child knows she was wrong. When we get home, I will definitely scold her severely. Please ask Shen Wei to withdraw the lawsuit. We are family, and it is unsightly to make such a fuss publicly.\"","Shen Wei's mother scoffed coldly, \"Now you remember we are family? What were you thinking earlier!\"","Shen Qingqing's family froze briefly, but soon put on ingratiating smiles. \"Yes, yes, we will definitely educate the child properly when we get home.\"","After much apologizing and making amends for over an hour, Shen Wei's parents finally relented, \"I can give her a call, but I can't guarantee anything.\"","They then called Shen Wei, but received the message: \"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently switched off.\"","Shen Wei's mother said, \"She has turned off her phone.\"","\"What should we do then? Let's go to the kindergarten.\"","Shen Qingqing cried, \"If they keep scolding me, I don't want to live anymore.\"","\"Sister-in-law, Qingqing is a child you watched grow up.\"","...","The things they did at the Shen family home were all written up by the ghostwriter.","After the post became popular, Shen Wei provided the ghostwriter with material from the surveillance system at the kindergarten, just briefly mentioning it.","The ghostwriter then vividly described the events."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Unlock the Points Hall","paragraphs":["The online posts are still live-streaming, describing Shen Qingqing's disheveled appearance.","Everyone is avidly watching the gossip unfold, relishing it.","Most people dislike Shen Qingqing's personality.","\"Being jealous of others is normal, but causing such a big commotion is just pure maliciousness.\"","\"I can't believe a girl in her 20s can be so cunning. It's truly terrifying!\"","There are also rumors that she was accepted by the Lu Group and is currently in the probation period.","Netizens immediately left messages on the Lu Group's official blog, called their website, urging them not to hire someone with such poor conduct.","Shen Qingqing thought that as long as Shen Wei withdrew the lawsuit, she could go work at the listed company.","After the incident blew over in a month or two, she would once again be the golden child.","But the company called her again.","Qingqing had saved the company's number from the previous call, so she immediately answered.","They are now heading to the kindergarten, with Shen Wei's parents in the car, along with the three of them.","Shen Qingqing lost face due to the lawsuit.","Now with the company calling, she immediately put the call on speaker.","She had thought it would be a call to lift her spirits. But it turned out to be an outcome she had never expected.","\"I'm sorry, but we've received a lot of complaints about some issues with your character, and we just had an emergency meeting to discuss your case. So we've decided not to hire you this time, but we can cooperate again in the future!\"","With that, the call ended with a click. Shen Qingqing's face turned green - this embarrassing incident was heard not only by her parents, but also by Shen Wei's parents. She felt she could no longer go on living.","This time, Shen Qingqing really cried.","Shen Qingqing's mother also blamed Shen Wei: \"Ah, this is all Shen Wei's fault. Suing her own relative, as if the matter wasn't big enough already? See, they've even taken away Qingqing's job.\"","If she said that, Shen Wei's mother would not be pleased: \"If your daughter hadn't caused this incident, it wouldn't have come to this. Constantly doing these ungrateful things, and now that she's lost her job, you still dare to blame Shen Wei.\"","\"Sister-in-law, why are you speaking like this? Qingqing is already suffering enough.\"","Shen Wei's mother said, \"It's because you people are unscrupulous. Let me give you a piece of advice - wrongdoing will bring about its own destruction!\"","The two families then started arguing.","The ones driving got caught up in the commotion and turned back home instead of going to the kindergarten.","They forgot one thing - the matter was not resolved, and Shen Wei would still be suing Shen Qingqing.","Meanwhile, the heat around Starry Sky Kindergarten has been exceptionally high, with many people wanting to send their children there.","At this moment, the authorities finally issued a statement saying that all the programs at Starry Sky Kindergarten are legal.","The authorities' main focus is on protecting children and preventing such incidents from happening again, and they will strengthen supervision in the future.","With the high heat around this issue, other kindergartens are quietly observing. As soon as the authorities issued the statement, they all became alarmed.","Seeing the authorities' statement, they realized that they would likely face frequent inspections going forward.","And with the current crackdown, if they were singled out as a typical example, they would have to stop their operations.","Suddenly, some kindergartens started completing their paperwork, some were recruiting staff, some were cleaning up, and some were even purchasing more fire safety equipment.","They all became busy.","As for the eye of the storm, Starry Sky Kindergarten, it has become a complete sensation.","Especially the live-streamers, after eating a meal there, they couldn't help but wear their hearts on their sleeves - the food there was truly delicious!","Many people who couldn't eat at the kindergarten went to the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant instead. After that, the live-streamer Xu Doudou was very disappointed, saying the food there was far inferior to the kindergarten's.","With this one statement, the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant practically wanted to send them a lawyer's letter.","They already had few customers, and now this statement has caused many people to stop coming.","There's inside information: \"Because the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant's previous chef was driven away, the ones left behind are his students who have only been practicing for a short while. They're barely over 30 years old and their culinary skills are not yet up to par.\"","With this insider information, everyone finally realized that Starry Sky Kindergarten truly had a chef, and it was not just a false claim.","Suddenly, many people want to come work as security guards or cleaners there.","The heat continues unabated on this end.","Within a day, Teacher Tang's WeChat was almost exploding with new contacts. Many people want to come study there, but Teacher Tang hasn't responded to anyone.","The mother of the previously betrayed Yuan Yuan came to find Teacher Tang again, deeply regretting: \"Teacher Tang, I was schemed against.\"","\"Your former employer promised that if I withdrew my child from your school, they would accept us for free. But when we went there, not only did they not waive the tuition, they said we were trying to extort them.\"","\"Isn't this just toying with us?\" The Yuan Yuan mother finished, crying with snot and tears.","Now that Starry Sky Kindergarten is a sensation, many wealthy and influential people want to send their children there.","She not only didn't get the promised 5,000 yuan, but also didn't even get the free tuition. It's like losing a watermelon and only finding a sesame seed, and the sesame seed isn't even found.","Now trying to find a 200-plus tuition kindergarten is practically impossible.","The cheapest is over 800, and the facilities and conditions are not as good as Starry Sky Kindergarten's.","So she came to plead with Teacher Tang again, regretting and wanting to come back.","Teacher Tang said, \"I'm really sorry!\" She also has some thoughts about this student's parent. Back then, she insisted on making a scene in the media.","She had done her utmost for Yuan Yuan, but the Yuan Yuan mother showed no gratitude, and now that she can't get any advantage, she wants to come back. What kind of place is this?","Come when you want, leave when you want.","No matter how she begged, Teacher Tang just wouldn't relent. Seeing her dilly-dallying, Teacher Tang directly blocked her.","The popularity and discussion around Starry Sky Kindergarten remains extremely high.","Everyone now fully understands:","This is the rich second-generation spending money to give back to the people.","The student parents are all excited, hoping that Shen Wei's Starry Sky will grow bigger and stronger.","Even the noble kindergartens have heard about it, with many asking their principals, \"Starry Sky is coming on strong, should we come up with a counterstrategy?\"","The noble kindergarten principal said, \"It's just temporary.\"","Over the years, she has also encountered many competitors, but before she could even take action, these people would end up self-destructing.","Strategies like low pricing are not the core competitiveness.","They have the best student resources.","And they have already built a renowned reputation - sending children to the noble kindergarten is a symbol of status and class.","Parents rack their brains to try to send their children there, and that is her foundation.","As for this newcomer Starry Sky Kindergarten, she doesn't take it seriously at all. It's not even worth a glance, as if giving it attention would just increase its hype - there's really no need.","On Shen Wei's end, her reputation value has been constantly rising, accumulating over 500,000 points.","Suddenly, Shen Wei's mental space expanded into a grand hall.","This must be the legendary points mall.","Shen Wei felt a bit excited.","Then came the cold system sounds in succession:","\"Congratulations, Shen Wei, for reaching 500,000 points. Rewarding you with a 3-square-meter space that can be used for storage and consciousness control, and the space can be upgraded.\"","Except for not being able to store living things, everything else can be stored.","Using this 3-square-meter space strategically would be powerful. And the best part is that this function can be upgraded.","\"Rewarding 10 million RMB\"","\"Rewarding 20 pounds of beef, 20 pounds of chicken, 20 pounds of pork, 20 pounds of vegetables, 20 pounds of fruit.\"","\"Rewarding 10 sets of high-quality role-playing toys, including doctor games, kitchen games, supermarket games, adventure games, pet games, farming games, archaeology games, sewing games, dress-up games, and fairy tale games.\""]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Ready to Go Live","paragraphs":["The new points plaza opened by the System: There are blind box area, live streaming area, exchange area, and customizable area.","Among them, the blind box area requires 50,000 points to draw once.","The probability of getting good items is 20%.","Shen Wei thought about it and decided to give up.","She used 500,000 points to unlock the points mall.","Suddenly, it was back to the pre-liberation era. She only had 30,000 points left, planning to be frugal and use them wisely.","The customizable area is interesting, it will estimate the points based on what you write.","The exchange area has thousands of items, all around 120,000 points. With the points she has, she can't afford anything.","During this period, Shen Wei figured out that the fastest way to accumulate points is to increase her online reputation.","Coincidentally, the System directly appeared with a live streaming area and gave her professional live streaming equipment.","There are also many rewards waiting to be unlocked. As long as the live stream reaches 15,000, 50,000, 100,000, 1 million, or 10 million fans, there will be rewards.","Ranking on the popularity list or regional list will also bring rewards, so Shen Wei decided to give it a try.","After all, there is a wave of free traffic now, so she can't let the points go to waste.","Shen Wei said to the System, \"System, don't you have several villain juveniles that need to be rescued? Why is there only He Lingfeng now?\"","The System's cold computer voice reported, \"The other little villains have not yet entered the key plot, waiting to be unlocked. Once they enter the key plot, new villain cubs may be unlocked at any time.\"","Shen Wei acknowledged it.","After Shen Wei's consciousness came out of the System space, she placed all the items awarded by the System in the space.","She took out the live streaming equipment.","Shen Wei gathered all the staff: \"We now have a new idea. Maybe we can use this platform to let everyone know better what kind of kindergarten we are!\"","\"I want to start live streaming in the future. Your faces may appear on the Internet, but I will additionally compensate you with a royalty fee for the use of your image!\"","\"As long as you are employed, the portrait rights belong to Starry Sky Kindergarten, 100,000 RMB per person, what do you think?\"","\"100,000 RMB in this city is quite powerful.\"","As soon as Shen Wei finished speaking, the school bus driver Zhang Daming became quite excited.","His son owed online loans and desperately needed money.","He was the first to agree, \"I can do it!\" As a small fry, 100,000 RMB is like a windfall for him.","The others also expressed their consent.","This is the rule of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Other places, once used, no compensation will be given.","Shen Wei said, \"There may be various live streams from time to time in the future.\"","She suggested that they each create their own account, and they can also help them gain fans. Nowadays is the era of nationwide live streaming.","As long as the number of fans reaches 1,000, they can do some live streaming e-commerce and hang small yellow cars, which are additional income.","This part belongs to them.","After everyone agreed, they signed the supplementary contract. Shortly after, 100,000 RMB was deposited into each of their bank accounts.","Zhang Daming was particularly excited, this sum of money solved his pressing need.","Zhang Daming said to Shen Wei, \"I want to go back.\"","As a school bus driver, his main task is to pick up and drop off students.","Most of the time, he is also doing odd jobs and other work in the school.","Shen Wei said, \"Go ahead!\"","Zhang Daming held back his excitement and hurried home.","As soon as he arrived home, he saw his wife sighing in distress.","Ever since his son owed a large amount of online loan, not only relatives, even long-time neighbors would avoid them as if they were cursed.","His son has now applied for a leave of absence and stays at home every day.","Seeing Zhang Daming return, his wife's despair welled up: \"Have you been fired from the unit?\"","It was rare to find a job with such high pay. She didn't expect there would be such a big incident at night. She also knew about it.","Now he's back before the end of the shift, so he must have been laid off.","Zhang Daming said, \"No, there's good news. Great news!\"","Then he showed the 100,000 RMB that was deposited in his phone reminder.","\"Where did this money come from?\"","His wife was also shocked by the 100,000 RMB.","Zhang Daming told her about authorizing the portrait rights to the kindergarten.","As ordinary people, they didn't care about whether their image was used or not.","But this money is real!","With this sum of money, they can first pay off the important debts, so that the interest won't keep accumulating.","After repaying 100,000 RMB, the couple felt much more relieved. His wife said, \"Shall we buy some delicious food to celebrate tonight?\"","Seeing his wife's increasingly gaunt face and the increasing white hair, Zhang Daming's heart ached.","He also knew that the pressure on his wife was no less than his own.","He went to work every day, but his wife had to face the strange gazes of others and the disappointment of their son.","Zhang Daming said, \"The job at Starry Sky Kindergarten is very good, I will work hard in the future, and we will pay off all these debts.\"","His wife's tears suddenly welled up: \"Thank goodness there is this job, it's so good, so good.\"","They had reached the end of their rope.","This job has given them hope.","Zhang Daming's wife said, \"Don't you always say you're short of cleaners? Can I go? I don't want any money.\"","She just wanted to express her gratitude, and she was already accustomed to being a housewife for so many years. Cleaning and organizing is her specialty.","Zhang Daming said, \"Okay, I'll talk to the boss about it when I get back. Even if you just come for the lunch, the food there is simply delicious!\"","His wife's eyes sparkled with a sense of relief: \"Really?\"","The two chatted happily, a relaxation they had never experienced in recent days."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: The Teacher Took You to Play House.","paragraphs":["The explosive kindergarten incident that sparked an uproar online ended in an unexpected way.","At first, ordinary netizens didn't understand the truth and fiercely criticized the kindergarten for days, all for the sake of Shen Qingqing.","Everyone had good intentions, fearing that the kindergarten might have abused the children.","Little did they know that they had become the perpetrators of the online harassment.","Netizens felt frustrated and indignant, feeling like they had been used.","They had a subtle sense of guilt towards Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They wanted to donate some money, but when Shen Wei went live, she said they didn't need the money.","Looking at the decorations in her house and the facilities inside and outside the building, it did seem like what she said was true.","Just when everyone had nowhere to vent their emotions, a notice caught everyone's attention.","The official short video account of Starry Sky Kindergarten announced: We are willing to accept supervision from the whole world. Starting tomorrow, we will open a live broadcast for three hours every day.","The more open and transparent Starry Sky Kindergarten became, the more guilty the netizens felt.","\"We believe in you now, don't be like this.\" Xiao Qi was one of them.","During this period, she had been like a keyboard warrior, ruthlessly attacking the kindergarten, and now that it had turned out this way, she hurriedly posted this sentence online, and it was soon upvoted to the top hot comment.","Some people also comforted: \"This is a good kindergarten, much better than those evasive ones.\"","Everyone was really curious to see what the kindergarten's live broadcast would be like.","Suddenly, the news that Starry Sky Kindergarten would start live broadcasting at 9 o'clock tomorrow mysteriously topped the trending hot search list on the humanities ranking.","The number of people who clicked to reserve and watch reached 200,000, and it was still rising.","...","At Starry Sky Kindergarten, Shen Wei led everyone to install the various live-broadcasting equipment.","These devices were awarded by the system and were very advanced, so they didn't need professional recording and post-production. The system could take care of everything.","Now the system and Shen Wei were a community of shared destiny. The higher Shen Wei's score, the more benefits the system would provide.","So she was putting in her whole heart and soul in these matters.","Moreover, the system was confident that no one could do better than it, because it was the most advanced AI that had transcended the times.","Other kindergartens had tried to boost the heat of this incident, hoping to undermine Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Unexpectedly, they had inadvertently helped them, gaining them such a huge influx of traffic.","It made those kindergarten people feel regretful, as they were the ones who had to fork out money.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten had turned this situation to their advantage.","The leaders of other kindergartens sighed enviously, \"Starry Sky Kindergarten must have someone guiding them.\"","Ordinary people really couldn't handle this wave of traffic.","Other people said, \"Shall we start a live broadcast in our kindergarten too?\" to ride on the trend and make some money, why not?","But the other kindergartens said no. They might not be able to withstand this kind of live broadcast.","If the effect is good, it's fine! But if there's even a small slip-up, and the people online see it, it'll be another huge uproar.","At the end of the day, they just didn't have Shen Wei's openness.","Other kindergartens were just annoyed.","When they first learned that Shen Wei was running a kindergarten, many of their peers looked down on her. \"A little girl, coming to our territory? Does she think this is a place for her?\"","They were just waiting for reality to slap her in the face. But unexpectedly, it was their own faces that got slapped.","Seeing Starry Sky Kindergarten reap such huge benefits, they began to suspect that it was their own hype from the beginning.","\"Young people really have their tricks!\"","With this kind of promotion online, Starry Sky Kindergarten directly caught fire! It is said that this wave of traffic was worth more than 10 million.","And Starry Sky Kindergarten got it all for free.","The more they thought about it, the angrier they got.","When they heard that Starry Sky Kindergarten was going to start a live broadcast, many of their peers couldn't even eat their lunch.","Teacher Tang's former boss was the angriest.","The middle-aged shrew of a director directly said in the family group and the teacher group: \"From now on, everyone should keep an eye on the live broadcast, and as soon as you find any violations, report them. For each successful report, I'll give a 50-yuan reward.\"","She just couldn't believe it, with so many people, they still couldn't find any problems with them.","The other teachers agreed immediately, as before, they weren't even allowed to play with their phones at work. If caught, they would be fined. But now not only would they not be fined, they would even get paid, it seems the boss was really angry.","That night, many kindergarten operators couldn't sleep, and the next day, kindergartens across the city were all focused on this matter.","Exactly at 9 o'clock, the number of fans on Starry Sky Kindergarten's official Weibo account started to grow rapidly.","In the first hour, it was just 230,000, and in the blink of an eye, it had changed to 300,000, and the decimal numbers were constantly increasing.","As soon as the live broadcast started, the first thing that caught everyone's eye was Shen Wei's beautiful appearance, and the netizens were immediately struck by this visual feast. \"Sister, come cuddle with me.\"","\"She's so beautiful, her looks can even rival those in the entertainment industry.\"","Shen Wei greeted everyone, \"Let's go see the children together!\"","Then she welcomed the children one by one at the school gate.","The school bus that drove in was the latest bulletproof model, a high-end school bus.","As the children got off the bus one by one, they greeted Shen Wei politely, \"Hello, Principal Sister.\"","Their soft and cute voices instantly melted the hearts of the viewers.","Shen Wei also greeted each of them, \"Hello, Qianqian.\"","\"Hello, Lingling.\"","\"Hello, Yu Le.\"","The children, seeing Shen Wei responding to their greetings, ran away happily, but would occasionally steal a glance back at Shen Wei.","Their adorable little expressions immediately made the viewers in front of the screen burst into laughter.","\"It turns out I don't dislike children, I just dislike naughty kids.\"","\"These little darlings are so cute and polite.\"","\"And the way they shyly look back after running away, it just gets to me.\"","After everyone had gotten off, they went back to the classroom together, and the netizens started to discuss enthusiastically again.","\"Where are those black sheep who said it was all an act? Just look at the mental state of these children, who looks like they've been abused?\"","\"They all look bright and cheerful. It's clear they are well-cared for and loved.\"","\"These days, it's so easy to spread rumors online without any consequence. I'm so angry when I think about how Shen Qingqing almost got accepted by the Lu Group.\"","\"Yeah, that kind of despicable person, can't they just stay away?\"","\"Don't argue, it's not worth getting all worked up over such people. Let's just focus on the little darlings.\"","Soon they entered the classroom.","As soon as Teacher Tang came in, the children excitedly ran up to her, vying to be hugged. Teacher Tang knew the little darlings loved hugs, and she hugged them one by one.","The netizens were all moved, this is the kind of love for children that only a true teacher can have.","Hugging a 30-pound child must be quite tiring, and there were so many children who all needed equal attention.","\"Qianqian is the cutest, although she's very shy, but when she's being hugged, her little feet are swinging happily.\"","\"Teacher Tang is hugging not only the little kids, but also the five-year-old me.\"","This statement immediately resonated with many people: \"Yes, if only I had had a teacher like this when I was in school.\"","A single sentence and the netizens were moved to tears. Luckily, this sad atmosphere didn't last long.","Then Shen Wei told Teacher Tang, \"Let's take the kids to play house, and today we'll play the kitchen game.\"","These were all rewards from the system, and she had decorated a small room for them.","Hearing they were going to play house, the children cheered excitedly.","The adults in front of the computer screens were also a little excited: \"Isn't this the game we loved playing when we were little?\"","Before, they just played it randomly, but now with a teacher guiding them, they were looking forward to seeing how it would go."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Too Top","paragraphs":["Everyone quickly lined up and headed to the game classroom.","As soon as they entered, many children exclaimed \"Wow!\"","Teacher Tang was quite surprised, as she had been taking care of the children this whole time and didn't know that the kindergarten had such things.","The children grouped up in twos and threes.","On one side were model toys, which were scaled-down replicas of real-life objects.","Over there were boxed meal stalls.","Ice cream stalls.","French fry stalls.","Egg pancake stalls.","And beverage stalls.","The children formed pairs to run their own stalls.","The remaining children were customers.","They were then given cards with an initial balance of 500 each.","Everyone then started simulating the activities, with some rushing to claim stalls and others wanting to be customers.","After the assignments were made, they started playing.","The beverage stall had all kinds of plastic models, looking just like real drinks, but the brands were clearly fake! And they couldn't even be unscrewed to drink.","The ice cream, when the small fridge was opened, emitted a chilly vapor like dry ice, giving the impression of a real ice cream freezer.","And the egg pancake stall - when you opened it, real yolks and egg whites would come out, and when you put them on the small pan, a real mini egg pancake would be fried.","The french fries would change color as they were \"fried\".","Not only the children were amazed, even the adults were eager to try it out.","Netizens were excited: \"Wow, I haven't played with toys for 10 years, the toy market has really developed to this extent?\"","A netizen below said: \"I have a child, but I've never found such interesting toys. Can you share a link, where can I buy these?\"","\"The toys might be too childish for college students, but just right for them.\"","\"Anyone know the price range of these? Looks like they're not cheap.\"","\"Replying to the comment above, I found a full set online for 9,800.\"","\"Looks like this is a kindergarten for the wealthy.\"","\"Can grown-ups come play too?\"","The netizens were discussing animatedly.","Ever since He Lingfeng helped Ning Fubao deal with the bad principal who bullied people, Fubao has been sticking to He Lingfeng.","Fubao was quite introverted and shy, but this time he took the initiative to ask He Lingfeng: \"Can we run the french fry stall?\"","He Lingfeng nodded.","He had been studying a lot lately, so Shen Wei was afraid he wouldn't fit in, so whenever there was a game, she would call him to join.","At this age, if they don't play now, when will they?","Although He Lingfeng was gifted in studies, playing house was something he had never done before. His little face was filled with seriousness and concentration.","In the eyes of the netizens, they couldn't wait to hug and kiss him.","\"Oh my god, this little handsome boy is so cute!\"","\"He'll be my boyfriend 20 years from now.\"","Ning Fubao then brought the fried potatoes and had He Lingfeng help with the sales pitch.","Netizens watching commented: \"This is the classic 'wife does the inside, husband does the outside' setup.\"","After a while, they saw a chubby boy come over: \"How much are these fries? I'm drooling already.\"","Ning Fubao hadn't sold anything before, so he looked at He Lingfeng, and He Lingfeng thought for a moment and said, \"5 yuan.\"","The chubby boy said, \"Okay, 5 yuan it is, give me one!\"","Then Ning Fubao started \"frying\" the potatoes.","The chubby boy swiped his card, and the 500 went down to 495.","The chubby boy happily ran off to the next stall, which was run by Lingling and Qianqian. He bought yogurt and soda.","Just by looking at the chubby boy's weight, you could tell he loved to eat. His eyes were beaming as he looked at the offerings at each stall.","Netizens were almost in stitches: \"This chubby boy is practically acting out my life.\"","\"He looks so happy when he's buying things.\"","\"I don't know, guys, I've been refreshing this stream for half an hour, and the boss just asked me what I was doing. I passed the stream to the boss, and soon he was also grinning stupidly.\"","\"Everyone wants to make money, but this chubby boy is just frantically buying and buying, too bad he can't eat it all.\"","They then went to the next stall.","Soon the chubby boy was holding a stack of \"items\" he had bought, his eyes shining brightly as he went to find Teacher Tang: \"This is for you!\"","These were just toys for the adults, but very important to the children.","Teacher Tang was softened by the chubby boy's gesture: \"Why are you giving this to me?\" Her eyes were filled with warmth.","The chubby boy blushed shyly: \"I like Teacher Tang the most.\"","Even though it was a very passionate and direct statement, coming from a child's mouth, it was especially infectious.","Teacher Tang said: \"Teacher likes you too.\"","Hearing this, the chubby boy was overjoyed, acting like a wealthy person as he patted his pocket: \"I still have money, next time you want to eat something, I'll buy it for you.\"","The netizens were all touched by the chubby boy.","\"I thought he was just buying for himself, but it turns out he didn't keep anything for himself, he's much more generous than me.\"","\"This must be the happiest moment for a kindergarten teacher.\"","\"As a working stiff, I've actually been healed by this chubby boy, he's so cute, I've officially declared him my internet son.\"","Many were buying or selling items.","Only a thin, small boy, Yu Le, was observing everyone.","Teacher Tang said: \"Why don't you go buy something?\" Participating in the house-playing is the key!","The thin, small boy thought for a moment and said, \"Okay!\" He then turned around and left, and after a while, he came back with 10 real eggs.","He went around to the different stalls, selling each egg for \"10 yuan.\"","These were real eggs, after all!","All the \"stall owners\" were thrilled.","The teacher didn't know where Yu Le got the eggs from.","After a while, they saw Chef Liu come in and say to Teacher Tang, \"Yu Le took 10 eggs from me, I was wondering what he was going to do with them. Then I came over and saw it was for the kindergarten's trading game.\"","Teacher Tang smiled: \"You just gave them to him? You really spoil the children.\"","Chef Liu smiled sheepishly: \"But he called me Grandpa Liu.\"","The netizens were almost in stitches: \"I've been laughing so hard my face is about to freeze, how can this be the kindergarten that got scolded? This is my true treasure trove of a kindergarten.\"","\"'But he called me Grandpa Liu,' who can resist that?\"","\"10 eggs, that's nothing, tell your auntie, and she'll buy you 100.\""]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Internet Son","paragraphs":["Friends said Yu Le seems to have a good business sense, as he was actually able to sell things to the group as a customer.","One profit after another, he now already has \"550\" yuan.","\"I declare this Yu Le to be the best businessman baby.\"","They played a game for over an hour.","When it was announced over,","Ning Fubao and He Lingfeng had the highest scores.","Friends who watched the whole process said: \"Oh my, the teachers didn't help them at all, yet they managed to come up with the idea of food delivery on their own, so clever.\"","For the 1st place, Shen Wei rewarded each of them with a small red flower.","Then she took them to the points room to have a look – 30 small red flowers can be exchanged for a Lego toy. 60 small red flowers for an air fryer. 100 small red flowers for a kitchen game set, the original worth 9,800 yuan.","The other babies in the kindergarten looked at Ning Fubao and He Lingfeng's small red flowers with envious eyes.","People online said: \"What a pity Yu Le didn't get any small red flowers, he really stood out.\"","\"When is the next game? I feel like the kids have become so skilled after not knowing anything at the beginning. I really look forward to their next one, go for it Yu Le! I believe you're the best.\"","Some parents also said: \"The gifts they give here are so substantial, unlike other kindergartens that only give cheap stuff like notebooks and skipping ropes!\"","\"Calculated this way, attending this kindergarten not only doesn't cost anything but can actually make money.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone reacted. Shen Wei must be a celestial being?","This kindergarten is amazing.","Netizens loved it immensely: \"Isn't this better than variety shows?\"","What's more, the small red flower that He Lingfeng got was directly given to Ning Fubao.","\"Although I know I shouldn't ship little friends, this pair is just too shippable.\"","\"They display CEO vibes at such a young age.\"","\"Those are small red flowers, you can't even touch my brother's.\"","\"All kinds of rewards from home can't compare to a single small red flower from school, you have to know how important it is to these babies.\"","\"Why is it over?\"","The teachers had fun, the students had fun, but the netizens didn't have enough fun yet.","This game was so much fun, the babies acted so adorably.","Soon this live broadcast ended, but there was a replay.","The number of people watching the replay soared, and before long it exceeded 5 million.","Starry Sky Kindergarten became a huge hit!","Many people wanted to enroll at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But whether it was phone inquiries, showing up at the school gate, or trying to add Teacher Tang's WeChat through connections,","the result was the same – they weren't accepting new students at the moment.","Even some parents were willing to pay tens of thousands of yuan, but this kindergarten didn't take the money.","Everyone became disheartened.","They would rather this kindergarten took money, at least then there would be a chance for their child to get in.","The enthusiasm of netizens was too high.","There were over 100,000 comments, many locals urging them to open new classes. Even people from other cities wanted them to open branches.","These days when Teacher Tang and Liu Chef walked on the street, there were actually people who recognized them, showing how popular their live broadcast had become.","Passersby would greet them,","even using classic quotes from the broadcast: \"But he called me Grandpa Liu\" to Liu Chef.","Liu Chef found it both funny and awkward.","Many old friends also called.","Now the phone kept ringing, and Liu Chef didn't feel like answering.","When he did pick up, it was indeed an old friend: \"Hey, I saw you, you were on the live broadcast, not bad, doing pretty well.\"","Then the friend added: \"Nowadays, even precious things need more promotion, right?\"","Liu Chef said: \"Yeah, how have you been lately?\"","\"Same old, but there is one thing. Can you get me a spot in your kindergarten? If it wasn't for being sworn brothers, I wouldn't dare ask you for this favor!\"","After the friend said that, it was hard for Liu Chef to refuse.","But Liu Chef said: \"I can't do that. There are so many people offering tens of thousands, but still can't get in. Let me tell you if they open new classes in the future.\"","Hearing that, the friend knew there was no way, so he could only sigh and say: \"Alright then!\"","After hanging up, Liu Chef's wife immediately came over: \"Another one asking you to pull strings?\"","Liu Chef said: \"Yeah, more calls like that than when it was the New Year holiday period.\"","Liu Chef's wife said: \"Didn't your little boss say before? Each person has two spots. You can't easily give your spots away, save them for our granddaughter!\"","Liu Chef knew the principle of charity begins at home.","\"Of course.\" No need to say more, his granddaughter was only three this year, still a year and a half away from kindergarten age.","Liu Chef's daughter-in-law also watched the live broadcast all day and couldn't get enough of it.","Liu Chef said: \"There will be another live broadcast tomorrow.\"","His wife told Liu Chef: \"This was really the right move, I heard Jiangbei Grand Restaurant has officially started layoffs. Many people who left can't even find a job.\"","Not to mention the high salary here, every day you get to see happy children.","When Liu Chef thought about it, he smiled.","Soon the phone rang again, he thought it was someone trying to get into the kindergarten. But when he saw the caller ID, his face darkened.","He didn't even look and just rejected it.","His wife asked: \"Who was it?\"","\"Liu Ming\", who else, his former apprentice, that ungrateful snake from back then.","It was because of this apprentice's scheming that the whole incident was exposed, forcing Liu Chef to leave Jiangbei Grand Restaurant where he had worked for decades.","Even with Liu Chef's good temper, he couldn't help but hold a grudge.","Seeing this person's call made him annoyed. He had just hung up when Liu Ming stubbornly called again.","His wife said: \"Maybe he has something important, why don't you answer and hear him out?\"","Persuaded by his wife, Liu Chef answered, but didn't say anything on his end.","Liu Ming said: \"Master, how have you been lately?\"","Liu Chef said curtly: \"If you have something to say, say it!\"","His icy attitude made Liu Ming's face pale, then he said \"Master, I was really wrong.\"","\"I just spoke carelessly, I didn't expect them to spread rumors!\"","\"After you left, I was restless and couldn't sleep for days. I also didn't apologize in time, but I couldn't bear the guilt, can you forgive me?\"","Liu Chef said: \"What's done is done, what's the point of saying all this!\" His attitude remained cold.","Liu Ming gritted his teeth and said: \"Master, I got laid off. Can I come work at your kindergarten?\" This was his real intention.","Liu Chef scoffed inwardly, he had been waiting for this all along. This person had no good intentions.","\"We don't need more people!\"","Once bitten, twice shy. He wouldn't fall into the same trap twice.","This apprentice liked to take advantage of others. In the past, because of their master-apprentice relationship and Liu Ming's poor family situation, Liu Chef had always let it slide.","But now their ties were severed, no one would show him that leniency anymore.","He regrets it now, but it's too late.","In life, you can't let your path become too narrow.","After hanging up, Liu Chef felt totally relieved. Who could have imagined that leaving back then was actually the right move.","...","On the 2nd day of work, Teacher Tang took the initiative to approach Shen Wei during the morning meeting and said, \"I have a favor to ask of you!\"","Teacher Tang has always been a central figure at the kindergarten, and all the children adored her.","Moreover, Teacher Tang had an upright reputation, so Shen Wei couldn't imagine what matter would compel Teacher Tang to use the word \"request.\"","\"Tell me,\" Shen Wei said.","Teacher Tang explained, \"Yesterday, one of my former teachers wanted to enroll his granddaughter at our school.\"","This place has become so popular that all the children have appeared on the live broadcast, so if a new person were to join, it would undoubtedly draw attention.","It would cause trouble for the kindergarten.","Others would think, \"If she can enroll, why can't I?\"","During this sensitive period, such requests should not be made.","However, this person is exceptional. When Teacher Tang was a student, it was this very teacher who sponsored her education.","Over the years, Teacher Tang has shown filial piety to her mentor during all major festivals and celebrations.","This time, when her mentor made this request, she truly could not refuse, so she turned to Shen Wei for help.","Shen Wei said, \"Doesn't each of you have two enrollment slots?\" In an instant, everyone's heart was stirred.","The bus driver, Zhang Daming, couldn't help but say, \"Can we resell our enrollment slots to others?\"","As soon as he said it, he felt ashamed. The kindergarten had always treated him well.","Moreover, they had just given him a bonus of 100,000 yuan, so saying this now made him seem insatiably greedy.","Usually, Zhang Daming was quite simple and honest, but at the moment, the burden of high-interest loans was suffocating him.","He had heard that many people were offering only 30,000 or 50,000 yuan, which this place wouldn't accept. Then he heard that he had an enrollment slot, and he temporarily lost his senses.","After saying that, Zhang Daming immediately turned around and tried to rectify it, his face flushed red, \"Just pretend I didn't say anything!\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Kill two birds with One Stone","paragraphs":["Zhang Daming's family circumstances were well-known to everyone.","Shen Wei said, \"As for your admission spots, you can handle them however you want. After all, each person only has two.\"","At that moment, even Zhang Daming couldn't help but have his eyes turn red.","Soon, the meeting dispersed.","Liu Master Chef pulled Zhang Daming aside and said, \"Do you really want to sell them?\"","Zhang Daming's eyes were red as he said, \"What choice do I have?\"","He wasn't like Liu Master Chef, whose spots were reserved for his own grandchild.","His son hadn't even graduated from university yet, and his other relatives couldn't use such precious spots. He was in desperate need of money.","Liu Master Chef said, \"If you really want to sell, I can connect you with buyers!\"","Yesterday, his phone was ringing off the hook. In the past, he used to be a chef at a major hotel, so he had the personal numbers of many influential people who had hired him for private events.","Those influential people learned that he was here and had their people call him, hinting that money was no object.","Liu Master Chef said, \"Do you want to sell? If you do, sell both spots together. I can get you 80,000 yuan for them. I won't take a single cent for myself.\"","He could give Zhang Daming a hand since Zhang Daming used to know people in the system but didn't know many wealthy people.","Wasn't this a win-win situation?","However, Liu Master Chef also told him, \"You'll definitely regret it after selling. Our kindergarten is getting better and better, and these spots may become even more precious in the future!\"","Zhang Daming pursed his lips and said, \"I'll still sell them.\" His son owed so much money that he had planned to sell his house.","With the 10,000 yuan from the portrait rights plus this 80,000 yuan and his salary, he could basically keep his house.","Liu Master Chef said, \"Alright, I'll help you contact the buyers. But once you agree, you can't back out!\"","The people who could afford this amount were powerful and influential. If he went back and forth, not only would he not get the money, but he'd also offend them.","Zhang Daming said, \"Thank you, Old Liu.\"","He still felt a bit sad, \"The school has given me so many things. My 100-plus pounds will be a burden on the kindergarten. I don't know how to repay them, but just watch my performance.\"","Liu Master Chef patted the school bus driver's shoulder and said, \"Just do your job well. Don't think too much about it.\"","Zhang Daming told Liu Master Chef, \"Don't we need more janitors here? Can my wife come work here? She doesn't want money, she just wants to repay a favor!\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Master Chef said, \"Let me talk to Shen Wei about it.\"","With so many children now, they were indeed short-staffed for indoor and outdoor cleaning.","...","Liu Master Chef negotiated a salary of 5,000 yuan per month with Shen Wei, which was the market rate.","When Zhang Daming heard this, he adamantly refused.","Liu Master Chef said, \"Just take it. It's impossible not to pay you for working here. And with the two of you together, you'll pay it off quickly!\"","Hearing this, Zhang Daming agreed.","...","The next day, Teacher Tang personally went to pick up the child of his mentor.","His mentor's child was a pretty little girl named Xu Wenwen.","The little girl was shy and introverted. When she saw Teacher Tang, she couldn't help but hide in her mother's embrace.","Xu Wenwen's mother said, \"Didn't you watch the live stream yesterday? You said you wanted to be friends with everyone! Why are you being shy again today?\"","Then Xu Wenwen's mother told Teacher Tang, \"Thanks to you this time.\"","Teacher Tang said, \"It's no problem. My mentor's kindness to me is as vast as a mountain. This small favor is the least I could do.\"","Xu Wenwen's mother felt a bit embarrassed and said, \"If it weren't for this incident, I wouldn't have bothered you.\"","The story was long. She didn't know that the kindergarten now had small cliques. She thought it was normal for children to roughhouse, but perhaps because her Wenwen was too fragile, she was always bullied. By the time the parents realized, the little girl had become introverted and lacked self-confidence.","Now they had no choice but to transfer her to another kindergarten.","But in her condition, she needed special care. The parents were worried that teachers at other kindergartens wouldn't be able to give her enough attention.","Coincidentally, they saw the live stream and remembered Teacher Tang.","So they decided to give it a try and contacted him.","Unexpectedly, Teacher Tang was very happy to oblige and even came personally to pick her up.","The mother sent her child off, feeling reassured that her child was in Teacher Tang's hands.","At school, the children played games together and quickly became familiar with each other."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: The Shock of Being Rich","paragraphs":["He Lingfeng found Shen Wei: \"Can I go study today?\"","Shen Wei immediately pinched He Lingfeng's little cheeks: \"You've been studying too much lately. You should play more!\"","Shen Wei was now doing her utmost to give him a happy childhood.","As time went on, He Lingfeng gradually revealed his true nature - he was indeed the certified villain.","He was quite aloof towards others.","But when facing Shen Wei, he was like a clingy puppy, listening to whatever she said, even more obedient than listening to Teacher Tang.","Seeing Shen Wei say that, He Lingfeng could only say, \"Alright then.\"","And so the live broadcast was opened again as usual.","Shen Wei didn't put in much effort.","Now the whole network was calling for her to quickly open Class 2.","Shen Wei currently had no plans to open Class 2.","But she planned to hire two more teaching assistants.","The number of children was steadily increasing, and this class might eventually have around twenty students.","One Teacher Tang alone would not be enough.","She wanted to have two more people.","Shen Wei promptly had the system help with the screening, and soon it selected two people - one named Tang Xiaoan and the other named Guo Qing.","These two were both top graduates from the preschool education major, ranking first and second in their class respectively.","These kind of students were quickly snapped up.","To compete with them would be quite a challenge, as there were positions in municipal and county-level kindergartens with benefits.","For ordinary people, the benefits were still very attractive.","Shen Wei's only approach was to offer high salaries. But as assistants, their salaries couldn't exceed Teacher Tang's, who earned 20,000 per month. So she set the assistant salaries at 15,000 per month.","The job offers were sent out quickly.","...","In the preschool education major, the graduating seniors were all looking for jobs.","The classmates all wanted to know where Tang Xiaoan and Guo Qing would go?","They were basically the cream of the crop this year, consistently ranking first and second, winning scholarships year after year.","Their instructors said the two had already been selected by the municipal kindergarten.","The others could only envy them.","But today, the classmates received an earth-shattering news - the two didn't go to the municipal kindergarten, but instead went to the currently trending Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The teachers angrily scolded them for an hour in the office, but they didn't change their minds.","The other students who overheard bits and pieces in the office spread the news, causing a stir in the department.","\"The teacher asked them if their future or money was more important?\"","\"Wow, how much were they offered?\"","\"I don't know.\"","\"Have you heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten? They livestream every day, and the kids there are quite cute.\"","The students in the class were chatting animatedly, when the two returned, and the class fell into an eerie silence.","After a while, the teacher called out a few other girls.","Soon, these girls came back joyfully saying: \"I've been admitted to the municipal kindergarten now.\"","The surrounding classmates all looked at Tang Xiaoan and Guo Qing, wanting to see their reactions.","But to their disappointment, the two had no reaction at all.","It was unbelievable - this was the best job option for students right now.","The others asked Tang Xiaoan and Guo Qing: \"Why didn't you go?\"","Having benefits was the most stable, no one knew how long a private institution could last.","The two had grievances they couldn't express.","They had interned there before, going enthusiastically.","The two girls were big shots in the school.","But in that place, they were nobodies.","Not only were they bullied and harassed by colleagues, they even had to take the blame for some things.","They had cried many times over this.","A senior colleague secretly revealed the secret - all the ones here were their seniors, and they had gone through the same thing back then.","Precisely because they had been bullied before, now that new people came, they had to retaliate.","Bullying the newcomers was a common practice there. Moreover, the contracts were very shady, not like the benefits everyone imagined - they were actually long-term contract workers.","A 20-year contract, and if they broke it midway, they would have to pay the kindergarten 1 million in compensation, while their monthly salary was only 3,500, and they had to pay rent.","It may have sounded decent, but the reality was quite unpleasant.","Just as they were hesitating, they received an offer from Starry Sky Kindergarten, offering a high salary of 15,000. Tang Xiaoan immediately decided to go, and Guo Qing struggled a bit before also agreeing.","They were quite looking forward to the new job. It was just that the teacher was furious.","She scolded them for a long time, and even the classmates mocked them for being short-sighted.","Little did they know, whether a job is good or not, only the person experiencing it knows.","Outward appearances mean nothing.","Tang Xiaoan said, \"The salary is high here.\"","The others quickly asked, \"How much?\"","Tang Xiaoan said, \"15,000.\" At this, the others fell silent.","15,000? Not just for an assistant, even veteran teachers might not be able to earn that much. An annual salary of 180,000 - for fresh graduates, it was an astronomical figure.","Many people's eyes went from disdain to deep envy.","If they had a 15,000 salary, hesitating for a second would be disrespectful to money.","After taking the graduation photos, everyone went their separate ways.","The two girls left with hope in their hearts for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Little did they know that as soon as they arrived, they had to sign an image authorization contract.","Shen Wei directly transferred 100,000 RMB into each of their accounts.","By the time they finished signing the employment contract and went back, their feet felt light, 100,000 RMB, wow.","They knew Starry Sky Kindergarten was rich, but they didn't expect them to be this wealthy.","Shen Wei hired two teaching assistants: \"The system awarded 2 million RMB, 10 pounds of beef, 10 pounds of eggs, 10 pounds of vegetables.\"","Shen Wei was now an undisputed little landed gentry.","She already had over 20 million in hand.","The power of money is indeed mighty - for employees, you don't need to talk about dreams, as long as the money is in place, everyone is happy to work.","Shen Wei was not greedy, but the employees below her were. They were determined to ride this wave and become the top kindergarten in the local area.","...","Since Starry Sky Kindergarten became a hit, there were people waiting every day to watch the livestream, afraid of missing a single session.","In fact, they had replay available.","But the fresh content was still interesting, and they could interact with the viewers.","Today, as soon as they opened the live feed, they didn't see beautiful Shen Wei or the cute children. Instead, it was Chef Liu.","Ever since he went viral last time, many people now addressed him as Grandpa Liu when they met him.","It was understandable for the children to call him that, but even those around his age also did, making him amused and embarrassed.","But to be honest, this Grandpa Liu was a real child lover.","Whatever the children wanted to eat, he would come up with creative ways to make it.","Today, Chef Liu was smiling warmly as he told the viewers: \"There are no children today, so I'll make something for you all to eat. You can also learn, it's all very simple.\"","The recipes were all written on the little blackboard!","There was pineapple and salted pork, beef stew with radish, stir-fried greens, steamed eggs with dried scallops, and hand-pulled chicken.","He didn't have much commentary, but as he cooked, it was a feast for the eyes, smooth and graceful.","It turns out Grandpa Liu was so handsome when he was serious.","All the ingredients were processed quickly in his hands.","The viewers were greatly impressed. The dried scallops were 85 count big ones, the beef was high-quality, and the eggs were numbered free-range.","They knew this place was lavish, but each time they were still stunned by the grand gestures."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: Cute Death and Greedy Death","paragraphs":["The netizens initially wanted to be charmed to death by the little kids, but ended up being tempted to death by Chef Liu.","\"Goodness, I clearly ate breakfast this morning, but now my stomach is growling.\"","\"Can we get some lucky audience members to come over and eat? I'm really craving it.\"","\"Did you see that pineapple just now? That's an imported golden pineapple, costing several tens per pound.\"","\"The fruit section has longans and cherries, but I don't even dare to look at the cherries this season in the import supermarket.\"","\"Goodness, the food is too good here.\"","\"That dried scallop is really expensive. My sister's business is in this kind of dried seafood, but she doesn't even dare to give me such good stuff.\"","\"I heard they are hanging there eating, whose kids are eating so well?\"","Some also recognized him: \"Isn't this Chef Liu from Jiangbei Grand Restaurant? He's no ordinary person. In the past, many gourmets would go to Jiangbei Grand just for him.\"","\"Ten years ago, a banquet he prepared would cost over 100,000 yuan.\"","\"Oh, do you all remember the parent who caused trouble at the beginning, Yuan Yuan, saying her child didn't want to eat at home after coming back? Now I understand, when you eat so well at the kindergarten, who would want to go back home and eat those things?\"","\"It's not that her child doesn't want to eat at home, I heard their family always has leftover dishes and rice mixed together, not to mention the child, even the adults don't like to eat it.\"","\"Goodness, my saliva is about to spill, just look at that color.\"","\"When will there be a camera that can transmit the aroma? I really want to smell it.\"","\"I thought I was the only one craving it, but then I saw our boss's eyes are practically glued to the phone now. Are there any fried chicken for sale?\"","Soon, eight dishes and one soup were ready.","Each dish was carefully prepared.","The children came to eat first, in other places the children may need to be coaxed to eat.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, these children were like starving little piglets, gobbling it down, and everyone watching them eat was delighted.","The netizens wanted to discern from the children's faces which dish was the most delicious.","But in the end, they just ended up making themselves hungry looking at it.","It's so fragrant!","\"Suddenly I remembered a joke that says, other kids are happy to have a weekend off, but the Starry Sky kids cry about it!\"","\"Yes, there's no place like this at home.\"","After the children finished eating, the adults were to have their turn.","Before the adults started eating, Chef Liu had already packed a small lunchbox.","Inside were hand-shredded fried chicken, braised beef, and pineapple spareribs.","These were all dishes the children loved to eat.","Ning Fubao's family was in difficult circumstances, so the chef would pack a separate portion for her to take home every time he cooked.","She was the only one who got this treatment, the other staff were too embarrassed to take food home, and the key was that no matter how much they cooked, everyone could finish it.","In the end, the chef tried to cook less, afraid of overstuffing these people.","The live stream finally ended, and the netizens began to frantically order takeout.","The food delivery platforms were flooded with orders, not knowing what had happened.","After inquiring, they found out it was simply because the people were so craving the food.","Ning Fubao took the food back, but found her grandmother had already eaten outside, and asked the child to share the food with others!","Ning Fubao carried the lunchbox and went out, seeing her former classmates.","When they saw Ning Fubao, they couldn't help but salivate: \"Is the food at your kindergarten really that delicious?\" They had been drooling while watching the live stream yesterday.","Ning Fubao said, \"Of course it's true, I still have the lunchbox here, if you don't believe me, I can let you smell it!\"","Then she opened the lunchbox. The aroma wafted out, and the other children were completely intoxicated by the fragrance.","Before they had smelled enough, Ning Fubao quickly closed the lunchbox.","These children were drooling so much: \"Can I have a bite?\"","All the others were looking at Ning Fubao with pleading eyes.","Fubao, seeing them so pitiful, could only say, \"But you can only eat it once.\"","\"Okay!\"","The children quickly finished the entire lunchbox.","The first thing they did after getting home was to ask their parents to transfer them to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The parents had no choice, they had been raving about this kindergarten since they knew about it, but couldn't get in.","It's said that Ning Fubao was really fortunate.","After going there, she went to such a good kindergarten.","The children who couldn't get into Starry Sky Kindergarten automatically became Ning Fubao's little followers.","Whenever she went out, a group of little friends would follow behind her. It was quite impressive.","She came from a poor family, only living with her grandmother, and the children rarely played with her.","But now everything has changed, many friends bring snacks and toys just to wait for her.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had a very high reputation.","And Shen Wei had appeared on screen, being recognized by many people.","Shen Wei's parents were so proud they couldn't contain it!","They had gotten rich from demolishing and relocating, dividing several tens of millions, and also invested in stocks. Now they had entered the ranks of the wealthy.","But they were always looked down upon, said to be nouveau riche.","Previously, people just said it.","But now Shen Wei's parents were suddenly shaken up, who could compare to their daughter, even running a kindergarten could create such a spectacle.","Those who used to look down on them started scolding their own children: \"Look at how Shen Wei runs her own kindergarten, it's so good now, and then look at you, just a playboy, other than eating, drinking, and playing, what else can you do?\"","These rich second-generation kids suffered undeserved misfortune: \"It's just a kindergarten, anyone can open one if they want to.\"","Later, their parents did think about it for a while, but after a long silence said, \"Forget it, forget it, you don't even like it, if it's not done well, we'll have to clean up the mess for you.\"","Somehow this remark reached the ears of Shen Wei's parents.","Shen Wei's parents were overjoyed, wanting to take advantage of visiting their daughter to come to the kindergarten.","They planned to find a job here, and maybe even appear online to get a taste of being an \"internet celebrity\"."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Her Dad Had a dream of being an anchor.","paragraphs":["Shen Dajiang and his wife Bai Xue came to Starry Sky Kindergarten for the first time.","Previously, they thought that opening a kindergarten was just a trivial matter for their daughter.","They didn't pay much attention to it, but unexpectedly, the kindergarten became more and more famous. Even people in the wealthy circle were seeking a spot for their children.","The couple only then realized the strength of the kindergarten.","They couldn't wait to come and see it for themselves.","Shen Wei brought them over for a tour.","The kindergarten was well-decorated inside and out, with a very spacious area. What surprised them the most was the small vegetable garden.","It was lush and green, and they liked it at first sight.","Shen Wei said, \"Are you two staying here for a couple of days?\"","Shen's mother said, \"Your dad is a fan of your live streams. He wants to come here to help in the future. Just arrange us in the kitchen.\"","Shen Wei was somewhat shocked, \"Go to the kitchen?\" That was Liu Chef's territory.","People who excel in any field often have a common trait: they don't allow others to mess around in their domain.","Even bosses' parents are no exception.","Shen's father said, \"We just plan to make some cookies and bread, which won't clash with Liu Chef's Chinese pastries.\"","Worried that Shen Wei might misunderstand, he added, \"You don't know, during this time, your mom and I have been at home with nothing to do, so we systematically learned about baking bread and pastries.\"","\"We originally wanted to make them for you, but since you never come home, now it's good. We can make them for the children.\"","Shen's father said enthusiastically, \"We'll do a live stream when the time comes.\"","Most people shy away from the camera, feeling that broadcasting themselves is not good. But Shen's father went against the norm. He was afraid that if he didn't livestream, Shen Wei wouldn't actively seek him out.","Shen Wei said, \"Let me discuss with Liu Chef and see where we can put the equipment for you to bake bread. Although you're my father, you can't mess around in the kitchen.\"","\"That's for sure,\" Shen's father promised, patting his chest.","Shen Wei specifically talked to Liu Chef about it, and Liu Chef said it was fine.","Since her dad was eager to show himself, Shen Wei planned to do a separate livestream for him to bake bread.","Nowadays, her daily livestream data is very good. Without artificially boosting her rankings, she can make it to the top three on the popularity list of the livestreaming website.","Starry Sky Kindergarten usually livestreams in the morning.","Many people are at work or school during the day, so it's surprising that they can gather over 100,000 online viewers. It's almost becoming a model in the livestreaming industry.","When Shen's father heard that Shen Wei arranged a special session for him, he immediately said, \"You can rest assured, I definitely won't embarrass you!\" There was a sense of eager anticipation in his eyes.","Although their family is wealthy, they are not considered anything special in front of real magnates.","In the past, they used to enthusiastically attend various high society banquets. But each time, they were overshadowed by so-called magnates. Over time, it felt like they were just a control group, and no one liked being constantly looked down upon.","Gradually, they stopped attending.","Shen's father and mother raise fish and flowers at home, and later they also thought about making some bread and pastries. They occasionally post on social media, but rarely get any likes.","They've never engaged in such a big platform before, so Shen's father is extremely excited.","He also wants to do something significant, to show everyone that he's not worthless.","Shen Wei understood her father's feelings, so she agreed.","The kitchen was originally spacious, but with Shen's father around, Shen Wei completely knocked down the wall next to the kitchen.","It was specifically for storing his ovens, stoves, dough kneaders, and other equipment.","The staff at the kindergarten all knew they were Shen Wei's parents and treated them very kindly.","The respect they didn't feel outside, they felt it here.","And all they heard were praises for Shen Wei.","The staff said that despite her young age, Shen Wei was responsible and had ideas. The recent fuss, she managed to resolve it successfully, which showed extraordinary capability.","Shen's father couldn't stop smiling.","They treated their only daughter like a treasure.","Before, they had always heard about those so-called heiress of wealthy families studying abroad one day and handling company affairs the next.","It sounded like they were very capable, but in reality, it was all just a facade.","Now, look at it, who in the city hasn't heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten?","Many old friends sent messages to Shen's father to congratulate him.","Those words, Shen Wei's parents found them pleasing to hear.","So, they became even more determined not to let their daughter down, thus investing hundreds of thousands in equipment and materials.","It was already half a month later when the workers finished installing everything.","Shen's father simply made a pot of small bread, and surprisingly, the bread he made was quite good.","The teachers and children at the kindergarten all said it was delicious, which boosted Shen Wei's father's confidence all of a sudden.","He was full of confidence for tomorrow's live broadcast.","Shen Wei even secretly asked Chef Liu, \"How was the bread my dad made?\" wanting to hear the professional's honest opinion.","Chef Liu said, \"It's delicious!\"","Shen Wei was somewhat surprised that her parents' little snack could actually earn Chef Liu's praise.","Chef Liu's praise was genuine.","But there was something Chef Liu didn't mention. Shen's father used flour that cost 60 yuan per pound to make the bread.","The recipe was also a classic one.","A few grams of milk, a few grams of water, a few grams of flour, following the recipe.","How could it not be delicious?","Using top-notch ingredients to make a small bread indeed felt like winning without a fight.","But it was delicious.","Very soft and sweet, anyway, the bakeries outside wouldn't use such good ingredients for them.","The next day, during the live broadcast, Shen Wei woke up and noticed that her parents' dark circles were a bit too obvious.","\"Did you two not sleep last night?\"","Shen's father stuttered, \"We did, we went to bed early!\"","But their eyes looked tired. He did lie down, but never really slept, afraid of making mistakes the next day.","Shen Wei said, \"It's just a routine live broadcast, no need to take it too seriously.\"","Shen's father immediately got excited, \"How could that be? This is my debut live broadcast!\"","Then whispered on the side, \"Darling, remember to turn on the beauty filter for Dad.\"","Shen Wei said, \"You two will be moving around, so the beauty filter will fluctuate.\"","Shen's father said disappointedly, \"Alright then.\" He was somewhat disappointed.","Shen Wei couldn't bear to see him disappointed, so she negotiated with the system in her mind if she could turn on a beauty filter.","The system said, \"You can customize one in the designated area, but it'll cost some points.\"","The Starry Sky Kindergarten's live broadcast had been bustling during this time.","Points didn't increase as rapidly as they did at the beginning.","Previously, the points were part of the newbie benefits, increasing rapidly at first. Now, however, it takes 10 reputation points just to earn a single point. After saving for so many days, it's only amounted to around 50,000 to 60,000 points.","Shen Wei planned to spend her points wisely.","The current momentum of the kindergarten is a bit too overwhelming. There's always the fear of something going wrong.","Generally, she was reluctant to spend points unless absolutely necessary.","But seeing her dad invest hundreds of thousands into the kindergarten and staying up all night just to enhance his appearance, she couldn't refuse his heartfelt wish. Shen Wei then went to the customization area and opted for the full panorama beauty enhancement.","The system calculated it would only cost 500 points.","Perhaps a full mirror beauty enhancement is the simplest function for an AI that spans generations.","Shen Wei immediately arranged for it.","She then shared the good news with her dad.","Shen's father's face visibly lit up: \"That's great, excellent!\"","Finally, they quickly started the live broadcast.","As soon as it began, nearly 10,000 fans poured in.","They were all regulars in the live room, either children playing games or chefs preparing food in the background. There was little commentary, but everyone had grown accustomed to it.","After all, Starry Sky Kindergarten's live room is very soothing.","But today was different; as soon as they entered, they saw Shen's father's face greeting everyone on camera: \"Hi, kids, hello, everyone.\"","For a moment, netizens were all puzzled, thinking they had entered the wrong live room."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Break the News","paragraphs":["The netizens couldn't help but look up the ID of the live stream room, and yes, it was correct.","The people in the live stream room had been watching for many days, and they were already familiar with it. But this was the first time they saw Shen Wei's parents.","At this moment, the middle-aged man in the live stream room said, \"I am Shen Wei's father. I came here to do some odd jobs, and I'm making small bread for you all.\"","\"These are the old-fashioned small breads. When I was young, I couldn't afford them, and I always wondered when I would be able to have them.\"","\"Now I know that when you reach a certain age, you can have what you want!\"","He babbled on in front of the camera, looking like a professional host.","The system had applied a beauty filter, and the faint dark circles under his eyes were gone.","With such a beautiful daughter like Shen Wei, he must have been quite handsome in his youth.","Under the beauty filter, he looked even more benevolent, and one could vaguely see his former handsome appearance.","The live stream room soon became lively.","Previously, the viewers had been chatting among themselves in the comment section, and the live stream didn't respond to them much.","But now that they saw Shen's father responding to the viewers so enthusiastically, they got excited.","\"Uncle, are you going to make bread?\"","Shen's father read out the question, then replied, \"Yes, yes, I'll make bread and cookies. What else do you want? I can go learn how to make anything I don't know.\"","The viewers were stunned, knowing that Shen Wei was a rich second-generation. Now, the uncle in the live stream room must be a first-generation rich.","In their minds, the first-generation rich were usually company executives who spoke little and rarely smiled.","Or they were the oily men who casually mentioned billions as a catchphrase.","But this was the first time they had seen someone so enthusiastic and lively, just like the friendly neighborhood uncle.","\"We want croissants, baguettes, napoleons, and donuts.\"","Shen's father looked puzzled, \"What are those?\" Then he scratched his head sheepishly, \"Uncle hasn't heard of those before, but don't worry, kids, Uncle can go learn!\"","He was chatting animatedly next to the camera. Shen's mother next to him said, \"Go ahead and make them.\"","\"Oh, oh, oh.\" Shen's father snapped back to attention, then started weighing the flour and adding milk and butter to the mixer according to the proportions.","The viewers in the live stream room were stunned when they saw this: \"Wow, he's using the top-tier Feibao flour.\"","Afraid that others wouldn't understand, this viewer quickly explained, \"This flour costs more than 60 yuan per pound. I only use it when making the highest-end pastries.\"","\"Uncle is using this material to make small bread? That's such a waste.\"","\"60 yuan per pound, my family's flour has never cost more than 3 yuan.\"","\"Is this what rich people are like? I really want to send my child to the same kindergarten as them.\"","\"In the past, we only saw the rich people shearing sheep and harvesting garlic. This is the first time we get to shear the wool of the rich. Please, let me shear it once, or at least let me have a taste!\"","\"I just want to know what bread made with 60 yuan per pound flour tastes like?\"","Shen's father was quite lively. Seeing so many people commenting, he couldn't help but want to interact with the people in front of the screen: \"How about I send you some after I've made them!\"","Seeing the enthusiasm of the people in the live stream room, he felt a bit embarrassed.","He had never been so popular before. He loved to cook, but not so much to eat.","Seeing how much everyone liked it, he was overjoyed.","As soon as he said that, even more people started calling him \"handsome uncle!\" and \"my internet dad.\"","Shen's father had never experienced this level of affection before, and his face turned red.","Although the live stream had a beauty filter, it actually amplified the advantages of his appearance.","It subtly let people feel the handsome he used to be.","Shen's father said, \"I'll research it again later, how to make that. This is my first time live streaming. Sending things will be talked about later!\"","He hadn't yet learned the tricks of short video making.","He then started making the bread again.","Perhaps due to the nervousness, even though Shen's father had made it many times at home, this time he was a bit clumsy. But the viewers in the live stream room were quick to notice that all the materials he used were top-notch brands.","Including the butter, flour, and milk. They were all premier brands.","Add to that, Shen's father had previously mentioned sending them some.","The number of viewers in the live stream room increased from the usual 100,000 to nearly 150,000.","And Shen's father was the type who would meet any request from the viewers.","When the viewers asked him to interact more with them and not keep his head down making the dough, this was exactly what Shen's father wanted to do.","He just wanted to chat with the viewers.","Then he said to Shen's mother, \"Why don't you do it first, and I'll answer some questions from the viewers. They're so enthusiastic.\"","Shen's mother said okay.","She did it alone, without Shen's father messing around, and Shen's mother's work was more seamless.","Shen's father, experiencing this for the first time, said excitedly, \"This is much better than playing golf. Those people in golf never looked down on me before. The internet is so much better.\"","As soon as he said this, everyone in the live stream was shocked. What did he mean? Was he bullied?","Among the viewers were not just ordinary netizens, but also some local aristocratic families.","Someone with inside information leaked, \"I know, their family is a newly-rich one, and they are not welcomed in high society.\"","The viewers immediately got angry when they heard this: \"Why are they not welcomed?\"","Seeing that Shen's father was just like their own father, so optimistic, and yet he was bullied, they felt a bit unhappy.","\"What's wrong with these people?\"","Shen's father didn't expect that his casual remark would make the viewers want to defend him. He quickly said, \"That's because I'm not good at playing golf!\" and tried to pacify them. He didn't want to offend anyone.","Little did he know that the more he did this, the more sympathy he garnered from the viewers.","Shen Wei, watching the live stream, didn't expect her father to be so popular.","His strategy was just sincerity.","Sincerity is the must-have skill on the internet.","The viewers had never seen anything like this before.","They called him all sorts of names, including \"internet dad.\"","Shen's father was delighted, \"Does this count as becoming a father?\"","He didn't quite understand.","The viewers immediately enlightened him.","Then they saw Shen's father blush, \"No, no, I didn't mean that.\"","Everyone was happy to indulge him.","Seeing some people still persistent, the other viewers said, \"Let him be, this is his first time live streaming, let him feel the love of the internet.\"","Everyone laughed, and the topic was dropped.","The viewers flooded the comment section: \"Shen's father is so easy-going, and Shen Wei is so beautiful, and the family has such a large business. Are you still looking for a son-in-law? One who has been to college.\"","Shen's father read out this comment and said, \"But Shen Wei already has a fiancé.\"","Shen Wei, who was watching the live stream, was dumbfounded. She had never heard of this.","Later, Shen's father explained to the audience that in the past, he and a friend had arranged a marriage for their children, but later the family backgrounds were too different, so they called it off.","The viewers said, \"Arranged marriage in this day and age? What an outdated concept!\"","Shen's father quickly said, \"We were all young and foolish back then!\"","He wanted to change the subject.","But the viewers were all attracted by this topic and kept asking who Shen Wei's ex-fiancé was.","Shen's father refused to talk about it.","He just chatted casually with the audience as if they were friends, but the viewers kept pressing him for details.","What they didn't know was that a public account had already joined the live stream and edited his words into a short video, which was then posted online.","Very quickly, Shen Wei's ex-fiancé was exposed as Gu Qingyan, the young master of the Gu family.","They then dug up his photos, and this young master of the Gu family, while handsome, had an androgynous appearance. He was tall and slim, especially his beautiful hands, which made the hand fetishists go crazy."]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Injustice","paragraphs":["That was just a joke from the elders.","Later, the valuation of the Gu Family's company skyrocketed to several billion, becoming one of the top enterprises in the region.","Meanwhile, Shen's Father was merely an ordinary nouveau riche, at most speculating in stocks and investments, with no real business assets.","The gap between them grew wider and wider, so no one took it seriously anymore.","He casually mentioned it online, but netizens somehow dug up all these details.","After this livestream.","Shen's Father gained many internet sons and daughters, who affectionately called him \"Internet Dad\" until he was dizzy.","Shen's Father dreamed of becoming an internet celebrity.","Many netizens searched for his old accounts. Lo and behold, he had been operating one account for 5 years already, with over 2,000 videos posted.","But most were just him lip-syncing to old songs, with barely any views. It was only after netizens commented that he should post more kindergarten-related content.","His followers surged from just over a hundred to over 50,000.","Shen's Father was overjoyed.","He worked even harder.","Every day, he spent heavily to hire Shen Wei's mother to film videos of him.","Including him eating 5 bowls of rice alone at the kindergarten.","When posted online, everyone was stunned.","Just by looking at how he ate, you could tell how delicious the food was.","At his age, five big bowls!","When there was no more rice left, Shen's Father still looked unsatisfied, but netizens could tell he was leaning against the wall.","Netizens finally understood why Liu Chef didn't cook more rice - he was afraid someone would burst.","There were also videos of him hoeing weeds and working in the fields.","In the videos, he looked so carefree that no one would have guessed he was from a wealthy family. He was just like everyone else's father.","While other crops were still growing.","The tomatoes had already turned a pale pink.","He plucked one and ate it - the skin was thin and sweet, proclaiming he had never tasted such delicious tomatoes before.","Netizens watched his little videos every day. At first, they thought he was exaggerating.","As a wealthy person, what good food hadn't he eaten?","Making such a fuss over a tomato, really?","But Shen Wei knew he was telling the truth, because the tomato seeds came from the system.","The taste had been refined hundreds of times, not only delicious but high-yielding too. One vine was laden with so many tomatoes that the branch was almost bent over. Even after picking, it kept growing.","On his page were also videos of him blindly feeling for shrimp, catching little kids - one grab, one child, the little ones running over laughing, calling him \"grandpa.\"","There were too many for him to carry.","These children knew Shen's Father liked them, and they loved playing with him too.","Calling him grandpa.","He finally understood why Liu Chef doted on these children so much.","He couldn't resist these soft little ones calling him grandpa in their sweet voices - it melted his heart completely.","Shen's Father repeatedly expressed to Shen Wei how well the kindergarten was run and how much he adored it!","Not knowing how else to show his support, he transferred 30 million to Shen Wei.","He gave Shen Wei all the spare cash he had.","Shen's Father's social media posts and online posts were all the same.","His formerly neglected posts now received over 100 likes each, with too many comments to reply to.","Shen's Father's phone kept buzzing every day.","Even some wealthy folks who used to look down on him now brought him up, their tone tinged with jealousy: \"Old Shen, you're something else, you even get to carry your grandkids!\"","Unlike them, whose children didn't even date, let alone have kids for them to carry.","Shen's Father used to be at the bottom of their circle, but now he had suddenly become a winner in life.","The children all adored him, and on top of that, he made videos that inexplicably made them jealous too.","They suddenly felt that all those years of playing golf weren't as interesting.","Horseback riding and the like were just so-so too.","It wasn't as fun as hoeing weeds and tilling fields.","These wealthy folks said, \"Why don't you open a farm stay?\"","So they could experience it too.","They couldn't possibly go enjoy themselves at a kindergarten, but opening something similar was feasible.","Shen's Father said, \"I don't have the money or time.\" His money all went to his daughter.","The others didn't expect Shen's Father to be so blunt and immediately said, \"I have money, you just need to take the lead in setting it up.\"","Shen's Father said, \"Aren't there already a lot of farm stays online?\"","The other party said, \"Those farm stays have no appeal, they've all been commercialized.\"","What they actually wanted was something like a private club, only catering to their kind.","These wealthy people didn't want to mix with ordinary commoners.","Upon hearing this, Shen's Father understood their intentions right away. Somewhat impatient, he said, \"I can't do that.\"","Since they had so many requirements, they might as well do it themselves instead of asking someone else to take the lead. What was the point?","...","Shen Wei's fiancé Gu Qingyan was exposed.","He was simply too handsome, and his personal account attracted many fans of his looks, some even urging them to have kids!","Shen Wei was so beautiful, and her fiancé had such looks too - how adorable would their children be?","The young master of the Gu Family never expected netizens to be in such a hurry.","He hadn't even dated yet, and they were already talking about having kids.","At his young age, he had never experienced such a scenario before. His face flushed red through the screen.","Even Gu Qingyan's close friends called him: \"Well done, you were so sneaky about getting yourself a fiancée without telling us.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"Come on, you don't know what really happened, it's just a misunderstanding.\"","\"I don't know the details, but she's such a beauty, you might as well go with it!\"","\"Get lost.\" He hung up.","The young master of the Gu Family felt inexplicably flustered.","He then opened the internet and was immediately bombarded with so many people mentioning him that he thought he was being cyberbullied.","Opening the latest alerts, he saw it was actually a photo of him getting cozy with a girl at a friend's gathering at a bar in the past.","In the noisy bar environment, they had to lean in close to hear each other speak.","He didn't even remember what they said, but the photo made it look like something had happened between them.","Netizens were cursing at him for being unfaithful!","Gu Qingyan's smile froze on his face.","He felt both embarrassed and angry.","What did the netizens mean?","He didn't even know Shen Wei.","How was he being unfaithful? He had been very faithful all these years and hadn't even dated.","His WeChat was inundated with mentions, and he could already imagine his friends laughing their heads off.","Gu Qingyan didn't need to open the latest comments to see: \"No wonder you've been so chaste all these years, you were just being faithful.\"","\"You're so wronged, even more wronged than Lady Dou.\"","Gu Qingyan's face flushed red with anger. He needed to go home and ask what this marriage arrangement was all about - how did he not even know about it?"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Don't Guess What a man Thinks.","paragraphs":["Gu Qingyan had just returned home when he saw his parents looking at that incident online. His face flushed red as he quickly snatched the phone from them, \"Stop watching it.\"","Gu Qingyan was the youngest child in the family, with an older brother Gu Wei and an older sister Gu Ru.","Being the youngest, he was particularly pampered, which made his personality rather spoiled.","At this moment, he asked his father, \"What's the deal with that marriage arrangement?\"","Gu's Father said, \"Well, when we were drinking, I did mention it. I thought that girl looked quite pretty, but it was just a casual remark!\"","They hadn't brought it up again for years, thinking it was settled.","\"Your Uncle Shen sent me a message, apologizing for his careless words during his first live broadcast when viewers kept asking about it.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"But... people online are mocking me now. How can they say such things about an innocent boy like me?\"","\"So what do you want to do about it?\" His parents had always indulged him, so they tried to placate him when they saw he was upset.","Gu Qingyan said, \"It must be clarified.\"","\"That might not be a good idea. It was just a joke, and everyone would have moved on after some banter. Getting so serious about it makes it seem like we look down on their family.\"","Besides, their family's business was doing better than the Shen Family's. The situation was quite delicate.","Upon hearing this, Gu Qingyan's handsome face fell. He then snorted and returned to his room.","Gu's Mother said, \"Do whatever you want, but don't ruin the harmony between our families!\"","There was an unspoken rule in their social circle not to offend others.","\"I know!\" Gu Qingyan said curtly.","His parents wanted to ask what he had in mind, but he slammed the door shut in anger, refusing to let anyone in, so they left him alone.","The next day, they saw their son in Shen Wei's live broadcast room.","This kid didn't seem to realize it was a kindergarten live broadcast.","He kept pestering Shen Wei, saying, \"Your fans are attacking me now, saying I'm dishonorable!\"","As he said this, even his parents felt awkward watching the screen, while the online viewers were laughing uproariously. It was Shen Wei's first time meeting Gu Qingyan.","She never expected the online \"Young Master Gu\" to have such a personality.","He was very handsome, with eyes that always seemed to contain a pool of water, gazing at people with an inexplicable sense of affection. At the moment, he looked aggrieved.","Having spent a long time in kindergarten, Shen Wei was skilled at comforting children. \"So what do you think we should do about it?\"","\"You should say online that we have no relationship at all, that you don't even know me.\"","\"Okay!\" Shen Wei readily agreed.","Gu Qingyan let out a sigh of relief, then stole a glance at Shen Wei.","Come to think of it, Shen Wei was quite pretty, and her straightforward nature was refreshing.","Shen Wei's earlier gaze had an inexplicable doting quality that made Gu Qingyan's face flush again.","Soon, Shen Wei picked up the phone and pointed the camera at their faces.","The online viewers were in a state of double bliss. Shen Wei was already beautiful, and her alleged fiancé was equally handsome. They didn't know which one to admire more.","They were both too good-looking.","Flattering comments flooded the live broadcast:","\"Wow, the future brother-in-law is so handsome, I'll allow this marriage.\"","\"Can I sleep in between you two?\"","\"The comment above is too thirsty.\"","\"Well, since you three don't mind, let me join too.\"","People said all sorts of things.","Gu Qingyan had never been teased online by so many people before. Flustered, even the corners of his eyes turned red.","Shen Wei said, \"Everyone, please don't say such things anymore. Today, in front of everyone, I hope you can help spread the word that we have no relationship whatsoever! We're not even friends.\"","\"We've never even met before. These comments have really brought a lot of trouble to the people involved!\" Her words were firm, carrying a sense of righteousness.","It made those who had been shipping them feel somewhat discouraged.","At this point, Young Master Gu stared intently at Shen Wei's face, \"You look down on me.\" Why else would she say they weren't even friends?","Not only were viewers from all over the country watching the live broadcast, but also the local socialites.","Since Gu Qingyan had appeared in the broadcast, his friends from high society were watching too.","Someone even shared the live stream with Gu Wei, Gu Ru, and Gu's parents.","Their son had originally intended to distance himself, but upon seeing Shen Wei deny any connection, he couldn't take it anymore.","That statement, \"You look down on me,\" made the Shen Family members cover their faces, unable to watch further.","Gu Qingyan had never pursued a girl in his life.","He was so good-looking that from elementary school to high school and college, countless girls pursued him.","So he had enjoyed special favor from girls, and for the first time encountering a girl who so firmly stated that they weren't even friends, his pride and sense of entitlement crumbled.","Shen Wei said, \"I don't look down on you. It's just that this matter has caused you trouble.\"","While Gu Qingyan's family members found the situation cringeworthy, his friends couldn't help but cheer him on from their screens.","So earlier, was Gu Qingyan throwing a tantrum?","The online viewers went wild: \"Sorry, Shen Wei, I didn't want to ship you two, but Young Master Gu has forced my hand with his pitiful act.\"","\"Could this be love at first sight?\"","\"Absolutely, look at his puppy-dog eyes, I really want to bully him until he cries.\"","\"Here's a pen for you to keep writing.\"","Shen Wei soon ended the live broadcast and switched to other content.","But everyone continued discussing the recent events endlessly.","It would have been better if she hadn't explained at all.","Gu Qingyan returned home dejected.","As soon as he got home, he was taken aback. His whole family was there - parents, brother, and sister.","The TV kept replaying a recorded clip of him saying, \"You look down on me?\" with Gu Qingyan's shocked expression, like a haunting echo.","Gu Qingyan, like a ruffled little rooster, rushed over and turned off the TV. \"What are you doing?\"","Gu's Mother said to Gu's Father, \"You handle our son's pursuit of a girlfriend.\" As a mother, she couldn't advise on how her son should court a girl.","That would just make him the kind of \"mama's boy\" everyone online disliked, so it had to be left to his father.","Gu's Father looked at his children, \"As the older brother and sister, you need to take some responsibility too.\"","Young Master Gu didn't want his family meddling in his affairs. \"I don't need you all to worry about it.\"","Gu Wei was 14 years older than him, so the age gap made him seem more like a father than an older brother to Gu Qingyan.","At this moment, he was speechless about his younger brother's situation.","Gu Ru was three years older than Gu Qingyan. She mocked him, \"You shouldn't have gone at all. If you hadn't, you'd still have the title of 'future husband'!\"","\"Now you have nothing, and you've only just realized you like her. Isn't this a classic case of 'pursuing a wife to the crematorium'?\"","Gu's elderly parents didn't know what \"pursuing a wife to the crematorium\" meant, but they felt it sounded ominous. \"Don't talk nonsense.\"","As good-looking as the Gu Family members were, they had never pursued anyone before.","After much discussion, which seemed like armchair strategizing, they decided to let him start by sending flowers."]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Really Handsome","paragraphs":["Gu Qingyan said, \"What? Don't start yet. I haven't figured it out!\" But his face was blushing.","Gu Qingyan immediately returned to his room. He could hardly stay in that living room anymore, with so many people surrounding him and teaching him how to pursue a girl. Just the thought made him suffocate.","People used to envy his family's good atmosphere in the past.","But the atmosphere was too good, with no privacy at all. Didn't they know that boys entering adulthood need some space?","A grown boy's thoughts didn't need guessing.","...","A new internet-famous kindergarten opened in the city, which was already quite eye-catching, but it became even more popular.","The main reason was that Gu Qingyan was too famous.","Among the three children of the Gu family, two were already married.","Only this little handsome guy was left unmarried, and many single ladies had longed for him in vain.","Everyone wanted to know who would win him over, as people love gossip, so they all flocked to the live broadcast room.","Not only ordinary folks, but even wealthy families couldn't resist tuning in.","As soon as they entered, they found the live broadcast quite captivating.","The children were adorable, and the facilities were top-notch.","Upon closer inspection, it was even more luxurious than prestigious aristocratic kindergartens.","The chef was the former head chef of the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant.","The teacher was the renowned Teacher Tang, quite reputable in the industry.","The school bus driver used to work in the system and was considered among the top three drivers in the city, which was an understatement.","Even the seemingly unnecessary role of the kindergarten doctor was filled by the youngest doctoral chief physician from the local people's hospital.","The more they learned about this kindergarten, the more shocked they became.","Everyone wondered how Shen Wei had managed to assemble such a team.","With these people's support, the internet-famous kindergarten would not just be a passing fad.","Even the current live broadcast's popularity was almost on par with a popular web series.","Someone sent Shen Wei a private message: \"Sister, people are reuploading your videos to other websites. You might as well register on those sites yourselves.\"","Shen Wei thought it made sense, and having more platforms to promote them would increase their fame faster.","So she quickly registered accounts on various platforms and verified them online. Then she posted their daily live broadcast compilations.","Especially on D-site, each post received around 2,000 danmaku comments.","Many people expressed their joy, saying they had finally found it and that watching on D-site was the most comfortable.","The fans would also create secondary works, editing some highlights into cuts.","With such promotion, the number of people watching the live broadcast increased daily.","Gu Weiliang, the elder brother of the young master of the Gu family, was in a meeting when his phone suddenly rang.","After glancing at his phone, an indistinct expression appeared on his face.","The managers below thought something had gone wrong with the European cooperation project.","Little did they know that Gu Wei was watching a small cut featuring his younger brother.","His brother had appeared in the live broadcast room again, and perhaps influenced by the previous incident, he had bought a large bouquet of red roses!","The previous misunderstanding had been cleared up, and the fans had dispersed.","But his action reignited the CP fans' fervor.","\"Oh my, he knows to give flowers, not bad.\"","Clearly, Gu Qingyan was also watching the comments in the live broadcast room. As soon as he saw the crowd praising him, his eyes shone with a touch of pride!","The Gu family was a prestigious household, and although his elder brother and sister excelled, Gu Qingyan was not cut out for business. Everyone supported him being true to himself.","Because everyone doted on him, his personality was rather naive.","As a famous young master, he was so easily elated by a few words from online fans that his elder brother could hardly bear to watch.","Gu Wei's meeting finally ended.","Gu Ru came to his office, and the first thing she said was, \"That stinky brat acts all nonchalant, but secretly goes to deliver roses.\"","They couldn't stand it anymore.","They had never seen their brother take an interest in anyone before, but now he was clearly smitten.","\"So what should we do?\" Gu Ru still wanted to help a little. Just sending flowers wasn't enough!","Moreover, their brother had previously denied any connection in a rush, but now he wanted to make amends. What girl could accept that without doubts?","This matter would undoubtedly make people suspicious!","They really needed to come up with more ideas.","Gu Wei said, \"Let's wait until he needs help.\" Their brother was quite shy. He was afraid that if others commented, the little guy would get angry out of embarrassment.","\"With his attitude, he'll never get a wife in eight lifetimes,\" Gu Ru snorted from the side.","Gu Wei asked, \"Did she accept the roses?\"","Gu Ru was taken aback by his words: \"I didn't see. I only watched a cut!\"","As soon as she finished speaking, their parents called: \"Have you watched that live broadcast? The first thing they said was about this.\"","Before they could speak, Gu Wei continued, \"So did she accept the roses?\"","\"Didn't see it. It quickly switched to other scenes! It seems the suggestions we gave were useful. We should give more next time!\"","But Gu Wei and Gu Ru fell silent.","They had never pursued anyone. However, since their parents had spoken, Gu Wei immediately asked his secretary for tips on how to pursue a girl.","This terrified the secretary, as the CEO had always been devoted to his wife.","Had he encountered his true love elsewhere?","Gu Qingyan was unaware that his ever-successful elder brother had almost been misunderstood by the secretary.","...","Everyone was curious whether Shen Wei had accepted the roses or not.","Actually,","Shen Wei did accept them.","But she said, \"Don't send more.\"","After saying that, she saw Gu Qingyan's eyes quickly lose their sparkle.","Shen Wei felt an inexplicable sense of guilt, as she couldn't bear to see others sad and upset.","Shen Wei said, \"We've cleared that up, right?\"","The young master Gu said, \"It doesn't count.\"","Shen Wei thought he was just joking: \"Don't be silly!\" She spoke as if coaxing a child.","Shen Wei was now fully focused on her career and hadn't considered personal matters.","\"Then let me come and beg for a job!\" he said. He thought it was normal for Shen Wei to reject him, as the two had no experience interacting, so who would be interested in a stranger from the start?","Shen Wei said, \"But we don't have any vacancies.\"","The young master Gu didn't seem to hear the polite rejection: \"It's okay, I can do anything, even carry gas tanks and change water.\"","\"And I don't want any pay!\"","Shen Wei said, \"Well... okay!\" Even if their relationship didn't work out, they at least had the connection between prestigious families.","So she saw him happily leave.","If he appeared in the live broadcast room the next day,","This time, Gu Qingyan's elder brother and sister, father and mother, were all watching the live broadcast room.","They watched as Gu Qingyan came and busied himself helping Shen Wei's father make cakes.","But he did so in a clumsy and inept manner.","Gu Qingyan had never done any household chores at home, and this was his first time making cakes.","Even with molds, he made them look bizarrely ugly. His parents, who had been watching the live broadcast, felt a tinge of envy.","They realized it was better to have daughters!","Gu Qingyan's parents' bitterness only lasted a moment, as they were worried the internet users would scold him.","But contrary to expectations, the public comments were all praising his hands.","Indeed, Gu Qingyan's hands were as white as jade, slender and fair. Just seeing his hands, one could tell he was an absolute beauty.","At times, people wanted to mock him, but as soon as he raised his head and looked at the camera, all insults fell silent.","The internet users said, \"Let's just say, we're fans of his looks!\""]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Someone Stole the House","paragraphs":["Every day, Young Master Gu could be seen in the presence of his in-laws.","Everyone was unaware of how his family had raised such an innocent child. In their impression, wealthy families would usually fight relentlessly over a bit of property.","The appearance of Gu Qingyan completely overturned everyone's perception.","At this moment, the livestream focused on a classroom.","They saw a Little Fatty saying to Shen Wei, \"Principal, let me introduce you to a boyfriend. My uncle is really handsome.\"","The little guy spoke very seriously.","The comments were filled with sympathetic tears for Gu Qingyan.","He was busy entertaining his in-laws, unaware that someone was about to steal his wife.","Soon, the screenshots from this side were sent to Gu Qingyan.","Gu Qingyan was furious!","He went straight to find Shen Wei. He was extremely displeased with that Little Fatty, thinking, \"How dare that brat introduce people to others?\"","The online viewers saw Gu Qingyan approaching from a distance through the glass, prompting comments like, \"The enemy will enter the battlefield in five seconds.\"","\"Little Fatty, you're dead meat.\"","\"Quick, quick, Gu Qingyan, your wife is going to be taken away.\"","When Gu Qingyan arrived and saw Shen Wei, he suddenly became timid, saying, \"Well, I think you have a good eye for investment. Why don't you help me invest? I'll give you money.\"","He had a bit of a crush on her, but since he wasn't familiar with Shen Wei, he didn't know how to initiate a conversation, so he ended up talking about investment in front of everyone.","The viewers watching the livestream from the Gu family's mansion were facepalming.","Gu's Mother was speechless.","She used to think her son had never been involved with anyone and was quite pure.","But now, she realized he was saying the wrong things, like praising a girl's investment skills? He couldn't even give a proper compliment.","As expected, the online viewers started mocking him.","\"Oh my god, this is the first time I've seen how the wealthy date. It's so ridiculous.\"","\"It's true. With just one sentence, he killed the atmosphere. There was still a bit of sweetness and ambiguity when they were apart, but once they were together, it became so awkward.\"","Shen Wei could see the comments.","Gu Qingyan could see them too.","Seeing everyone's mocking comments, Gu Qingyan's face turned red, and he became even more tongue-tied.","Shen Wei tried to defuse the situation, \"Why don't I take you for a tour?\"","She then took him to the vegetable garden.","This vegetable garden was meticulously tended by Liu Chef.","After Shen Wei's parents arrived, they also paid close attention to the vegetable garden, which was neatly arranged, with some vegetables already growing on trellises.","The tomatoes were ripe, and the chili peppers and eggplants were also growing in the field.","\"Indeed, my family from China has a farming heritage. I don't know if it's because of my age, but I just love the sight of a field.\"","\"Who doesn't? My biggest dream is to have my own vegetable garden in the future!\"","\"Wow, this vegetable garden is so neatly arranged.\"","\"Can I eat a tomato?\" Young Master Gu asked, eyeing the slightly greenish-red persimmons, which looked appetizing.","\"Of course!\" Shen Wei said.","They saw him take a persimmon and take a bite. It was sour and sweet, with plenty of moisture.","Perhaps because it wasn't fully ripe, it had a crisp texture when eaten.","It was a flavor he had never experienced before.","The online viewers were drooling, and many asked them to sell some.","\"Their livestream is so magical. Why am I craving their food three times a day?\"","\"Not only am I craving Liu Chef's dishes, but I also want Shen Wei's parents' little buns. Now, even the persimmons are making me hungry. Watching this livestream is really making me drool two pounds worth of saliva.\"","\"I have a feeling that this persimmon must be delicious. The last time Shen's Father ate one, I was already craving it. Now even Young Master Gu enjoys eating it. It must be exceptional.\"","\"Who doesn't? I can't take it anymore. If this continues, I'll have to uninstall the livestream app!\"","Shen Wei said, \"Since everyone wants to try the tomatoes from our livestream, let's give away five pounds for free.\"","Shen Wei then set up a giveaway, and soon, five people won the prize.","The troll named Black was jumping up and down, \"Only five portions? For such a big deal, you're just giving away this trivial thing?\"","An online viewer retorted, \"I didn't win, but I still want to argue with you. Although tomatoes are available everywhere, I want to eat the same ones as Gu Qingyan. Besides, they're not asking for a penny from us, so why are you complaining?\"","\"If you're so great, then pay for it and enter the giveaway!\"","\"You don't have anything yourself, but you keep pressuring others. Today, we will strike the first blow against PUAs.\"","\"Well said.\"","\"They're giving it away for free, and you're still picky. Have you been spoiled by these trolls? If they don't do a giveaway, you call them stingy. If they do a giveaway, you still complain. Is that the only sentence you know how to say?\"","\"Besides, giving away tomatoes is just a trial run. Who knows, maybe they'll give away buns or invite people to dine with them in the future?\"","The online viewers praised, \"That makes sense! It suddenly fills me with hope!\"","The online discussion became heated, with someone excitedly saying, \"Ah, I won! These persimmons look so delicious.\"","\"The persimmons you won aren't worth much. Can I buy them from you for $100?\"","\"I can hear your scheming from across the city. I'll give you $200 for them.\"","\"No, thank you.\"","The livestream regained its excitement.","Soon, the livestream ended, but everyone felt they hadn't seen enough and wanted to rewatch some highlights.","The replay views skyrocketed.","Other kindergartens in the city were feeling sour.","They initially thought it was just a kindergarten livestream.","Kindergartens usually just involve entertaining or putting children to sleep. What could be so interesting?","After some thought, they believed Starry Sky Kindergarten's popularity couldn't last long.","They even planned to mock Starry Sky Kindergarten, but little did they know that the joke was on them.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had quite a variety of content.","One moment, they showcased the chef's culinary skills, and the next, they showed the kindergarten teachers playing games with the children.","Now, they even created a prime-time drama, and online viewers are still eagerly watching to see if Young Master Gu will successfully pursue Shen Wei.","This livestream was destined to be a hit.","At first, everyone thought it was a publicity stunt, but now, no one dared say that. Who could claim that Young Master Gu would act for you?","The other kindergartens were furious. How could they keep changing things up like this?","The more they thought about it, the angrier they became, but they had no way to replicate this approach.","How frustrating, sour, and envious!!!"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Live streaming merchants have ambitions","paragraphs":["Recently, Shen Wei's livestreams have been extremely popular.","Kindergarten livestreaming has seemingly become a new trend in the livestreaming world.","No one had ever imagined that a kindergarten could become such a hit.","Each of her livestreams attracts over 100,000 viewers online.","Those businesses are drooling over this.","For a livestreaming fan base, having 1,000 loyal fans is enough to sell products worth over 100,000 yuan.","But 100,000 fans, what a concept! Tsk tsk...","Those businesses are practically disdainful of Shen Wei sitting on a goldmine without realizing it.","Even if she's simply livestreaming without explaining products, just driving a toy car around, she could easily earn a seven-figure sum per livestream.","So the businesses eyeing her viewership are frantically messaging Shen Wei in private.","They just hope she'll start selling products soon.","Those watching the kindergarten livestreams are mostly mothers and highly educated women.","These are the main forces of internet consumption!","How could the businesses not make money off them? They can't sleep at night.","While others seek collaboration online, Shen Wei mostly politely replies with a simple \"Thank you, no need.\"","But some are crazy about this.","A clothing brand called \"Little Eggs\" sent people from their business department to fly to Shen Wei's city and besiege Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Claiming it was for business collaboration, they simply told the gatekeeper Li Yi and tried to barge right in.","Li Yi wouldn't let them in, and they almost got into a physical altercation outside.","The commotion was so loud that Shen Wei had to come out and see what was happening.","She saw a young man with dyed yellow hair pointing his finger right at Li Yi's nose and arrogantly saying, \"Do you know who I am?\"","\"You're just a barking dog guarding the gate here!\"","Shen Wei's expression immediately soured. No matter which business it was, with zero respect shown, there was absolutely no chance of collaboration.","\"Who are you, and what are you doing causing a ruckus here?\" Shen Wei's face darkened.","When the yellow-haired salesman saw Shen Wei approaching, he immediately put on a fawning smile, \"Oh, I'm the person in charge of 'Little Eggs' clothing.\"","\"We've sent you so many private messages online, but you never replied, so I came in person, sincerely hoping to collaborate with you on a livestream.\"","He looked at Shen Wei with a calculating glint in his eyes.","Without a team, Shen Wei had somehow managed to make her livestreams this wildly popular.","He thought that besides collaborating, it would be best to also sign an exclusive contract.","That way, Starry Sky Kindergarten's entire viewership would be directed to their products - just thinking about it felt great.","As soon as the yellow-haired salesman mentioned \"Little Eggs clothing,\" Shen Wei's system started searching and relayed all the information it found within seconds.","Little Eggs clothing is particularly generous with advertising and has bribed many internet celebrities to leave positive reviews - 99% of online searches yield praise for the brand.","But the system found that many of their products are mislabeled - products marked as Class A for infants and children are actually Class C and B.","The clothes won't fall apart easily, but they overcharge by 10 times or more compared to similar products in the same class.","There's an inexplicable herd mentality where the more expensive a product is, the more people assume it's high-quality, so the brand has become a \"affordable luxury\" among pregnant mothers this year.","It has become the leading brand in the children's clothing and toy sector.","Now they've set their sights on livestreaming and have already collaborated with many top livestreamers.","They've become so big that they usually ignore small internet celebrities.","Originally, Shen Wei's few hundred thousand fans wouldn't have even registered for them since the livestreamers they work with have at least 2 million fans.","But Shen Wei's viewership is so good, and her fans are so niche.","Their research showed that although Shen Wei's fan base doesn't compare to those top livestreamers in number, she might actually outperform them in product sales.","Plus, since Starry Sky Kindergarten hasn't done any product livestreaming before, the premiere would generate buzz worth tens of millions - a win-win for their marketing-savvy company.","Shen Wei said, \"I said we're not collaborating. Moreover, you just insulted our gatekeeper, so you need to apologize immediately.\"","The yellow-haired salesman felt a little displeased - he was used to being fawned over by internet celebrities seeking collaboration. Now, this person was showing her true colors: \"We're a top brand. That we even considered you is an honor. Don't be rude.\"","Other mother-and-baby livestreamers would grovel just to collaborate with them.","Now she was putting on airs too.","Shen Wei said flatly, \"Get lost.\"","This completely enraged the yellow-haired salesman.","The yellow-haired salesman said, \"You'll regret this. I'm telling you, if you make an enemy of us, you won't have a good outcome. I advise you to know your place - this is just a kindergarten after all. You can't defeat capital, can you?\"","Shen Wei snorted coldly, \"What about capital? We're running this kindergarten legitimately. Why would we be afraid of rats like you lurking in the gutters?\"","The yellow-haired salesman was furious. \"Hmph, you underestimate the internet. Online, I can make you live or die!\"","Shen Wei didn't want to engage with him any further. She gave Li Yi a signal with her eyes.","Li Yi said, \"I told you to leave earlier but you didn't. Now you can't leave even if you want to! Apologize, or try me?\"","The yellow-haired salesman stubbornly stuck out his neck, \"Heh. I'm right here, do your worst?\"","Li Yi was a former soldier - if he didn't want the salesman to leave, he couldn't leave.","With just a bamboo rod, he knocked the salesman down several times to eat dirt.","The yellow-haired salesman was angry at first, then became enraged.","But he had to lower his head while on someone else's turf.","Finally, he resentfully apologized before leaving immediately.","Having never experienced such humiliation before, as soon as he reached the airport, he messaged the marketing manager: \"Destroy this kindergarten, damn it, how dare they insult me!\"","The marketing manager was his sworn brother.","He immediately asked, \"What happened?\"","The yellow-haired salesman said, \"Hmph, a bunch of ungrateful fools. We gave them a chance to get rich and they not only rejected it, they arrogantly made me apologize!\"","He had grown accustomed to arrogance within his project team.","He had heard that internet marketing departments have some vicious, underhanded tactics.","This kindergarten looked down on him, didn't they? Fine, he'd teach them a lesson.","If the kindergarten came begging for a truce next time, it wouldn't be the previous collaboration terms.","By then, even Shen Wei would have to apologize obediently to him.","Shen Wei didn't dwell on this incident.","She just thought the forest had grown large enough for all kinds of birds to nest.","With the rapid development of the internet, even those of low quality could ride the trend to dizzying heights.","Having grown used to being flattered, they truly believed in their own abilities!","Shen Wei felt satisfied seeing Li Yi giving that yellow-haired salesman a hard time.","But just two days later, Doctor Lu found Shen Wei saying, \"You should go take a look! Little Eggs clothing's livestream is publicly dissing us.\"","Doctor Lu mostly just did odd jobs now.","Since there were rarely any injuries at the kindergarten that required his medical attention.","Besides studying to be a nutritionist, Doctor Lu spent his time surfing the internet at 8G speeds.","He would inform Shen Wei of any issues right away.","Shen Wei immediately opened that livestream and heard the host saying, \"We previously wanted to collaborate with Starry Sky Kindergarten, but they not only refused, they also said some unpleasant things. Yes, you're internet celebrities, but we in the real business world are no worse than you internet celebrities.\"","There were many fans of the brand in her livestream chat.","Seeing their beloved host claiming the brand was bullied, coupled with their love for the brand, they immediately rushed to attack.","\"What kind of thing are they? Just a small internet celebrity, isn't it? How dare they talk about us?\"","There were also anti-fans stirring up trouble in the comments.","\"To be honest, I don't know what confidence Starry Sky Kindergarten has? As a kindergarten, their focus shouldn't be on turning the kids into idols, yet they're making it like a drama series, and some people are even shipping the characters.\"","\"Exactly, they say they're making all sorts of delicious food for the kids, but in reality, it's all just for publicity.\"","\"You said it, that's the real truth. I've been disgusted by them for a long time, heh.\"","\"Oh, you dare say that? Aren't you afraid of their kindergarten's crazy fans?\"","..."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Save the Children","paragraphs":["This is the first time I've seen a merchant tear apart a web celebrity.","Crowds gathered to watch the spectacle, and quickly the hype built up.","There were even some black fans hired by the marketing department to stir up the muddy waters.","\"Do you remember He Lingfeng? He used to appear on camera all the time. He's such a cute kid, I've been following him, but then I realized he was silent and reserved. It's really pitiful, he doesn't have his own parents and can only rely on this kindergarten, so he has to suffer in silence.\"","\"Shen Wei initially exploited He Lingfeng for publicity, but after gaining popularity, she stopped featuring him. Let's save the child, I can't imagine what kind of treatment a child without popularity would receive in a web celebrity kindergarten.\"","After two days, the merchant finally came up with an angle that could critically hit Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The mom community is the most easily provoked.","Especially when someone uses children as a subject.","It immediately struck a nerve with the moms.","No matter whose child it was, they immediately projected themselves onto the situation.","They ranted endlessly. But some longtime fans of the kindergarten's livestream couldn't stand it anymore.","They immediately clarified online: \"I've been watching since the kindergarten first started livestreaming, it's definitely not like what you're saying.\"","\"He Lingfeng doesn't appear in the livestream because he simply doesn't want to, we should respect the children's wishes.\"","\"Besides, when they were playing the kitchen game before, he confidently faced the camera and even gave his beloved little flower to Fu Bao. How could he possibly be bullied every day? Open your eyes to the truth, you haters!\"","\"Exactly, you can criticize others for suffering, but don't say the children at Starry Sky Kindergarten are suffering! That's the first thing I don't believe!\"","\"They ride in a 2 million yuan school bus every day, with chefs personally cooking for them. Their toys cost thousands of yuan each, and they have a huge lawn to run around on. If you call that suffering, please let me suffer like that!\"","\"People have accused Starry Sky Kindergarten of child abuse before, but the officials have already released data proving otherwise. Are you still mindlessly defaming them, or are you questioning the officials?\"","Those haters, of course, dared not respond to that question, but they didn't accept the other side's argument either. Soon, the two sides began hurling insults at each other.","It quickly turned into an all-out war!","This issue's popularity had already overshadowed the previous clothing brand controversy. Now everyone was focused on attacking the kindergarten, asking why He Lingfeng wasn't allowed to appear.","Was there some unspeakable secret?","Some even wanted to help him \"escape this fiery pit.\"","The speed at which this matter escalated was so rapid that Shen Wei definitely didn't believe no one was fueling it from behind the scenes.","Young Master Gu had been here for a few days. He found this kindergarten to be extraordinarily good, with a very comfortable atmosphere.","The reason Gu Qingyan was unwilling to inherit the family business was because their side was too complex, with constant power struggles between various factions, which was very tiring.","Coming here under the pretext of being an engaged partner, he gradually grew to enjoy working here.","Now that someone was trying to disrupt this place, he was furious and immediately called his elder brother: \"Help me investigate what's really going on behind this.\"","\"Got it!\" His brother readily agreed.","In the previous online attack, everyone was very anxious. But this time, everyone calmly showed up in the meeting room when the incident occurred.","They weren't as flustered as before.","They had been through major storms, and the last time was even more ferocious than this one, yet they persevered. There was no reason they couldn't get through this one.","Everyone wanted to see how Shen Wei would handle it.","\"For now, the best solution is to have the child come out and clarify!\"","But Shen Wei disagreed.","The netizens had fallen into a delusional state, and no matter what she said, the other side wouldn't be satisfied.","Instead, they would fall into a self-proving trap, repeatedly demanding proof from them.","It would be endless. They couldn't do their normal work anymore!","\"That method is viable, but unnecessary. We're a group of adults, surely we can protect one child.\"","Moreover, He Lingfeng was a child prodigy who had already started learning university-level courses, with a particular interest in computer science.","Just a few months ago, he was still illiterate, so his rapid progress far exceeded their understanding of geniuses.","Shen Wei wanted to protect him and prevent outside interference from affecting him.","But she never expected the haters to seize this opportunity to launch a frenzied attack.","The next day, the kindergarten's livestream went on as usual.","As soon as the livestream started, 50,000 people poured in, more than any previous livestream.","The comment section at the bottom of the screen, which used to be filled with compliments about how cute the children were or young people joking around online, was now filled with insults.","Many loyal viewers also hoped Shen Wei would explain the situation clearly.","Shen Wei only said one sentence: \"This incident is not true.\"","She didn't say anything else.","Seeing this, the livestream haters became even more excited.","\"Don't know what to say, huh? Didn't come up with a good excuse?\"","\"Yeah, why doesn't the kid go study with the other kids?\"","\"In this day and age, you're not letting the child study, what are you even thinking?\"","\"I used to think He Lingfeng was just cute, now I realize how pitiful he is.\"","Shen Wei continued the livestream as usual, but the viewers said all sorts of things, making the atmosphere very chaotic.","At that moment, someone suddenly said: \"Oh, look, someone posted a statement on Xiao Moushu.\"","\"What's that?\"","Shen Wei thought that as long as the hype died down, it would be fine. But she never expected someone who supported her to finally snap.","Shen Wei didn't ask anyone from the kindergarten to issue a statement.","Unexpectedly, she saw someone defending her, which piqued her curiosity.","She then searched for Xiao Moushu on her phone, and the top trending item on Xiao Moushu was a statement posted by Su Jun.","\"I've seen what's happening online, and I'm really angry. Let me tell you the truth about why He Lingfeng doesn't attend school with regular kids. It's because he has already studied elementary and middle school curricula. Would you ask a middle school student to learn 1+1=2? Would they be willing?\"","\"As for claims that Starry Sky Kindergarten mistreats children, I strongly disagree with that.\"","\"It was Shen Wei who initially discovered He Lingfeng's special talents and arranged tutors for him, at 200 yuan per hour. Ask yourself, would you be willing to pay such a high price for tutoring your own child?\"","He then shared screenshots of the tutoring platform's records.","The 200 yuan tutoring fee had caused a stir on their platform at the time.","He had photos with He Lingfeng and even short videos of He Lingfeng doing homework assignments."]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Fight fire with fire","paragraphs":["As soon as the words were spoken, the comments section on Xiao Moushu's post immediately surged to 3,000.","Netizens commented: \"What's the deal with 1,200? My brother's tutoring fee is only 25 per hour. My brother must be the one who was picked up.\"","\"I'm really jealous, my own child doesn't get treated as well as a kindergartener.\"","\"Those who accused He Lingfeng of abuse should apologize now.\"","\"Just a while ago I was defending the kindergarten, and someone kept pestering me. We argued for an hour. Now that they've posted this clarification, that person is hiding like a turtle. If you have the nerve to insult others, you should have the nerve to apologize. Don't hide in there silently, I know you're watching.\"","The netizens didn't expect the situation to develop this way.","Initially, they were so adamant, scorching everything in their path.","Now they realize they were mocking a joke.","Su Jun was right, who would spend 200 per hour on tutoring for a 5-year-old?","And to be able to keenly discover a child's talent, that's not neglect - the child must be given special attention to know their abilities in this area.","Other people realized: \"No wonder we could only see He Lingfeng when he was playing games.\"","\"So he was secretly taking lessons behind the scenes.\"","\"Do you remember? There was a live stream once. He Lingfeng publicly said he didn't want to play, he just wanted to study, but Shen Wei persuaded him to strike a balance between work and play.\"","\"I see, she's making me cry. Not only did she pay top dollar for his tutoring, but she also gave the child a childhood where he could play freely with his friends.\"","\"I'll be staying put here today, let's see who dares to badmouth them now.\"","But the trolls wouldn't surrender so easily: \"Am I the only one who thinks this is just the old trick of exploiting children again? The celebrity kindergarten is starting to hype up a child prodigy!\"","\"Yeah right, a 5-year-old learning middle school material. What a joke?\"","\"A 5-year-old's brain probably isn't even fully developed yet.\"","\"To say something so outrageous, looks like Shen Wei is playing a bigger game here.\"","\"Maybe when they initially paid 200 per hour to hire someone, they already had a plan in mind. Are we all just pawns in their game?\"","\"That's terrifying.\"","\"The celebrity kindergarten just wants attention, right? Well, this is a great way to create a child prodigy that will keep them famous for 10 years.\"","\"The kindergarten's loyal old fans must be helpless. What do you mean? Does Shen Wei need money? Spreading rumors every day, don't you have any scruples?\"","Everyone was in an uproar.","They had already forgotten about the clothing promotion incident from the beginning.","In front of the phone, a little blond boy was watching the commotion with a sly smile on his lips: \"I told you, ordinary people can't compete with capital, why wouldn't they believe me?\"","Now you see, if there are no flaws, he can create them.","They've been using these methods successfully over and over.","They've taken down more celebrities than you can count.","Now Little Yellow Hair couldn't wait to see Kindergarten Teacher Shen Wei crying her eyes out.","If Shen Wei knew it was because she provoked the wrong people that led to this situation, would she regret it?","At that moment, someone from the business department immediately called Little Yellow Hair: \"Oh no, Shen Wei is responding with a live stream.\"","\"So what if she's live streaming, she's too preoccupied with her own troubles to bother with us. Good job bro, now think of another way to take them down so they can never recover.\"","On the other end, the business department was going crazy: \"Just go look for yourself, stop blabbering with me.\" They were completely panicking.","After hanging up, Little Yellow Hair didn't know why the other person was so agitated, but he immediately went to watch. Oh no, this was a mess that couldn't be swept under the rug.","Shen Wei was tearing into them directly on her live stream, not about He Lingfeng's issue, but pointing her guns directly at them instead.","She had their product samples and test reports.","\"Little Eggs previously approached me for a collaboration, but I declined because their test results didn't meet standards. I never expected they would show up at our kindergarten and verbally abuse our security guard. Once they knew we wouldn't work with them, they started making outrageous claims.\"","Finally, she revealed two test reports from reputable institutions.","One verified their products as Class B, but labeled them as Class A.","As we know, Class A clothing is typically much more expensive than Class B.","Coupled with Little Eggs' brand premium, the markup could be tenfold or more.","Many parents just want to buy good quality for their children, even if they have to cut spending elsewhere.","But they ended up falling into the company's trap, with that hard-earned money going straight into the company's pockets.","A company's reputation is crucial.","Little Yellow Hair's face stiffened, never imagining Shen Wei would go for the jugular like this.","Using such high attention to directly target the brand.","\"Little Eggs\" is one of the largest domestic maternity and childcare companies, with billions in annual sales.","Now they've been exposed, causing an uproar.","Many people forwarded the test reports to their friends' circles or groups.","The state cracks down hard on fraud, but people have been operating in the dark, never expecting the company would commit fraud.","Their painstakingly built brand image over so many years has now been destroyed.","No wonder the business department was in such a panic earlier. They thought they were just going to extinguish a small celebrity, as easy as squashing an ant. But they ended up kicking an iron plate this time.","With this single move of striking at the root, Shen Wei shifted everyone's attention from He Lingfeng to Little Eggs' clothing.","\"Oh my god, I've been buying this brand for my child since they were 1 year old. They're heartless.\"","\"I don't replace my own clothes for years, just so I can buy good ones for my child, even if I have to grit my teeth.\"","\"I'm devastated, I just bought clothes from this brand for my brother's kid a few days ago, and now it's exposed.\"","\"I've been saying for a while that after buying their clothes, my child would break out in rashes. Back then when I posted about it online, many people said it was my child's problem. Now the truth is out - it's their poor clothing quality.\"","From the other side of the internet, Little Yellow Hair was sweating profusely.","Soon, his direct supervisor started calling him.","Once they investigate, they'll know he's the one who stirred up this mess.","If the brand pursues legal action, he won't be able to pay it back in several lifetimes. His eyes darkened, not daring to pick up the call.","But Shen Wei wasn't done yet.","Soon, she released another video clip.","This clip contained the raving statements Little Yellow Hair made earlier.","Shen Wei's side had high-definition security cameras provided by the system.","They captured his expressions crystal clear.","Especially when he arrogantly said he would make Shen Wei regret it, and that an arm can't twist a thigh, and so on.","Now everyone finally understood why the voices criticizing the kindergarten exploded overnight.","This is why.","\"Wow, I never knew what it meant to throw one's weight around until now.\"","\"No wonder the state doesn't allow monopolies, once you have power, this is what you become.\"","\"I've reported them, urging the authorities to investigate Little Eggs thoroughly. I also suggest everyone keep records of past purchases to prepare for refunds. Our money is hard-earned, we can't just let these unscrupulous companies take advantage.\"","\"Sisters, I've written the refund and reporting methods on Xiao Moushu.\"","Shen Wei's counterattack was so swift, Young Master Gu returned with evidence that Little Eggs had hired internet trolls.","All of a sudden, Little Eggs, who was once a national clothing brand, became an existence that everyone wanted to beat up."]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Live Streaming Paused","paragraphs":["Not only them, but even the big streamers who had previously streamed Little Eggs were impacted by this wave.","Some people truly trusted these streamers, but now they find that their trust has been betrayed.","After Little Eggs' incident, everyone felt insecure.","Little Eggs' company kept trying to downplay the issue, removing it from hot searches, but many people still flooded into Shen Wei's live stream room.","Now, no one thought about He Lingfeng's initial incident anymore.","\"Those who have never criticized Starry Sky Kindergarten, come and give a like.\"","At this moment, a charming and adorable little boy suddenly appeared in the live stream room - it was He Lingfeng.","The live stream room didn't expect a child to show up at this time. And He Lingfeng was truly cute, sure to become a handsome guy in the future if he continued like this.","He Lingfeng looked at Shen Wei and said, \"I know what's happening online.\"","Suddenly, the internet seemed to be paused. Many people were very surprised.","Shen Wei asked, \"Who told you?\"","He Lingfeng said, \"I saw it myself on the computer in the multimedia room.\" He was a computer genius after all.","He could now secretly browse the news.","If it weren't for this big incident, He Lingfeng wouldn't have planned to tell Shen Wei this secret yet.","But since the incident happened, even though he was a child, He Lingfeng wanted to speak up about it.","He hadn't said anything yet, but Shen Wei could sense it.","She immediately said, \"It's okay, the truth will come to light!\"","He Lingfeng's eyes turned red.","The two were in front of the live stream camera.","When the child cried like this, many fans in the live stream room couldn't bear it: \"This kind of cyber-bullying is hard even for adults to endure, let alone children.\"","\"Look how you've upset the child.\" The fans kept chattering.","He Lingfeng resolutely said, \"But I have something I want to say.\"","Shen Wei was stunned for a moment. \"Then say it.\"","Facing the live stream camera, the child said, \"Hello everyone, I'm He Lingfeng. I'm living and eating well here, very happily. Someone is teaching me classes now, and I can also play with other kids. It's not like what you all said. I hope you won't say anything about the kindergarten anymore. Sister Shen Wei is my benefactor.\"","Shen Wei didn't expect He Lingfeng to say such a statement either.","This statement, which clearly no one taught him, was truly moving.","Shen Wei was chosen by the system to help change her destiny, and incidentally help the young villain.","But the more she interacted with these children, the more she felt a sense of social responsibility. She truly treated He Lingfeng as her own, unwilling to let him suffer the so-called fate in the book.","The two had tears in their eyes.","In the live stream room, the fans were crying in floods.","At this moment, many people said, \"Oh my god, Professor Liu has issued a statement!\"","Previously, many people online had been questioning whether He Lingfeng had middle school-level abilities.","The debate raged endlessly, alarming Professor Liu.","He was the professor from Shen Wei's university who gave He Lingfeng a lesson every week, and he became more and more astonished with each lesson.","It wasn't that the child's level was extraordinarily high.","He was only 5 years old, after all.","Professor Liu had been a teacher for so many years and loved talent.","He really didn't want to see a young genius being slandered online like this.","He couldn't help but clear things up.","Professor Liu's account had been verified many years ago, but he had never posted anything until now. His explanation about He Lingfeng from Starry Sky Kindergarten immediately went viral.","It's worth noting that Professor Liu's former students are now pillars of the industry.","He was a teacher of teachers.","An old-school academic like Professor Liu, who is so stubborn, would never fabricate lies for others.","Moreover, he had already retired. It was time for him to cherish his reputation.","The fact that he voluntarily came forward meant he truly believed He Lingfeng was a talent. Immediately, everyone believed that He Lingfeng was a genius. Many people, out of admiration, went to find his previous clips to see what this young genius looked like.","\"A 5-year-old kid is already doing middle school-level questions. I went home and kicked my son's butt.\"","\"What kind of celestial baby is this? Every time I help my son with his homework, I almost have a heart attack. I never knew there were kids who love studying so much that they can skip grades.\"","\"Before, I heard about kids skipping grades in elementary school at most. But 5 years old and skipping directly to middle school level? This must be a future pillar of the nation.\"","\"I used to think he was just cute, but now I realize he's not only cute but also talented!\"","He Lingfeng's former parents and living environment were also dug up, and the more people saw, the more they sighed in pity.","How dare these people attack Shen Wei? If not for Shen Wei, He Lingfeng would still be living in a garbage heap.","\"When I think that just half a year ago, He Lingfeng couldn't even eat or dress warmly, my heart aches. There must be many more like him. Could we find them and donate some money?\"","\"Shen Wei is really such a good person, even finding a university professor to teach him.\"","\"I know about this. At that time, many people didn't attend the university's math class. The last time, Shen Wei brought him to observe the class, and it was posted on the campus forum!\"","They then found the campus forum post and did some archaeology. It turned out to be true.","No one believed He Lingfeng had university-level abilities at the time.","Su Jun and Professor Liu both instinctively concealed this fact.","People online only knew he had middle school-level abilities.","Even so, they thought it was impressive.","Immediately, many media outlets caught wind of this and wanted to get an exclusive interview while the heat was strong.","They rushed to the kindergarten but couldn't even get through the door.","Li Yi was there, standing firm like a rock, not letting anyone in.","Looking around, other newspapers had also come to fight for the scoop.","They were all camped out at the entrance.","Shen Wei had wanted to protect He Lingfeng from being disturbed by the media before.","Fortunately, He Lingfeng lived here and didn't have to go out, able to hide here.","Shen Wei also posted a message on her social media account: asking everyone not to disturb their private lives anymore.","The next day, fans eagerly awaiting the live stream at the set time were excited, but then found that Starry Sky Kindergarten had posted an announcement half an hour ago that the live stream would be temporarily suspended from that day.","The fans were not having it: \"But this is my electronic pickled vegetable!\"","\"Who was so scummy as to do this?\"","\"No way, I need to see the babies, I need to ship the CP, I need to see delicious food. Quickly resume the live stream, or I'll beg you.\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Youthful Mindset Steady","paragraphs":["The live stream from Starry Sky Kindergarten has been shut down, completely contrary to everyone's expectations.","For some time, people have been following the live stream every day, and it has become a habit for the fans.","Through the live stream, people knew that Liu Chef is a spoiled grandfather figure - everyone calls him grandpa. He has no principles and just laughs in a silly way.","They also knew that Teacher Tang is a great teacher, and the kids all love her.","And they knew that Doctor Lu has a cold exterior but a soft heart. He surfs at 8G network speed, and every time it's his turn on the live stream, he always says many brilliant lines with a cold face.","After a long time, it has become more than just watching a live stream, but a deep companionship.","These days, everyone is under a lot of pressure.","Seeing the little kids playing so happily and merrily is truly healing.","Perhaps the popularity of Starry Sky Kindergarten has blocked someone's financial gains, as there have been constant disturbances from the beginning.","But no one thought that Starry Sky Kindergarten would really shut down the live stream.","The fans in the live stream room rushed angrily towards the brand.","They wanted to scold them fiercely, for stirring up trouble unnecessarily and causing the kindergarten to stop broadcasting.","They even bought water armies to defame the kindergarten. This is not the manner and grace of a national brand.","They are simply acting like bandits from the past.","And playing the \"those who go with me will prosper, those who defy me will perish\" game. Even the Qing Dynasty perished.","The fans wanted to curse at them, but the brand's live stream room was already filled with curses, with voices crying out for refunds everywhere.","Some were using all kinds of foul language to insult the host, and the host was almost in tears on camera, but they had no sympathy for her.","This brand has been deceiving people for over 10 years, so it should bear all of this.","The PR managers of the brand collectively resigned!","At this moment, the brand's headquarters was facing joint inspections from various departments.","Just the charge of fraud alone would result in an astronomical fine.","On top of that, there were also some tax issues, so the entire accounting leadership and legal representatives were summoned. This time, they were likely facing dire consequences.","The manager found Little Yellow Hair, the salesman, who was trembling.","He entered this office area that he was most familiar with, but as soon as he walked in, many colleagues glared at him angrily.","Don't think they didn't know what happened - it was Little Yellow Hair who caused this mess!","They worked hard here and had high salaries!","And there were even some internal discounts, so their products were prestigious gifts.","They could even resell them on a small scale.","Working here meant they were not short on money, but he ruined this good job.","Little Yellow Hair tried to shrink his shoulders to lower his presence, but it was useless. He was completely surrounded by colleagues, and someone in the crowd shouted, \"Beat him!\"","The angry colleagues immediately rushed towards Little Yellow Hair and beat him to the ground with punches and kicks, causing him to scream in pain.","There were too many people throwing punches, and Little Yellow Hair couldn't tell who had actually hit him.","By the time the manager pulled him up, he had been beaten for more than 10 minutes. His whole face was swollen, and his eyes had been gouged.","He couldn't even speak a complete sentence, and he was shaking with rage.","Furious, he called the police, but the company said the surveillance cameras were broken!","Little Yellow Hair's heart sank - he had a bad feeling. This must have been arranged by the manager, otherwise why would the surveillance cameras break right after he was beaten? This was not a place to linger!","But he had come to the headquarters to take responsibility, how could they let him leave?","Afterwards, he was brought to the meeting room with a bruised and swollen face, and all the senior leaders from various departments were speaking to him with a black aura.","\"Why did you provoke that kindergarten?\"","If it weren't for his provocation and scheming, the other party would not have retaliated.","Now the brand's black marks have been exposed, and the resulting loss online is incalculable.","And they were also bought out by a competitor's hot search.","Currently, the brand is facing product returns from major distributors and astronomical fines.","They may even have to mortgage this entire building.","\"Tell us what to do.\"","Upon hearing this, Little Yellow Hair's legs almost gave out.","\"I have no money!\" he was truly scared now, not even caring about the pain on his face. \"I'm sorry, I was wrong.\"","But the leaders waved their hands dismissively, as if shooing away a fly. \"We're all adults, does an apology resolve everything? Await the legal summons.\"","Little Yellow Hair went limp and collapsed to the ground, a jumble of regret, self-blame, and fear.","This grown man actually started crying, with snot and tears flowing together, a disgusting sight.","He did regret it - he should never have taken on this project with the kindergarten.","He had been arrogant for too long, truly believing the world revolved around him.","While Little Yellow Hair was saddled with enormous debt, the online condemnation of the Little Eggs brand did not stop.","Some former small hosts also came forward to lament.","Originally, it was because their partnership with this brand went poorly that someone fabricated black marks against them online, causing a cyber attack that forced many to leave the industry.","But in hindsight, if there were just some communication issues between the contracting parties during a business partnership, the crime did not merit such consequences.","It's thanks to the kindergarten's perseverance.","And with Starry Sky Kindergarten's fan base, they were able to withstand the attack. Otherwise, it's terrifying to imagine a company with such unchecked power online.","Now that the incident has blown up, no one is protecting this brand anymore.","As long as someone speaks out, there will be huge traffic, and those who previously left the industry are now coming forward to speak up, even sharing past chat records and screenshots.","The partnership back then had ruined their futures.","At this moment of the brand's downfall, everyone is liking and applauding.","Indeed, doing too many disgusting things will eventually lead to hitting a brick wall!","The kindergarten's fans had no idea this brand was so terrifying.","Afterwards, they all flocked to the kindergarten's official blog to leave messages, very concerned about everyone being affected.","Some said, \"Not live streaming is quite good, at least it protects the children!\"","But more people wanted the live stream to continue.","At this moment, everything at the kindergarten is normal.","An unexpected figure has appeared at the kindergarten - Professor Liu.","Professor Liu is currently giving He Lingfeng a private lesson.","Shen Wei and the 5-year-old He Lingfeng are both as usual, finally relieved that he had been worrying for nothing!","The younger generation is better at staying calm than them.","He just didn't want the online situation to affect them, which is why he came to visit and also gave He Lingfeng a lesson.","In the end, Shen Wei invited him to stay for a meal.","With a relaxed mood, Professor Liu said, \"I've been smelling the aroma for a while now. What's for lunch today?\"","Who would have known that the usually composed Professor Liu is actually a foodie in private?","It's just that he's good at hiding it, so people don't usually know.","Shen Wei said, \"Today I've stewed beef tendons.\"","She had specifically asked someone at the farmer's market to save those beef tendons.","There were only a few cattle, so it took some time to accumulate the amount they needed.","They were cooked until soft and sticky, and tasted exceptionally fragrant.","Upon hearing this, Professor Liu's mouth watered. \"Wonderful, then I'll mooch a taste from you today!\" Then, regaining his composure, he said to Shen Wei, \"Be sure to cultivate He Lingfeng well.\"","Professor Liu had been teaching for so many years, yet he had never seen someone so young with such a gift for mathematics and computer science!","What is a prodigy? Someone who understands before being taught, an extremely rare occurrence.","It's fortunate that Shen Wei discovered him early on, otherwise in an ordinary family his talents could have been neglected.","Professor Liu told Shen Wei, \"He Lingfeng's approach is great, but he's learning too quickly. He needs a large number of practice problems to solidify his foundation, we mustn't let him get ahead of himself.\"","\"I have an account on a mathematics forum with a lot of basic knowledge curated by reputable professors. He can take online courses there.\"","Shen Wei said, \"That's wonderful!\"","She was familiar with the mathematics forum and its high standards.","The fact that Professor Liu personally authorized an account for He Lingfeng showed how much he valued the child's abilities."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Iron Plate Beef Tendon","paragraphs":["Shen Wei repeatedly thanked Professor Liu.","Professor Liu said, \"No need for that, I'll just eat more, and consider it your thanks.\"","Shen Wei took Professor Liu to a small restaurant.","As soon as they entered, they saw the sloppy braised beef tendon on the sizzling iron plate.","The beef tendon had been pressure-cooked beforehand, then braised in a special sauce, making it soft and tender. Finally, it was finished on the iron plate to give it a crispy outer layer.","It was truly delicious!","In the past, Liu Chef had made it before, and there wouldn't be a single tendon or drop of broth left - they would all be used to mix with rice, which was incredibly tasty.","At this moment, Professor Liu couldn't say another word and went straight to eating.","Today's soup was seaweed egg drop soup.","No one knew how Liu Chef made it, but with just a few eggs, the soup was almost filled with wispy egg strands.","The soup was refreshingly tasty, and with one sip, it warmed the stomach.","Professor Liu drank the soup while eating the iron plate beef tendon.","There were also stir-fried greens that didn't look special, but were crisp, delicious, tender, and juicy when eaten.","Professor Liu didn't know which dish to eat first.","But his favorite was still the rich, spicy beef tendon - he had three bowls of rice, which was the high-quality rice from Wuchang!","It had an intense aroma.","Professor Liu ate with great enjoyment.","He didn't realize how full he was until he stood up, his stomach bloated.","It had been a long time since his stomach felt this full - he had to lean against the wall to get up.","He used to think people were exaggerating when watching live streams, but now that he had experienced it himself, he knew it was not an exaggeration at all.","The food here was just that delicious.","Before eating, Professor Liu had thought of coming to see He Lingfeng and the others.","But after the meal, he changed his mind and told Shen Wei, \"Here's what we'll do - I'll come twice a week to specifically tutor He Lingfeng.\"","That way, he could also eat a meal here.","Originally, he had planned to come once a week, but with such delicious food, once a week was far too little, so he changed it to twice a week.","Having a professor of his caliber come would be a good thing for the entire kindergarten.","Shen Wei was of course delighted, \"Okay, thank you so much. Rest assured, we will compensate you generously for your services.\"","Professor Liu smiled and agreed. Afterwards, he had some fruit and a bottle of yogurt after the meal, feeling that the kindergarten was doing pretty well.","...","Today, they had the iron plate beef tendon, and as soon as this dish came out, everyone from the children to the teachers ate it up with relish!","Even Shen's Father specifically told Shen Wei, \"This iron plate beef tendon is really too delicious!\"","They ate it last.","Each person could only have five or six pieces of the finger-thick iron plate beef tendon.","They couldn't eat as much as they wanted, which was truly torturous.","Liu Chef truly lived up to his reputation as the head chef of the Jiangbei Grand Restaurant - his cooking skills were top-notch.","Shen Wei said, \"I told the beef stall vendor to save any beef tendon for us!\"","Shen's Father said, \"Ah, that's too little, you should just buy up all the beef tendon in the market!\"","Based on the previous frequency, they could only eat it once a month, which was not nearly enough.","They wanted to eat it again as soon as they finished the meal, but with the short supply of beef tendon, they were left craving more.","Shen Wei was a bit troubled, \"But I haven't had time to go to the market recently.\"","Shen's Father slapped his chest resoundingly, \"Then I'll go.\"","He was a man of great drive.","In the afternoon, he first brought in two large freezers.","Then he went to the market. No one knew how he found the suppliers, but he bought 500 kilograms.","When he brought it all back, the kindergarten employees welcomed him with cheers lining the path.","Everyone loved eating beef tendon.","Old Man Shen was amazing!","Shen's Father's face turned red, \"Alright, whatever you want to eat from now on, I'll buy it for you!\"","When he made those little buns, they were too sweet, so Shen Wei didn't let him make them often.","But making them every few days wasn't enough to keep Shen's Father occupied.","Now an opportunity had come up!","He took charge of logistics and procurement.","Soon, Shen Wei's father approached Shen Wei secretly and said, \"Good daughter, transfer some money to me.\"","Initially, he hadn't expected his daughter to be so successful and prosperous in her career, so in a fit of joy, Shen Wei's father had transferred all his money to his daughter. Now, when he needed to buy things, he realized his pockets were empty.","Subsequently, Shen Wei transferred 10 million to her father.","As soon as Shen Wei's father received the money, he perked up, \"Don't worry, daughter, if you ever need anything in the future, just give the order, and I'll buy it all for you.\"","Shen Wei's father had been living a life of leisure at home for years.","He felt that this life was becoming dull.","After coming to the kindergarten for not too long, he suddenly felt a renewed passion for life.","It was better to stay busy! Keeping occupied made time fly by.","Moreover, he could eat several big bowls of food every day here - in a word, it was invigorating.","The kindergarten itself was quite harmonious.","However, the kindergarten's parents were influenced by online rumors.","Especially Elder Sister Xu from the mall - her daughter Mengmeng had always been well taken care of at the kindergarten.","This child was clearly more lively and cheerful compared to before starting at the kindergarten,","All thanks to the attention from the teachers and the principal.","She had always been grateful.","Fortunately, her mother-in-law loved getting small bargains and transferred her daughter to this kindergarten.","Little did she expect that once it became popular, problems would arise.","In these past few days, she had read those heartbreaking comments online and felt angry.","She kept posting to clarify the situation, but as an ordinary person, how could she withstand those malicious trolls?","Sometimes she was so angry she couldn't eat, and now that they weren't live streaming anymore, she was even more worried about the kindergarten.","It was so difficult to find such a good kindergarten, she desperately hoped it wouldn't be disrupted by the trolls.","Mustering her courage, she drafted and revised the message multiple times before finally sending Teacher Tang a greeting.","After sending the message, Elder Sister Xu's heart raced and her breathing quickened.","She was anxious, fearing to hear bad news.","Very soon, a reply came: \"Everything's fine here!\"","Teacher Tang even specifically sent a video of Mengmeng playing with everyone just a while ago.","Seeing this video, Elder Sister Xu's heart settled a bit.","Afterward, other people from the mall came over and asked, \"How is your child's kindergarten doing?\"","Everyone knew that Elder Sister Xu's child was attending the internet-famous kindergarten.","This kindergarten was so exclusive that money couldn't guarantee admission.","Elder Sister Xu said, \"It's fine, those people online are just making nonsense.\"","\"Then why did they stop live streaming? I still wanted to watch the live stream.\"","Elder Sister Xu replied, \"It's better that they stopped, saves us from the messy online quarrels!\"","That's what she said, but in her heart, she also hoped the kindergarten would continue live streaming.","However, since the kindergarten hadn't said anything, she didn't dare say much either.","When the other kindergartens saw that Starry Sky Kindergarten had stopped live streaming, they all breathed a sigh of relief. The reason was simple - this kindergarten was just too good at creating sensations!","And then streaming every day, and setting the standards so high.","Now some students' parents use Starry Sky Kindergarten as an example, wanting to find a replacement for Starry Sky Kindergarten, but replacements are not easy to find.","It has become very difficult for other kindergartens to enroll students.","Now that Teacher Tang doesn't stream anymore, it's truly a blessing from heaven.","Unfortunately, the joy didn't last long, as many fans flocked again to Teacher Tang and Doctor Lu, as well as the official kindergarten account, petitioning to restart the kindergarten live streams.","The principals of other kindergartens are once again worried."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Young Master of the Noble Family","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten was different from most kindergartens.","Most internet-famous kindergartens would raise their prices as they gained more online popularity.","But despite becoming a hit, Starry Sky Kindergarten stopped enrolling new students altogether.","Every day, mothers hoping to enroll their children would call and queue up, with over a hundred calls per day, not counting private messages online.","People from other cities even invited Starry Sky Kindergarten to open a branch near their neighborhoods.","Seeing the situation with Starry Sky Kindergarten, principals of other kindergartens gradually let go of their worries.","No matter how popular Starry Sky Kindergarten became, they were not on the same track.","Starry Sky Kindergarten only had one class with 20 students, hardly making a profit compared to their own kindergartens.","It was just a place for a rich heir to experience life, right?","If they wanted to enroll, they would have to look to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","What good would it do for parents to like Starry Sky Kindergarten?","When parents seeking a Starry Sky Kindergarten standard came to enroll, the admission teachers would sneer at them: \"Then go to Starry Sky Kindergarten!\"","Leaving the parents stunned.","Other kindergartens used this petty, triumphant way to humiliate many people.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten did accept some children.","Previously, Shen Wei had promised that each employee could have two enrollment spots to recommend students.","How they handled those two spots was up to them.","It was essentially an employee benefit.","The school bus driver had sold both of his spots.","Teacher Tang gave one spot to her mentor's granddaughter.","Ever since joining this kindergarten, the employees had truly dedicated themselves to its success.","Now that the kindergarten had declared it would not enroll new students, they didn't want the enrollment spots to bring more trouble.","The school bus driver's spots were helped to be sold by Liu Chef.","He sold them to his former customers.","These people had some connections and favors to call in.","Giving those high-class nobles gifts like bags, cars, and money meant little to them.","But offering a kindergarten enrollment spot was a novelty.","Especially for the now limited-edition Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The wealthy can't resist anything limited-edition.","Thus, after passing through many hands, one of the spots ended up with the Liu Family.","The Liu Family used to be in the steel and construction material business. Although not well-known online, they were one of the local old aristocratic tycoon families.","They truly had their own mines.","They had many sports cars worth millions in their garage.","The Liu Family's third young master had a 5-year-old son, Liu Chen, who had not yet chosen a kindergarten.","The reason was straightforward.","Children from such wealthy families no longer needed to attend kindergarten.","Even the most luxurious local aristocratic kindergarten was not up to their standards.","Sending a child to kindergarten would inevitably lead to envy and jealousy.","Young children especially needed to be nurtured closely.","They would typically have a private tutor.","But there were downsides to that approach as well.","Children need to play with their peers.","So the Liu Family patriarch eventually decided to send the child to kindergarten after all.","But he hadn't decided which one yet.","After considering options for a year, he had to make a decision this year.","This was a family matter unknown to outsiders.","So when a gift of an internet-famous kindergarten spot arrived unexpectedly, it was a pleasant surprise.","The third young master couldn't help but remark to his buddy: \"These people are truly skilled at reading minds!\" Even he felt inferior in comparison!","Without a whisper leaking out, someone had sent a gift hitting the mark.","As the third young master spoke, he was merely joking.","For them as the served party, their subordinates being perceptive was not a bad thing.","The more attentive their subordinates were, the more at ease they felt.","The third young master's buddy was Bai Lingqi.","Upon hearing this, Bai Lingqi raised an eyebrow.","Bai Lingqi asked the third young master: \"So will you send your child there?\"","The third young master scoffed: \"What 'send'? I've looked into it, they're always showing off online!\"","For the wealthy, discretion is most valued.","Clearly, the gift-giver had failed to grasp the sensibilities of aristocratic families this time.","Bai Lingqi said: \"Why don't you give me that spot then?\"","\"Huh?\"","The third young master narrowed his eyes and said: \"What do you want it for?\" A glint of interest appeared in his eyes.","Bai Lingqi replied: \"Isn't it an internet sensation? My wife loves chasing trends!\"","The third young master immediately refused: \"No way, figure out a way to get one yourself.\"","Although he didn't understand this kindergarten, he understood Bai Lingqi.","That guy was too sly.","If he wanted something, it couldn't be worthless.","As iron buddies and childhood friends, the third young master had been tricked by him a few times before, so he was on guard now.","Bai Lingqi was speechless: \"If you don't want it, why hold onto it? What kind of person are you!\"","It seemed he had rushed this matter.","He should have been more nonchalant to avoid alerting the third young master.","After parting with his buddy, the third young master carefully researched this kindergarten.","He then discussed the results with his father.","A child's admission was a significant matter.","Although a playboy, the third young master's only child, Liu Chen, was dearly loved.","Even the most indulgent noblemen are filled with parental love for their own children.","After consideration, the patriarch said: \"Go ahead, but get a bodyguard for Chen.\"","The Liu Family's children were all precious treasures.","Minor scrapes and bruises were fine, but they had to prevent any kidnappings or harm, eliminating all dangers.","It may seem like an overreaction, but such incidents had occurred before.","After informing Shen Wei's assistant, Shen Wei and her parents were surprised.","They never expected a prestigious aristocratic family they could never reach before to be willing to send their young master to study here.","But since they had accepted the enrollment spot, they could not refuse.","The other party stated they would bring a bodyguard. Otherwise, it would be like any other child.","Shen Wei said: \"But we may livestream here, and faces could be shown. Is that okay?\"","Of course, the other party readily agreed.","Because they had investigated beforehand, so it was not entirely unexpected.","The child was set to attend Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The third young master's grandmother was displeased and confronted him: \"I don't care about your mistresses, but Chen is your only child. Why are you sending Chen to this unknown little kindergarten? What are you thinking?\"","\"Grandfather investigated it himself, and someone as smart as Bai Lingqi was eyeing that spot too, so it must be good. Didn't we previously agree to send the child to kindergarten?\"","\"But we said an aristocratic kindergarten before,\" the grandmother retorted.","At least it was a well-established kindergarten, which sounded more reassuring than some trendy one.","Mister Liu the Third loosened his necktie with a dashing air, saying, \"That elite kindergarten is just ordinary! They're all the same. If the kid doesn't like it, we can always switch, no big deal.\"","What Grandma hated the most was Mister Liu the Third's carefree attitude.","She used to love his wild side, but now she detested it just as fervently.","However, there was nothing she could do, as the matter had already been settled in front of the old master. She could only resignedly accept it."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Street-side Delicacies","paragraphs":["At the tender age of five, Liu Chen had always been pampered and raised with utmost care.","When it was time for him to start school as per their arrangement, his family didn't need to pick him up or drop him off; he had a dedicated driver and bodyguard to escort him.","The first time Shen Wei laid eyes on Liu Chen, this little boy looked like a cute, chubby dumpling.","His dark, sparkling eyes were absolutely adorable, and he would politely greet the teacher with a \"Good morning, teacher.\"","He seemed to have excellent home training.","Although it was their first meeting, the little boy carried himself with remarkable poise.","However, his eyes couldn't help but wander, taking in his surroundings.","He was still a bit shy and quiet.","In the Liu Family, Liu Chen was the little prince.","The other nephews were over a decade older than him, so he was currently the most doted upon child.","Everything he ate, drank, and played with was of the highest quality.","Especially his diet—it was exceptionally light and healthy, tailored for his delicate digestive system. He had never tasted street foods like sausages or skewers before.","Yet this week, Liu Chef had arranged for them to sample street food delicacies.","These dishes, forged through the trials of street vendors and beloved by the masses, were utterly destructive to the palate of the young master Liu Chen.","Liu Chen had his eyes opened to a whole new world.","Add to that his first experience with new friends.","The atmosphere in the class was wonderful. As soon as the other children saw how adorable Liu Chen looked, they all eagerly flocked to play with him.","Liu Chen had never encountered so many peers his own age before. Some little girls even vied to be his \"girlfriend.\"","Children are simply honest and passionate when they take a liking to someone.","But Liu Chen shyly declined, saying he was too young to have a girlfriend.","His earnest explanation was met with a resigned \"Okay, then.\"","Liu Chen even went after them to apologize. This innocent, childish banter not only amused Shen Wei but also brought a smile to the young teaching assistant's face.","Liu Chen was a little sweetheart. Even at such a young age, he had an endearing charm that would undoubtedly captivate girls in the future.","Here, no one knew about his family background, and without adults' guidance or prior favoritism, children simply accepted each other as they were.","For the first two days, Liu Chen was still quite polite and reserved, but after that, he too joined in the fun, always reluctant to leave and turning back for one last look after each dismissal.","Once he got home, the little rascal would sigh wistfully.","The Third Young Master Liu couldn't help but ask with concern, \"How was school? Why the sighs? Didn't you like it there? If not, I can transfer you elsewhere!\"","For others, such a coveted spot would be precious, but to them, it was nothing. If Liu Chen didn't like it, they could simply switch schools anytime. After all, he wouldn't allow his son to suffer the slightest discomfort!","Liu Chen told his father, \"Why does there have to be night?\"","The Third Young Master Liu laughed, \"What's that got to do with anything?\"","Liu Chen explained, \"If there was no night, I could stay at kindergarten forever!\"","His father pretended to grab him and smack his bottom, \"You little rascal, you've only been in kindergarten for a few days, and you don't want to come home anymore!\"","Liu Chen shyly buried his face in his father's clothes.","Although the Third Young Master Liu had many women in his life, having his only flesh and blood snuggled against his chest melted his heart, and in that moment, he wished he could give his beloved son everything he possessed.","Not only did the child love kindergarten, but the bodyguard did too.","The staff meals at Starry Sky Kindergarten were the best he had ever tasted.","He just ate a bit too much, polishing off seven bowls.","Liu Chef would always leave some food for the staff to eat later in the afternoon if they got hungry and wanted to reheat something in the microwave.","But because the bodyguard ate so voraciously, there was nothing left for anyone else's afternoon meal.","The bodyguard felt embarrassed and offered to pay for his meals.","After some thought, Liu Chef agreed. He had never encountered someone with such a hearty appetite before.","The bodyguard felt that escorting the young master and getting to eat at the kindergarten was the most comfortable job he had ever had!","He couldn't help but feel grateful countless times for his keen judgment in accepting this assignment.","It was pure bliss!","...","Shen Wei had not streamed live for three days, and the comments kept pouring in.","Eventually, the local authorities even gave Shen Wei a call.","The reason was simple—the audience kept calling the hotline, demanding that she resume her live stream. Such was the power of public opinion that it could not be ignored.","Hence, the staff specifically sought out Shen Wei.","Shen Wei decided to resume her updates.","As soon as she went live this time, her longtime fans noticed an adorable new addition.","It had only been three days, but they showered the live stream with endless praises and flattering comments, as if compliments were free.","The Third Young Master Liu's grandmother had the live stream playing on the TV, and she and her best friend watched it together, infuriated. \"I really don't know what my son-in-law was thinking, sending our only son to this kindergarten!\"","She was a severe germaphobe, and seeing her precious, well-raised grandson all sweaty and disheveled was unsettling.","At that moment, the Third Young Master Liu's wife let out a shrill exclamation, \"Oh my god!\"","Her child, who had never been so dirty before, was actually playing with children's mud, completely covered in it.","It drove her crazy. He had to transfer schools! What kind of place was this, with teachers letting children play in the mud, exposing them to who knows how many germs?","Her best friend, however, was engrossed in watching, telling her, \"Look at the child.\"","The Third Young Master Liu's wife glanced at the TV and froze in astonishment.","She had never seen Liu Chen so happy before.","In their wealthy circles, children were taught from a young age to be polite and modest, just as society expected of well-mannered children from prestigious families. But they seldom smiled with such carefree joy.","\"What's wrong with you?\" her friend asked.","The Third Young Master Liu's wife felt her face and realized that at some point, tears had welled up in her eyes.","Although her marriage to the Third Young Master Liu was a business arrangement, she had fallen in love with him at first sight.","After giving birth to their child, her love only grew deeper.","But even after their wedding, the Third Young Master Liu continued his philandering ways, just as he had before they married. Such behavior was commonplace in their elite circles, as long as he didn't bring any illegitimate children home.","In their world, love was a pursuit bordering on the laughable.","Over time, she became overly sensitive and easily angered, with frequent arguments at home. Though their child was well-behaved, he seldom wore such a radiant smile.","In that moment, her heart trembled.","Her friend remarked, \"This kindergarten is actually quite good. If I had a child, I would want to send them here too.\"","The Third Young Master Liu's wife remained silent but picked up her phone and started tapping away.","Suddenly, a flurry of special effects exploded across the live stream.","A long convoy of vehicles appeared.","The fans in the live stream were stunned.","Many went to check the top donor's profile.","To their surprise, it was a wealthy sister, identified as Liu Chen's mother. With that revelation, everything became clear.","Some even revealed her identity as the Third Young Master Liu's wife.","No wonder there was an extra little friend at the kindergarten—it turned out he had such an esteemed background.","The news spread like wildfire, and within an hour, everyone knew that the young master of the Liu Family was at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Consequently, various friends from the elite circles caught wind of this and began inquiring about it. How did he get admitted? They all wanted their own children to attend as well."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Noble Kindergarten Feels Crisis","paragraphs":["The Noble Kindergarten has always held a prestigious position.","Many middle-class families want to enroll their children in this kindergarten, but they need to make a reservation half a year in advance.","Parents from both families have to go through interviews and verify their assets.","Just the preparation materials for the interview, when printed out, form a thick stack.","Children must have at least 1-2 special talents before entering the kindergarten.","Being able to speak a foreign language fluently is already the lowest standard for the kindergarten. Many kids have even learned the expensive equestrian skills.","The parents' group of the kindergarten is even more spectacular. Whenever there is an event, they compete to be the lead parent, showing off various resumes, which is quite intimidating. There are even Greater China CEOs of multinational corporations.","It's hard to imagine that parents have to put in so much effort just for a kindergarten.","Therefore, the Noble Kindergarten has no real rival in the city.","They had heard about the Starry Sky Kindergarten before, but the Noble School didn't take it seriously at all.","They didn't even give it a glance, as if giving it a glance would be an elevation. No matter how popular it became online, it would eventually fade away from people's attention.","But when Liu Chen, the young master of the Liu family, went to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, this news spread, and Teacher Zhang from the Noble Kindergarten's admissions office became a bit restless.","Others might only see the Liu family as wealthy, but they knew that the Liu family was not just ordinary rich.","They were among the top ten richest families in their city.","Their family businesses added up to over a billion!","For such a pampered young master like Liu Chen, their kindergarten had previously sent teachers to approach the Liu family, hoping that Liu Chen would come to their kindergarten.","They even brought many toys and gifts, but unfortunately, they didn't even get to see Liu Chen's face.","At that time, Teacher Zhang thought it was normal because such wealthy families might not keep their children in this city.","They might go abroad or to a bigger city and choose a better kindergarten.","But she didn't expect the Liu family to choose the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","For the Noble Kindergarten, Liu Chen was an important source of students. One Liu Chen was more valuable than 100 children from middle-class families.","With him going to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, how could Teacher Zhang in charge of admissions not be concerned?","The key was that this was a signal. She was afraid that these wealthy families would follow the trend and all go to the internet-famous kindergarten, undermining her position.","So even if it was just one young master from a wealthy family who went there, it was enough to raise Teacher Zhang's alertness to the highest level, and she immediately reported to the principal.","The principal didn't expect that this internet-famous kindergarten would actually have the ability to shake the position they had built over the years.","Considering Teacher Zhang's understanding of wealthy families and their tendency to follow trends and flock together, he realized her concern was reasonable.","\"So what do you think we should do now?\"","The principal looked at Teacher Zhang. Since she had come to talk to him, she must have had a solution in mind.","Teacher Zhang said, \"We've been too low-key all these years, we need to do some promotion.\"","Previously, their low-key approach was intentional.","Although low-key, everyone in the city was promoting them.","From the wealthy elite to ordinary people, everyone knew about their kindergarten. It was like a luxury brand – once they had established this reputation, there would be fans helping to promote it.","One positive word from someone else was more effective than a hundred self-praises.","And this feigned low-profile also suited the taste of the elite!","That's why many children of powerful and influential families came here to study over the years.","Although the teachers at this Noble Academy were ordinary, they interacted with the elite and powerful, and over time, they developed an air of arrogance. When talking to others, they liked to look down on people.","The more arrogant they were, the more others flocked to them.","So the principal was well aware that there was no need to criticize this matter too much.","They were not a kindergarten that gained popularity through service, but through nobility and quality.","But now that an internet-famous kindergarten had snatched the young master of the Liu family, they suddenly felt they had been too low-key all these years, allowing any Tom, Dick, and Harry to walk all over them.","The principal immediately said to Teacher Zhang, \"I'll give you 10 million yuan for promotion, and you need to make good use of it.\"","As the Noble Kindergarten, many tycoons were their clients.","Children here received exclusive services, so parents were naturally generous.","They would readily donate money to the kindergarten, so they never lacked funds.","This time, the Starry Sky Kindergarten had indeed hurt them, so the promotion budget they allocated was the highest in years.","\"Okay!\" After receiving the 10 million yuan, Teacher Zhang immediately started advertising online and offline.","They even used drone advertising, employing all the currently popular promotion methods.","Overnight, news about the Noble Kindergarten seemed to be everywhere, visible to everyone.","Traffic surged instantly, and the public, who had only heard of the Noble Kindergarten before, now got to see what it was like.","This also satisfied the public's desire to peek inside.","Then they showcased the resumes of some outstanding students, and people realized what it meant to be behind from the starting line!","A child of just a few years old had already won various awards at international competitions.","Even the children's speeches were well-prepared, and the parents spared no effort in promoting their children.","Just being admitted to the Noble Kindergarten was a symbol of ability and status, and many families who were rejected would wait a year to try again and again for this kindergarten.","Outsiders watched the spectacle, while insiders saw the reality.","When other kindergartens saw the Noble Kindergarten's promotion efforts, they didn't dare say a word.","They didn't know what had gotten into them this year.","How could kindergartens be so competitive, one after another?","The Starry Sky Kindergarten was one thing since they didn't accept students.","But the Noble Kindergarten was the nightmare of all kindergartens.","Now, with their overwhelming promotion, it became even more difficult for others to recruit students.","And some people had learned from inside sources that they had spent 10 million yuan just on promotion this time.","10 million yuan – that's the construction and operating cost of 10 kindergartens combined, spent on a single promotion campaign.","It seemed that only the Starry Sky Kindergarten could compete with the Noble Kindergarten.","After all, they were run by a rich second-generation, so it was like a battle between gods, with the little ones suffering.","At the Starry Sky Kindergarten, Shen Wei learned about the Noble Kindergarten's operations through the system.","But since they were not in the same league, she didn't take it too seriously.","She was in a good mood, as Professor He Lingfeng's online courses had reached 100 class hours.","The children were like sponges, learning hungrily.","They had already grasped the basics.","Every time Professor Liu gave lessons to the children, his eyes were brimming with kindness and admiration. Those who didn't know him would think he was their own grandfather!","He Lingfeng also enjoyed attending Professor Liu's classes very much.","Each time he would say \"Hello, teacher!\" with a crisp voice, making Professor Liu's face crease into a flower of smiles.","Recently, Professor Liu had indeed been enduring unprecedented hardships at the Third-tier school.","But now, a student like He Lingfeng was enough to erase all his past regrets.","There was also a feeling of gratitude - he was lucky to have come here, where the food was particularly good. Teaching the children and enjoying some delicious home-cooked meals put his mind at ease.","A few days ago, he had contacted his old friend Professor Gao after finishing some work and gave him a call.","\"Old Liu, you've taken on a closed-door disciple too?\" Professor Gao specialized in computer science, but he used to be a mathematics professor too! He was a top expert in both fields.","Professor Liu asked, \"Closed-door disciple?\"","Professor Gao said over the phone, \"The one logging into your account!\"","Since this student was only taking basic subjects,","it definitely wouldn't be Professor Liu himself.","On the mathematics forums, there were beginner sections with some internal teaching materials compiled by these masters. Only their most esteemed students were granted the privilege of accessing such materials.","So Professor Gao assumed this was the case this time too."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Trick to Get a Good Teacher","paragraphs":["Professor Liu laughed and said, \"He's just a student, but he's quite special.\"","Professor Liu and Professor Gao used to be colleagues for decades. Professor Gao's curiosity was instantly piqued by Professor Liu's words: \"How is he different?\"","Professor Liu said, \"He's a genius.\"","Professor Gao was noncommittal on the other end of the phone: \"Heh heh.\"","The main reason was that he had checked the student's reading records, which were all basic university textbooks, with no particularly difficult academic theories or published papers.","He also had no notable contributions in problem-solving forums or international puzzle communities.","Professor Gao then teased, \"What? After going to a third-tier university, you now consider ordinary seedlings geniuses?\"","It's not that Professor Gao looked down on others, but he had mentored too many geniuses over the years.","The geniuses that others seldom encountered were commonplace to him.","His graduate students, doctoral students, and postdoctoral fellows were all mathematical geniuses, and he was already immune to the word \"genius.\"","Professor Liu said, \"He's not just a genius, he's one in a million.\"","Professor Gao replied, \"You just keep boasting. It's been years since we last met, and your bragging skills have improved considerably.\"","Professor Liu was so angry that he puffed out his cheeks and glared, \"What nonsense? It's the truth, do you know how old he is?\"","Professor Gao was taken aback, then said, \"Is he 12 years old?\"","Although the student was reading basic university courses on math forums,","if a 12-year-old child could understand them, even someone like him who had seen many geniuses would praise the child's limitless potential.","Professor Liu laughed and said, \"He's 5 years old.\"","Professor Gao was furious: \"Okay, you're kidding me.\"","Professor Gao was also almost 70 years old, and when his temper flared, he hung up the phone with a click.","He thought he was just catching up with an old friend with a rare phone call, but somehow he ended up being mocked.","Studying those materials at the age of 5? What a joke?","Not only in China, but internationally, there's nothing so exaggerated.","Professor Liu immediately called back, and Professor Gao said irritably, \"Hello? Are you going to tell the truth this time?\"","Professor Liu laughed, \"I've been telling the truth all along. If you don't believe me, come and see for yourself!\"","Professor Gao's temper got the better of him: \"Fine, I'll go see right now. I warn you, if he's not like you said, you'll have to treat me to a good meal.\"","Professor Liu asked, \"When will you come over?\"","\"I'll have my assistant book a ticket right away and come over immediately!\" When Professor Gao's temper flared, he was impulsive.","After all, he didn't have any academic conferences to preside over recently.","He could go out, meet an old friend, and take a break, while also seeing for himself what this 5-year-old kid was all about.","After hanging up, Professor Liu happily told Shen Wei, \"I've tricked my friend into coming. You said earlier that He Lingfeng has talent with computers, right? This friend of mine used to be the chair of the computer science department at a Project 985 University. Let him take a look and see if this kid really has a knack for computers.\"","Professor Liu's care for He Lingfeng touched even Shen Wei, who said, \"Thank you, Professor Liu.\"","Professor Liu laughed, \"Don't mention it. Just have Liu Chef make some delicious food for him later. My old friend Gao, like me, has no other hobbies except for his love of eating.\"","Shen Wei said, \"No problem!\" Then she asked Shen's Father to buy some abalone and lobster to treat their honored guest.","Shen's Father was at the wholesale market at the moment, having replaced his car with a small three-wheeled vehicle.","Small three-wheeled vehicles are more convenient than cars at the wholesale market. He immediately agreed, \"Okay,\" and headed straight to the seafood area, buying over 4 pounds of large lobsters without hesitation.","He also bought plenty of king crabs and abalone, planning to let the children eat some too and improve their diet.","Shen Wei's father was always cheerful and never considered money an issue.","He just bought whatever he usually bought without worrying about prices!","So whenever the seafood stall owner saw Shen's Father, he would greet him with a big smile and a warm, friendly attitude, treating him better than his own father.","In the afternoon, Shen Wei went to pick them up from the airport. She had originally planned not to trouble Professor Liu.","But Professor Liu insisted on going to meet his old friend himself, despite his advanced age.","So the two of them went together, and Shen Wei even bought flowers.","Their timing was perfect, and they arrived at the airport just as Professor Gao came over with a small suitcase.","Professor Gao was alone.","Seeing Professor Liu, a smile appeared on his face: \"Long time no see.\"","Shen Wei then presented the flowers to Professor Gao, who nodded, took the flowers, and the three of them got into the car together.","As soon as they got into the car, Professor Gao started asking questions: \"So what's the deal? Tell me about this genius.\"","He had originally planned to put on an act in front of Shen Wei, but he was too curious to hold back.","Professor Liu had no choice but to tell him about how he met Shen Wei and He Lingfeng, as well as He Lingfeng's background!","Even a well-traveled person like Professor Gao was stunned and took a while to respond: \"So you're saying this kid completed elementary, middle, and high school curricula after just a few lessons?\"","And now, at just under 5 years old, he has already reached the university level.","Professor Liu said, \"Well, you're here now, so you might as well see for yourself.\"","Professor Gao urged them to drive faster.","When they arrived at the kindergarten and saw He Lingfeng, Professor Gao was taken aback. Although he had mentally prepared himself beforehand, seeing such a young child was still difficult to accept.","Shen Wei was about to show Professor Gao some of the child's previous coursework, but Professor Gao wasn't interested and said, \"Let me give you a few problems instead.\"","He wanted to test the child himself. He Lingfeng immediately agreed, and they went into the classroom.","Professor Gao hadn't prepared anything beforehand, but as an experienced scholar, he could come up with problems on the spot.","However, considering the child's age, he started with a few relatively simple problems.","To his surprise, He Lingfeng solved them quickly, and the solutions he showed were all correct.","Professor Gao's heart raced, and he immediately gave a few slightly more difficult problems, which the child solved again.","Finally, Professor Gao presented even harder problems, and the child took a lot more time.","The steps were quite tedious, and it seemed to be beyond the usual curriculum, but the child's foundation was solid, allowing him to solve them through sheer brute force.","Professor Gao was stunned.","He looked at Professor Liu with a dazed expression.","Finally, Professor Liu smiled and said, \"Well? I wasn't kidding, was I?\"","Professor Gao nodded stiffly.","Professor Liu seized the opportunity and said, \"This child is interested in computers. Why don't you conduct some tests on him?\"","Professor Gao understood as soon as he heard, \"Well, well, this kid was waiting for him here.\"","His old friend was rather kind to this boy.","But at the moment, he had no time for teasing remarks and immediately started a computer lesson, explaining in a clear and simple way that captivated the child's attention.","The child could sit still, focus, and not get distracted, which was already better than many college students.","Professor Gao became more and more excited as he taught, \"A genius at 5 years old!\"","If the child starts learning now, in twenty years, they will have twenty years of computer experience. With solid knowledge and youthful vigor, as an academic talent, it might even be possible to surpass developed foreign countries.","In the field of computer science in China, some projects have been strangled by beautiful countries. Now there is a successor! Professor Gao's heart burned with passion.","He was so absorbed that he didn't even notice his physical state and spoke until his mouth was dry and his tongue parched.","When he finally stopped, Professor Gao could barely stand.","Shen Wei promptly said, \"Thank you for your hard work, let's go eat something!\"","Professor Gao had come in a hurry this time, and the kindergarten probably hadn't made any preparations. Having found a genius, he was already satisfied. The food didn't matter much.","But unexpectedly, the delicacies here once again shocked him - lobster three ways, king crab three ways, and pork belly with chicken.","All were his favorite dishes. The cooking level was extremely high, even he, a seasoned gourmand, ate with his head down and eyes closed in bliss.","After finishing the meal and wiping his mouth, Professor Gao declared, \"I'm not leaving anymore. I'll stay and guide He Lingfeng with you.\"","Professor Liu said, \"But aren't you very busy?\"","\"I can make time,\" said Professor Gao.","Then he called Professor Liu aside and said, \"Well, well, over there I was laboriously teaching and cultivating new talent, while you were eating so well here and even took on a young disciple. That's not fair! I'm not leaving this time, no matter what you say.\"","Shen Wei was also quite excited, and then suddenly heard the system's voice in her head, \"Congratulations, you have invited a doctoral supervisor to guide He Lingfeng. System reward: 1 million RMB, 10,000 points, 20 pounds of vegetables, 20 pounds of fruit, 5 walnut seeds.\"","Hearing the system's mechanical voice again, Shen Wei was almost moved to tears.","Ever since her internet fan base became saturated, she had not received any new points.","It seemed that to earn points in the future, she would have to cultivate the young villains in the book properly. The better He Lingfeng developed, the more the system would reward her."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Meeting the Parents","paragraphs":["Gu Qingyan had been at the kindergarten for a while now.","His incident of being intimate with Shen Wei's doll caused quite a stir.","Gu Qingyan was embarrassed by his blunder in front of the camera and had been avoiding Shen Wei ever since.","Instead, he devoted himself to serving Shen's Father day and night.","Despite being a young master who never got his hands dirty, he was moving goods and unloading cargo at the kindergarten.","Sometimes, Shen's Father watched in trepidation, telling Gu Qingyan to take a break, but the young master was quite stubborn.","Shen's Father clearly didn't think it was idle for a young master from the prestigious Gu family to be at their kindergarten. So, ultimately, it was still about his daughter.","Shen's Father said to Shen Wei, \"It was my fault for blurting it out back then!\" What was originally unknown became known to everyone on the internet!","It was his first time livestreaming, and he didn't know what to say, so he ended up spilling old gossip.","It did create quite a buzz, but now he regretted it.","Having Gu Qingyan continue like this was no solution.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright, I'll talk to him.\"","When Shen Wei approached Gu Qingyan, he acted like a rabbit spotting a hawk, intending to run away but stopping awkwardly after just two steps.","Shen Wei said, \"You're avoiding me.\"","Gu Qingyan turned around, not daring to meet her eyes. \"I... I'm not.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Shall we go out and chat?\"","Shen Wei wasn't great at talking to boys either, but Gu Qingyan's reaction was too amusing, putting her at ease.","The two went to a nearby cafe. Since it was during work hours, the cafe was mostly empty.","They found a corner and each ordered a drink.","Gu Qingyan tensed up, took a sip of coffee to calm his nerves, then blushed and turned away upon seeing Shen Wei.","Shen Wei said, \"Thank you for your hard work during this time.\"","Gu Qingyan replied, \"It's nothing, it's what I should do.\" After all, he still had the title of her fiance.","Shen Wei said, \"But...\"","Before she could finish, Gu Qingyan cut her off. \"My parents want to come and have a meal with you.\"","His father and Shen's Father used to be good fishing buddies.","But they drifted apart, and since their children got involved, Boss Gu and Mrs. Gu wanted to get together!","Upon hearing this, Shen Wei readily agreed.","Shen Wei said, \"I don't have time for romance right now. I'm focused on work.\"","Though she didn't spell it out, Gu Qingyan understood the implication.","Gu Qingyan insisted, \"I'm not interested in romance either. I just really enjoy the kindergarten atmosphere and the food is great. I don't want any payment!\"","Shen Wei said, \"Okay, if you don't mind, you're welcome to stay!\"","\"Mm,\" Gu Qingyan nodded.","After a brief chat over drinks, Shen Wei left.","As soon as Shen Wei was gone, Gu Qingyan's hardened expression crumpled, and he gazed longingly at her departing figure like an abandoned puppy. What should he do? He had been too impulsive, misspoken in front of the camera. He didn't know if he could make amends.","He decided to come clean with his parents and see if they could help him out.","...","Gu Qingyan told Shen Wei that his parents preferred regular food, nothing too fancy.","That's what he said. But Shen Wei couldn't do that.","She handed the shopping to her father.","Plus, Liu Chef had experience with hosting banquets and knew how to arrange the courses.","They prepared all the ingredients a day in advance, soaking items like abalone.","Boss Gu's family knew the kindergarten was busy, so they chose a weekend to avoid causing trouble.","The gathering was held at the kindergarten!","Shen Wei and her parents waited early, with her father dressed in a suit.","After being the kindergarten's shopper, Shen's Father increasingly looked like a retiree, wearing vests and loose pants. No one would guess this old man was a millionaire.","So when they saw him in a suit and leather shoes, Shen Wei felt unaccustomed.","Soon, a black luxury car pulled up at the kindergarten entrance. A family of five emerged.","Boss Gu and Mrs. Gu brought all three of their children. They really valued this meeting.","Previously, Shen Wei thought her parents were too formal.","But compared to the other side, they were understated. Everyone was dressed in haute couture suits and gowns, looking ready for a gala rather than a casual meal.","Shen Wei, in just a white dress, seemed ordinary.","Shen Wei's parents greeted them, \"Boss Gu, Mrs. Gu, long time no see!\"","Boss Gu laughed, \"But I see you every day. I'm a loyal fan of your daughter's livestream! She's really doing great!\"","It was true.","At first, the Gu family just wanted to make sure their son didn't embarrass himself on the livestream.","But as they watched, they were charmed by the adorable children.","And tempted by Liu Chef's delicious cooking.","This time, they refused high-end restaurants, which they were tired of.","They wanted to taste the food Liu Chef prepared for the children at the kindergarten.","Mrs. Gu took Shen Wei's hand, \"Good girl, the last time I saw you, you were just a little thing. I didn't expect you to grow up into such a graceful young lady in the blink of an eye.\"","A mother knows best - she could see through her son's little crush.","The foolish boy insisted at first, but then his girlfriend slipped through his fingers, and now he regretted it and worked like a dog!","But his approach was too stupid, not even trying in front of Shen Wei, just fawning over her parents. It made Mrs. Gu anxious.","\"Auntie, I'm happy if you're pleased. I'm just doing a small thing,\" Shen Wei smiled.","Mrs. Gu laughed, \"I heard even the young master of the Liu family is attending, forcing Noble Kindergarten to advertise to compete with Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","Clearly, Starry Sky Kindergarten posed a significant threat to Noble Kindergarten.","Shen Wei was beautiful and well-spoken.","The more Mrs. Gu saw, the more she approved, not wanting to let go of Shen Wei's hand.","Meanwhile, Boss Gu and Shen Wei's father chatted, planning to go fishing on Boss Gu's private yacht - supposedly more fun and exciting.","Brother Gu Wei and sister Gu Ru were also looking around here.","They had only seen it in the live broadcast room before, but now that they were here in person, they really felt that this place was great. It was just that Gu Qingyan kept following them from behind.","At this moment, Gu Ru was somewhat speechless. This silly boy, instead of going over to Shen Wei's side, why was he always hanging around them? If he relied on himself to pursue a girl, it would be a hassle for him in this lifetime."]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: The Mother Tree Tea of Da Hong Pao","paragraphs":["Mrs. Gu took out a jewelry box from her bag, \"I felt a connection with you the moment I saw you, so this is for you. You'll look beautiful wearing it.\"","Shen Wei opened the jewelry box to reveal a string of bright green jade beads, plump and rounded.","The size was 10-11, indicating high quality apple green jade.","A young lady wearing this would look gorgeous.","With the skyrocketing prices of jade these days, this jade necklace is easily worth tens of millions, a true family heirloom.","As Mrs. Gu pulled out the necklace, Shen's Mother immediately spoke up, \"Oh my, this is too much to accept.\"","This jade piece was well-known in high society circles, last auctioned at Sotheby's.","Back then, the starting bid was 30 million, not to mention the premium added during the auction. It was an astronomical price.","Shen Wei also politely declined, \"Auntie, this is far too precious.\"","But Mrs. Gu insisted, \"I felt an instant connection with Shen Wei. A young lady should wear beautiful things like this.\"","Despite Shen Wei's repeated declines, she could not refuse the gift.","Just then, the aroma of dishes wafted in from the kitchen!","Mrs. Gu linked arms with Shen Wei, \"I was craving these dishes after watching your livestream. Come, let's taste them.\"","Everyone eagerly followed to the dining room upon hearing there was food.","The table was filled with delectable dishes.","Included was the famous sizzling beef tendon, along with dishes previously featured on the livestream.","The rest were dishes fit for honored guests.","Liu Chef did not disappoint as the head chef of Jiangbei Grand Restaurant, expertly combining flavors.","Each dish, meat or vegetable, looked mouthwatering.","Though not initially hungry, the tantalizing aromas had everyone's stomachs growling!","As they took their seats, there was no need for formalities as at other gatherings over drinks.","Everyone was here for the food.","Gu Ru, ever conscious of her figure from constant dieting, went straight for the vegetable dishes first.","One bite had her eyes widening - it was exceptionally delicious!","No wonder viewers on the livestream went wild with cravings. The vegetables were stir-fried to a perfect crisp, retaining their fresh sweetness.","If she could eat like this every day while dieting, she'd be happy! The flavors were impeccably balanced.","Boss Gu's favorite was the sizzling beef tendon, with its irresistible wok-charred aroma and melt-in-your-mouth tenderness.","It was the perfect accompaniment to rice - even he, usually not a big rice eater, had two bowls.","His brother Gu Wei loved the lobster meat, a high-protein delicacy with incredible freshness.","They often ate lobster, but this was the most delicious they'd had all year.","Not only was the quality superb, but the cooking was perfectly timed.","The others had intended to make small talk at the table, but once the food arrived, all thoughts were consumed by grabbing more bites before others claimed their desired dishes.","By the time dessert - almond tofu - arrived, everyone was stuffed.","The almond tofu was incredibly smooth, like a soft silky pudding.","The subtle flavor combined with the velvety texture made it seem to melt down the throat.","Boss Gu laughed, \"Old Shen, your daughter is truly blessed to pull off such an impressive feat!\"","With support from talents across various fields, even the prestigious Noble Kindergarten was shaken in such a short time. Her success was undeniable.","Hearing this, Shen's parents beamed with pride.","Once shunned by the elite as nouveau riche, they now basked in their daughter's glory.","Shen Wei invited, \"Uncles and aunties, please come back if you enjoyed the food!\"","Boss Gu quipped, \"You said it, so I won't hold back next time.\"","Shen Wei smiled, \"Of course.\"","The chatter turned to family matters, these socialites effortlessly creating a warm atmosphere.","Mrs. Gu and Shen's Mother made plans to visit a beauty parlor together, Mrs. Gu lamenting she only had one child while praising her daughter.","Shen's Mother reciprocated the flattery.","Though their relationship was not close, the Gu family's efforts fostered a pleasant rapport.","Amidst the pleasantries, the demure Shen Wei secretly messaged her system, \"System, any high-value gift recommendations?\"","With the system store's vast offerings, she was unsure what to choose.","The system suggested, \"You can use points to custom order in the bespoke section.\"","In this section, Shen Wei would describe her desired gift, the system would quote the points required, and she could decide whether to redeem it - far easier than searching the massive store listings.","Shen Wei's eyes lit up at this idea.","In the bespoke section, she placed an order:","Half a pound of Da Hong Pao mother tree tea leaves, gift box set.","She had previously heard from Gu Qingyan that his parents loved tea.","While Shen Wei had prepared an expensive tea set worth hundreds of thousands, the Gu family's opening gift of a priceless jade bead necklace rendered hers inadequate.","Thankfully, she had her system cheat.","The Da Hong Pao mother tree produced only a few pounds of tea leaves each year, revered by tea connoisseurs as divine - beyond material value.","The system quoted 10,000 points for this order.","Shen Wei gritted her teeth and redeemed the points, and a tea leaf gift box appeared in her spatial storage.","She retrieved the wooden gift box in a private room. Upon opening it, a fresh fragrance wafted out, hinting at the extraordinary quality within even before seeing the leaves themselves.","Shen Wei brought the tea gift to the living room and presented it to Boss Gu, \"Uncle, this is my gift to you.\"","\"Oh my, you're so thoughtful! Your aunt and I love tea. This is wonderful!\"","Mrs. Gu also praised the gift.","After an entire afternoon of pleasant conversation, as the Gu family prepared to leave, Mrs. Gu said to Shen Wei, \"I'm at ease leaving my son in your care. Our whole family supports him getting more experience here.\"","Though phrased vaguely, everyone understood the implication - their hope for this young couple's romantic future together.","It was the Gu family's acknowledgment and approval.","This meal was enjoyed by hosts and guests alike, leaving the Gu family raving about it even after returning home.","Once home, Mrs. Gu remembered the tea gift from Shen Wei and decided to open it right away.","She was determined to praise the gift regardless, having already been won over.","Boss Gu was equally curious as they opened the box together.","Afterward, they saw the words inside and exclaimed, \"Imperial Golden Bud Mother Tree Tea!\"","The others quickly gathered around.","Even those outside the tea circles knew the value of this item.","Just asking for one or two buds of this tea online would fetch offers in the tens of millions.","The key was that the mother tree's yield was extremely low each year.","It basically never fell into the hands of outsiders.","Upon opening the outer box, a deep fragrance wafted out.","Boss Gu was a tea lover and couldn't resist immediately brewing a pot.","As soon as it brewed, the aroma almost overflowed.","This tea was too precious; even the first brew wasn't thrown away. He took a light sip.","That lingering fresh aroma, smooth and mellow, brought a sweet aftertaste. Layers of flavors bloomed in the mouth. In that instant, all the high-end teas he'd had before seemed like mere leaves. This was the true king of teas.","The Gu family members all sipped a few cups. Afterward, Boss Gu put the tea away, treasuring it like a precious gem, \"No one is allowed to mention this. I'll slowly savor it myself!\"","However, Mrs. Gu remarked, \"That girl Shen Wei is really honest, giving us such a precious tea. The pearl necklace I gave her doesn't seem enough. Maybe I should gift her a pair of aquamarine earrings next time.\"","Boss Gu said, \"Ah, this life is worth it! That Shen Wei girl is truly good, a perfect match for our son. We're the ones who lucked out.\"","Gu Qingyan was speechless. He'd wanted his family to help give him a boost, but how did they end up all siding with Shen Wei instead?","Wait, whose parents were they anyway?"]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: System Releases New Task","paragraphs":["Aside from initially releasing a mission to save He Lingfeng, the System had not issued any other tasks.","Shen Wei's kindergarten had been running steadily. A few online controversies were also handled promptly.","She now knew how to run a kindergarten.","When she heard the mechanical voice of the System issuing a task again, Shen Wei felt slightly dazed. This time, the computer issued the task: \"Expand the business area and enroll up to 100 students.\"","Shen Wei was suddenly filled with motivation.","With the previous experience, she was gradually getting the hang of it.","To enroll students, she first needed more staff, so Shen Wei asked the System to help screen some teachers again.","Only by first preparing sufficient teachers and assistants could they start enrolling students.","Shen Wei gathered all the employees in the small conference room.","She shared her ideas about enrolling students and hiring staff.","Teacher Tang heaved a sigh of relief: \"That's great!\" She had really been bombarded with harassment.","Every day, dozens of people would add her on WeChat, leaving hundreds of messages.","The parents were most concerned about when Starry Sky Kindergarten would start enrolling students.","Since the kindergarten had no plans to enroll at the moment, Teacher Tang had to reject them every time.","Now that they were finally enrolling, the long-standing pressure was relieved!","The education expert, Weng Lan, couldn't help but smile: \"With us enrolling, that should not be a problem. The most important thing now is to find teachers.\"","\"Yes!\" Doctor Lu chimed in, \"Other places are worried about enrollment. They have to do street promotions, online marketing, sharing on WeChat Moments, and such. But many people want to come to our place and can't get in.\"","The school bus driver, Zhang Daming, told Shen Wei, \"If there are any pick-up and drop-off tasks, just let me know!\"","He had already paid off a large portion of his online loans.","His salary was high, and by the end of this year, he would be able to pay off all his debts. The kindergarten had done him a great favor.","Any task that required his service, he would gladly oblige.","Liu Chef said, \"I think it's doable.\"","Upon hearing the news, everyone was quite happy.","Liu Chef told the group, \"Let's keep this confidential for now. Although 100 spots are a lot, it's not enough to withstand any publicity.\"","\"100 spots aren't many. Even if it were 1,000 spots, we wouldn't be afraid.\"","For now, being able to start enrolling was a good thing. If they caused a stir, it wouldn't be pleasant.","The others quickly agreed, \"Don't worry about that, we know what to do.\"","The remaining task was to hire staff.","But seeing that Shen Wei seemed to have it all figured out, the others were reassured.","It's true that although Shen Wei was young, she was quite capable when it came to handling matters. Some of the so-called \"old hands\" might not be as good as her. Indeed, when it came to recruiting, sincerity was the killer technique.","Moreover, the high salary offered, the kindergarten's reputation, and the clincher of having Liu Chef who could cook, ensured that many people would want to come.","The kindergarten employees found that there was no need for them to get involved in this matter.","Like Zhang Daming, they said, \"Just let us know if you need anything.\"","Shen Wei agreed, then asked everyone to return to their respective positions, keeping only Liu Chef behind.","Liu Chef was the first veteran employee at the kindergarten, and he was very responsible.","He cared about every aspect of the kindergarten's operations. With him around, managing the kindergarten became much more convenient for Shen Wei. This household couldn't do without Liu Chef!","Shen Wei said, \"The amount of food being prepared daily has become too large. Why don't you hire a few more people to help you wash and cut the vegetables?\"","\"I'm not too familiar with the culinary world, so you can handle the hiring. You can recommend someone, and we'll offer a 10,000 yuan referral bonus. Our starting salary for kitchen staff is 10,000 yuan, for chefs it's 20,000 yuan. For a head chef, like yourself, it's 50,000 yuan. Does that work for you?\"","Previously, Liu Chef only had to prepare meals for the children.","Now, with the permanent presence of Shen's parents, Gu Qingyan, Professor Liu, and Professor Gao, the workload had increased significantly.","Liu Chef's dishes were delicious, and everyone here had a big appetite.","The cooking tasks had become exceptionally demanding, so recruiting more kitchen staff had to be put on the agenda.","Liu Chef was almost speechless. This boss of theirs was great, but her biggest problem was being too generous!","He knew full well that they weren't short of money, but he had lived a frugal life for so long. Suddenly seeing Shen Wei being so lavish with money made him worry.","Liu Chef said, \"Just leave this matter to me, but there's no need to give me money. Nobody's money comes from thin air, you know!\"","His words were filled with the concern of an elder for a younger person.","Shen Wei said, \"Thanks to your help during this period, I've noticed it all!\"","Liu Chef smiled warmly and waved his hand, saying, \"Hey, it's nothing. You're younger than my son, and since I have the energy, I'll take care of you a bit more. Ever since I started working here, spending every day tending to the little vegetable garden and playing with the kids, even my wife says I've become younger than before. I would work at this place even if you didn't pay me.\"","Shen Wei said, \"But I still have to pay you. When the year-end comes, you'll be the first one I'll give a raise to.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Alright, thank you, young lady.\" Calling her \"boss\" was too formal, and calling her \"little Shen\" was too casual, so he came up with this way of addressing her.","Liu Chef varied his cooking styles every day, and the kindergarten's meals were designed with even more care than grand banquets.","It was a case of using sincerity to earn sincerity.","Other workplaces had bosses who only cared about exploiting their employees, but here, they were worried that you might be working too hard and would immediately compensate you financially.","It was truly fortunate to have such a boss, and one felt compelled to give 200% effort to this kindergarten.","If he couldn't work hard at a job like this, he would slap himself in the face.","After getting off work, Liu Chef told his wife, \"I won't be coming home yet,\" and then went somewhere with a bottle of wine.","He wasn't looking for anyone else, but Chef Chen.","The two of them used to be fellow disciples under the same master.","To be honest, Liu Chef was not as skilled as Chef Chen.","But Liu Chef had a more amiable personality. In their complex relationship, even if he suffered a bit, he would just let bygones be bygones.","Chef Chen, on the other hand, had a sharp temper.","In the past, those old gourmets who accepted money to slander him were brutally scolded by him online.","In the industry, people both loved and hated him - they loved his delicious food but hated his sharp tongue.","Chef Chen now ran a private kitchen restaurant.","It was just as disorganized as he was.","He would open for a couple of days when he felt like it, and he decided what dishes to serve on his own whim.","When unhappy, Chef Chen shut himself in, wandering from place to place.","Many people came specifically to him but couldn't get a meal.","Gradually, he was branded as a \"poison tumor\" within the industry.","Criticism poured in endlessly. Chef Chen became even more reclusive, cooking for himself every day, drinking a bit of wine, as he had made enough money before!","Liu Chef came over and saw Chef Chen humming Beijing opera while sitting in a rocking chair.","Outsiders only knew they were master and disciple.","But they didn't know these two were actually relatives.","Years ago, Chef Chen took Liu Chef's mother as his godmother.","Although they didn't talk about it openly, they kept in touch secretly over the years.","\"Oh, why are you here?\" Chef Chen said as he stood up.","Liu Chef said, \"Came to see you!\"","Chef Chen said, \"I know about you. You're at a kindergarten now, right? I think that's better than when you were at Jiangbei Grand Restaurant. With your skills, you were underappreciated there, earning just a few bucks.\"","He even knew about Liu Chef being betrayed by his disciple.","There were no secrets in this industry.","Chef Chen was indignant on Liu Chef's behalf, saying, \"You didn't give that little beast a beating.\"","Liu Chef smiled and said, \"That's all in the past, why bring it up?\" Now that little disciple of his was fired.","Without him, the little disciple was nothing. Now he regretted it, calling Liu Chef constantly until Liu Chef got annoyed and blocked him.","Chef Chen grunted angrily, \"I'm indignant for you, but you don't care.\"","Thus, Chef Chen's temper was unmanageable, getting into 10 fights a day otherwise.","Liu Chef said, \"You're getting old these years. It's pointless to keep being so unrestrained. Have you thought about doing something else?\"","Chef Chen said, \"I've thought about it, but with my bad reputation these years, no one will want to hire me if I try to work somewhere else. If I open my own restaurant, people will look for trouble. I'll just live on my retirement pension in a few years.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Have you considered coming to our kindergarten?\"","He then went on enthusiastically about how great the kindergarten was.","Since coming here, the little vegetable garden was thriving.","On top of that, the kids loved his cooking, calling him \"grandpa\" adoringly. Just thinking about it made him beam with joy.","Chef Chen laughed, \"No wonder you came to me, to be a recruiter. Tell me, what's the monthly salary?\"","Liu Chef said, \"50,000, plus a 10,000 bonus for referrals, which I'll also give to you.\"","Liu Chef didn't need the money, he just wanted his master's skills to be truly renowned.","Now they had live streaming, so if Chef Chen cooked well, he could become famous quickly.","In his youth, his master was just a bit scattered, but never had any real black marks.","Now, cooped up at home, his talent couldn't be expressed, which was truly a pity.","Chef Chen knew Liu Chef sincerely wanted to help him.","His heart warmed, as he hadn't wasted his life when even amidst all the hatred and cursing, someone was there to support him at a crucial time.","\"Since you say that kindergarten is so good, I really should go and see what makes it so special.\""]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Recruitment Plan","paragraphs":["After Chef Chen came to this side, he was quite satisfied and settled down quickly.","Then everyone was surprised to find that the food here became tastier.","Even Doctor Lu had some trouble with it: \"If I keep eating like this, I'm afraid I'll weigh over 200 pounds next year!\"","It was really delicious.","Even the teaching assistants here, the young ladies Tang Xiaowan and Guo Qing, ate heartily.","In addition to the meals, there was also fruit and yogurt for dessert. Coming here for work became everyone's happiest daily event.","As for chopping vegetables and the like, Liu Chef introduced that.","He just found some diligent and honest kids to do the work.","Moreover, the wages here were decent, so they all came when called.","With their participation and Liu Chef's help, things suddenly became much easier.","The cafeteria on this side was no longer busy.","But Liu Chef loved to concern himself with everything, and when he saw something to do, he was busy running around.","He was actually busier than before.","Even Chef Chen said, \"Why do you torment yourself like this?\"","Liu Chef said, \"I just want this kindergarten to be great.\"","Chef Chen was speechless. He hadn't been here long.","But in his years of wandering, he had seen all kinds of people, and the environment of this kindergarten was indeed like a paradise on earth, as Liu Chef said.","No wonder he took such good care of it.","And it wasn't just him; everyone had deep feelings for this kindergarten and had put in tremendous effort.","Everyone shared the same goal of making this place better.","Nowadays, the relationship between employees and employers had become strangely adversarial, but here there was a real sense of community!","Chef Chen didn't say anything else, but he really liked this atmosphere.","So he put his thoughts into action.","The cafeteria dishes were upgraded intensely once again, and everyone ate deliciously.","Everyone looked at Chef Chen with a deep gaze.","They loved and hated him at the same time. The food was delicious, but after eating it and seeing their gradually protruding bellies, they had to diet - wasn't this torturing people?","Even Shen Wei's parents were overjoyed with the food.","One by one, they didn't even live in their own huge villas anymore, but instead stayed here often.","Professor Liu and Professor Gao went even further - they simply didn't leave after eating.","They remembered how in the past, others would at most give them a little more labor allowance to get them to \"come down from the mountain.\"","But here, they got paid and well fed.","Wasn't this the life of an immortal?","Professor Gao couldn't help but pat Professor Liu's shoulder: \"You really know how to find a good place! This is better than the life we had at the university before. And now the two of us are jointly teaching the five-year-old computer prodigy He Lingfeng.\"","He Lingfeng had already started learning basic programming now.","He was only five years old! They were keeping this under wraps for now, but Gao wanted to bring He Lingfeng out and let those old folks in academia see what \"promising successors\" really meant!","...","Shen Wei had recruited people that were systematically screened.","Especially for the kindergarten teachers, they all had over 10 years of teaching experience in the industry.","If these people left, it would cause the foundations of the other kindergartens to collapse by half.","But there was nothing they could do, because Shen Wei's salaries were simply too high.","After the other kindergartens heard about this, of course they desperately tried to stop it.","They were reluctant to let the good teachers leave, but it was impossible for them to raise salaries.","These weren't just individual teachers.","If they raised the salary for one teacher, the others would revolt.","They couldn't afford to give everyone a raise, their kindergartens didn't earn that much money!","So they could only try to use emotions to pressure and manipulate their teachers.","But this was no longer an era of being satisfied with just food and water; everything required money.","These teachers had worked so long but never received the salaries that were easily offered elsewhere.","On top of that, after working for so many years, they inevitably had some grievances.","After much consideration, the other kindergartens seemed to have noticed this. Not only did they not try to retain their teachers, but they even resorted to underhanded tactics and endless emotional dramas, practically pushing these highly talented teachers away.","The other kindergartens were resentful, thinking it was the Noble Kindergarten poaching their people. They were very displeased!","But they didn't dare speak up, because the Noble Kindergarten in this city had an influential presence and could make things happen.","Their parents were truly not to be provoked.","Before, there was a small kindergarten that had foolishly challenged the Noble Kindergarten head-on.","The result? They got completely wrecked and still owed hundreds of millions.","So the Noble Kindergarten rarely took action, but when they did, they inflicted damage.","Everyone didn't even consider the possibility of other kindergartens, because the salaries offered were simply too high. Besides the Noble Kindergarten, who else could afford to pay so much?","The Noble Kindergarten had no idea they had been pinned with such a big black mark. They knew that good teachers were being poached now.","But they never thought it was Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Because Starry Sky Kindergarten didn't enroll students.","And everything had been quite steady there recently.","When Teacher Zhang brought this up with the principal, she was somewhat indignant, afraid that it might be some wealthy children trying to force their way into this kindergarten again!","They really resented it. So what if those people had money?","They could go open bars, cafes, shopping malls - why did they have to encroach on the education sector? It was truly infuriating!","It was only because Starry Sky Kindergarten had become popular.","Although basic education didn't make much money, if done well, its influence was a subtle form of wealth.","The secrets they had guarded for years were suddenly made public.","That's when everyone realized there was such a great option here, and before long, there were quite a few young masters looking to open their own kindergartens!","The principal of the Noble Kindergarten said to keep investigating.","Knowing yourself and your enemy is the way to win every battle!","Teacher Zhang used many of her connections but couldn't find out anything no matter how much she inquired.","When she reported back to the principal, she felt quite embarrassed.","The principal said, \"We'll take it one step at a time!\" Although she said that, her mood wasn't great."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Violin Teacher in Position","paragraphs":["A melodious violin sound echoed in the rented house. It was the famous piece 'The Butterfly Lovers', tender and touching.","Coupled with the melancholy in the young woman's heart as she played the violin, it added an extra layer of poetic beauty,","Captivating even those who knew nothing about music.","These old-fashioned rental houses had no soundproofing, and as she played, the afternoon sunlight seemed to soften.","Just as Song Panpan was immersed in her performance, a sudden knock at the door interrupted her.","She then put down her violin.","Her heart still racing.","Such a suspenseful, lingering ambiance is something all musicians strive for but rarely achieve,","Even veteran professional violinists struggle to reach this level consistently.","Annoyed by the disruption, Song Panpan knew exactly who the visitor was without having to guess.","Sure enough, as soon as Zhu Auntie entered, she boomed in her typical loud voice, \"Song Panpan, you're home! I just bought some watermelons, have a taste.\"","Song's Mother said, \"You're too kind.\"","Zhu Auntie chimed in, \"Hey, these watermelons are cheap. Just one yuan each, though a bit small, but they'll quench your thirst.\"","\"You should eat more while they're in season, I remember when they were expensive, one yuan per jin. A melon this big would've cost six or seven yuan.\"","She rambled on, and upon seeing Song Panpan emerge from her room, a glint of schadenfreude flashed in Zhu Auntie's eyes before she smiled again as if her previous expression had been a figment of one's imagination. \"Panpan, why don't you go find a job?\"","Her warm demeanor belied the hurtful words that struck at Song Panpan's vulnerability.","Song's Mother seemed oblivious to the malice, \"The other day, Starry Sky Kindergarten sent our Panpan an invitation, but this child hasn't decided whether to accept it or not.\"","Zhu Auntie remarked, \"Oh, she can't go to that kindergarten. You're a returned student from overseas, going to teach at a kindergarten? People will mock you! Why spend all that money studying abroad if you end up at a kindergarten?\"","\"At the very least, you should join an arts troupe or something.\"","Song's Mother responded, \"But she hasn't taken that job.\"","Zhu Auntie's smile deepened, \"I hear Panpan playing the violin so passionately every day, I thought she was quite skilled. But to professional judges, she's probably just average. No hurry, keep practicing. What's there to fear?\"","Song Panpan clenched her fists tightly, the ill-intentioned remarks masked by feigned warmth cutting her like knives.","Recalling the hardships she'd endured over the years, her eyes began to sting with tears. But she held them back,","Knowing that if she cried, Zhu Auntie would only mock her further.","Zhu Auntie then began boasting about her daughter's new boyfriend, a civil servant candidate, and kept insisting on introducing Song Panpan to potential matches.","Song's Mother deftly ushered her out, and after she left, Song Panpan finally broke down, retreating to her room to cry on her bed.","The once celebrated prodigy had fallen to such depths.","Indeed, Song Panpan's family was an ordinary one.","Studying the arts is prohibitively expensive, and it was only after trying a free trial lesson that her teacher recognized her talent for the violin and took her under his wing.","The teacher said the child was gifted and, after some time, truly admired her abilities.","Not only did he waive her tuition fees, but he also took her to competitions, where she won virtually every domestic award.","The teacher had boasted proudly, \"You'll definitely make it big in the music world one day!\"","He advised her not to study domestically since the violin originated from abroad, and encouraged her to pursue her education overseas instead.","Her family fell silent upon hearing this but ultimately supported their cherished daughter's ambitions.","So she went abroad, sparing no expense in her diligent studies.","In addition to the violin, she even reached a performance level in piano.","But upon returning home, instead of the expected accolades and applause, it seemed her lifetime's luck had been exhausted in her early successes.","Every time she auditioned for an institutional orchestra, some issue arose, leading to her elimination.","Eventually, Song Panpan took a job teaching violin at a training institute.","She had missed the golden window when overseas-educated \"sea turtles\" were in high demand.","Now, such teachers no longer held the same appeal.","Coupled with decreased consumer spending, fewer students were enrolling.","Many mismanaged training institutes began laying off employees one by one.","As a woman in her twenties, Song Panpan could still find work.","But she wanted to pursue her passion, and suitable opportunities were scarce.","A few coffee shops offered violin performance gigs, and some suggested she busk on the streets with her violin case. But none of these aligned with her aspirations.","Her prolonged unemployment made her something of a local \"celebrity\" in the neighborhood.","When she used to win awards, everyone praised her as a violin prodigy, telling her not to forget them when she made it big, even asking for photos together.","Now that they saw a supposed genius was no more successful than an ordinary person, the tones changed.","Gradually, snide remarks emerged, with Zhu Auntie being the most gleefully spiteful.","She would constantly nag Song's Mother, saying their ordinary family should never have invested in the arts.","\"Oh dear, we don't understand any of that fancy stuff. You should just find a proper job!\"","\"I introduced you to that skewer place before. The guy's loaded, owns two properties! They need servers, you should go work for him - they'll save on labor costs too.\"","Song's Mother protested, \"But that man is divorced with a child!\"","\"What's there to fear? Divorced men know how to cherish their partners!\"","Her mother didn't want to argue, brushing it off with a forced laugh.","After that, Zhu Auntie seemed to revel in a sense of superiority, frequently visiting to show off while feigning kindness by bringing eggs and fruits.","Her warm manner contrasted with her hurtful remarks.","A while later, Song's Mother came in and said, \"Don't cry, that's just how she is, she has a foul mouth!\"","Song Panpan declared, \"I've decided, I'm going to Starry Sky Kindergarten!\" If she couldn't find another job, she'd be the laughingstock.","Song's Mother sighed deeply, then said, \"That's better than the training institute, at least.\"","The kindergarten's salary was quite high too - offering 20,000 yuan upfront, which shocked both mother and daughter.","Song Panpan vowed, \"I must prove myself.\"","Song's Mother said from the side, \"We don't need to live our lives for others to see. We'll just live for ourselves, and let others say whatever they want.\"","After that, Song Panpan came to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, played the piano piece \"To Alice\" and the violin piece \"The Butterfly Lovers\", and was immediately accepted on the spot.","The salary was 20,000 yuan per month, plus a 100,000 yuan one-time payment for the rights to use her image.","When she returned from the interview, she had the job offer and 100,000 yuan in her pocket, feeling dazed.","Moreover, a group of kindergarten employees applauded for her.","Shen Wei the school bus driver, Liu Chef, they were all there. Although the number wasn't large, the applause was warm.","The children also blinked their eyes and said, \"Pretty sister, you play the violin so well.\"","In an instant, Song Panpan's heart softened.","What was originally a choice made out of helplessness suddenly gave her motivation. So what if it was a kindergarten?","She could still teach properly.","She would teach some talented children, and see what the neighboring aunties could say then.","Song Panpan had always thought her mother was a woman who didn't fight, but she didn't expect that when the news of her admission came out, her mother immediately went to Zhu Auntie's home for a visit, hinting through her words that her daughter had found a job with an annual salary of nearly 300,000 yuan.","When she returned, Song's Mother excitedly described how Zhu Auntie's face had turned black at that moment.","Her mother even deliberately provoked her, saying, \"It wasn't for nothing that she learned everything. If she hadn't learned the violin back then, could she have gotten such a good job?\"","Zhu Auntie was angry but didn't dare show it.","The humiliation that mother and daughter had suffered before was now paid back in full."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Starlit Kindergarten Provides Stage","paragraphs":["Inside a dance studio, a boy was sweating profusely. His name was Wu Feng.","His movements combined grace and firmness.","And many of his forceful movements seemed featherlight.","The boy was ordinary-looking, but his dance talent was exceptionally strong.","It added a filter to his plain appearance.","Everyone who had seen him dance thought he was extraordinarily handsome.","Wu Feng was wiping the sweat from his face at that moment, the sweat absorbed by the towel, providing some comfort.","He was thirsty, but having just exercised intensely, he couldn't drink a lot of water; he had to wait.","Looking at the other children in the dance studio who were still stretching, a hint of envy flashed in his eyes.","Who would have thought that his dance skills had reached a level akin to a young professional dancer?","Yet he had never attended a professional dance school.","When he auditioned years ago, all the teachers were excited after his performance.","He thought he had it in the bag.","And the students in his group were lackluster, their defenses shattered after watching his dance.","With a prodigy like him around, what business did they have being there?","But when the results came out, he wasn't accepted, while the others were.","The reason was nothing more than his height. As a boy, he was only 1.7 meters tall.","Among male dancers, this stature was a congenital deficiency.","Female dancers are all required to be over 1.7 meters, and boys must be at least 1.8 meters. Otherwise, who would he pair with in future performances?","Like dance schools, there are many rigid rules.","No matter how much he loved it, he had to give up.","After all, the competition in dance schools was always the fiercest. Losing him was nothing.","After failing three times, he was completely disheartened.","He then started working in a dance training institution.","Ironically, several of the students who attended his classes were part of his audition group. Those who were accepted now had to call him, who wasn't, their teacher.","As a \"teacher,\" he didn't receive recognition from the professional academy, which was always a thorn in his heart.","Many extracurricular tutoring institutions were being cracked down upon, including those in the arts.","Many art institutions have gone bankrupt.","They had to eke out a living in cracks and crevices.","After years of training, money was not a problem for him, what he lacked was a stage.","Although he danced well, he had no professional endorsement and had not participated in any major dance dramas, so joining a dance troupe was difficult.","The stage was like a carrot hanging in front of a donkey. It seemed to be in sight just by raising his eyes, but always beyond reach.","He was almost desperate.","Suddenly, he received an offer to become a kindergarten teacher.","He instinctively refused.","What he wanted was not to be a teacher, but a stage.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten seemed to know his thoughts.","They claimed to be a celebrity kindergarten and could specifically build a stage for him. Online with a hundred thousand viewers.","And their children were all little kids, more flexible bodies.","He can also provide professional guidance.","The current external training is mixed, many are not from a young age learning dance, dare to teach children.","It is said that there are indeed children who have become paralyzed because of dance.","So those who have practiced from a young age, understand the body better, and know how to protect students.","An online stage was enticing him.","Although he was young, he bore the demeanor of an elderly, seldom surfing the web.","His impression of internet celebrities was still stuck in the realm of the bizarre and the grotesque.","He always felt the internet was full of noise and attention seekers.","Yet, the idea of him having a small stage to perform on moved him deeply.","He later searched online for the Starry Sky Kindergarten, making an effort to understand the current state of the internet.","People had high praises for this kindergarten.","Going there would be an unprecedented gamble.","He would have to close his dance studio here.","He was different from others.","His dance studio was indeed profitable, especially when he coached art exam students.","A salary of 20,000 might seem a lot to others, but for him, it was nothing.","No one could bear to replace a high salary with a lower one.","Yet, because they promised him a stage, he was willing to do it.","He craved the stage.","He craved to showcase himself under the spotlight.","Even if it was a tiny glimmer, he wanted to seize this opportunity.","Shen Wei also mentioned on the phone that the internet is the best at covering up flaws.","On the internet, as long as you choose the right angle, his height disadvantage would be unnoticeable.","By then, everyone's attention would be on how well he dances.","He was already somewhat tempted, but after hearing Shen Wei's words, his slight interest transformed into full determination. He decided to finish teaching his current students and then enroll at Shen Wei's place.","His only condition was, \"You promised me, you must give me a stage.\"","Shen Wei assured him there would be no problem.","She could even invite the public to come and watch, increasing the audience.","This was an effortless task for Shen Wei.","But it made her heart flutter once again.","Shen Wei added, \"You must commit to staying here for a long time, at least a year!\"","He agreed.","He then came over to sign the contract.","The atmosphere in the kindergarten was very comfortable. The sun shone on the green lawn, and not far away was a well-organized vegetable garden.","The children's outdoor castle stood there, like a kingdom from a fairy tale.","Everything made him want to dance.","But he restrained himself, after all, now was not the time.","After signing his work contract here, it was lunchtime. He went to the cafeteria and had some regrets.","The food here was just too delicious, and it's vital for a dancer to maintain a light weight.","A delicious cafeteria is simply a temptation for him.","He had been eating boiled vegetables for years. Suddenly, he had a meal of such high quality, and he ate until he was stuffed.","He felt a long-lost sense of fullness in his stomach and said to Doctor Lu, who was eating next to him, \"Is the food always this good?\"","Doctor Lu looked up and said, \"Our food is always delicious.\"","Doctor Lu used to be a handsome young man, but now his face has gained some weight. With his beaming smile, he's quickly becoming the most popular male teacher in the kindergarten!","Doctor Lu was very content with his life now.","Back when he was a doctor, children would cry at the sight of him during check-ups.","Now, the children sweetly call him \"Teacher Lu\". Who would remember that he was once the Doctor Lu who could stop children from crying at night?","Afraid that this new colleague might not understand the situation,","Wu Feng had recited the menu for the whole week over here.","The little male colleague next to him was dumbfounded: \"What should I do then?\"","\"I'm a dancer, I can't get fat.\"","Doctor Lu said, \"What's the big deal about this, you can be a soft fat person. No matter how hard it is, you can't starve this mouth.\"","Wu Feng felt a bit regretful, but he was already on this ship of thieves, and there was nothing he could do about it now.","The food here is truly delicious.","After he finished eating, his stomach was rumbling.","As if to say: After all these years with you, I finally got to eat something delicious.","The dance teacher didn't eat any fruit after the meal, and took a sugar-free yogurt, which was his last stand."]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: It's Anxious","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten and Noble Kindergarten have always been sworn enemies.","But it must be said, Noble Kindergarten has also been a teacher to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Ever since Noble Kindergarten's last grand publicity campaign, Shen Wei realized where her kindergarten fell short compared to that one.","It wasn't just the core subject teachers and the kindergarten environment.","More importantly, parents hoped their children could learn more and develop richer hobbies at kindergarten.","Shen Wei always felt that children's horse riding and golf were just satisfying the middle class's imagination of the upper class.","She didn't want to offer those.","The choice of specialty subjects was more mainstream.","Take Song Panpan's violin and piano, for instance, or Wu Feng's classical dance teacher and the soft gymnastics team.","These hobbies were easily understandable by ordinary parents.","And convenient to showcase.","But just two specialty classes were far from enough.","So Shen Wei also found a drawing teacher and a calligraphy teacher.","For now, that was all, but later Shen Wei planned to add English and computer classes.","But that would have to be gradual.","Currently, computer and English teachers still needed systematic screening.","If Shen Wei bypassed the system to hire people, it actually wouldn't be too difficult.","Not only did Starry Sky Kindergarten have a reputation in the industry,","But Shen Wei also had money.","With enough money spent, even big-name teachers were possible.","But Shen Wei still wanted to choose the best, at least those with decent character and professional ability.","So far, the system-selected people hadn't made any mistakes and were all very capable industry experts.","So Shen Wei was full of confidence in this new drawing teacher.","It was just that the person the system selected this time was somewhat unexpected.","The drawing teacher Qi Zhong had a long stack of background information that took Shen Wei 10 minutes just to read through.","Apparently, Qi Zhong was once ranked first and was admitted to the Central Academy of Fine Arts.","After graduating, he studied under a painting master and his skills were extremely formidable.","At his peak, one of his paintings cost hundreds of thousands of yuan.","And you had to book at least two years in advance to get one, because there were so many orders, but now his paintings are worthless!","Because he did something that shook the entire art world.","Back then, in addition to painting, he also tutored art students.","While he had many students each year, there were always a few that were his favorites, including one particularly talented painter.","With his professional eye, if the student performed normally, he would at least rank in the top three in exams.","He and the student checked the results as soon as they were released, but the student was unexpectedly not admitted.","Not accepting this, he wanted to go see the student's work, but something insidious had happened.","The work of the person before his student had paint smeared all over the back, contaminating his student's work.","The two papers were indistinguishable.","The person before was admitted with a high score, while his student's test paper was voided.","Years of hard work were undone by someone's despicable act. He was furious!","He told the student about investigating the incident.","That student calmly consoled him.","Clearly, it was the student who had suffered injustice, yet it was the student comforting the teacher instead.","But the next day, he learned of a tragedy - that student had committed suicide.","Looking at the student's diary from before death, he realized how suffocating the student's family environment had been.","Both parents had been extremely controlling.","This exam was the student's only way out of that dysfunctional family.","And the student had prepared for it so diligently, with everyone telling the student they would definitely succeed.","Little did they expect things would take such an extreme turn.","Having one's work contaminated, many would consider themselves unlucky.","But it was the last straw that broke the camel's back, leading to the talent's demise.","Teacher Qi Zhong was enraged and decided to avenge his student.","So he exposed the incident.","Leveraging his influence in the art world from back then, he pressured the perpetrator to drop out.","He uncovered the truth behind the incident.","He even personally confronted and violently beat up that person.","He vented, but the incident had too severe an impact, essentially a celebrity cyberbullying a nobody.","And this nobody wasn't entirely a nobody either, as his father was also a businessman.","As a result, with various instigators added, Qi Zhong ended up being portrayed as an unstable madman.","The Calligraphy and Painting Association issued a statement dissociating itself from him.","Various art associations expelled him. Even his originally respectable job was gone because of this incident.","He just grimly drank alone, visiting his student's grave, saying words no one asked whether he regretted.","For the sake of one deceased person, had he ruined his own future?","What use was it even if he had? The dead would not be revived.","But he didn't care, constantly livestreaming his paintings.","That livestream room was also harassed by hired trolls from the deceased student's parents, hurling insults.","No one could withstand prolonged cyberbullying.","By the time Shen Wei met him again, he had gone from a spirited youth to an unkempt old man with an unkempt beard.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm from Starry Sky Kindergarten. We spoke on the phone before. I wanted to ask if you're interested in coming to teach our children how to draw.\"","Teacher Qi Zhong was silent for a while.","If it were earlier, he would never have considered teaching children painting as a livelihood.","But now, he hadn't earned a single cent in several months.","And learning art was expensive.","His brushes, inks, and pigments were a major expense.","He used mineral pigments, sold by the gram, costing nearly as much as gold.","He urgently needed a job.","But even so, teaching kindergarteners had never crossed his mind.","Shen Wei continued, \"The children at our kindergarten are all very cute, and they have great imagination when painting!\"","She then showed him some children's drawings.","The children's works were indeed imaginative, despite lacking professional guidance - elephants flying in the sky, birds swimming underwater, and so on.","The drawings were crude.","But they looked charmingly naive, and you could easily tell what the children were depicting.","The world of fairy tales was most worth exploring.","He said, \"How much would you pay me?\"","Shen Wei replied, \"20,000 yuan a month!\"","He said, \"Not enough.\"","Shen Wei asked, \"How much do you want then?\"","He thought for a moment, \"25,000, I'm a bit in debt.\"","Shen Wei agreed, telling him there was also a 100,000 yuan payment to buy out his image rights for livestreaming.","Interestingly, upon hearing of the additional 100,000 yuan for image rights,","\"Then I'll take 20,000 yuan!\" Shen Wei said immediately.","After all, he didn't initially intend to ask for an extra 5,000 yuan.","He just wanted to repay his debt.","Now that he had this unexpected windfall, there was no need to quibble over those 5,000 yuan.","Qi Zhong said, \"If you can provide materials like pigments, I can reduce my salary further.\"","Shen Wei readily agreed, \"No problem. But there's no need to lower your salary!\"","She then asked him to make a list.","When Shen Wei saw the list, she suddenly realized she had been careless.","These were all kinds of mineral raw materials.","And they were very expensive.","At that moment, the system spoke in Shen Wei's mind: \"There's a promotion on pigments in the points mall right now. 500 points can get you 24 kinds of mineral pigments, 1 kilogram each.\"","Shen Wei was startled and immediately redeemed the points. Soon, shimmering mineral pigments arrived in her space.","It's better to use points.","There's a free kind of happiness.","Qi Zhong said, \"I'll use mineral pigments for my own artworks, but I'll use regular ones for teaching the children.\"","Even if he was wealthy, he couldn't be so wasteful.","He still understood propriety.","Soon, they signed the contract. Shen Wei transferred the money, and they agreed on his work schedule.","Shen Wei couldn't wait to see his surprised reaction when he saw all those pigments."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Get to Know the Immortal Job","paragraphs":["The Calligraphy Teacher was recommended by the system.","Shen Wei called and surprisingly it was Wang Pei's Mother who answered.","Soon they met in person.","Shen Wei knew the Calligraphy Teacher was young, but didn't expect him to be so handsome.","His face could easily rival any celebrity.","His handsomeness was different from Gu Qingyan's.","Gu Qingyan, the Young Master of the Liu Family, had an aloof and transcendent vibe, with an indescribable sense of brokenness.","Wang Pei's Mother said beside him, \"This child has had a bit of social anxiety since young, doesn't like talking to people much.\"","Having his mother speak on his behalf showed he had severe social anxiety.","Because of this personality flaw, he couldn't find a job.","Every time he interviewed, the other party would see him bringing his mother and think he was too much of a mama's boy.","He hadn't been able to showcase his talents.","Shen Wei said, \"Could you write a few characters for me?\"","Then she saw him dip his hand in water and write on the table,","His strokes were remarkably smooth and graceful. Very beautiful calligraphy.","It had elements of the seal and semi-cursive scripts, yet formed its own style.","Even Shen Wei, who didn't understand calligraphy, thought it looked great.","Shen Wei said, \"But you may need to be on camera. We pay 100,000 for buyout rights if you appear on camera, would that be okay?\"","Wang Pei's Mother nodded repeatedly, \"Sure, sure, I used to be a fan of your live channel and watched your streams all the time!\"","She didn't expect Shen Wei's side would even pay for appearances.","Great that there were live streams, she could watch her son's performance too.","Seeing her enthusiastic attitude, Shen Wei quickly finalized some details, then asked Wang Pei, \"So would you like to work with us?\"","Although Wang Pei's Mother kept nodding in approval, for work he still needed to say it himself.","Wang Pei nodded and said, \"I'm willing!\" His voice was quite pleasant too, albeit a little trembling when he spoke.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright, then come try it out.\"","Hiring so many teachers, the Calligraphy Teacher was the easiest.","Soon the newly hired teachers all started their jobs.","They hadn't appeared in the live classroom yet.","Six veteran teachers from kindergartens in the industry had all signed contracts.","Only after coming here did they realize their previous salaries were far too low.","Shen Wei was paying almost double.","Their former kindergarten principal had envied her before, but was always stingy with money.","So they decided to come here.","News of Shen Wei hiring people quickly spread through the industry.","Everyone was suddenly shocked to find that the one poaching wasn't the noble kindergarten, but Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The noble kindergarten also realized then, ah, so they'd been blaming Starry Sky Kindergarten for the wrong reasons recently.","Both sides were furious.","Especially the noble kindergarten.","Although they knew the so-called Prince wasn't behind the poaching this time,","The situation hadn't improved much.","Even if the Prince came to open a kindergarten, he might not succeed.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten had already brought the Young Master of the Liu Family into the fold.","This was a bad development. Now they were being so aggressive again, what was Shen Wei trying to do?","The noble kindergarten had never worried about its status in the industry before.","They thought their years of reputation meant some upstarts couldn't compare.","But now they didn't dare say such things anymore.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was coming on strong, posing a severe threat to them.","The noble kindergarten principal gathered everyone for a meeting, focused on whether anyone had been poached, \"You'd better tell us this matter right now, even if you don't we'll investigate and find out.\"","She was afraid there were moles among the teachers,","Who might later leak the kindergarten's core practices to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Rarely had the principal flown into such a rage in a meeting.","All the teachers looked at each other.","If they'd been poached but weren't leaving, standing up to pledge loyalty would elevate their positions.","But no one made a move.","Meaning none of them had been poached.","The noble kindergarten principal nodded in satisfaction. It seemed the other side knew their place,","And didn't dare openly challenge them.","\"Good, no one is to mention this meeting outside.\"","She felt better after dismissing the meeting.","Little did she know Shen Wei wasn't wary of her, but just hadn't considered the noble kindergarten's teachers at all.","The noble kindergarten's teachers had too much of a superiority complex.","They normally treated the children condescendingly.","They failed the personality check in the system's screening.","So they weren't being wary, but looked down upon, though they were unaware.","Although they had teachers, they still needed teaching assistants.","So Shen Wei had Tang Xiaowan and Guo Qing recommend classmates.","The referral fee was 2,000 yuan per person.","The two teaching assistants each recommended 4 people, earning 8,000 yuan.","And those recommended were genuinely willing to come!","After joining Starry Sky Kindergarten, they immediately understood why the top students would give up institutional jobs to come here.","Those who went into the system were full of regret too.","They didn't know how good the place they went was.","But the youth organizing this career were live streaming every day on their friends' circles,","Exposing all the unspoken rules of the workplace.","Now the best career was at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Fresh kindergarten teacher graduates were anxious to get in. They never expected their classmates to provide a way.","Recently, Tang Xiaowan and Guo Qing had been busy with dinners every day.","The people they earnestly screened and recommended","Were good in personality and solid in skills, according to their checks beforehand.","But after seeing the real environment and cafeteria food here, they were still excited like anything.","Not only were employee meals free and delicious, there was imported fruit, drinks, and yogurt too.","Most importantly, here they could attend classes with the children for free,","Learning calligraphy, painting, musical instruments, dance.","Outside those would cost at least 300 yuan per class, here it was free!","Some assistants were so overjoyed they couldn't contain themselves, posting videos on the internet with a watermelon effect over their faces to describe their heavenly jobs.","Once posted, fans in the comments were envious,","Everyone saying things like, \"Family, anyone know? I'd give 20 pounds of fat to get this job!\"","Immediately a studious type responded, \"I'll give 30 pounds of fat.\"","\"I'll give 50 pounds.\"","\"I want to weigh 80 pounds, but there's no way, I'm just over 80 pounds, I really can't lose any more weight.\"","\"Quick, get rid of that unsightly bulge.\"","\"I'm already working on it.\"","\"Does anyone actually know what kind of job this is? I really need it, please, don't make me beg you on my knees.\"","\"...\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: Chef Liu got promoted","paragraphs":["When Qi Zhong joined the company, he heard that Shen Wei wanted to give him a surprise.","He wasn't sure what to expect, but she was the boss, so he didn't want to offend her.","He simply said, \"Okay!\" and followed Shen Wei to a room that had been converted into a simple art studio.","There were new easels, canvases, and chairs.","Next, Qi Zhong saw 24 glass jars filled to the brim with mineral pigments.","The painting teacher Qi Zhong was immediately stunned. He rushed over, opened a bright yellow jar, and the pigment was vivid, with a gemstone-like color.","At his wealthiest, he could only afford to buy around 100 grams of mineral pigments. These jars contained 1 kilogram each. The appeal was too great for him.","His face instantly lit up with delight, successfully making Shen Wei laugh.","The once gloomy old painting master had transformed into a sunny puppy.","He kept saying to Shen Wei, \"This is too extravagant, I'm so sorry.\" But the happiness on his face was undisguised.","He was practically walking on air, like a child who had received their most beloved toy.","He simply couldn't restrain himself and had to open every single pigment jar to inspect the powder quality.","His expression was one of pure bliss and wonder.","After looking through all 24 jars of pigments, he gazed at Shen Wei like she was a goddess.","\"Thank you, boss!\" he exclaimed loudly.","Shen Wei said, \"Is there anything else you need?\"","He shook his head.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright then, if you need anything else, just let me know, and I'll have someone procure it for you.\"","\"Okay, I'd also like a lockable cabinet to store all these materials!\" Qi Zhong had seen good things before, but these materials were too precious.","They were still in glass jars.","Spilling even a little would be a tremendous waste.","These mineral pigments were made from finely ground gemstones, vibrant in color.","In ancient times, only royalty and nobility could use them.","To produce these pigments, the makers had to climb treacherous mountains to collect the minerals, then painstakingly sift and refine them. The effort was immense!","These mineral pigments wouldn't fade for hundreds of years.","In the past, when painting, he had set a rule for himself to only use these precious pigments for his artworks.","Twenty-four colors of mineral pigments were like a treasure trove. Just looking at them brought immense satisfaction!","Qi Zhong had initially thought that working here was just a way to earn some money and pay off his debts.","He never expected this kindergarten to shower him with so many pigments.","He simply couldn't resist the temptation.","Having someone lend a helping hand during his difficult times really struck a chord with Qi Zhong, and he reflected deeply on many things.","In fact, his successes and failures over the years had been too extreme.","Deep down, he was still proud and reluctant to teach children.","After gaining some fame, he became a bit reckless, neglecting to shave his unkempt beard.","He had somewhat given up on himself.","Now, seeing the new boss put in so much effort for him, he suddenly realized how aimless his past life had been. What a shame.","Regardless, one needs to look forward. Let the past be the past!","As the painting teacher Qi Zhong gazed at the pigments, his eyes shone with joy, yet also a tinge of sadness.","But the gloom that had enshrouded him was nowhere to be seen.","When Shen Wei saw him again in the afternoon, he had shaved off his beard, trimmed his hair, and looked like a handsome Korean man!","At that moment, he called out to Shen Wei with a smile, \"Boss,\" looking nothing like his initial self.","Shen Wei greeted him, but was soon summoned by Liu Chef.","Liu Chef told Shen Wei, \"Shouldn't we hire an accountant at this point?\"","\"Teacher Tang said she has a relative who studied accounting and previously worked at one of the Big Four auditing firms but has since quit and is staying at home.\"","Shen Wei had heard that people working at the Big Four auditing firms were experts. \"Would someone like that be willing to come to our place?\"","Liu Chef said, \"You should ask Teacher Tang.\"","Shen Wei thought about it and agreed that they should indeed hire an accountant.","Previously, with fewer staff, the system handled payroll, taxes, and other matters.","But now, as the staff grew, they needed a professional accountant, or it might raise suspicions.","Shen Wei thanked Liu Chef, \"Thanks!\" Otherwise, she wouldn't have even considered this.","Liu Chef said, \"Hey, you're too polite!\"","Afterward, Shen Wei approached Teacher Tang and inquired about her relative, the accountant.","Teacher Tang said, \"This relative of mine has always been an excellent student. Many private companies have tried to poach her, but now...\"","Teacher Tang paused, finding it a bit awkward to continue, but she still told Shen Wei the truth.","The reason her relative wanted to come work for them was mainly because her child was now over 4 years old and would soon turn 5, eligible for kindergarten.","She had heard that working here offered two spots, and she wanted one for her child.","The workload at the Big Four auditing firm was quite heavy.","It was still manageable before, but after having a child, she was often exhausted and wanted to try a less-demanding private company.","This was also for the sake of her child, so she was willing to give this place a try.","Shen Wei said, \"That's perfect!\"","She then invited the woman over. She appeared gentle and kind, despite being a young mother. Her work experience was more than sufficient, and having her take care of everything would be a huge relief.","The new accountant lived up to expectations. Within the morning, she had already organized all the relevant documents.","Shen Wei truly felt like her staff was carrying her through. Whenever there was an issue at the kindergarten, her employees would take care of it for her.","There was one more thing on her agenda: setting up a stage. She had previously promised the dance teacher that she would have one built.","With so many tasks at the kindergarten, she was tackling them one by one.","Shen Wei was financially comfortable, so she wanted to make it the best stage possible. For the indoor stage, she even installed a sound booth and lighting.","Additionally, there were classrooms for various specialties, such as painting, music, dance, and calligraphy.","Fortunately, they had many unused classrooms previously, so they could just renovate them.","She had a familiar construction crew, so she only needed to share her ideas, and they would have their designers draft plans immediately.","Once finalized, they would proceed with the renovations. It was very convenient, and the efficiency was improved.","The other staff were busy preparing for student recruitment.","Now that the personnel were in place!","They planned to enroll 100 students, with each of the six seasoned teachers leading a new class of twenty students.","The extra class would be reserved for the children of employees, as part of their benefits.","In any case, during this period, quite a few people have been greeting Shen Wei, almost enough to form a class. Each class would be assigned one or two teaching assistants.","Right now there are eight teaching assistants, which is still a bit short! But there's no other choice. There's no time to recruit more people.","They can only make do for now, and once this busy period is over, they will assign more staff to the classes.","They've set a new course schedule, with one calligraphy class, one art class, one dance class, and one music class per week for each class.","Shen Wei has directly promoted Liu Chef to the position of deputy principal.","Apart from Shen Wei, his word is law.","The old staff who used to work with Shen Wei all obey Liu Chef.","Because he has been here the longest and is truly devoted to the kindergarten.","The newcomers also respect him, because they have all eaten the food cooked by Liu Chef.","The only one with higher culinary skills than Liu Chef is his mentor Chef Chen, so naturally they defer to their junior.","Liu Chef turned bright red, as he had never expected to become a leader at his age.","However, since this responsibility has fallen on him, he is quite excited about it.","Liu Chef has always been a lively person, originally giving 100% of his effort to this kindergarten. Now that he has become the deputy principal, he will probably have to put in 200%.","Sometimes there's no one available to help with the cooking.","Chef Chen is speechless with this junior disciple of his, calling someone to fetch him back: \"With so many staff and children now, you're not focused on your main job!\"","They will be admitting another 100 children in the future, so they need to seize the time to practice their skills.","Although Liu Chef is the deputy principal, he is still scolded by his mentor like a little chick. Then he goes off to help with various tasks, not daring to utter a word.","The people chopping vegetables couldn't help but laugh, but Chef Chen shot them a glare, and they nearly cut their hands.","The one person you can't provoke here is Chef Chen, he truly doesn't tolerate any nonsense from others."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: The Pressure Brought by Peers","paragraphs":["Carefree Kitten is a loyal fan of the live stream room at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She enjoys squatting in the live stream room, watching the happy children playing, and can't help but smile like an indulgent aunt.","It's as if her own less-than-perfect childhood can be healed by watching others.","This time, she opened the live stream room as usual.","But then she heard some extremely big news.","Starry Sky Kindergarten is recruiting students! They're opening 100 spots, and those interested can download the application form from the homepage. There will be online interviews in 10 days.","Those who pass the interview can enroll. The interviews will last 3 days, and parents must accompany their children.","Upon hearing this news, Carefree Kitten immediately exited the live stream room and hurriedly called her best friend: \"Hey, isn't your kid going to kindergarten? That Starry Sky Kindergarten I told you about before is recruiting now. You should go sign up quickly.\"","Her voice was rapid and urgent, pouring out like a stream of beans, afraid that if she was even a second late, the spots would be gone.","She's been a long-time viewer of Starry Sky Kindergarten's live stream room.","The kindergarten practices happy education and has low tuition fees.","They eat so many delicious foods every day, and even have professional chefs.","Every detail is enough to drive parents crazy.","The fans in the live stream room used to say that if Starry Sky Kindergarten opened recruitment, everyone would vote it as the number one kindergarten.","It's just a pity that Starry Sky had only been doing small, exclusive classes, so others didn't have the opportunity to attend.","The old fans in the live stream room know that the staff at Starry Sky get two free enrollment spots as a benefit.","But only one accountant had the courage to actually apply and work there.","It really takes guts!","To get in, they'd have to do a large-scale recruitment.","Now they've finally opened it up. But there are only 100 spots, so it's very precious.","Her friend immediately started preparing upon hearing the news.","Carefree Kitten downloaded the application form and sent it over.","When she downloaded the form earlier, it was super slow.","You could tell everyone was really excited.","This kind of enthusiasm was only seen during the housing craze back in the day.","...","In the live stream room, after Shen Wei announced that Starry Sky Kindergarten was opening 100 spots, 50,000 people instantly left.","But after two minutes, not only did those 50,000 people return, they brought another 100,000 with them.","The live stream room's popularity skyrocketed to number one.","Even the short video platforms sent people to investigate why the traffic suddenly exploded like that.","The words Shen Wei said in the live stream room were screen recorded and shared in local community groups.","Not only were the viewers panicking, but even teachers from other kindergartens were rushing to report it.","\"What do we do? Starry Sky Kindergarten is recruiting students!\"","\"We need to come up with a plan!\"","Even when Starry Sky wasn't recruiting before, they were already causing a huge stir.","Now that they're recruiting, just thinking about it made people gasp in dismay.","The kindergarten staff created a small group chat and added the principals of various kindergartens in the city.","Within three minutes, dozens of people joined.","Someone immediately shared the news about Starry Sky Kindergarten's recruitment in the group.","Everyone fell silent.","But they were all watching.","No one knew who would fire the first shot.","\"We kindergarten operators need to unite,\" said one person. It was Teacher Tang's former employer.","They had a bad relationship with Starry Sky Kindergarten in the past.","Ever since Starry Sky became popular, Teacher Tang's former employer couldn't sleep well at night.","When Teacher Tang went to arbitration over her social security payments, her former employer had to compensate her 80,000 yuan, which was really painful for them.","They heard that it was Shen Wei, the principal of Starry Sky Kindergarten, who instigated Teacher Tang to go to arbitration.","Teacher Tang's former employer constantly thought about ways to stir up trouble. They didn't even run their own kindergarten properly anymore.","Upon hearing that Starry Sky Kindergarten was recruiting, they were more fired up than anyone else.","\"What do we do now?\"","Others said, \"What can we do? The one we should be most worried about is Noble Kindergarten.\"","When Starry Sky Kindergarten first opened, no one paid attention to them.","Who would have thought that in just a few short months, they would leave everyone far behind?","Their popularity is catching up to Noble Kindergarten, making everyone's feelings a bit complicated.","\"Someone tried calling to report them for fire safety and tax issues before! After the investigation, all of Starry Sky's affairs were found to be reasonable and compliant.\"","Others fell silent upon hearing this.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was exposed online by someone later. The kindergartens in this group had all bought traffic before.","Not only did they fail to take Starry Sky down from its pedestal, but they ended up purifying its fan base instead.","For now, Starry Sky is only recruiting 100 students.","100 students isn't a large number for a kindergarten.","But their popularity is high. If any tricks are pulled now, it would backfire spectacularly.","\"Are we just going to watch helplessly?\"The feeling of sitting idly was too disheartening.","\"What can you do about it?\" others questioned back.","Silence filled the group.","In the end, it was Teacher Tang's former employer who exploded in anger. The gist was that these people only wanted others to cause trouble and bring Starry Sky down, but they didn't want to stick their own necks out.","They only hoped for the best outcomes.","If that's the case, then everyone might as well just stop living.","They'll just watch as Starry Sky recruits all the students away.","Her outburst upset the others, but what she said was true.","No matter how much they discussed, they couldn't come up with a solution.","This motley crew gradually dispersed.","The other kindergartens found ways to inform Noble Kindergarten about this.","They were just small fries themselves.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was backed by a wealthy heir, which these small business operators couldn't stand up against.","But Noble Kindergarten was different - it had a solid foundation.","And everyone had noticed Noble Kindergarten's frantic advertising recently, so they must have been driven to desperation.","These equally-matched opponents would make an interesting fight when they clashed.","Everyone was waiting to watch the drama unfold.","But to their disappointment, Noble Kindergarten's reaction was very calm. They just said, \"Oh, we know!\" as if they didn't care at all.","What they didn't know was that the principal of Noble Kindergarten was gritting her teeth so hard she almost broke them.","She exited the WeChat conversation page.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten couldn't help but say to the enrollment officer Zhang: \"No wonder my right eyelid has been twitching these past few days. Turns out this was the cause.\"","Teacher Zhang was as anxious as an ant on a hot pan regarding the student admissions.","They appeared cold and aloof on the outside.","Only internally did they know the immense pressure brought by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The principal said, \"Keep a close eye on the children from these prestigious families. When necessary, sacrifice any interests to meet all their conditions and get those children to our kindergarten.\"","She wasn't anxious about Starry Sky Kindergarten's admissions itself.","Rather, it was the fact that these prestigious children had always been monopolized by Noble Kindergarten in the past.","Having Starry Sky Kindergarten lure away even one was a huge loss.","Last time when the Young Master of the Liu Family went to Starry Sky, the principal couldn't sleep well for three or four days.","The principal told the admissions teacher, \"People out there are waiting to see us fail. At times like this, we must steady ourselves and take it one step at a time.\"","As long as those wealthy children didn't go to her kindergarten, there was still a chance.","As for the children from ordinary families, they were completely out of their scope.","Teacher Zhang said, \"Last time, The Liu Family said they wanted to build a horse ranch on campus. That's The Liu Family with several diamond stores!\"","The principal had rejected it before.","Everyone wanted to do this and that, but their place wasn't a wishing well.","But with the matter brought up again, the principal couldn't refuse, saying, \"In that case, you contact the horse ranches and see how we can make it happen!\"","Building one wouldn't hurt.","It would also convey to the prestigious families that only at their kindergarten could their demands be 100% satisfied.","Teacher Zhang said, \"But to set up a horse ranch and raise a few horses, our maintenance cost would be in the millions per year.\"","Their kindergarten wasn't short on money.","But their spending was much higher this year.","The kindergarten was shareholder-owned. If they couldn't generate sufficient profits this year, they might not have a good time at the annual meeting.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten said coldly, \"This year's situation is special.\"","Carefree Kitten Shen Wei herself didn't know that her admissions news had brought such immense pressure to other kindergartens!"]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Internet Celebrity Kindergarten is Terrifying","paragraphs":["These days, all the young children across the city have been a little anxious.","The demand for short-term training at various talent institutions has surged.","There are more tasks than they can handle.","Even the teachers at the short-term training centers have some reflections: \"Oh, I just sent away a student who's going to Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","They've vaguely heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten before.","It's quite well-known among parents with children of the appropriate age.","But ordinary people haven't paid too much attention to it.","This time, they've felt the appeal of this internet-famous kindergarten.","A single admission interview can drive parents across the city crazy.","\"What's so special about what you're doing? I have more than a dozen kids lined up here. This isn't teaching the kids, it's basically putting me to the test.\"","The training center teachers have never dealt with such young children before.","And the young children's ability to learn is relatively poor.","Some of them can't pick things up, start crying, and she's been grating on her ears all day long to the point of tinnitus.","And the parents booked specific times, hoping to get some extra time to carefully practice their pieces. But there's no time for that, because the next task is already lined up!","Fortunately, it's just 10 days.","After these 10 days, it should be fine.","One of the two training teachers said, \"I earned more in these 10 days than in a whole month!\" Although it's tiring, it's still quite satisfying.","Online, people's conversations have also shifted to curiosity about this event.","Word has it that during those days of admission interviews, there will be a live broadcast online, and they're all looking forward to it.","Although some people say, \"What can little kids perform?\"","But they still secretly set alarms to tune in.","Soon, the 10-day period flew by in a flash.","Shen Wei started the live broadcast on her end.","The judges were Shen Wei, Liu Chef, Teacher Tang, art teacher Qi Zhong, music teacher Song Panpan, dance teacher Wu Feng, and calligraphy teacher Wang Pei. Seven of them sat in a row.","It looked quite official.","A huge venue was prepared.","Doctor Lu and Weng Lan, along with a few assistants, were in charge of organizing the order of the children's entry outside.","Doing some coordination work. For this unprecedented admission process, Starry Sky Kindergarten had suspended classes for three days.","Almost all staff were mobilized.","Chef Chen prepared delicious food in the kitchen.","This time, whether selected or not, everyone could come and get a lunchbox.","With so many people, they couldn't do a buffet.","Even just lunchboxes, Chef Chen's dishes were extraordinary.","Chef Chen was almost flipping the ladle hard enough to spark flames.","Several core teachers, Shen's parents, and Gu Qingyan were all helping in the kitchen.","They were the busiest!","Shen Wei and the other judges had it a bit easier.","There were only 100 spots available.","But at least 1,000 people had registered.","So they couldn't be too lenient at the start. On this side, there were 7 judges in total. As long as 6 of them gave satisfactory scores, the applicant could pass directly. The results would be announced on the spot, clear for all to see, with no shady dealings.","The live broadcast started on schedule.","A wave of long-time fans rushed in: \"Oh my, it's set up just like an interview venue!\"","\"Seeing this scene takes me back to my thesis defense days!\"","\"I was randomly scared to death as a college girl, just watching this live broadcast is making me so nervous!\"","\"Although I'm still single from the womb, I need to watch this so that when my future baby goes to kindergarten, I can use these interview tricks.\"","\"Learning +1.\"","\"Learning +2\"","\"Learning +10086.\"","\"Kids really don't have it easy these days. Just to get into a kindergarten requires an interview.\"","\"If Starry Sky Kindergarten didn't do interviews, they'd be able to squeeze in over 1,000 kids.\"","\"1,000 kids is an understatement, I'm afraid there would be 10,000 kids.\"","\"By the way, did you all hear what Doctor Lu said earlier? All the parents who registered their kids can go and get lunchboxes from their place.\"","\"What a great deal! Anyone want to lend me a kid?\"","\"The comment above opened up a new path of thinking.\"","\"Indeed, they're all talents.\"","The online chatter was lively and animated.","On Shen Wei's end, the interview process began soon after.","This live broadcast drew not only the fans in the chat, but almost every kindergarten in the city was secretly watching too! \"","You could see that every teacher was holding a phone. A quick glance showed they were all watching this live broadcast.","The principals, who rarely woke up early, had all gone to their offices, but surely they were watching this live broadcast too!","It's known that Noble Kindergarten targets the children of high society, but Starry Sky Kindergarten had never publicly recruited students before.","Everyone wanted to take this opportunity to see what their selection criteria were.","In the WeChat groups before, those principals were all in the live broadcast chat, feeling apprehensive.","Noble Kindergarten had taken the lead to liaise with the equestrian facility, paying a deposit of hundreds of thousands to establish a partnership quickly.","As a precaution against Starry Sky Kindergarten snatching their potential students. Once Starry Sky made a move, they'd immediately launch a new round of promotional advertisements.","This was a war without smoke and fire.","The first group of parents to enter now","was an honest-looking middle-aged couple with a little girl.","This interview was indeed nerve-wracking.","The husband couldn't help but tug at his clothes a few times after entering, and the wife's anxious eyes didn't know where to look.","But the little girl's eyes were full of curiosity.","The fans in the live chat couldn't help but comment: \"This couple is basically acting out me.\"","\"Being picked first is so much pressure!\"","Shen Wei seemed to sense the couple's nervousness and said, \"Hello, please briefly introduce yourselves and your child.\"","The man replied, \"My name is Zhang Dazhu, I'm a tile layer. My wife doesn't have a job.\" He spoke haltingly, his voice slightly trembling.","It was at this moment that the child's clear, bright voice rang out: \"My name is Tian Tian, and today, I'm 5 years old!\"","Although the couple was dressed very plainly, it was evident that they loved this daughter dearly. The child wore a beautiful little dress and had her hair neatly braided into pigtails.","After the child spoke, Teacher Tang asked, \"Has the little one attended school before?\"","\"No, I haven't.\"","This child's performance was better than many adults'.","When the parents saw their child doing so well, their faces beamed with pride.","They were then asked to perform any talent they wished.","The child said, \"I can mimic sketches. My dad, my mom, and I will perform together.\"","\"Great!\" Shen Wei said, leading the applause.","Soon, familiar lines from Spring Festival comedy sketches came pouring out of the little one's mouth.","This kid is really impressive, not intimidated at all. So enthusiastic and lively, a little drama queen, especially endearing!","Compared to the child, the parents seem a bit clumsy.","But they're doing their best to cooperate with her.","After it was over, everyone in the room had a slight smile on their faces.","The little one even courteously bowed and said, \"Thank you, teacher!\"","The group burst into warm applause.","Then Shen Wei said, \"Please give your scores!\"","Then everyone held up the cards in their hands, and everyone passed.","Shen Wei said, \"Congratulations, a truly auspicious start! You came so early, you must not have eaten much this morning, go to the cafeteria and have some lunchboxes and fruit! Report back here in three days.\"","Netizens were going crazy.","\"I really love this group, a family that can raise such a lively and cheerful child is so lovely.\"","\"Did you see? When she said they passed, the child's mother's eyes turned red. Oh my, it makes me want to cry too, what's going on?\"","\"Looking at this group, I could tell their family's living conditions aren't that great. But being poor and being neglectful are two different things. The parents were making an effort to cooperate, and the child was clearly nervous but still performed well.\"","\"The baby is amazing, I hereby declare her my twenty-first internet daughter!\""]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Snatching Students","paragraphs":["The first to enter Starry Sky Kindergarten had already secured a spot.","Once this news spread, the other parents and children started to get anxious.","The main reason was that the number of openings was really limited, and every spot taken meant one less available.","It was bound to get increasingly intense after that.","Soon, netizens witnessed an unprecedented admissions performance.","Several applicants performed the same routine, clearly taught by the same teacher.","Some kids even forgot their lines on stage and started crying.","For kids of that age, forgetting lines is normal, but these kids might have been spoiled and used to throwing tantrums at home.","Feeling embarrassed in front of the crowd, they lashed out at their parents. Such kids naturally didn't pass.","Then there were kids at such a young age trying to flirt, giving roses to the female teachers one by one and saying \"I love you.\"","Netizens couldn't help but screenshot it to use as reaction images.","It was a morning full of shenanigans, driving the live stream viewership higher and higher.","Many were sharing the live stream link.","Not only were students' parents watching, but also people from aristocratic families.","They had heard before that the young master of the Liu Family went to Starry Sky Kindergarten and never wanted to go home, always happy there.","Others also wanted to send their kids there.","As they were hesitating, they saw this admissions process.","They realized the kindergarten was admitting ordinary kids, making them feel a bit ambivalent, not as eager as before.","The Aristocratic Kindergarten felt the same way. Ever since Shen Wei admitted the first child from an ordinary family, the principal felt half relieved.","As long as they weren't competing for the same students, having a thousand kids from ordinary families posed no threat to them.","But she relaxed too soon. The next applicant was a little boy in a suit.","He was accompanied by a butler and nanny.","\"Hello, I'm Shao Dongdong!\"","The Aristocratic Kindergarten principal, who had just taken a sip of water, choked upon seeing this scene in the live stream.","Why was Shao Dongdong here?","The Shao Family was a low-profile but prestigious wealthy family locally and nationally.","The Aristocratic Kindergarten had wanted to enroll Shao Dongdong before.","They had even promised to admit him immediately and provide him with dedicated teachers.","The child they had all tried to enroll was now auditioning here.","Shen Wei said, \"Hello Shao Dongdong, do you have any talents to perform?\"","The little kid nodded. Despite being only 5 years old, dressed in a miniature suit with chubby cheeks, he looked incredibly adorable.","Yet he also carried an aristocratic air of restraint and courtesy.","\"I can play the piano.\"","\"Okay, please go ahead.\"","Then they saw the little kid sit in front of the piano, looking even cuter.","A smooth rendition of Canon flowed out from his tiny fingers, with exquisite grace.","The fans in the live stream were stunned: \"Is this really a young master raised by the wealthy? How fortunate am I to witness a young master performing.\"","\"At the age of wearing diapers, he can play such a profound piece, and his hands are so nimble. Clearly expertly taught by a renowned teacher.\"","\"Didn't you see? Judge Song Panpan's eyes lit up. A promising seedling like this, whoever cultivates him will surely have an easy time.\"","As the piece ended, the live stream viewers felt entranced, even wishing it hadn't ended so soon.","Previously tormented by chaos, they were suddenly jolted by such high-quality performance.","Unwilling to let this brilliant display conclude so quickly.","The judges evidently felt the same way, as Shen Wei asked, \"Can you do anything else besides piano?\"","Shao Dongdong said, \"I can also dance.\"","Then the butler played some music, and Shao Dongdong danced street style.","Despite being a child, his moves were powerful and on point.","The live stream fans went wild.","\"Baby, promise you won't become a scumbag man when you grow up, okay?\"","\"No wonder I can't find a boyfriend, he's still in kindergarten.\"","\"I can tell at a glance, he's my internet baby.\"","\"What a cute son.\"","The little guy danced in perfect harmony, so adorable.","After finishing, he was a bit out of breath.","\"What else can you do?\" Shen Wei couldn't help but ask.","The live stream fans also wanted to know his full repertoire.","Shao Dongdong said, \"I've also practiced calligraphy.\"","Upon hearing this, the live stream fans were utterly astonished. He was just a kid, yet so far ahead of adults!","\"I was smiling while watching the live stream, but seeing this superhuman baby, I suddenly couldn't smile anymore.\"","\"When will this torment of being outperformed by the young and old end?\"","\"He must be admitted unanimously, right? So cute.\"","Shen Wei didn't ask him to demonstrate calligraphy.","Because he had already taken up enough time in this group.","Moreover, his admission was a foregone conclusion, no need to further occupy others' time.","Shen Wei said, \"If there are no objections, let's score him!\" At that moment, the art teacher Qi Zhong suddenly spoke up: \"Wait a minute.\"","All eyes turned to Qi Zhong, wondering what his opinion was.","Qi Zhong, sitting on the judges' panel, looked at Shao Dongdong and asked, \"Have you ever learned painting before?\"","The little kid shook his head, indicating no.","A child like Shao Dongdong, gifted in everything, was a teacher's dream student.","He had captivated the other art teachers with his three talents, except he hadn't learned painting.","Qi Zhong persisted, \"Why not?\"","Shao Dongdong obediently said, \"I don't like it.\"","Instantly, the live stream was filled with laughter.","\"Did you see the art teacher's disbelieving expression?\"","\"There's actually someone who doesn't like painting, that's like rubbing salt in his wound.\"","\"Turns out the art teacher is so arrogant, he also fancies this superhuman baby.\"","\"But the baby said he doesn't like painting, that's hilarious.\"","\"Another day of the art teacher being hurt.\"","The other young judges couldn't help but burst into laughter upon seeing Qi Zhong's blackened face turn even darker. Then, looking at Shao Dongdong, he said, \"That's because you haven't experienced the charm of painting.\"","In the end, they proceeded to score, and Shao Dongdong got full marks from everyone, becoming the second kid admitted.","As Shao Dongdong was leaving, Qi Zhong stubbornly told him, \"I'll make you experience the appeal of painting.\"","The dance teacher Wu Feng next to her couldn't help but laugh: \"How could you try to snatch students?\"","\"This is the one I've taken a liking to, you guys pick someone else.\"","\"On what grounds? He said he doesn't like painting anymore,\" Song Panpan said.","The online fans were about to die laughing: \"Fight, fight!\"","\"Really, have you guys seen the hot search?\" one person suddenly dropped a line.","It was quite abrupt, and the fans in the live stream all felt tense.","The past two times they were on the hot search were due to random incidents.","This time, everyone was watching so joyfully, could it be that someone was causing trouble again?","But it couldn't be helped that everyone's curiosity was piqued.","They immediately exited the app and switched over.","When they opened the hot search, they were shocked.","Wait, painting teacher Qi Zhong, music teacher Song Panpan, calligraphy teacher Wang Pei, and dance teacher Wu Feng? Why were they so experienced?","Their resumes were thoroughly dug up online.","They were actually top-notch experts in their fields.","When they came back and saw the teachers sitting on the judges' panel again, the online fans were filled with reverence.","\"Why don't you guys consider opening an adult class at this kindergarten? The tuition fee doesn't matter, I just want these great teachers to teach me.\"","\"The kids who can attend this Starry Sky Kindergarten are so blessed. The faculty is top-notch in the industry. It has been elevated to a whole new level.\"","\"Especially the painting teacher, I'm in tears. He ruined everything for his former students, and in the past, he was considered a once-in-a-millennium genius in the art world. No wonder they say he can make kids feel the charm of painting. It's not arrogance, he has the skill.\"","\"Upright values, protective of his students, with skills - how did Shen Wei manage to find all these people?\"","\"If Starry Sky Kindergarten doesn't become popular, it would be an injustice.\"","\"Sisters, don't digress. Let's keep asking in the live stream, will they open an adult class?\"","\"With such great faculty, is it a waste to only teach little kids? Consider us big babies who can pay $300 a month.\""]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Parents' Hearts Are Biased","paragraphs":["The kindergarten was still holding interviews.","Those queuing outside could occasionally hear the applause and sounds of musical instruments from within.","Generally, only high-end kindergartens required interviews.","Children from ordinary families rarely prepared specifically, as Starry Sky Kindergarten only gave them 10 days' notice.","Most were just winging it.","They were betting on the children's impromptu performance and responsiveness.","The parents looked anxious, wishing they could perform on behalf of their children.","Those waiting outside were a bit nervous.","But those coming out had a different demeanor.","Whether they passed the interview or not, they could eat the lunchboxes provided.","Including a bottle of water, a lunchbox, and a box of fruit.","Those whose children weren't selected thought since they were already there, they might as well eat.","After eating, they were amazed.","Some parents were already fans of the live streaming channel.","Their expectations were high, and they were still captivated by the food.","One father of a child was a short video maker, the kind who entertained himself.","Seeing the kindergarten lunchboxes this time, he immediately started a live stream titled: \"Family Finally Gets to Eat the Popular Starry Sky Kindergarten Lunchboxes.\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten was always trending on the live streaming charts.","Seeing this new channel about their lunchboxes, people couldn't resist checking it out.","The dining hall was filled with parents and children.","Some children may have performed poorly in the interview and were in tears, but it didn't affect their eating speed!","The streaming father was suddenly excited seeing hundreds of viewers.","He then zoomed in on the dishes with his phone.","So the viewers could see clearly.","This meal consisted of stir-fried shrimp with bamboo shoots, eggplant with minced pork, a large chicken wing, and a tomato and egg stir-fry","with rice underneath.","The streaming father told the viewers, \"Family has never had such delicious lunchboxes before!\"","The dishes looked ordinary, but they were all great accompaniments for rice.","Especially the eggplant with minced pork, when mixed with rice, each grain was coated in flavor.","One bite brought immense satisfaction.","Tomato and egg stir-fry is something every household can make.","But Chef Chen is a master chef - the eggs were smooth and without any fishy smell.","The rich tomato acidity had a hint of sweetness, perfect for kids.","Even kids who didn't like eating would find this sweet and sour tomato egg dish appealing.","Many viewers had heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten's renowned cuisine.","Seeing the live stream title, they immediately clicked in.","But they were greatly disappointed.","From previous live streams, they knew the kindergarten's cafeteria was famous for its good food.","But this? What happened to the squirrel fish, braised tofu knuckles, and the popular iron plate beef tendon that many loved?","When the streaming father saw the discontent in the comments about an ordinary lunchbox not being worth a live stream, he was about to leave.","But he explained, \"This is already very good. I didn't expect they would provide meals at all. Our family didn't eat anything this morning.\"","\"And with one child bringing two parents, that's 900 lunchboxes for 300 people. That's quite a lot.\"","They couldn't expect small, elaborate dishes in such a situation.","Wouldn't that be too much to ask?","When everyone calculated it, they were shocked.","900 portions - that's a massive scale.","At home, cooking for just a few people takes half a day.","They understood, but still weren't happy with the explanation.","Amid the back-and-forth, a viewer couldn't help but comment, \"Why does everyone look like they're enjoying it so much?\"","Especially the parent behind the streaming father.","He thoroughly mixed the rice and dishes before inhaling it like a hurricane, like he was drinking the rice.","Without chewing at all.","And the adults and children behind him all had an enraptured look.","\"Is it really that delicious?\" The viewers posed an existential question.","The dishes didn't attract them, but everyone seemed intoxicated, which piqued their curiosity.","They were really savoring it.","And the streaming father kept emphasizing how delicious it was.","The person next to him didn't even bother looking at the live stream, finishing one portion and immediately asking for another.","Opening this new lunchbox revealed different dishes, like a surprise blind box experience.","Every homestyle dish was exceptionally tasty. The streaming father originally wanted to interact with the viewers, but the aroma was irresistible!","Facing such exquisite cuisine, not eating it would be unforgivable.","He couldn't be bothered with the inquiring fans anymore, digging into the food noisily.","Infuriating the viewers, who felt tricked into watching just to get tormented by the deliciousness.","One by one, they went to Starry Sky Kindergarten's official live stream channel.","Asking when they would open a restaurant. They couldn't take it anymore!","Even just selling lunchboxes would be fine!","\"Can you open a restaurant? We're just saying, expand your operations! It's not a distraction for a kindergarten to open a restaurant.\"","\"Sisters, did anyone not see the student parent's live stream? So tempting!\"","\"They even had fruit like mangosteen, pineapple, and lychee - all my favorites!\"","\"I just peeked in, and those kids who got rejected were eating while crying, so funny.\"","\"Before, someone in the live stream said we could borrow a kid to go eat, and I mocked them back then. No need to ask, I regret it now.\"","\"Or maybe they could do a giveaway and let a few people come eat.\"","\"Don't mention it, before Shen Wei's dad, the old principal, gave out a tomato in a giveaway and the live stream viewers kicked up a fuss, saying it was too stingy. So they stopped doing that!\"","\"Hey, who's being so disagreeable and ruining it for everyone.\"","...","The children and parents who weren't selected left the kindergarten feeling the trip wasn't wasted.","Thanks to their child, they got to eat a delicious lunchbox.","Although their child wasn't selected, they got to perform in front of everyone, good practice for next time!","When the kids heard their parents say they only got to eat the great lunchboxes because of them, their previously disappointed faces revealed a hint of pride.","They didn't seem as dejected as before.","After returning home, the children continued playing with toys. The two parents secretly discussed, \"We should enroll our child in an interest class.\"","On normal days, they felt their child was the best.","This time, they truly saw the gap.","\"We still need to send our child to Starry Sky Kindergarten, with its sumptuous food. Although we can't eat it often, our child can eat it, which is better than us eating.\"","Apparently, the fragrant lunchbox that left them spellbound was just Chef Chen's ordinary performance.","Because the quantity was too large.","So he just put in some effort.","If they were all treated like this with just a casual effort, imagine how amazing it would be if he prepared it with dedication.","Such a great environment, such great teachers, plus delicious meals.","It's hard to find even with a lit lantern.","\"I think so too.\"","Before, they considered whether to go or not to go.","But after going, they realized there are two types of kindergartens.","One is Starry Sky Kindergarten, and the other is all the rest.","It's better than those 3000-4000 yuan high-end kindergartens they investigated earlier.","The children playing in the sand nearby were completely unaware that their parents were already planning to re-enroll them in Starry Sky.","The couple had even divided the responsibilities.","The mother decided to spend a year cultivating their child.","The father, on the other hand, would closely monitor every move of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Especially regarding the second round of admissions.","The preparation time was too short this time. If they had been given more time, they were confident their child would have been admitted."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Staff Quota","paragraphs":["The intense interviews were ongoing at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Five-year-old He Lingfeng came along.","Since he normally lived at the kindergarten.","This time, with a three-day break, the little guy was getting a bit bored.","After finishing his online classes, he came out for a stroll.","He ran into this interview room and saw Shen Wei, unable to resist getting close to her.","Perhaps it was because she had saved him before.","He really liked Shen Wei a lot.","This little guy had a high self-esteem, learned knowledge quickly, and had a mature demeanor for a child.","Though his chubby little face looked quite pinchable, he never let others pinch it.","Except for Shen Wei.","Shen Wei held the child in her embrace.","The usually formidable little prodigy rested his head on Shen Wei's shoulder.","Looking ever so obedient.","Though he was a bit precocious, deep down he was still a child, somewhat enjoying being held, his serious little face bashful. But he still sat next to Shen Wei, sticking close to her.","He thought no one had noticed.","Little did he know this scene was being recorded in the livestream.","He Lingfeng was an extremely handsome child, currently the most attractive at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Even the young master Liu Chen and the earlier Shao Dongdong couldn't match up.","In the livestream, there were many mother fans of his, getting excited at the sight of He Lingfeng.","\"Oh my, the baby is so cute.\"","\"He still has some baby fat, he must be so cuddly.\"","The internet is a place of forgetfulness.","Last time when he could learn middle school curriculum, being called a child prodigy and even reported by the media.","When Shen Wei rejected him.","It had only been a month, but no one brought up that incident anymore.","Fortunately, the hasty internet sensation didn't spread over here. Otherwise, it might have ruined the child.","He Lingfeng is now jointly directed by Professor Liu and Professor Gao, with Shen Wei occasionally letting him participate in kindergarten activities.","Completely the image of a sunny, well-behaved young lad, nothing like the misanthropic villain the system claimed.","Online, people showered He Lingfeng with praises.","The child could already read.","Seeing the passionate confessions from netizens, his cheeks flushed bright red.","Seeing the child like this, the livestream viewers were even more smitten and cooed loudly.","Liu Chef loved children the most, and the kids interviewing this time were all so nervous.","Now seeing He Lingfeng come over, he said, \"Quick, let Old Liu hold you.\"","He Lingfeng also liked this Liu Grandpa who cooked delicious food. He then stretched out his arms.","Held in Liu Grandpa's embrace.","Netizens saw Liu Chef beaming with joy.","The livestream commented, \"Liu Chef loves kids too much!\"","\"That's right, have you all noticed that in all the performances so far, Liu Chef would always give supportive votes. He's someone with absolutely no boundaries when it comes to spoiling kids!\"","\"But I really like him, seeing him reminds me of my own grandpa.\"","\"I can feel that the people at this kindergarten truly love children. Unlike those who are just doing it for the money.\"","\"Now I'm really envious of the kids who get selected into the Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"Me too.\"","Online, another wave of praise followed for Liu Chef.","Liu Chef was practically the internet grandpa now.","Liu Chef's wife was watching the kindergarten livestream.","She liked casting it on the TV to see everyone clearly.","Liu Chef held a high status in the culinary world, and everyone respected him. He always carried himself properly too.","Who knew he had this side, completely losing boundaries and principles when seeing kids.","Even Liu Chef's wife couldn't help but laugh watching him.","You could really see how satisfied he was with this job.","He used to pretend otherwise.","Saying he was just making do with the job! At his young age, he couldn't retire early, he wouldn't be able to sit still.","Now he radiated passion for the work.","Those two days off actually made him feel miserable all over.","Liu Chef's wife planned to save up some words to tease him later.","But then the doorbell rang at this moment.","Opening the door, she saw, \"Oh, you came over?\"","It was her older daughter-in-law with her grandson, and younger daughter-in-law with her granddaughter.","These two rarely visited.","Only meeting during the New Year usually.","Now they came together.","And brought the kids along.","The grandchildren she hadn't seen in a while sweetly called her grandma upon seeing her.","Earlier, Liu Chef's wife mocked him for losing principles around kids.","Now she was the same.","Looking at her grandson and granddaughter, her heart was melting.","\"Come in, grandma will give you candy.\"","She really didn't know how to contain herself.","Bringing out all the candies, chocolates, dried fruits and nuts, wishing she could feed them directly into the kids' mouths.","These two kids hadn't seen each other in a while.","But with blood relations, they quickly warmed up and started playing together.","The older daughter-in-law said to her son, \"Be a good boy and let your sister go first, don't bully her!\"","\"I know, Mom.\"","Though Liu Chef's wife was happy, with both kids coming over, there must be a special reason.","The two daughters-in-law seemed prepared, asking, \"What's going on?\"","The older daughter-in-law couldn't keep things to herself, plus her son was almost 5 years old, unlike the younger one whose daughter was only 3.","The older daughter-in-law said, \"I heard Dad is working at the Starry Sky Kindergarten, and there are two openings left, so I was thinking we could let the kids attend kindergarten there.\"","Previously, Liu Chef had shared this in the family group chat, but the two sons said there was no need for the hassle.","Since they didn't live in the same district, it would be inconvenient to send the kids over.","The daughters-in-law didn't say anything in the group, likely thinking the same.","But now it was different, the Starry Sky Kindergarten had become popular.","Even they in the neighboring district had heard about it.","It was very difficult for ordinary kids to get in.","They now had this convenient opportunity, which piqued their interest.","The older daughter-in-law shared this with the younger one.","The two immediately agreed.","Driving straight over.","In the car, they listened to the livestream.","And grew increasingly fond of it.","Initially, they had underestimated the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Had they known how great this kindergarten was, they definitely wouldn't have brushed it off earlier.","The younger daughter-in-law said, \"I was thinking the same, though my little Nuonuo is still small, the siblings can look out for each other, plus Nuonuo can clearly express herself during meals and using the restroom, so she can come here too!\"","She didn't dare wait, hearing that a spot could now sell for tens of thousands, who knows what changes might happen in two more years.","The daughters-in-law's little thoughts, of course, couldn't be hidden from their mother-in-law's eyes.","Liu Chef's wife said, \"Alright, but will you be leaving the kids with me to look after, or will you all be coming over too?\"","Liu Chef's wife was in good health nowadays, and had nothing much to do at home. She could look after the kids if they were left with her. But these days, children are raised delicately, so she wasn't sure if the parents would be comfortable with that.","The two daughters-in-law said, \"We hope to leave the kids here, and come visit every week. That way, we can see the kids and also spend more time with you both.\"","Liu Chef's wife nodded, \"You came just in time. Someone offered 60,000 yuan for this spot, but your dad didn't sell it, thinking you might want it if you decided not to take it.\"","The two daughters-in-law visibly relaxed, \"We knew our dad would have a plan. Otherwise, we wouldn't have gotten into such a great kindergarten!\"","\"We two sisters will stay here for about 10 days or so. Once the admission is done and the kids have adjusted, we'll go back.\"","Luckily Liu Chef was there, and the kids' grandpa is now the vice principal. It was obvious that the kids wouldn't face any trouble.","There was nothing more reassuring than this."]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Flirting with Them 800 Times a Day in a Broken Kindergarten","paragraphs":["This was everyone's first time watching the livestream of the kindergarten, and the livestream room was buzzing with excitement all day long.","Unexpectedly, just before the livestream ended, Shen Wei gave everyone a surprise.","\"Dance teacher Wu Feng and music teacher Song Panpan will perform at the end.\"","These new teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten were still trending topics online.","The news of their upcoming performance quickly spread through the WeChat groups.","Soon, everyone moved to another classroom with a stage.","This classroom could accommodate over 100 people.","Shen Wei had mentioned to Wu Feng earlier that she would give him a stage. He didn't expect it to happen so soon.","A couple of days ago when Shen Wei told him, he was a bit shocked.","Some parents who were originally left out were about to leave, but decided to stay after hearing this news.","After all, Shen Wei didn't chase them away.","In an instant, the people who stayed packed the classroom to the brim.","Even the windows and hallways were filled with people standing.","Wu Feng's heart was pounding rapidly, not from nervousness but from excitement.","It had been so long since he had performed on stage, since he had an audience.","Now, with so many people watching him, that long-lost joy made his blood feel like it was burning, about to burst through his veins.","After he took his position, the lighting changed rapidly, and the music began quietly.","With his first move, everyone was stunned because Wu Feng infused his breathing into his movements.","Just that opening stance captured everyone's attention.","Everyone witnessed firsthand what it meant to be a natural beauty filter.","To be honest, Wu Feng wasn't handsome.","And he was short and skinny, not very noticeable among the judges.","But when he started dancing, he was incredibly charismatic.","Swaying gracefully to the rhythm of the music, he was like a light breeze that captivated your gaze.","Every gesture, every step exuded an indescribable beauty.","Watching his entire face and expressions, you became truly immersed. Even his hair strands seemed to glow.","The floor he stepped on became textured, airy and soft.","An ordinary floor, but when he danced on it, it was like clouds.","It was so beautiful.","Even the people in the livestream didn't dare speak.","Everyone was engrossed.","Rather than just a dance, it was more of an artistic performance.","Among the new teachers, the art teacher was the most famous.","His past experiences were enough to astonish anyone.","The music teacher studied abroad and was proficient in two performance-level instruments at such a young age,","which was very impressive.","Although the calligraphy teacher didn't showcase his skills, he was very handsome,","attracting most people's attention.","Only the dance teacher seemed ordinary among them.","This dance performance made everyone see him in a new light.","When the dance ended, many were left wanting more.","\"Is that it?\"","\"I can't get enough of watching, can it be a bit longer?\"","\"Now I finally understand why ancient emperors loved watching beautiful people dance so much. Who wouldn't be entranced by this?\"","\"Someone, make him a royal consort.\"","\"A royal consort's position is too low for him. In ancient times, he would have been more than qualified to be the emperor's wife.\"","After the dance ended, Wu Feng deeply bowed to everyone, and thunderous applause nearly blew the roof off!","Art transcends boundaries.","Wu Feng's dance was so beautiful that even art teacher Qi Zhong's eyes reddened.","It's unclear what he was reminded of.","When the dance teacher came down, the art teacher gave him a hug.","\"That was truly amazing.\"","\"How many years of training does it take to reach this level?\"","\"I also want my child to learn dance.\"","Most of the people watching were parents of students.","Many children weren't admitted.","Before the performance, they thought it was no big deal not getting admitted. What could they do about it?","But after watching the dance, their regret multiplied tenfold.","Such a great kindergarten, they came for the interview but didn't get selected.","If their child could learn even a little bit, it would be a lifelong benefit.","When looking at Shen Wei, their eyes held a hint of resentment.","Starry Sky Kindergarten only admitted one hundred students, not enough, far from enough.","The food here was already enough to make people like it, and now they realized the real highlight was the teachers.","After the dance ended, many parents asked the dance teacher for his contact information.","But Wu Feng's dance was impressive precisely because the general audience could understand it.","Truly reaching artistic heights.","Every movement challenged the limits of aesthetics.","The audience here were mostly parents of students.","Dance is a widely chosen extracurricular activity for parents.","Many people had also checked out some dance training institutions recently.","Teachers they previously thought were great paled in comparison after watching Wu Feng's dance.","Those teachers didn't even qualify to be Wu Feng's assistant.","It was the difference between the heavens and the earth.","This shabby kindergarten hooked them eight hundred times a day.","Wu Feng didn't add any parents on WeChat. Some clever ones pestered Shen Wei to let their child transfer in as a mid-year admission.","They were willing to pay extra tuition fees.","Originally only mildly interested, now their interest grew twelvefold.","Watching the chaos unfold below the stage,","Shen Wei said, \"We're not accepting mid-year transfers for now, but you can closely monitor for any future admissions.\"","\"When will that be?\" the parents pressed.","Shen Wei replied, \"It's not clear now, please refer to any announcements on our website.\"","After the dance teacher finished his performance,","music teacher Song Panpan took to the stage to play the violin.","She was the epitome of the traditional Chinese beauty with long, black hair.","The moment she raised the violin to her shoulder, the stage suddenly dimmed.","The noisy crowd quieted down.","A spotlight shone down.","The surroundings were dark.","The LED screen in the background projected a bright moon.","Instantly, the abstract image of the moon goddess materialized.","She played the heartbreaking \"The Butterfly Lovers\" on her violin.","This classic piece is well-known across China.","Many artists have performed it.","But the magic of a live music performance is incomparable to recordings.","The sorrowful, pleading music was like an old tale of love from past generations.","The fresh and elegant moon goddess performed this beautiful piece.","Music cannot deceive.","Even without understanding music, one could hear the difference in skill levels.","The parents were inspired to have their children learn another instrument.","The violin is great.","Easy to showcase.","This interview trip was worthwhile.","They have accumulated a lot of experience.","Nowadays, children have many opportunities to perform on stage.","If only there was an instrument as portable as a violin, that would really make me stand out among my peers.","Nowadays, which parent hasn't dreamed of their son becoming a dragon or their daughter becoming a phoenix?","Just thinking about it makes those people ecstatic.","I must learn the violin!","It has such an artistic atmosphere.","Not only were the live audience going crazy.","The viewers in the livestream were stunned too: \"Oh my god, they're like celestial beings!\"","\"I studied violin for 5 years when I was young, but I eventually gave up. Seeing her playing the violin now makes me want to pick it up again and relearn it.\"","\"Is Starry Sky Kindergarten tempting me?\"","\"Is there an adult kindergarten? I don't mind the name, I just want to go there and learn, and eat at their cafeteria while I'm at it.\"","When the music ended, everyone was applauding enthusiastically.","Even the calligraphy teacher and art teacher were having unusual thoughts.","It's just that their specialties weren't suited for performance exhibitions.","They felt a tinge of regret.","Even the art teacher marveled, how did Shen Wei manage to gather all these people together? He was in awe of her skills."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: Requesting a Price Increase for Kindergarten","paragraphs":["The livestream ended.","At the end, the issue of tuition fees for this term was discussed.","All the parents were very concerned, and even colleagues had been secretly tuning in to the livestream all day, finally getting a valuable piece of information!","The kindergarten teachers perked up immediately.","They had anticipated this, as Shen Wei's previous tuition fee of 260 yuan was unrealistic.","With so many new students joining, it was impossible to continue charging 260 yuan.","If they kept it at 260, it wouldn't be charity, it would just be causing trouble.","Shen Wei said the tuition fees would likely be charged at a normal rate.","She didn't specify the exact amount!","Many were guessing.","Currently, a relatively good kindergarten charges around 3,000 yuan per month.","But it's obvious that Starry Sky Kindergarten is of a higher caliber than those.","So everyone was anticipating that the tuition fees would be at least between 3,000-4,000 yuan.","With that being the case, it wouldn't be the previous 260 yuan anymore.","Some parents started brainstorming: \"Is there anyone willing to transfer their spot? I'm willing to pay 20,000 yuan.\"","If those who were accepted were to give up because the tuition fee wasn't 260 yuan, then they would be missing out on a great opportunity.","The key is that not only they are smart.","At one point, several people wanted to buy a spot, and the price kept rising.","On Shen Wei's end, she had closed the livestream room, leaving the fans of the livestream room feeling miserable.","They flocked to the comment section to leave messages.","They wanted to know exactly how much the tuition fee would be.","It couldn't be eight thousand to ten thousand yuan, could it?","Everyone was guessing at that time.","The next day, as soon as Shen Wei opened the livestream room,","The people pouring in were all concerned about the tuition fee issue, with no interest in watching the interviews.","Seeing that the screen was filled with questions about this, Shen Wei said: \"Then let me announce the tuition fee.\"","Those watching the livestream sat up straight.","They had been speculating about this news for a long time yesterday.","Most people thought the tuition fee would be at least 3,500 yuan.","But Shen Wei said: \"The tuition fee will be 1,600 yuan per month from now on, including breakfast, lunch, school bus, uniforms, dance, music, painting, calligraphy, with one class per week. All of these are included, and in the future, we plan to offer English and computer interest classes as well!\"","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief. 1,600 yuan was considered very reasonable by all.","Those who had been demanding to transfer their spots yesterday were still demanding it today, with the price being driven up to 60,000 yuan, but no one was willing to sell.","Everyone wasn't blind.","Their child's bright future was more important than a few thousand yuan.","Having so many high-level teachers for early education.","Having such carefully selected children as classmates.","Who would care about those few thousand yuan?","Those wanting to buy a spot didn't want to waste a year, so they were willing to spend a little more money to get in. There were many parents with this demand.","But the children who had worked hard to get in were not willing to sell their spots at all.","And this was the first year that Starry Sky Kindergarten was recruiting students. Many people were still observing and had not applied in time!","Now that the popularity was so high, there would definitely be more applicants next time.","Once the spots were taken, it would be difficult to get them back.","Soon, the old fans in the livestream room came up with a suggestion - don't buy spots from those children who had worked hard to get in.","Every staff member at Starry Sky Kindergarten has two recommendation spots.","At that moment, everyone who had appeared on the livestream started tapping into their connections.","In the end, only the spot from School Bus Driver Zhang Daming was sold.","It turned out true as Liu Chef had said earlier. It was sold too cheaply, and now it could fetch an extra 10,000 yuan.","The others realized this spot was precious and didn't want to sell it casually!","Moreover, Starry Sky Kindergarten had generously given them 100,000 yuan for a buyout of their image rights early on.","So they weren't that short on money.","They had to be a little more selective with the people they recommended.","However, everyone was quite appreciative of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The benefits given were so substantial, which was essentially giving them money.","It was rare to find a place with a good environment and high salary, so they had to work hard.","...","The Starry Sky Kindergarten livestream was a huge hit.","Elder Sister Xu from the Mall also became a celebrity.","Ever since her colleague told people that Elder Sister Xu's child attended Starry Sky Kindergarten,","Others flocked to ask her how her child got in.","They learned that it was Elder Sister Xu's mother-in-law who penny-pinched and enrolled the child there. At the time, Elder Sister Xu was unwilling.","They clutched their chests, saying to Elder Sister Xu, \"It's a good thing you didn't refuse back then, otherwise you'd be regretting it now.\"","Elder Sister Xu wholeheartedly agreed.","That parent who had paid money to go to the kindergarten and make trouble by withdrawing their child was now regretting it deeply.","With such a precedent, they couldn't afford to make the same mistake.","These past few days, Elder Sister Xu occasionally watched the cut compilation videos of the children from the livestream.","The selection process was truly strict.","Now that Starry Sky Kindergarten was so popular, even her nemesis in procurement was trying to butter her up.","They wanted to see if they could use their connections as an old student's parent to recommend their child.","Elder Sister Xu was sick and tired of it all.","Too many people had been coming to her to consult about the kindergarten lately.","At noon for lunch, she deliberately found the most secluded corner in the mall's food court.","Elder Sister Xu took out her phone, which she hadn't really checked all morning.","As soon as she opened it, she saw 99+ replies.","Upon further inspection, it turned out an unfamiliar person had added her to a group.","The group name was \"Starry Sky Kindergarten Class 1 Parents Group.\"","Elder Sister Xu opened it and saw that many were parents of students.","She had seen them before when picking up their children and added them on WeChat.","Elder Sister Xu took a closer look and realized that the group didn't include Teacher Tang, Shen Wei, or any of the others.","It was a private group for student parents.","At that moment, the group had been chatting for a while.","Elder Sister Xu scrolled up, and it seemed endless.","But she patiently found the very first message and read through them one by one.","The parents' group had already shared the latest 1,600 yuan tuition fee.","Someone had also shared some highlights from the children's interviews.","Most of the comments were along the lines of being grateful that they had enrolled early. Otherwise, according to the current standards, their children might not have been accepted.","One person's comment sparked a discussion among everyone.","That person said: \"I plan to pay the 1,600 yuan tuition fee for the next payment!\"","They had already paid nearly half a year at the previous rate of 260 yuan.","It was clear to everyone what kind of facilities and food their children were getting.","\"260 yuan doesn't even cover the costs. I'm really grateful to that kindergarten. As long as my child is happy, I'm happy. They've been so good to us, I don't want to take advantage anymore.\"","So they created a private group to discuss whether they should do this, and the response was very enthusiastic.","Everyone chimed in: \"I've been wanting to say this for a while but didn't have the courage.\"","\"I don't know what others think, but I'm willing to do it.\"","\"The kids are really happy here. I'd even be willing to pay 2,600, not just 1,600.\"","\"The kindergarten is a business, they need to make money. Even though Shen Wei isn't short on money, we should act like we don't know that.\"","\"You're right.\"","\"I agree.\"","\"I agree too.\"","Elder Sister Xu was the last to see it.","By the time she saw it, everyone else in the group had already agreed.","Not wanting to be left behind, Elder Sister Xu said, \"I agree too. It's already great that the kids can attend this kindergarten. Plus, they've added extracurricular classes now. I've inquired about it, and teachers of their caliber charge at least 300 yuan an hour for private lessons.\"","The parents really aren't losing out.","The group admin didn't expect everyone to be on board so quickly. She immediately said, \"Alright, I'll add Teacher Tang and Shen Wei to the group. Everyone can discuss it with them and show them our support.\"","Soon, Teacher Tang and Shen Wei were added to the group.","As soon as they joined, the parents enthusiastically petitioned for a price increase.","Shen Wei was dumbfounded. \"There's no need, no need. I said 260, so it's 260 - that's already a discounted rate for you all.\"","\"But we've been enjoying that discount for a long time now.\"","\"We really can't let you subsidize us anymore!\"","\"That's right, we all agree.\"","\"Next month, we'll pay 1,600.\"","\"Please, just take the money. I hope you can earn more!\"","\"I'm especially worried you're not making enough.\"","\"We're not asking for your opinion on the price increase, we're telling you. Understand?\"","Seeing the parents' comments one by one, Shen Wei was truly touched.","This was their acknowledgment of her and Teacher Tang's efforts.","Sincerity really does beget sincerity.","The parents' thinking was very simple. 1,600 might not be much, but it would cover their basic costs.","Maybe the Starry Sky Kindergarten could stick around for longer.","The students' parents were eager for Starry Sky Kindergarten to become a century-old institution.","So this unhealthy operating model of subsidizing costs should change.","Shen Wei agreed!","The students' parents were overjoyed.","One of them even took a screenshot and posted it on social media.","All the parents begging Starry Sky Kindergarten to raise prices became a hot topic again.","Other kindergartens' competitors felt sour and resentful - how did they manage to get such supportive parents?","Begging to be charged more?","I've really seen it all!"]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: Reaping What You Sow","paragraphs":["The hottest topic in town right now is the student selection at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Any parents with children of the appropriate age who need to attend kindergarten are paying attention.","Starry Sky Kindergarten can be considered a pioneer.","They've directly brought the practices of elite kindergartens to a regular kindergarten.","The fee of 1,600 RMB is quite affordable for ordinary families.","Since enrollment began, they've been constantly trending.","There are even public accounts specifically compiling reactions,","As well as compilations of the children who have been accepted.","It's no exaggeration that in a short period of time, the viewership has exceeded 200 million.","At this moment, a new livestream suddenly emerged, with someone revealing their experience of withdrawing their child from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Those few words strung together instantly struck a nerve with everyone.","People are dying to get into Starry Sky Kindergarten, yet someone withdrew from there.","Clicking into the live stream, the whistleblower turned out to be Yuan Yuan's Mother.","As soon as she started the livestream, many asked what had happened.","The heat instantly shot up to the local top trending topic.","It triggered the sensitive nerves of other kindergarten principals in the area.","They couldn't resist tuning in, wondering if there was any real gossip.","Each one like a shark smelling blood in the water.","If there was any dirt on Starry Sky Kindergarten, they'd immediately pounce to tear it apart, as Yuan Yuan's Mother had blocked too many of their paths to profit.","When Yuan Yuan's Mother saw so many people watching her livestream, she got a bit carried away, saying: \"Alright, I'll tell you today how our child withdrew from there.\"","\"Initially, our child was attending Starry Sky Kindergarten for 260 RMB.\"","\"Everything was going well, and the child was quite happy, until suddenly one day, a woman approached me saying that if I withdrew from there, she would give me 5,000 RMB, and my child could attend their kindergarten for free.\"","\"At the time, I was blinded by greed, thinking it didn't matter which kindergarten the child attended.\"","\"So I withdrew from there. Only then did I realize it was a massive scheme by Giraffe Kindergarten against Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"They just wanted to use me to create a bad impression of Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"After I withdrew, not only did I not receive the 5,000 RMB they had promised, but my child also couldn't enroll in their kindergarten for free. Isn't that a scam?\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother was truly furious.","There were also people from other kindergartens in the livestream, originally intending to gather information.","Little did they expect the plot by Giraffe Kindergarten to be exposed.","With the livestream containing such explosive revelations, everyone immediately became excited and started demanding: \"Is this true or not?\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother had dealt with Giraffe Kindergarten for so long that she knew they were no good.","She brought up that kindergarten and swore through gritted teeth that what she said was true.","The viewers in the livestream gasped in shock: \"How terrifying when you think about it, that business warfare exists so close to us.\"","\"These established kindergartens are too evil. 260 RMB was clearly a subsidized fee from the other party. But to tarnish Starry Sky's reputation, they resorted to such despicable tactics.\"","\"And they even went back on their word. I really can't respect people like that.\"","\"Does everyone remember the times when Starry Sky Kindergarten was inexplicably smeared a few times before? It was probably the same trick.\"","\"I said back then that there must be something going on, but no one believed me then. You see, I was right.\"","\"Which one is this Giraffe Kindergarten? They're so sinister.\"","\"I know, that's Teacher Tang's former employer.\"","\"Oh, no wonder.\"","Giraffe Kindergarten still didn't know what had happened. It was other competitors who passed the information to them.","The principal of Giraffe Kindergarten was the same Middle-aged Woman who had gone to throw a tantrum at Teacher Tang.","When she saw the livestream, she was nearly enraged to death: \"Thinking you could get it for free, you're treating yourself like a beggar.\"","The more the Middle-aged Woman thought about it, the angrier she became. She clicked into this livestream, only to find Yuan Yuan's Mother still talking about this matter.","Hearing it was unbearably grating, so she immediately called.","As soon as the call went through, the livestream automatically closed.","The Middle-aged Woman shouted curses: \"Have you gone crazy from being poor? Why would I just give you 5,000 RMB for free!\"","\"Let me tell you, if you want that money, you're trying to extort it. Now you're even trying to smear our kindergarten's reputation, you'll be receiving a lawyer's letter soon.\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother was no pushover either, saying: \"You really know how to bully people. You tricked us into withdrawing before, promising free enrollment and 5,000 RMB that you never gave.\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother continued: \"I'm just telling the truth, letting everyone know your true colors! Businesses like yours are bound to fail eventually.\" Then she hung up.","The Middle-aged Woman was about to be enraged to death. She never expected Yuan Yuan's Mother to be so stubborn.","She immediately called back, only to hear a busy tone - this woman had actually dared to block her number.","Soon after, the latest livestream clip appeared on WeChat.","In the video, an furious Yuan Yuan's Mother played an audio recording for everyone.","The Middle-aged Woman nearly fainted. The people in the livestream all heard the conversation between the two of them.","The fans in the livestream immediately became angry: \"At this point, she still shows no remorse and acts arrogantly, clearly having been arrogant for too long.\"","\"Giraffe Kindergarten, was it? Alright, I've remembered your name today.\"","\"Everyone go take a look, someone has already dug up information on the principal of Giraffe Kindergarten. She's Teacher Tang's former employer, who previously didn't provide social security for employees and was taken to arbitration.\"","\"Posting from a burner account as an insider: When Teacher Tang was working at the kindergarten back then, because of her exceptionally high teaching quality, many parents really liked Teacher Tang. The principal felt her position was somewhat threatened, and repeatedly undermined Tang, who was the most senior teacher but received the lowest salary.\"","\"Isn't this workplace bullying?\"","Once the information was out, everyone became enraged.","\"A kindergarten that treats its teachers so poorly and breaks promises to parents, with so many ill intentions, how can they be allowed to run a kindergarten?\"","\"Exactly, I wouldn't feel at ease leaving my child at this kindergarten.\"","The torrent of insults in the livestream was unbearably harsh for the Middle-aged Woman to read.","Someone as stubbornly unapologetic as her couldn't withstand the barrage of criticism from everyone.","It was as if she had been locked in an ice cellar - she couldn't let people continue digging further.","Immediately after, she switched to another phone number to call Yuan Yuan's Mother again.","Knowing that Yuan Yuan's Mother was recording, I didn't dare to underestimate her anymore. Forcing myself to be patient, I said, \"I'm from the Giraffe Kindergarten.\"","\"The previous incident may have been a misunderstanding. We can negotiate this matter. For now, our kindergarten won't pursue this issue with you. As we discussed before, we'll give you 5,000 yuan and free admission for your child. Just stop the broadcast immediately and clarify that this was merely your imagination!\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother was not usually smart, but this time she showed a rare moment of cleverness.","Yuan Yuan's Mother said, \"Things have already escalated to this point. I wouldn't dare to send my child to your kindergarten. What if you mistreat my child? Then I would have nowhere to cry.\"","\"What do you want then?\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother abruptly hung up the phone. When the Middle-aged Woman called back, she only heard the busy tone.","Yuan Yuan's Mother no longer cared about getting into the kindergarten. She was now focused on another matter.","Because of this exposure, everyone was afraid they couldn't find a kindergarten, leading to increased attention on Yuan Yuan's Mother's platform. Now she already had over 20,000 followers.","Popularity means money. She could start live streaming and selling products as an internet celebrity.","The Middle-aged Woman never expected Yuan Yuan's Mother to expose this online.","She went crazy, repeatedly calling from new numbers, but no matter how many numbers the Middle-aged Woman tried, she couldn't keep up with Yuan Yuan's Mother's blocking speed.","The Middle-aged Woman felt a tinge of regret, wishing she hadn't provoked this foolish person.","Yuan Yuan's Mother had caught her off guard with this move."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Dog Bites Dog's Hair","paragraphs":["Doctor Lu read about the incident involving Yuan Yuan's Mother and Giraffe Kindergarten with great interest, even forwarding it to Shen Wei.","\"Look at this!\"","When Yuan Yuan's Mother wanted to withdraw from the kindergarten initially, she caused a huge uproar.","At that time, Giraffe Kindergarten was in the spotlight, and many people were paying attention to this incident.","She was giving others a knife to stab them.","It made many people at Starry Sky Kindergarten feel disheartened. To be fair, everyone treated Yuan Yuan very well.","They had devoted their efforts to nurturing their precious little ones. But for the sake of a few thousand yuan, the parent began to stab them in the back.","The tuition fee of 260 yuan was unmatched in the entire city!","He wasn't upset for himself, but for Shen Wei's undeserved treatment.","Shen Wei, on the other hand, contributed both money and time.","The bus driver rose early to pick up and drop off students, and Chef Liu prepared delicious meals with great creativity.","In the end, they ended up with an ungrateful person.","Doctor Lu not only read it himself but also shared it in the Starry Sky Kindergarten staff group.","It's more enjoyable to share the joy with others.","...","The middle-aged woman spent the entire night being repeatedly blocked by Yuan Yuan's Mother.","However, due to her interference, Yuan Yuan's Mother also stopped live streaming.","The next morning, the middle-aged woman, unusually up early, arrived at her own kindergarten with a black eye.","Just thinking about this incident made her furious.","She had initially planned to hold a meeting once everyone arrived, but after staying up all night, her mind was like a muddle, and she needed to put their heads together to find a breakthrough.","She couldn't let Yuan Yuan's Mother continue exposing secrets here.","Soon, however, she received some news that many children had called in sick today!","It's normal for children to occasionally take sick days.","But for so many children to call in sick at the same time was definitely not normal.","Combined with yesterday's events, even without the principal saying anything, those below clearly understood.","It was like a bad signal.","Sure enough, within an hour, something even more troubling happened for the middle-aged woman – a parent came to request a refund, no longer wanting their child to attend this kindergarten.","The middle-aged woman was not someone with a good temper. She had initially planned to coax the parent gently, but the parent was adamant.","Adding to her lack of sleep, she immediately flew into a rage: \"If you want to leave, just leave, but you won't get a single cent back.\"","Unfortunately, the parent didn't back down: \"If you don't refund me, I'll call the mayor's hotline immediately!\"","The middle-aged woman scoffed coldly: \"If I was afraid of you, I wouldn't have opened a kindergarten in the first place. The fact that I can open one means I have people above me.\"","But instead of being intimidated by her words, the parent laughed coldly: \"Oh really? Then who are the people above you?\"","The middle-aged woman waved her hand impatiently, shooing the parent away like swatting a fly: \"You'd better leave. If you keep causing trouble, I'll have the security guards kick you out.\"","Little did she know that the parent had already recorded everything with a hidden camera and soon shared it in the kindergarten parents' group.","The parents immediately exploded: \"We pay tuition fees at the kindergarten, to put it bluntly, we're like the sugar daddies of the kindergarten.\"","\"This kindergarten not only has a lot of dirt, but they're also disrespectful to the parents, and they threaten to have security guards kick us out at the drop of a hat, claiming they have people above them. It's simply outrageous.\"","One by one, the parents began cursing and tagging the principal and teachers in the official group.","The middle-aged woman's relatives hurried over to mediate, persuading the parent to leave with great difficulty.","This parent had a short temper and immediately slapped the middle-aged woman, leaving her ear ringing.","The middle-aged woman was about to hit back when her relatives stopped her!","After sending off the parent, the middle-aged woman lashed out at her own relatives: \"Whose side are you on? She hit me, and you didn't stop her, but you stopped me?\"","The middle-aged woman was furious, having never been so disgraced in all her street years.","She ranted endlessly: \"She wants a refund? Pfft, dream on. For that slap, she's not leaving without paying 20,000 yuan!\"","The relative sighed wearily: \"Stop talking, someone recorded the whole thing and posted it in the group.\"","\"What?\" The middle-aged woman was stunned: \"Let me see it!\"","When she saw the group, her eyes went dark.","Apart from curses, there were demands for refunds, people leaving the group, saying they would settle the score offline, and if they didn't get a refund, there would be trouble!","Some even asked who her higher-ups were, claiming they knew people in the prosecutor's office and would investigate thoroughly!","The middle-aged woman was in a complete panic, no longer concerned about the red handprint on her face.","Instead, she vented her anger on the relative who had tried to mediate: \"Why didn't you tell me sooner?\"","They hadn't even figured out a counterstrategy yet.","Disaster struck when it was raining heavily, and someone had already shared the incident online.","Giraffe Kindergarten bullied Teacher Tang, didn't pay social security for employees, and backstabbed competitors. Now they were disrespectful to the parents.","They were simply downright wicked.","With this incident tied to the trending Starry Sky Kindergarten case, her phone didn't stop ringing all day.","While Giraffe Kindergarten was embroiled in this scandal,","many quickly shared the news in Yuan Yuan's Mother's live stream.","Yuan Yuan's Mother wore a smug expression and began live streaming, ranting about how they deserved it.","But soon, she noticed a viewer's comment: \"Now that you've left Starry Sky Kindergarten, do you regret it?\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother had a sudden realization: \"Regret? I regret it so much I could turn blue.\"","Currently, an admission slot at Starry Sky Kindergarten could sell for 60,000 yuan.","She couldn't get in even if she wanted to. Ever since she exposed the story yesterday during her live stream, she felt people giving her strange looks even when she went out to buy groceries.","With the newfound popularity of her live stream, she couldn't help but entertain crooked thoughts.","\"I hope the friends in my live stream can help me. My child cries every day, saying they miss the teachers and the principal of Starry Sky Kindergarten. I really know I made a mistake. Could you all help spread the word so my child can be re-admitted?\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother grew more convinced: \"We went there when no one else had. This shows how much trust we had in her. She can't just abandon us!\"","The viewers had initially been quite sympathetic towards her.","Although she had failed in her attempt to gain an unfair advantage,","the child was ultimately innocent.","Out of consideration for the child, they had been quite gentle with her. But upon hearing her words, they immediately lost their composure.","\"No way, did I just witness moral kidnapping?\"","\"Didn't you voluntarily withdraw from the kindergarten back then? For that petty gain, you stabbed Starry Sky Kindergarten in the back!\"","\"Seeing Starry Sky Kindergarten thriving, you want to come and take advantage again.\"","\"Still talking about going to Starry Sky Kindergarten, trusting her so much, wasn't it just because you were attracted by the low prices?\"","\"Please, I hope you can figure this out, it's you who owe Starry Sky Kindergarten, not the kindergarten owing you.\"","\"A person who only thinks about taking advantage of others, you deserve to encounter this kind of thing.\"","Yuan Yuan's Mother was dumbfounded.","Weren't the others consoling her before?","Why did it shift to Starry Sky Kindergarten, and now everyone was cursing at her again.","The netizens hurled insults at her in waves, like knives.","Yuan Yuan's Mother immediately ended the live stream. Indeed, the internet is not something everyone can handle.","This incident trended on social media.","Those wealthy families who previously wanted to observe and send their children to Starry Sky Kindergarten, after much thought, ultimately agreed to go to Noble Kindergarten instead!","The main reason was that Starry Sky Kindergarten had become too controversial.","Even a small incident could attract everyone's attention, which was a concern for the wealthy families.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten was delighted.","This is what they call \"the shrimps and clams quarreled, and the fisher benefited.\"","The principal instructed the teachers: \"When these children from wealthy families come, they must have dedicated teachers, available at their beck and call, and we should try our best to meet their every demand, letting them experience the service of Noble Kindergarten!\"","The principal had a smug expression on his face.","They had been harassed by Starry Sky Kindergarten for a while, and finally welcomed this great news.","Meanwhile, Shen Wei was indifferent, as she was receiving rewards from the system."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Physical Examination","paragraphs":["Shen Wei recruited 100 students, but ultimately 103 students were admitted.","She exceeded the task issued by the system.","At this moment, her mind was filled with the mechanical voice left by the system.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for expanding her business premises and increasing the number of enrolled students.\"","\"Reward: 10 million yuan, 100,000 points.\"","\"Reward: 100 pounds of beef, 100 pounds of vegetables, 100 pounds of high-end fruits.\"","\"Space upgraded to 10 square meters, with potential for further upgrades.\"","\"Shen Wei's original storyline has been changed, with an important suggestion to take her parents for a health check-up.\"","Shen Wei had received other rewards before, more or less.","This time, the system was exceptionally generous, with rewards and supplies ten times the usual amount.","The space existed in her consciousness. Indeed, it had expanded greatly.","The rewarded meats, vegetables, and fruits were stored neatly there. All she had to do was exchange them with her consciousness in an open space.","What concerned her most was the change to her original storyline.","She hadn't forgotten that she was still the supporting character in a book.","However, in the original storyline, after \"she\" committed suicide, her parents passed away a few years later, and their life's fortune went to others.","When Shen Wei had originally read the book, she thought her parents had died of grief after losing their only child.","Now, it seemed that there might be more to the story.","She immediately booked the most comprehensive health check-up packages at a private hospital.","She drove back to the kindergarten, picked up her parents, and headed to the hospital.","Her parents had been helping out in the kitchen recently.","Shen's Mother said, \"Your father and I have learned a lot about cooking. We can now be Chef Chen's assistant chefs!\"","They were proud of this.","After tasting Chef Chen's cooking, they realized he was even better than Liu Chef.","To be recognized by such a master-level chef was truly an honor.","Shen Wei said, \"You two must have been exhausted during this time.\"","Mentioning this, Shen's Father beamed with delight, forgetting to even ask where they were going. He excitedly said, \"Not at all! How could that be tiring? Many parents praised our cooking.\"","\"Sometimes I even want them to taste the dishes we make at home. They're even better!\" He had always been boastful, and now he was showing off.","If there was anything good, he couldn't help but flaunt it to others.","In the past, as a nouveau riche, he was mocked when trying to join social circles.","Now, busy working here, he seemed full of energy and spirit.","\"Oh, that's right, today is the first day of school for the children. Where are you taking us?\"","After driving for quite a while, Shen's Father finally remembered to ask this crucial information.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm taking you both for a health check-up.\"","Shen's Father's expression changed instantly, \"What health check-up? We're not sick. Besides, the kindergarten is busy now.\"","As the purchasing manager, he had just ordered 3,000 pounds of rice from an outside supplier two days ago.","They had provided lunchboxes, and in just three days, they had consumed an entire month's worth of rice.","He still had important matters to attend to. Leaving now would be foolish, wouldn't it?","Shen's Father immediately refused to go.","Shen Wei said, \"I've asked Doctor Lu to handle the delivery.\"","After all, he just needed to oversee the unloading process, without exerting much physical effort.","Older people were often unwilling to get health check-ups.","Shen's Father kept muttering, \"No need for a check-up if there's no illness. Getting a check-up will only lead to finding some illness!\"","At their age, it wasn't like when they were young. After using their bodies for so many years, they were bound to have some minor issues.","He had heard of misdiagnoses before, even leading to people being scared to death.","Wasn't that causing trouble with good intentions?","Shen's Father had always been a sensible person, but the mention of going to the hospital made him act like a petulant child, insisting on getting out of the car.","Shen Wei said, \"No, you must listen to me this time!\"","The sentence gifted by the system kept repeating in her mind.","Seeing Shen Wei's expression, Shen's Mother said to Shen's Father, \"Just listen to our daughter. Getting a check-up won't hurt.\"","Upon Shen's Mother's intervention, Shen's Father reluctantly said, \"Alright.\"","After all, she was a filial daughter.","He had no choice but to go along with her.","Soon, they got out of the car.","It was a private hospital.","Upon entering, they were greeted with luxurious services. This comprehensive check-up alone would cost a five-digit sum.","Shen Wei took both of them for the examination.","At this private hospital, there was no need to queue, and all the tests were conducted on the same floor.","Whether it was the examinations or collecting the reports, everything was done quickly.","However, they had to undergo many tests, which took nearly half a day.","After receiving the final reports, Shen Wei took them to the doctor.","The doctor recognized Shen Wei as being from the famous Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The kindergarten had become incredibly popular recently.","Its clips were constantly appearing on recommended feeds. Once you watched one, the system would automatically recommend more.","Seeing Shen Wei in person gave the doctor a sense of the virtual world crossing into reality. He was about to make a joke, but upon seeing the test reports, the smile on his face quickly turned serious.","\"Show me the other reports.\"","The doctor's sudden change from smiling to a grave expression was alarming.","Even Shen's Father trembled, \"What's wrong, doctor?\"","The doctor said, \"Based on the comprehensive test reports, you should first consider the possibility of early-stage liver cancer.\"","Normally, doctors wouldn't be so blunt.","But Shen Wei had booked the most comprehensive package, including all preliminary and auxiliary tests.","Combining all the results, the doctor could clearly identify the issue.","Shen's Father was dumbfounded, \"That can't be. I've been in excellent health and haven't been sick for a year.\" He muttered under his breath, \"I don't know if this private hospital is reliable.\"","The doctor said, \"Although we are a private hospital, all our equipment is state-of-the-art, and our staff are highly paid professionals from major hospitals. You can rest assured!\"","Shen's Father smiled sheepishly, saying nothing more.","Shen's Mother's test results also revealed an issue - a grade three cervical lesion, dangerously close to cancer.","Her values were several times higher than normal.","Shen Wei's heart sank as she asked the doctor, \"Is it treatable?\"","The doctor replied, \"Fortunately, you came in time. Since it's still early, there are many treatment options available, but you will need to be admitted to the hospital.\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: Modify Original Plot","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's parents were dumbfounded.","They never expected both of them to have medical issues.","Shen Wei said, \"Okay, we'll go back and research this.\"","The doctor expressed understanding.","Shen's Father went from initial disbelief to desperate denial, then scheduled an outpatient appointment at a major hospital in the city.","At the major hospital, they realized why Shen Wei chose to pay several times more to go to the private clinic.","At the major hospital, one test would require waiting an entire day.","After getting the test results, they'd have to wait another one or two hours just to speak with a doctor.","But concerning their own and their spouse's health, they were willing to wait, no matter how exhausted.","After completing the tests, just as the private clinic had said, there were no available beds for admission.","Afterwards, they returned to the private clinic.","Shen Wei's parents were admitted and repeatedly told, \"Don't tell anyone else at the kindergarten.\"","Everyone was busy, and they wanted to avoid causing any disruption since they had caught it early.","They planned to consult with the doctor who performed their physicals.","Before knocking on the door, they overheard the doctor saying to someone inside, \"You still need a physical exam, especially at your age. I've previously encountered two patients, and it's fortunate they were tested in time. If it had been a late stage, no amount of money could have helped.\"","Shen's Father asked Shen's Mother, \"Is he talking about us?\"","Shen's Mother replied, \"It seems so.\"","This time, they were admitted to the hospital. Since they were self-sufficient, Shen Wei didn't need to stay and care for them.","They had dedicated nurses, and although the fees were higher, the service was excellent.","Knowing Shen Wei was busy, they sent her away from the hospital.","Here, Shen's Father called his old friends from his circle, urging them all to get physicals.","The others initially reacted like Shen's Father had, dismissively saying, \"Why get a physical? I'm too busy.\"","But once Shen's Father mentioned his condition, they all became interested.","The people in Shen's Father's circle were also aging!","Having some ailments was normal, but cancer was the biggest fear.","If they could catch it early like Shen's Father, that would be great.","The high-end private hospital, which was originally not very busy, suddenly became bustling.","Shen's elderly parents were in a private room.","Some had individual rooms, but Shen's parents found that boring.","Now, it was convenient.","Several of their fishing buddies were also admitted.","\"How are you, Old Chen?\" Shen's Father mocked when he saw his fishing buddy also wearing a hospital gown.","Old Chen said, \"Don't ask. I love fishing, but I've overeaten and my stomach is upset!\"","Shen's Father said, \"There's an empty room next to mine. Why don't you move in, and we can chat when we're free?\"","\"Sure, I'll have my assistant handle the paperwork right away! By the way, I heard your daughter's kindergarten, Starry Sky, is doing amazingly well. What's the story behind that?\"","Shen's Father perked up at the mention of the kindergarten and began lecturing enthusiastically.","Shen's Mother laughed and secretly recorded a video to send to Shen Wei, \"Your father! He's practically become a spokesperson for your kindergarten now. He goes around promoting it every day, but when others want to enroll, he says there's no availability. He's too cheeky.\"","Even Shen's Mother marveled that this kindergarten had surpassed the one they had opened, with her husband constantly bragging about it.","Their only concern was whether there would be any impact on the kindergarten once they were gone.","Shen Wei reassured them, \"Don't worry about the kindergarten. Fortunately, we hired more people in advance, so it can manage temporarily without my parents. As for my father's procurement tasks, those have been temporarily assigned to Doctor Lu.\"","Shen Wei's mother said, \"Okay, we'll stay here and get proper treatment. Don't worry about us.\"","Shen Wei nodded, saying, \"That's great. From now on, we should all get annual comprehensive physicals.\"","Shen Wei's mother, like many elderly people, was reluctant to get physicals, but this time, she was fortunate to have done so, making her reconsider their importance.","Shen Wei's suggestion received no objections.","Soon, Shen's Father posted in the kindergarten group: \"The boss is paying for everyone to get a high-end physical exam.\"","These exams cost five figures, but everyone should find time to get them done. It's at a private hospital that also operates on weekends.","Having experienced the benefits himself, he wanted to provide the same for others. The kindergarten colleagues were excited.","Apart from basic entrance exams with some blood tests and other items, none had undergone comprehensive physicals.","They all praised the boss's generosity.","The boss, flattered by the praise, even distributed several 2000 yuan red envelopes in the group, allowing everyone to claim a few dozen yuan.","Everyone was even happier.","Meanwhile, Giraffe Kindergarten was facing internal and external troubles.","Parents were frequently coming to withdraw and request refunds, teachers weren't receiving their salaries (last month's pay was still outstanding), and there was constant online abuse and attacks.","Those with quick wits had already started looking for new jobs.","More and more people had left.","With no students and teachers gradually leaving, Giraffe Kindergarten was showing signs of decay.","The internet truly had the power to ruin a business.","Not everyone could endure such a major setback and recover like Starry Sky Kindergarten.","When Starry Sky Kindergarten was mentioned, many of Teacher Tang's former colleagues contacted her, \"Could you help me become a teacher at your kindergarten too?\"","They had just enrolled many new children, so they were likely short-staffed.","The few people still in contact with Teacher Tang were diligent.","Those who had formed cliques to ostracize her had already been blocked by Teacher Tang.","Teacher Tang said, \"We don't have any teaching positions available. We've recruited quite a few people.\"","Everyone knew about the recent hiring of very experienced teachers with over 10 years in the industry, many of whom were pillars at other kindergartens.","After considering, Teacher Tang said, \"There are still a few assistant teacher positions open.\"","Her former colleagues fell silent at the mention of assistant teachers.","After all, they had been teachers in the past, even if not for 10 years, they had been in the industry for several years.","Now, after all those years of effort, they were reduced to being assistant teachers.","Only one person asked, \"How much do assistant teachers make per month?\"","Teacher Tang replied, \"15,000 yuan per month!\"","Suddenly, everyone's eyes lit up. \"I'm willing to be an assistant teacher.\"","\"The money doesn't matter, I just want to experience being an assistant teacher.\"","Teacher Tang informed these few people about the situation to Shen Wei, and Shen Wei quickly agreed.","Shen Wei wasn't indifferent about the disgusting incident that happened at Giraffe Kindergarten initially.","Now that she was digging up information on them, she didn't have any burden on her conscience.","Somehow, news about the salary at this place got out.","An assistant teacher at Starry Sky Kindergarten could earn up to 15,000.","Colleagues who went to other kindergartens instantly felt that their salaries were no longer attractive.","For no good reason, others were earning several thousand less.","And the other person was just an assistant teacher.","How much must the regular teachers be earning? They went to the wrong place. If only they had gone to Starry Sky Kindergarten, although the reputation of being an assistant teacher wasn't great, who cared about reputation? Salary was tangible and real.","Previously, those senior teachers came to work as assistant teachers. The little assistant teachers became anxious all of a sudden.","They feared losing their great jobs and being replaced.","These few people were from the same school and worked at the same unit. Renting together could save them some money.","A couple of days ago, the little assistant teachers binged dramas every night. Now they studied until 10:30 every night.","Learning music, dance, child psychology, child nutrition, they crammed all kinds of subjects."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: The Female Lead of the Original Book Seduced the Male Lead of the Original Book","paragraphs":["The mechanical voice of the system sounded: \"Latest news report, Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng are having an affair.\"","Shen Wei has been busy with the kindergarten recently.","She hasn't been paying attention to Shen Qingqing at all.","Upon hearing this, Shen Wei became interested and said, \"Bring it up, let me take a look.\"","She really wanted to know how Shen Qingqing managed to hook up with the person in power at the Lu Group this time, after failing to get hired there.","The system quickly played back the experience of the two meeting and getting to know each other.","After watching, Shen Wei sighed, \"Indeed, the original script is powerful!\"","She thought that with Shen Qingqing's bad reputation and legal troubles, once she lost contact with the Lu Group, everything would be over.","Who could have imagined that Shen Qingqing would go out of her way to corner Lu Zheng?","She made an unconventional self-promotion in the parking lot.","Implying that she was envied and suppressed, and that she had an opportunity to join the company, but now she had nothing.","When she got emotional, she even cried tears of sorrow.","Although Lu Zheng is the person in power at the Lu Group, he is also a grown man, and somehow Shen Qingqing's pitiful state touched his sympathy.","Lu Zheng personally instructed HR to hire her.","Many people knew about Shen Qingqing's previous online incidents.","When they saw her coming to work, many went to HR for an explanation.","But they received a meaningful answer: \"Mr. Lu's order!\"","People's anger turned into mockery.","They couldn't afford to offend her, in case Shen Qingqing became the future Mrs. Boss.","The original three-tenths disgust increased to thirteen-tenths.","The Lu Group office was divided into two camps.","One group ostracized Shen Qingqing, the other flattered her.","Some people even went so far as to move Shen Qingqing's desk next to Lu Zheng's office.","The two already had feelings for each other, and with everyone's help, they grew even closer.","In less than a month, they were already passionately kissing in the office.","As the person in power at the Lu family, Lu Zheng previously treated Shen Qingqing as just an ordinary employee.","But now, Shen Qingqing is his woman.","So Shen Wei, who had issues with Shen Qingqing, became someone Lu Zheng disliked.","The system warned Shen Wei that it detected Lu Zheng was coming to cause trouble.","So it gave her an early notice.","Shen Wei found it speechless watching this.","Shen Qingqing could even hook up with Lu Zheng in this way.","It felt like there was no way to avoid the original script no matter what.","It's a good thing she had the system's help.","Otherwise, she would be disgusted to death by these two going around in circles.","Everything happens for a reason.","Just as Shen Wei sorted out the causes and effects, she received a call from Shen Qingqing.","Previously, Shen Qingqing's anonymous report had caused a lot of trouble for Shen Wei.","She manipulated public opinion but was killed by it herself.","Now she was blaming all the responsibility on Shen Wei.","This quickly led to the breakdown of their families' relationships.","They no longer spoke to each other.","When Shen Qingqing's call came through, Shen Wei answered, \"Hello.\"","Shen Qingqing said, \"About that lawsuit online, please drop the charges. This has already caused me quite a bit of trouble!\"","Her words were full of accusations toward Shen Wei.","Shen Wei laughed, \"What does this have to do with me? If you hadn't caused trouble, this wouldn't have happened. It's all your own doing.\"","Shen Qingqing seemed a bit angry on the other end.","But soon the phone was passed to a man: \"Is this Miss Shen? You really do have a sharp tongue. Shen Qingqing has been saying you bullied her, but I didn't believe it until now. Tell me, how much money do you want to drop the charges?\"","This arrogant tone could only belong to that jerk CEO.","Shen Wei asked, \"Who is this?\"","Lu Zheng said, \"An insignificant person, the CEO of the Lu Group. Shen Qingqing is my girlfriend.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Speak to my lawyer!\"","Lu Zheng snorted coldly, \"Must you be like this?\"","Shen Wei was too lazy to continue talking to him and hung up.","Not everyone could face such overbearing arrogance from a CEO. She just felt unlucky.","Although Shen Wei hung up, the other party clearly would not let it go so easily.","Soon, the security guard came to Shen Wei, saying there was someone looking for her outside.","Shen Wei used the system to check the surveillance footage, and sure enough, the overbearing CEO had pursued her all the way to the kindergarten for love.","Shen Wei immediately went out to meet him.","As soon as the CEO saw Shen Wei, he said, \"Your kindergarten has upset my girlfriend. I want to buy it. Name your price.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Not for sale!\"","Lu Zheng arrogantly said, \"I advise you not to be irrational. There's no need to go to such lengths for a trivial matter. Why don't you just take the money and leave? Tell me, is 5 million enough?\"","Shen Wei was completely speechless. \"How is your 5 million so valuable!\"","She had not calculated how much she had invested in this kindergarten.","But it was definitely not just 5 million.","More importantly, the staff she had assembled were top professionals in the industry. Money alone could not measure their worth.","The CEO was just dating his little wife. Yet he had to pick a fight and make others feel uncomfortable.","The CEO said, \"Oh, not enough?\" His eyes carried a hint of mockery, as if accusing Shen Wei of being greedy.","The CEO didn't want to dwell on it further. \"1 million. Sell me the kindergarten immediately!\"","Shen Qingqing got out of the car and, seeing what Lu Zheng was doing for her, was moved to tears. \"Brother Zheng, you're so good to me!\"","The CEO said, \"Silly girl, who else would I be good to?\"","Shen Qingqing leaned weakly into the CEO's embrace.","The CEO put one arm around his woman's shoulders.","Then, when he turned back to Shen Wei, his expression was cold and emotionless.","Shen Wei said, \"If you want to show off your romance, please do it elsewhere!\"","Shen Qingqing's original intention was to make Shen Wei jealous, to show her that she had someone to protect her, love her, and stand up for her.","But it had the opposite effect.","It almost made Shen Wei vomit up her breakfast.","What did Shen Wei do to deserve seeing such a nauseating scene first thing in the morning?","Lu Zheng was clearly a true CEO. At this moment, he let out a cold snort. \"Women's tricks.\" He seemed to enjoy his woman's little antics.","As if Shen Wei's disgust was just a way to attract his attention.","Shen Wei could no longer bear it. \"If you're sick, go to the hospital quickly. Don't just stand here disgusting people for no reason.\"","The CEO asked, \"Why are you so rude?\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Not only am I rude, but I'll also beat people up!\"","Then she called security guard Li Yi to drive these people away.","Although Li Yi only had one leg, he wielded a large broom ferociously.","Driving away the CEO was as easy as shooing away a chicken.","Shen Wei smiled, the imperious CEO shook with rage: \"Fine, you won't regret it. I'm only going easy on you because you're Shen Qingqing's sister.\"","Shen Wei said: \"Get lost, you're clearly unwell. Coming here to act out an idol drama? Anyone want to be your audience? If you want to act so badly for others, let me help you out. I won't deceive you, I have full coverage high-definition cameras here.\"","Upon hearing this, the CEO's face changed: \"Still want to play with public opinion?\" Just like with Shen Qingqing, he said to Shen Wei: \"Woman, are you threatening me?\"","Shen Wei told the security guard: \"Keep hitting him!\" How did such an idiot get out?","Li Yi struck the CEO's buttocks with a broom.","The CEO instantly acted like a monkey possessed.","Feeling he had lost face, he glared furiously at Shen Wei in uncontrollable rage.","Shen Wei said: \"See you online.\"","The CEO never expected someone to not give him face. Fuming, he took his girlfriend and left in a huff.","Shen Wei told the system to quickly edit the surveillance footage from multiple angles.","Then she posted on the kindergarten's official account: \"The kindergarten is not for sale, I'll say it again, not for sale!\"","Shen Wei's account already had 650,000 followers.","Currently focused on livestreaming.","But she would post a short video daily to drive traffic.","Fans saw the many exclamation marks and wondered what had happened.","After watching the video, everyone burst out laughing.","\"Oh my, how many CEO novels has this guy read to be so steeped in the lines?\"","\"That 'woman's tricks' line was so cringeworthy I dug a three-bedroom apartment with my toes.\"","\"He wanted to buy our lady's kindergarten for $5 million, did he not check that our lady is a rich heiress who doesn't lack money?\"","\"I'm a bit angry, our lady runs a non-profit kindergarten, what's wrong with that? Some shady people always come to cause trouble.\"","\"Am I the only one who finds the CEO's young wife very familiar? Isn't she the one Shen Wei's sister exposed online before?\"","That incident was huge back then, and several old fans suddenly remembered it.","\"Who would have thought it was her?\""]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Facing the Overlord","paragraphs":["It didn't take long for the identities of the two people to be uncovered by the powerful internet.","Lu Zheng went all out for the beautiful woman he loved, and quickly became a laughingstock.","Lu Zheng's identity was also exposed - he was the CEO of the Lu Group.","At his age, he was quite famous in the CEO circle.","What Shen Qingqing had done before was witnessed by many people.","For such a person with poor character to attract the Powerful CEO so much, it seems the Powerful CEO's brain wasn't working properly either.","In no time, the Lu Group's official website was flooded with insults.","It almost drove Lu Zheng crazy.","He thought it was all Shen Wei's plot.","So he sued those who insulted him.","This only made the public's impression of him worse.","More and more insults and sarcastic remarks appeared.","As a large enterprise suffering such an unjustified disaster, its stock price immediately dropped by ten percentage points.","Many shareholders were already dissatisfied.","They insisted that Old Boss Lu replace this young son of his.","\"Since the young master is so willing to stand up for his girlfriend, he might as well stay at home with her and not embarrass us at the company anymore.\"","The stocks that entered the market these days plummeted, suffering losses of over 10 billion yuan.","Old Boss Lu had no choice but to come out despite his illness, and replaced this unworthy son of his with a professional hired CEO.","This finally quelled the outrage.","Obviously, Lu Zheng didn't know what he had done wrong, shouting at his father's sickbed: \"Why are you siding with outsiders too?\"","Looking at his son, Old Boss Lu thought back to when he studied business at the prestigious school abroad.","After returning to the country, Lu Zheng had performed outstandingly in several acquisitions.","How could he not realize this person was stupid?","To do such a thing for a woman.","\"You get out,\" Old Boss Lu didn't even have the strength to argue.","Lu Zheng glared at his father resentfully, then turned and left the sickroom.","As soon as he walked out, he saw his girlfriend Shen Qingqing with red eyes, softly saying, \"I'm sorry, it's my fault you're in this mess.\"","Originally, the Powerful CEO was a bit unhappy with Shen Qingqing too.","But seeing his girlfriend's red eyes, he immediately said, \"It's not your fault. Even without the Lu family, I can start my own business. It's just a kindergarten, right? If you want to open one, I can help you.\"","What Lu Zheng enjoyed the most was defeating others in their areas of expertise.","It gave him an unparalleled sense of satisfaction.","What's so difficult about a kindergarten?","Even without the Lu family, he could still make it work.","Compared to Shen Wei, he was the true Powerful CEO.","He had just as much money as Shen Wei.","Originally, he disdained using such methods against a weak woman.","But Shen Wei's actions had obviously angered him.","Not only did she refuse to listen, but she even dared to retaliate online.","Since that's the case, he couldn't be blamed for using legitimate business tactics to target Shen Wei.","\"What about the rumors online?\" Shen Qingqing asked.","Lu Zheng said, \"No need to worry, I'll have someone leak a piece of news to divert attention, do some charity work, and this will blow over soon!\"","What he had previously disdained, he now had to resort to certain measures to deal with.","Shen Qingqing looked at Lu Zheng with admiration in her eyes, \"Thank goodness I have you.\"","\"As my woman, rest assured, I won't let anyone bully you.\"","The things the two of them said outside the hospital room made the passing nurses shudder.","One of them happened to be a fan of CEO novels, and hearing these familiar phrases, she felt the awkwardness of encountering an acquaintance from the third dimension.","Not only did she quickly walk away, she even wanted to wash her ears.","Later came the Powerful CEO duo's counterattack.","Most people just mocked them, without any deep resentment.","A few laughs and it would be over.","Shen Wei's video was reported and taken down.","Soon, a major piece of news came out.","Boss Lu was planning to open a kindergarten.","Shen Wei opening Starry Sky Kindergarten had attracted attention from all walks of life.","Those young masters and noble ladies from high society all wanted a piece of the action.","Once it's up and running, it would be a valuable family connection.","The vacancies at Shen Wei's Starry Sky Kindergarten had already become an extremely sought-after commodity.","Didn't you see? Shen Wei's father was originally just a nouveau riche, but now those from prominent families were treating him like a brother.","Seeing Shen Wei's success, others also wanted to try their hand at it.","But there was a vast gap between intention and practice.","After all, doing it well is one thing, but doing it poorly would not only waste money but also backfire.","So most people were just watching from the sidelines.","No one dared to really invest in this industry.","Never did they expect that the first to actually do it would be the Powerful CEO and Shen Wei's cousin.","The two of them bought an even larger plot of land.","They started anew, promoting early on that for every student enrolled, they would pay 2,000 yuan.","Meaning they wanted to challenge Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Other kindergartens were stunned - how could these celestial beings fight while the mortals suffer?","What had the kindergarten industry done this year to invite so many rich scions?","They could only hope that the target was Noble Kindergarten, and not a price war.","This promotion was quite effective - many people were already closely following the development.","Every few days, someone would come and ask when it would be completed.","Popular before even opening - everything made Shen Qingqing and the Powerful CEO quite proud.","Shen Wei was just an individual working alone, but Lu Zheng represented capital.","How could an individual compete against capital?","Others had also heard about it, and comforted Shen Wei: \"It's okay, we already have a foundation!\"","It wasn't like the very beginning anymore when any little thing could shake them.","Shen Wei said, \"It's fine, whoever wants to open a kindergarten, it's their business. I want to hold a baby dance gala.\"","Currently, the little kids were learning dance.","Several promising seeds had already been discovered by the dance teachers.","Since those who came here were all nursery teachers, they had taught a lot of baby dance too.","Kids just need to have fun, after all.","Now Shen Wei was entertaining them.","Buying them clothes.","Once this event idea was proposed,","The entire kindergarten agreed.","They announced it through the platform, informing everyone.","The popularity instantly overshadowed the incident with the Powerful CEO and Shen Qingqing.","After all, Shen Wei's side was doing a real event that could be seen.","No matter how great the Powerful CEO's promotion was, they hadn't even built the place yet.","At the earliest, they wouldn't be in business until next year.","Just wait and see."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Baby Dance Party","paragraphs":["The chair of the Fashion Design department received a major order.","She immediately summoned a few winners from the campus fashion design competition and asked them to work overnight to create haute couture garments.","Upon hearing those words, several female students in the Fashion Design department jumped with excitement.","In the domestic fashion industry, reputation and seniority matter greatly.","Newcomers usually need to apprentice under a designer for at least 10 years before having a chance to make a name for themselves.","Moreover, many aspire to study under international designers.","Many plan to study abroad, but the tuition fees for studying overseas are extremely high.","Tasks like pattern-making and material-sourcing require considerable personal expenditure, making it unaffordable for most students to study abroad.","Most who come to study fashion design are chasing dreams.","The four years of university can easily dampen those dreams.","The fastest way to get recognized is by having a celebrity wear one's designs on the red carpet at an award show.","However, the fashion world is filled with skilled veterans.","Even prominent brands may not gain favor from celebrities, let alone students who haven't even entered the workforce.","When notified by the department chair this time, each student was filled with great ambition, feeling that their opportunity had finally arrived.","But the chair said that this haute couture commission was for an unusual client - a kindergarten.","\"Ah!\" someone exclaimed in disappointment.","The chair continued, \"But they are paying well.\"","One of the more composed female students asked the chair to clarify the situation.","The chair explained, \"The kindergarten is hosting a baby dance party. They hope we can create haute couture outfits for each child, preferably with original designs from you students.\"","\"The fabric requirements specify materials that children can safely interact with. Reducing rhinestones, sequins, and the like to prevent children from picking them off and ingesting them. So you need to showcase your skills while minimizing unnecessary embellishments. This is the biggest order we've received this year!\"","\"How much is the investment?\"","\"200,000 yuan.\"","\"How many outfits?\"","\"122 sets. The client has already provided the heights and weights of the children.\"","Some quick-witted students had already started calculating - each outfit would cost around 1,600 yuan.","This was definitely not a low price.","The Fashion Design department chair must have some connections.","They had previously received orders for customized Han Chinese clothing, square dance outfits, and most often, performance costumes.","This time, with a generous budget and good pay, it's no wonder the chair was giving it such emphasis.","Children don't require much fabric, so this was a decent commission.","\"What's the timeframe?\" the composed student asked again.","The others also paid close attention, as this was indeed a critical question.","The chair said, \"One week. You must work to the highest standards for this commission, and absolutely do not cut corners.\"","One week was an extremely tight deadline.","The chair continued, \"Each of you will be responsible for 20 outfits. Start designing now, and submit your design drafts tomorrow. I'll review them immediately, and once approved, I'll show them to the client's parents. As for production, you'll need to form your own teams. Excellence is a must. If any team underperforms, you won't be invited again next time.\"","Everyone voiced their agreement.","They then hurried back to the dorms and began designing on their computers.","Twenty distinct dance party outfits - this was something they had never encountered before.","With such a tight schedule, they barely moved from their spots except for lunch breaks.","By the time they submitted their drafts in the afternoon, they were feeling lightheaded from sitting for so long.","There was no choice - they had been glued to their seats until their legs went numb.","However, when the chair reviewed the submissions, half of them were rejected.","The other students were apprehensive, not expecting such a demanding task and strict standards from the chair under this time crunch.","One of the students whose work was rejected protested, \"What's wrong with these? Aren't they attractive?\" as she picked up her design drafts.","The chair said, \"These designs are simply rehashes of what you've submitted for previous competitions, just old products passed off as new! Some are even plagiarized from foreign brands. You might be able to fool me, but can you fool the client?\"","The chair sounded somewhat exasperated, \"You're not cheating anyone but yourselves.\"","She paused and scanned the room, \"Do you know what kind of institution can afford to spend 200,000 yuan on a children's dance party? What kind of parents would that be?\"","Everyone was taken aback.","The chair continued, \"You're always complaining about lack of opportunities. But when an opportunity arises, you make excuses! If none of you take this seriously, then I'll go to the third-year students instead. They need this opportunity more. I only thought of you since you're about to graduate and could use the practical experience. But now I see my efforts were wasted - you have even pettier ulterior motives than I imagined!\"","The chair sounded angry. After saying this, the other female students felt ashamed and apologized, \"We made a mistake, please don't be angry!\"","\"We're truly grateful for this opportunity.\"","\"We'll definitely work harder on this.\"","The students made their commitments, and only then did the chair reluctantly agree to give them another chance.","From that point on, they truly burned the midnight oil.","The dorms had an 11 PM curfew, so they specifically requested access to a large classroom that was open 24 hours.","Many students started drafting patterns and even beginning the production work in this large classroom.","As students of the Fashion Design department, they had access to various premium fabrics without needing to order materials online.","The next day, many had panda-like dark circles under their eyes from lack of sleep.","But when the chair saw their designs, she was satisfied.","The students she had carefully selected clearly had their own perspectives on fashion design.","Her previous words seemed to have taken effect.","This time, the students showed no lethargy whatsoever.","They approached the haute couture designs with the same dedication as creating gowns for the red carpet, then scaled the designs down proportionately.","Shen Wei reviewed the design drafts and found them satisfactory.","The production funds had also been remitted.","From then on, they worked around the clock in a frenzied pace.","Third-year juniors came to help, envious of the opportunity their busy seniors had received.","With the underclassmen's assistance, progress accelerated significantly.","The third-year students soon realized that their seniors were working to extraordinarily high standards.","Several seniors had even spent their own money to achieve the desired ethereal, multi-layered effect on the fabrics - a quality clearly exceeding the 1,000 yuan price point.","The graduating fourth-year students recalled the department chair's instructions and treated this as an opportunity for real-world training experience.","They approached the task with the same level of commitment as preparing for Paris Fashion Week.","They were truly putting their heart into it.","The head instructor also took notice of this and came over several times.","They truly recruited many students from the freshman, sophomore, and junior years to help them, all serving without pay.","When it was time to turn in the work on this side,","Starry Sky Kindergarten sent people to collect it.","Each car could only transport a few outfits.","It took an entire day of back-and-forth trips to transport over 120 costumes back.","Every single outfit had a child model.","These child models were sponsored by the department.","Such wonderful designs, it would be a pity to crush them.","When they were brought to Starry Sky Kindergarten, the kindergarten teachers loved them as soon as they saw them.","Previously, the children's dance gala had also been organized at other kindergartens.","But they had never seen such grand and gorgeous costumes.","Even the adults felt that these outfits looked so beautiful.","They imagined how delighted the children would be when they saw them."]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: High Fashion Clothing","paragraphs":["The dance party at Starry Sky Kindergarten officially began.","All the little kids arrived early.","The children didn't need to put on makeup.","They just had to tie their hair up lightly.","Every kindergarten teacher was a master at tying hair.","Soon everyone changed into dresses and suits to attend.","The livestream fans were stunned.","Starry Sky Kindergarten spared no expense. The kids looked like little celebrities in these clothes, which were 1:1 scaled-down replicas. Each outfit was stunningly beautiful.","Most of the people watching the livestream were mothers or highly educated women.","These children's outfits perfectly captured everyone's sense of beauty.","Screenshots were taken in abundance.","\"Every outfit is so beautiful, how is this possible?\"","\"A small kindergarten dance party somehow has a dazzling, star-studded feeling.\"","The little babies obviously knew they looked beautiful.","Each one grew proud and confident.","At an age where they were already adorable doing anything, the beautiful clothes made them utterly cute.","Liu Chef's granddaughter NiuNiu, though only three years old, also got to wear a lovely dress.","First everyone danced together, then the boys and girls split up to dance separately.","NiuNiu in her puffy dress was seen cozying up to one boy, then another, saying \"I'm NiuNiu, I really like you, brother.\"","Xiao Bao was NiuNiu's older brother.","Their mother had instructed him to look after his little sister at kindergarten.","But he saw NiuNiu cozying up happily to all the boys. Then NiuNiu went to snuggle He Lingfeng, saying \"I'm NiuNiu, I really like you, brother.\"","Xiao Bao was exasperated: \"I'm your brother!\"","NiuNiu said, \"You're my brother, but he's also a brother!\" Xiao Bao was distraught.","He Lingfeng patted NiuNiu's head, and her eyes immediately sparkled.","Xiao Bao grabbed NiuNiu's hand: \"I'm your brother!!!\"","The livestream fans were cracking up: \"Oh my, NiuNiu is such a little cutie, I remember being like that when I was young.\"","\"She can't take her eyes off the handsome boys, so adorable.\"","\"If NiuNiu keeps finding handsome boys, Xiao Bao is really going to cry.\"","\"Xiao Bao really wants to be NiuNiu's one and only brother.\"","\"Xiao Bao is saying, I'm not coming to this lousy kindergarten anymore, whoever wants to come can come, or else my sister will be taken away.\"","\"Random thought, which team designed these? They look great!\"","\"I've never seen some of these dresses before, can I get them scaled up even though I have no occasion to wear them? I really love them.\"","\"I love the outfit He Lingfeng is wearing!\"","\"Hi friends, I'm the chief assistant, or as you say, the CEO's assistant. The outfit He Lingfeng is wearing is definitely haute couture, I've seen my boss wear that kind of fabric before, all custom-made abroad. It looks so cute on a child.\"","\"I want one too.\"","\"Every time I watch a kindergarten livestream, I can't help but wonder, why am I not a little kid?\"","\"Shen Wei, are you really not going to open some kind of university for the elderly?\"","\"No need for that, ladies.\"","Everyone laughed.","The kindergarten dance party quickly became a hot topic of discussion.","Everyone was talking about the custom-made student outfits.","The kindergarten released news that they had the outfits specially designed by the fashion department.","Soon that fashion department was inundated with countless calls.","Everyone wanted the same outfits the babies were wearing.","Some were even from out of town, asking if they could open an online store because they loved the clothes so much.","Parents from other kindergartens also wanted the same clothes for their kids.","Orders were pouring in nonstop.","The department head later gathered the students involved and said, \"See, I told you, every time is an opportunity!\"","\"Thank you, professor.\"","The department head now had a new idea.","Fashion students have a hard time finding jobs.","Why not start a studio led by her, selecting some outstanding graduates? With all these orders, they'll have money, people, and customers - a triple win. They might actually make it big.","Those kids were quite excited too.","They had only designed outfits for one kindergarten, but it caused such a huge sensation.","Seeing the little babies wearing their designs made them truly happy from the inside out.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's popularity also drew some criticism, with people saying the kindergarten was not doing its job properly.","All they did was play with the kids every day and not teach anything useful.","Some so-called experts weighed in.","Netizens were speechless: \"Dude, do you know what a kindergarten is?\"","\"Yeah, what's a kindergarten's proper job supposed to be?\"","\"Does a kindergarten need to teach calculus or something?\"","\"Should they study physics, chemistry, and biology?\"","\"Does a kindergarten need to research lunar bases?\"","\"This kindergarten apparently doesn't teach dynamics, how low!\"","All sorts of sarcastic comments piled up.","The expert had hoped to ride the wave of popularity, but greatly overestimated their prospects.","Finding themselves unable to withstand the ridicule, they sneakily deleted their comment.","Many aristocrats and elite upper-class people also took notice of Starry Sky Kindergarten's baby dance party.","They found the children's outfits quite appealing, despite their refined fashion sense.","Starry Sky Kindergarten did a great job.","Some kids who used to attend aristocratic kindergartens quit, because they also wanted to wear such beautiful clothes and attend parties like this.","Plus, they had learned all sorts of etiquette before.","They would surely shine at such a dance party.","So two aristocratic kindergartens had noble little lords withdraw.","The principal personally received them, as their family backgrounds were so impressive.","The principal said regretfully, \"Why are you leaving? If there's anything lacking here, just say so and we'll improve it right away.\"","The kindergarten principal smiled kindly and amiably.","The nanny who came to fetch the children said, \"Our young masters said that no matter what they wanted to do, you would oblige them. Including eating lots of candy and skipping classes to play outside.\"","The principal had not yet grasped the gravity of the issue: \"Yes, that's right, we're more humane here!\"","But the nanny said coldly, \"Our young masters said you had ulterior motives, that you just wanted to spoil and ruin them.\"","\"Don't think they're only 5 years old, they've been studying thug life since young.\"","\"Who knew your kindergarten was so wicked.\"","\"Little children should be strictly disciplined.\"","\"The good habits little master developed at home have vanished entirely in just a few months here,\" the kindergarten principal's face turned pale.","She could not imagine that fulfilling every wish of the children to give them a happy childhood would be criticized so harshly.","The nanny was utterly disheartened, and as she left, she remarked, \"I should have chosen Starry Sky Kindergarten instead.\"","That comment was a direct hit to the heart of the aristocratic kindergarten principal.","After the nanny left, those words still lingered in the principal's mind: \"Damn it.\"","She truly felt like spitting blood."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Rescuing the New Villain","paragraphs":["Shen Wei received the latest notification from the system.","\"Save the anti-hero Mu Zhixing.\"","It was followed by a brief introduction.","Mu Zhixing was a girl who suffered from her parents' divorce at a young age and was abused by her wicked stepfather. With her genius painting ability, she gained worldwide fame.","But on the very night of her success, she committed suicide.","This extreme act unveiled the scars from her childhood.","Art lovers around the world mourned the loss of the genius.","Radicals took revenge on her biological parents and stepfather who had mistreated her, but the painting prodigy would never return.","After reading her introduction, Shen Wei said, \"She was just a painter. How could she be considered an anti-hero?\"","The information provided by the system never mentioned that she had harmed anyone.","The system replied, \"It's because she was a friend of He Lingfeng. All her painting earnings were used to sponsor the destructive computer genius He Lingfeng.\"","Shen Wei pondered, \"I see. So how is Mu Zhixing doing now? She hasn't been bullied, has she?\"","The system answered, \"Not yet, but she has less than half a month before the incident.\"","Shen Wei's heart skipped a beat.","With time running out and the task being critical, she had to bring Mu Zhixing back quickly.","For all the anti-heroes, the system provided clues to identify the specific individuals and their locations.","Otherwise, finding someone would be like searching for a needle in a haystack.","But this time was too rushed. She had to act immediately and prevent the future painting genius from being bullied by her wicked stepfather.","...","At this moment, Mu Zhixing was in the living room.","Her mother and younger sister had just gone shopping and bought a lot of things.","Although only 5 years old, the younger sister had a boastful mentality.","She kept showing off the new things her mother had bought for her to Mu Zhixing.","\"Sister, look at this new dress mother bought me.\"","\"This is the new strawberry hair clip mother bought me.\"","\"Mother said I look like a little princess wearing this. Did you see these shoes? These are crystal shoes that only princesses have.\"","\"But mother didn't buy anything for you.\"","As the younger sister flaunted her new possessions, the mother added fuel to the fire, \"Of course I would buy things for you because you're a smart and adorable baby, unlike your sister who looks unpleasant.\"","Saying this, she glared at Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing, only 6 years old, stood there helplessly.","Seeing her meek demeanor infuriated the mother, who grabbed her and pinched her arm hard. \"Raising you is like raising an enemy.\"","The pain on Mu Zhixing's arm made her want to cry.","But when the mother saw her about to cry, she grew even angrier and pinched her inner thigh hard.","She didn't stop until Mu Zhixing burst into tears.","The younger sister clapped and cheered, \"Mother is so powerful!\"","Mu Zhixing's mother divorced her biological father.","She then moved in with her stepfather and gave birth to a younger daughter. Mu Zhixing always felt like an outsider.","When the younger sister was little, it was fine, but as she grew older and understood flaunting and jealousy, she would constantly emphasize to Mu Zhixing that their mother didn't love her.","Whenever Mu Zhixing showed the slightest discontent, the younger sister would run to their mother and tattle.","No matter what, Mu Zhixing would be the one punished and beaten in the end.","The last time someone said Mu Zhixing looked better than her younger sister, the latter cried for a long time.","In the end, the mother beat Mu Zhixing until she was covered in bruises, and only then did the younger sister stop crying.","Since then, the mother and daughter's oppression of Mu Zhixing had become more frequent.","What happened today, with just a few pinches on her inner thighs, was considered lenient treatment.","Although Mu Zhixing felt sad and felt that her mother didn't love her and preferred her younger sister, girls are naturally drawn to their mothers.","Moreover, she had an important matter to tell her mother.","At this moment, the younger sister was playing dolls with her kindergarten friends in her room.","The mother was baking the younger sister's favorite pizza in the kitchen.","Mu Zhixing followed her silently, wanting to speak but not daring to open her mouth.","Soon, the mother pushed her aside, \"Why are you here? Get out of the way!\"","Mu Zhixing, used to being suppressed by her mother, had a slightly timid nature. She paused for a moment and said softly to her mother, \"I have something to tell you.\"","\"Father keeps hugging me and touching me!\" Her voice trembled as she spoke.","The \"father\" she referred to was clearly her stepfather living with them.","She was 6 years old and attended kindergarten.","Although not as prestigious as her younger sister's kindergarten.","But the kindergarten teacher had said that no matter if it's a boy or a girl, the areas covered by their small vest and shorts should not be touched by others.","Girls mature earlier than boys, and Mu Zhixing vaguely knew this was something quite shameful.","She didn't dare make a scene and secretly went to find her mother.","However, upon hearing this, her mother mocked her instead.","\"You little brat, you're just a few years old and already making up stories like that. What do you know? Why say such disgusting things?\"","\"How shameless can you be, thinking of that at such a young age! You have no sense of decency!\"","\"Your father was just doting on you. Your younger sister doesn't even get that kind of treatment, yet you're not only ungrateful but also saying these vile things.\"","Tears filled Mu Zhixing's eyes.","Her expression of wanting to cry but not daring to looked truly pitiful.","Mu Zhixing inherited the best traits from her parents.","Although her biological parents were just average people, she seemed to have hit the genetic lottery.","With her big eyes and pointed chin on a small face, even in old clothes, she appeared to be a beautiful budding flower.","In the past, even talent scouts for child models had approached her.","But Mu Zhixing was too timid. When modeling clothes, she couldn't open up, so she was rejected.","Having lost the opportunity to be a money-making tree, her mother treated her even worse.","At that moment, a neighbor knocked on the door, \"I'm cooking right now but realized I'm out of ginger. Do you have some? Can I borrow a couple pieces?\"","Being neighbors, the mother said, \"Sure, here you go.\"","Probably out of courtesy, instead of leaving right away after getting the ginger, the neighborly neighbor wanted to chat for a bit.","This neighbor lady was a kindhearted person.","Knowing that Mu Zhixing's mother favored her younger daughter, she had mentioned this issue before in conversation, after all, they were like sisters from the same mother.","Children don't hold grudges, so there's no need to be so extreme. But Mu Zhixing's mother remained stubborn.","Seeing Mu Zhixing crying pitifully, the neighbor felt sympathetic and said, \"Why is this child crying?\"","She silently lamented, \"Poor thing!\"","Such a beautiful little girl, living with her own mother is worse than living with a stepmother.","Mu Zhixing's mother seemed able to see through the thoughts of the neighbor auntie, and snorted, \"Auntie, you don't even know what this child just said, quickly say again what you said earlier.\"","Although Mu Zhixing didn't know about the sordid affairs of adults, she still vaguely felt embarrassed and could only cry, not daring to speak again.","Her mother immediately said, \"Look, look, she said I favor her little sister, she acts like someone has terribly wronged her!\"","The auntie forced a laugh, \"After all, it's one's own child, just comfort her, children's thoughts are delicate.\"","There was nothing more to say staying here, so the neighbor made an excuse about having a dish simmering and turned to leave.","After she left, Mu Zhixing's mother said to her, \"I was saving face for you earlier by not saying anything, otherwise you would never be able to hold your head up again, slandering your father, trying to steal your mother's man, have you no shame?\"","Mu Zhixing cried sorrowfully, and finally returned to her \"secret corner\" on the balcony to find her paintbrushes and paint.","She couldn't write yet.","Painting was like keeping a diary for her, her best friend.","But today, when she opened her paintbrushes, all the watercolor brushes had been soaked in water, unable to apply any color at all. The sketchbook had also been torn into a mess.","Only her little sister would do such a thing.","Mu Zhixing was usually forgiving, but this sketchbook and these brushes were her spiritual sustenance. With them ruined like this, she immediately went to confront her sister.","\"Why did you ruin my sketchbook like this?\"","Her sister was used to bullying her older sibling on a daily basis.","She said, \"So what if I did it? In the future I'll tell Mom not to buy you any more paintbrushes, you'll never be able to paint again!\"","These words struck Mu Zhixing to the core. She didn't know where the strength came from, but she pushed her sister with force.","Her sister was first incredulous.","Then she wailed in anger, \"You actually dared to push me!\" and burst into tears.","Mu Zhixing stood rooted in place, a sense of dread slowly drowning her heart.","Having made her little sister cry, she knew her mother would never let her off the hook."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: The Mother Competing with Her Daughter in Femininity","paragraphs":["Mu Zhixing stood stiffly there, like a child who had done something wrong, coaxing her younger sister: \"Don't cry.\"","Hearing her sister's sobs, their mother rushed in from the kitchen. Upon seeing the sisters, she slapped the elder one without saying a word.","Mu Zhixing cried from the slap. She was only a year older than her sister.","At that moment, she was just a 6-year-old baby.","Little did she know that her mother would embrace the younger sister, gently comforting her. Turning to Mu Zhixing, she said, \"The sight of you disgusts me.\"","...","At this point, Shen Wei found Mu Zhixing's biological father. She said, \"Can you take the child back?\"","Her biological father was unwilling.","After all, he had remarried and had a new pair of children. His ex-wife's daughter naturally didn't matter to him.","Moreover, over the years, he had not paid any child support.","Previously, the court ruled that he had to pay 500 yuan per month.","With interest, it would amount to over 50,000 yuan.","He had been in hiding all these years and didn't want to give the other party a chance to fleece him.","Shen Wei felt a chill in her heart.","She knew this child wouldn't have an easy time. She didn't expect it to manifest in front of her, and it made her feel pity.","The parents had divorced, and both parties disliked their former child.","But at the moment, the child's biological father had to step up to claim custody.","Shen Wei said, \"You don't need to raise her. I'll help you raise her. The main thing is that the child is too pitiful.\"","The other party couldn't refuse Shen Wei. He thought about taking the child back, which would also annoy his ex-wife.","Their divorce had been a messy affair, treating their once intimate partner like an enemy.","Now, this matter could trouble her, so he was naturally willing.","Shen Wei didn't expect that what moved Mu Zhixing's biological father was not the child's plight, but rather the chance to annoy her biological mother. She didn't know what to say about him.","Regardless, agreeing was a good thing.","The two of them went to Mu Zhixing's biological mother's home and knocked on the door. They heard an impatient voice from inside: \"Who is it?\"","The door opened, and Mu Zhixing's biological mother's delicate eyebrows immediately furrowed: \"It's you, why are you here?\"","\"I've come to see my daughter.\"","\"Oh, so you remember you have a daughter now? All these years, you haven't come to see her or paid any child support, and now you acknowledge her as your daughter? Sure, you can see her, but give me money first.\"","\"Money, money, money, all you know is money, woman. As her father, it's only natural for me to see my daughter. If you dare stop me, I'll tell your neighbors that you're not letting me see my daughter!\"","\"I won't let you see her today, what can you do about it?\"","The two quickly started arguing.","Shen Wei suppressed her anger and said, \"Hello, I'm the lawyer hired by Mu Zhixing's father. We can discuss any issues with me.\"","The biological mother was taken aback. To the child's biological father, she said, \"Have you gone mad? Why hire a lawyer for such a trivial matter?\"","\"Why? So I can see if you've been abusing my daughter!\" With that, he barged in.","\"You can't just barge in!\" The woman tried to stop him, but how could a woman's strength stop a man?","Shen Wei took the opportunity to enter as well. As soon as she stepped inside, she saw Mu Zhixing curled up, crying pitifully.","She looked abnormally thin and frail.","In stark contrast to other children her age.","Even if Mu Zhixing's biological father had no emotional connection with the child, seeing this would enrage him.","He wasn't angry that his child was being bullied, but rather felt that he had been slapped in the face: \"You're a mother too, is this how you take care of a child?\"","Hearing this blatant accusation, the child's biological mother exploded.","\"I've done a good job taking care of her, have you contributed a single cent all these years? I'm a woman raising a child all by myself. You haven't contributed anything, and now you're running over here to criticize me? Shameless!\"","The child's father said, \"If that's how it is, then give me custody of the child!\"","\"On what grounds? When the child was difficult to raise, I took care of her. Now that she's obedient and sensible, able to earn her keep, you want her back? How convenient for you, eh? I won't give you the child.\"","Shen Wei watched clearly from the side. These two weren't fighting over the child, but rather their own grievances.","Shen Wei went over to check on Mu Zhixing. The child was trembling all over.","While her parents argued on the side.","Shen Wei whispered to the little one, \"Hello, I'm Shen Wei. What's your name?\"","\"Mu Zhixing,\" the child said softly.","Shen Wei said, \"Today, I've come to take you away from here. Auntie has a kindergarten at home with lots of little brothers and sisters for you to play with. There are also pretty little dresses.\"","Mu Zhixing said, \"But mom won't let me leave.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Don't worry, big sister will find a way.\"","Mu Zhixing secretly glanced at Shen Wei, then stealthily extended a little finger.","Shen Wei understood and said, \"Then let's pinky swear!\"","The little girl hesitated for a moment, then hooked her finger. She was too young to know how to deal with this complex family situation.","Her biological mother's favoritism, her stepfather's peculiarity – it all made her want to escape this place.","Children are the best at sensing kindness. Although she had just met Shen Wei, she really liked this beautiful big sister.","Shen Wei had only exchanged a few words with Mu Zhixing.","But suddenly, Mu Zhixing's biological mother noticed and flew into a rage: \"You get out of here right now! This is my home. If you keep this up, I'll call the police for trespassing.\"","\"You don't want to raise the child, so why won't you let me raise her? You're being unreasonable,\" the biological father continued arguing.","Neighbors from the left and right opened their doors to see what was happening.","Mu Zhixing's biological mother felt that there was no point in continuing like this and said, \"If you don't leave, I'll call my husband right now.\"","Mu Zhixing's biological father was also a coward. Hearing this, he said, \"Hmph, I'll come back another time.\" With that half-hearted remark, he turned and left without saying a word to his daughter.","After the biological father left, the sliver of hope in Mu Zhixing's eyes was once again extinguished.","Her biological mother sat on the side, a bit angry. Then, she pulled Mu Zhixing up and asked, \"What did that woman say to you earlier?\"","Mu Zhixing shook her head: \"Nothing!\"","Her biological mother grabbed a broom and started beating the child.","The child cried in pain.","But her biological mother still seemed unsatisfied and beat her particularly viciously this time.","By the time Mu Zhixing's stepfather returned home, the child had cried until she was hiccuping.","The stepfather immediately dissuaded the birth mother, saying, \"What's the matter? Getting so worked up!\" He then picked up Mu Zhixing by his side. Mu Zhixing dodged, clearly refusing his embrace.","The birth mother had not paid attention to such details before, but now that she saw it, she let out a cold snort, \"Little slut, she deserves a beating.\"","The stepfather said, \"Don't say that. The child is still young, and if there's anything she doesn't understand, we should teach her properly.\"","The birth mother snorted coldly from the side, \"You think she's young, but she knows a lot. Originally, it's not easy being a stepfather. If you're good to the child, the child might even suspect you of harboring ill intentions.\"","The stepfather was taken aback, then looked at the child with a hint of darkness in his expression. But he concealed it quickly.","The birth mother embellished what Mu Zhixing had previously accused the stepfather of, adding oil to the fire, and ended with, \"A child that young, to think of such things, she must be a natural-born slut.\"","The stepfather smiled and said, \"After all, she's just a child. It's normal for her not to understand. Today, I feel like eating braised fish.\"","The birth mother said from the side, \"Picking such a troublesome dish, if you want to eat fish, I'll have to go buy it!\"","The stepfather smiled gently, \"Good wife, go and buy me one, I want to eat some fish to nourish myself.\"","This stepfather had a mild and well-mannered appearance, completely different from the loud quarreling with the ex-husband earlier.","It was evident that the child's mother preferred Mu Zhixing's stepfather, \"Alright, I'll go buy it for you now.\"","After she left.","The stepfather grabbed Mu Zhixing and went back to the room.","He threw the child onto the bed.","There was some annoyance in the stepfather's eyes, \"Didn't I warn you before not to say those things out loud? Do you think your mother will side with you?\""]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Rescue Mission","paragraphs":["Mu Zhixing burst into tears.","The stepfather said, \"Let's continue playing the marriage game!\"","\"I won't play.\"","\"You naughty girl!\"","The stepfather was still in the process of \"desensitizing\" the child, but he hadn't taken the most despicable step yet.","But the child could distinguish between good and bad intentions in her eyes.","She cried even more miserably.","Her pretty little face had turned completely red from crying!","The neighbors next door started knocking on the door.","The stepfather had to restrain himself, and then glared at Mu Zhixing, \"You got off easy this time.\"","Mu Zhixing was terrified, hoping that someone would descend from the sky and rescue her, taking her anywhere.","She recalled what her beautiful sister had said, that she had many children to play with and beautiful little dresses.","At that moment, she ran out of her stepfather's room and hid in a corner of the balcony.","Not knowing when she could leave, crystal tears slid down her eyes.","The next day, as soon as Mu Zhixing's mother stepped out, she discovered a banner hung at the community gate. She was going to join the crowd but realized it was about her family when she got closer.","Mu Zhixing's biological father was holding up the banner and telling the neighbors that the child's mother treated her poorly and wouldn't let him see her!","A group of gossipy elderly people surrounded him.","The mother immediately became furious, rushed over, tore down the banner, and threw it on the ground raving, \"What are you trying to do?\"","\"If you don't give me custody of the child, I'll keep causing a scene. I'm a poor man, and I'm not afraid of someone like you who has money.\"","\"Why do you need custody of the child? What do you want to do with her?\"","The child's father completely avoided answering that question and said, \"Since you only love the child you had later, then give this child back to me!\"","The two quarreled to the point of no reconciliation.","During a fit of rage, it's easy to speak without thinking, especially since the two had divorced bitterly.","They accused each other of infidelity before and during their marriage.","The surrounding people were excited and upon closer listening, realized that neither of them was a good person; they had both erred during their marriage.","Relatively speaking, the woman was better. She had taken the child when they separated.","The man had said he didn't want the child at the time, fearing it would hinder his ability to find a new partner.","\"Now he wants her again, what good does he think will come of it?\"","\"If you don't give her to me, I'll keep talking, don't think I don't know about your past misdeeds.\"","The child's mother was about to explode with anger, \"How blind was I to have chosen you in the first place?\"","Such an idiot.","Even if he left, she still had to live here.","Moreover, the child's stepfather was well-known in this area, and his family was already dissatisfied that he had married a divorced woman with a child.","Now encountering this disturbance from her ex-husband, how miserable was her fate?","While they were at odds over the child's custody, neither of them was doing it for the child's sake.","At that moment, the child's father had a clever idea, \"Give me 500,000 yuan and I'll leave immediately.\"","\"Why don't you go rob someone for 500,000 yuan?\"","While the child's mother was engaged in this war of words, the stepfather returned and saw a crowd gathered.","He immediately started fighting with the child's biological father.","Shen Wei was nearby, and with her system capable of releasing electric shocks, she naturally wouldn't let Mu Zhixing's biological father be wronged.","With the increased crowd, they were soon separated, both with bruised faces.","The child's stepfather spoke up, \"We won't give up custody.\" He hadn't achieved his vile intentions yet, so how could he let his prey escape?","Mu Zhixing's biological father had old and new grudges against him.","At that moment, he mocked, \"You say you won't give me my child? What does it have to do with you? I'll sue you, and while I'm at it, I'll expose all your past deeds. Don't we have the internet now? Why don't we calculate the months between your affair and your child's birth date; I guarantee there will be a surprise!\"","After saying this, he still wasn't satisfied, \"Oh, I heard you have a respectable job? Otherwise, I'll hang this banner outside your company building, how about that?\"","The child's biological father was just a scoundrel. He had seduced the child's mother in the past.","Love is easily worn down by the mundane matters of life, let alone when both people are dishonorable.","The cracks grew wider over time.","After the child was born, they each went their separate ways.","Originally, they were just playing their own games, not interfering with each other.","But speaking it out loud was enough to shatter one's values.","Now, in a fit of rage, he seemed intent on mutual destruction.","Even the child's stepfather was intimidated by his behavior, his heaving chest showing how enraged he was.","Seeing the growing crowd, the child's mother made a quick decision, \"If you want me to give you the child, then you have to pay me every penny of the child support the court ordered, 50,000 yuan.\"","The child's stepfather disagreed.","But the child's mother said, \"He can talk big, but let's see if he'll actually put his money where his mouth is. The first one to object will be him!\"","Sure enough, when she said that, the child's biological father's face fell.","But the child's biological father was no pushover either, saying, \"I hear your husband works at a good company and has a respectable job. If I tell everyone that you're abusing my daughter like this, I wonder what they'll think of him.\"","\"You dare!\" She took pride in her husband's work. Just the thought of this scoundrel made her tremble.","\"Alright, so you want the child? I'll give her to you. But if you ever try to send her back, I'll scratch your face.\"","The child's mother decisively signed away her custody rights.","She then went back home, picked up the frail Mu Zhixing, and tossed her into their arms like trash. Fortunately, Shen Wei was quick and caught the child.","As they left, the crowd of spectators dispersed.","Back at home, the child's stepfather was furious, \"Why did you give them the child?\" He was like an enraged lion. \"Your ex-husband is a scoundrel, can he raise the child properly?\"","The child's mother said, \"I know he can't raise her well, but continuing this won't do us any good. He's worthless; I've given her up! If he gets tired of her later, it'll be hard for him to send her back!\"","The mother sensed the stepfather's reluctance to let the child go and said, \"You have your own daughter, why are you still hung up on that little burden?\" She was a little jealous.","The child's stepfather would usually comfort her, but at that moment, his mood was terrible.","He turned and went upstairs, and after returning to his room, he furiously smashed a glass!","...","Meanwhile, Shen Wei took the child out for a McDonald's kids' meal.","The child's birth father, who wasn't eating, said to Shen Wei, \"Why did you go through so much trouble to bring the child here?\"","Shen Wei said, \"I have a connection with this child, and the child wasn't living well at home.\"","The child's birth father gave a flattering smile, \"Oh, I see, a great philanthropist.\"","While Mu Zhixing was eating, there were red marks on her arms from being hit with a broom.","Although the child's birth father didn't care about his own daughter, seeing her beaten made him somewhat angry, \"That woman really isn't a good thing. Even if raising her carelessly, she shouldn't have let the child become like this, look how thin the child is.\"","The child's birth father said, \"I'll give you the child, and I'll feel at ease, but this child is also pitiful!\"","After saying that, the child's birth father tapped the table with his hand, making quite a few small gestures.","\"The abandonment of adoption agreement you had me sign earlier, I can sign it, but I can't stand that woman always plotting little schemes.\" He had an undignified separation from his ex-wife. Now that he could make her suffer and someone else would raise his daughter, he was delighted."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Bringing Back","paragraphs":["Shen Wei had never seen such a father who would go so far just to argue.","Even when he saw the injury on the child's body, he was only angry for a moment.","But it was convenient for her.","So both sets of parents signed an agreement to relinquish custody. Shen Wei took these two documents, first took the child to the hospital for a medical examination, then went to a welfare institution for an assessment, and also called in the most renowned lawyer to help her fight this case.","It took less than a month for her to obtain custody of Mu Zhixing.","The child's father was also big-hearted; he took the money and left, without even thinking to go back with Shen Wei to see where she would take the child.","At the very least, he should have known where Shen Wei would take the child.","Mu Zhixing was nervously playing with the hem of her clothes.","Soon they arrived at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shen Wei introduced her to Uncle Li, the gatekeeper.","Uncle Li is usually not very talkative or smiley, but he is very patient and gentle with children. Many children like to cling to him and learn his magical martial arts skills with the staff.","They kept calling him \"Master, Master\".","Uncle Li earned some money and got himself a glowing metal prosthetic leg.","This had an irresistible attraction for the children.","So cool.","And so, after spending a long time here, Uncle Li's temperament gradually became more gentle.","But towards outsiders, he remained merciless.","Shen Wei brought Mu Zhixing back.","In some classes, the children were reciting in clear, melodious voices, chanting the Thousand Character Classic.","Shen Wei took Mu Zhixing from room to room, greeting everyone.","Mu Zhixing was a little timid and fearful. But she could feel that the people here had no malice towards her.","They would also softly introduce her, saying her name was Mu Zhixing.","And that due to her family circumstances, she would be staying here.","Currently, the only other residents were Doctor Lu, Uncle Li, and He Lingfeng.","And now a little girl had been added.","Fortunately, the kindergarten had a large area, so there was no shortage of rooms.","Mu Zhixing had her own independent little room.","Shen Wei had someone prepare it for her. It was in a pink color that girls love.","It had a desk, a schoolbag, children's cosmetics, and all kinds of little dolls.","The most special arrangement was that she was given many new notebooks and painting brushes.","Mu Zhixing stared at everything, enraptured - it was the room of her dreams.","Shen Wei asked, \"Do you like it? From now on, you'll live here, and consider this your home!\"","Mu Zhixing nodded.","Shen Wei called over He Lingfeng. In the novel, the two of them were good friends.","Now that they had met so early, they would definitely greet each other.","Mu Zhixing was a year older than He Lingfeng, but she looked even more timid.","When He Lingfeng first came, he was about the same as her now. But under the nurturing love here, he had grown in body and courage, and become smarter.","At this moment, he looked at Shen Wei.","Shen Wei told him, \"Her name is Mu Zhixing, she's your elder sister. You're a boy, so you have to look after her from now on.\"","He Lingfeng nodded and said hello, also taking the initiative to say that she could come to him anytime in the future.","Though just a child, he had quite a sense of manliness.","The two of them soon went to have their meal.","Mu Zhixing followed He Lingfeng to eat.","Children find it easier to accept other children.","Especially after her previous experience at home, she always had some wariness and nervousness towards adults.","There were many delicious foods at the kindergarten. Everyone praised them endlessly.","Just like the young master of the Liu Family, who came with an air of dignity and grace, but had now almost become a little chubby.","He was very good at snatching extra dishes. And he had even taught himself how to act cute with Chef Liu so he could get an extra serving of his favorite dishes.","When Chef Liu saw how thin Mu Zhixing was, he felt pity and gave her several extra servings.","After all, she was a little girl, and she ate very properly and neatly. After finishing, she even thanked Chef Liu.","It made Chef Liu's heart melt.","The smile on his face even made his apprentice Chef Chen feel awkward.","Chef Liu said, \"Little girls are still the best! Better than boys.\" So adorable.","All the teachers had heard about Mu Zhixing's experiences, so they unconsciously paid extra attention to this poor little girl.","On her first day, they didn't arrange for her to join a class. Instead, Shen Wei took her around to get familiar with the surroundings.","In the mornings, there were the main academic classes. In the afternoons, it was mainly leisure, games, and special talent classes.","Shen Wei deliberately took her to see Teacher Qi Zhong.","Qi Zhong only had one art class per day.","The rest of the time, he was working on his creations in his own studio.","A single painting often took him several months or more to complete.","When Qi Zhong painted, he would first plan it out thoroughly in his mind before putting brush to canvas.","When Shen Wei brought Mu Zhixing to see him, the little girl stared in amazement as the lines on the canvas gradually formed a beautiful picture.","Afterwards, Shen Wei told Teacher Qi Zhong, \"Please keep an eye on this child for me, I have something to attend to!\"","In fact, it was a deliberate attempt to create some space for the two of them.","Mu Zhixing was certified by the system as a genius, so she would definitely be very talented at painting. He Lingfeng had already proven this!","In her entire life, Shen Wei had never met anyone as incredible as He Lingfeng.","A genius was like someone who was born with all that knowledge already in their brain.","Even without a teacher's instruction, they just knew it.","And when a teacher did teach them, they would make leaps of progress in a single day.","Since Mu Zhixing's talents lay in painting, it was good to let her start interacting with advanced teachers like this at an early age. Even if she couldn't start practicing yet, simply being immersed in that artistic environment would elevate her aesthetic sensibilities.","With Qi Zhong as her mentor, her artistic foundations would be extremely high.","Qi Zhong received a lot of preferential treatment here.","So when Shen Wei, his employer, made a request, he naturally agreed without hesitation.","He even found the child a small sketchpad and let her draw and play with it.","The child held the brush preciously.","At this moment, Qi Zhong was in a prolific period of creation.","He soon became immersed in his work again, losing track of time as he often did.","When he finally twisted his stiff neck and glanced at his watch, three hours had passed.","Suddenly remembering the child, he turned his head and was startled to find the little girl staring unblinkingly at the canvas.","\"You didn't leave?\" he asked in surprise.","\"Mm-hmm,\" the child obediently replied.","He had been painting for hours on end.","Not just children, even professional artists might not be able to sit there silently for so long without making any noise.","This child's obedience was almost heartbreaking.","Teacher Qi Zhong asked, \"Do you like painting?\"","\"Mm-hmm,\" the child nodded vigorously.","Qi Zhong was fond of children who enjoyed painting. \"So what did you draw just now?\"","Teacher Qi Zhong looked over and saw that it was still a blank sheet of paper.","Kids, it doesn't matter if they scribble. The important thing is to start doing it! He said, \"How about this, you help me add to the painting.\"","He meant for the child to draw on his artwork.","Such a thing had never happened before in kindergarten, and likely never would again.","He had been working on his painting draft for over a month now.","A work of this level could easily sell for tens of thousands in the past.","And artists are usually exceptionally protective of their drafts, not allowing anyone to touch them.","But at this moment, for some reason, Teacher Qi Zhong actually let Mu Zhixing draw on it.","But the little one was timid and immediately shook his head no.","Teacher Qi Zhong didn't force him, saying, \"Alright, if you want to paint in the future, come to me!\"","He was quite satisfied with this art studio.","Not only did it have all kinds of art materials and tools, but it was also very quiet.","Having a quiet place in a kindergarten was actually quite rare.","So he was grateful for what Shen Wei had done for him.","Mu Zhixing's eyes shone with an unbelievable light: \"Really? I really can?\"","It was just one sentence, but it made the child jump for joy.","It was the first time Teacher Qi Zhong saw Mu Zhixing show this emotion.","Through this child, he vaguely saw his former self, feeling happy just from painting.","He said, \"Of course you can.\"","The little one was very happy, his whole face smiling.","After a while, a rumbling sound could be heard coming from the baby's stomach.","Children get hungry faster, so the kindergarten would organize some afternoon snacks.","Mu Zhixing's face turned red, and Teacher Qi Zhong took his hand: \"Let's go to the cafeteria to get you something to eat.\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Stirring up Controversy Online","paragraphs":["Qi Zhong took Mu Zhixing out for lunch. The cafeteria was full of little children in the afternoon.","The five-year-old computer genius He Lingfeng was also there. He still remembered Shen Wei asking him to take care of Mu Zhixing.","He sat beside Mu Zhixing and kindly introduced, \"This is delicious!\"","Mu Zhixing was a bit surprised and responded with an \"oh.\"","Seeing that she did not touch her food, He Lingfeng immediately picked up a piece for her, saying, \"Try it.\"","Mu Zhixing took a bite and said it was delicious.","He Lingfeng couldn't help but smile.","The food at the cafeteria was indeed very delicious, with every dish crisp and savory.","Even the few young teaching assistants no longer ordered takeout after coming here, as no takeout could satisfy their taste now.","Mu Zhixing was also full. After finishing her meal, she carried her plate to the back kitchen, saying she wanted to wash the dishes.","However, Liu Chef chased her out.","Mu Zhixing used to stand on a stool to wash dishes at home, so she was familiar with this task.","But in the kindergarten, there were many workers, and they really didn't need the little children to wash dishes. What if they dropped and broke them or cut their hands?","Liu Chef refused, but Mu Zhixing insisted.","In the end, Liu Chef had to give her a small basin to wash dishes in.","The other children watched Mu Zhixing washing dishes.","After finishing his meal, He Lingfeng also took his bowls and chopsticks to wash them.","Where one goes, others follow. Many children started washing their dishes as well.","That night, many parents posted in the group chat: \"Oh, thank you, teachers! My child has learned well in the kindergarten and now knows how to wash dishes at home!\"","Parents really didn't expect their children to do any chores.","In this era, most children are only children, so if they can do some chores, in the eyes of their parents, they are extremely sensible.","Teacher Tang said she didn't teach them that.","The next day, when she came to the back kitchen and inquired, she learned that it was Mu Zhixing who started this trend.","Indeed, children have the strongest learning ability.","Thinking about how sensible and sensitive Mu Zhixing is, Teacher Tang couldn't help but want to take more care of her.","Shen Wei was still considering which class to place Mu Zhixing in. According to the rules, she should be enrolled in Class 6.","The students in Class 6 were all newcomers, so they could form a new group dynamic.","But Teacher Tang said, \"Let her be in our class!\" She also wanted to take better care of this poor child.","Additionally, He Lingfeng had also expressed his desire for them to be in the same class.","So Shen Wei asked Mu Zhixing if she wanted to join Class 1, and she nodded.","Thus, the little girl was assigned to Class 1.","Class 1 was the star class.","The children in this class were already familiar to everyone from their previous live streams.","The sudden addition of a new child naturally drew a lot of attention.","Many people wanted to join Class 1, but few were accepted.","The child was led away by Teacher Tang.","The teaching assistant Tang Xiaowan came to find Shen Wei, \"Let me tell you something!\"","The children's rooms needed to be cleaned.","Shen's Mother used to help with the cleaning, but after she was hospitalized, this task fell on Tang Xiiaowan.","She made a surprising discovery.","The bed was neat and tidy, with neatly arranged dolls on it. However, the small mat under the table was a bit messy.","In other words, Mu Zhixing had not slept on the bed the previous night.","Shen Wei immediately went to find Mu Zhixing, \"Baby, didn't you sleep on the bed last night?\"","The little girl seemed nervous, \"I... I thought the bed was too pretty, so I didn't dare...\"","Shen Wei felt a pang of pain in her heart, \"From now on, sleep on the bed, okay? Children's bones are still growing, and sleeping all curled up is not good for bone development.\"","The little girl then agreed.","Shen Wei discussed with Teacher Tang that Mu Zhixing would participate in the morning activities, and in the afternoon, if there were no special events, she would learn painting with Qi Zhong.","Although Teacher Tang didn't understand, she still agreed.","Qi Zhong also liked this little girl very much and readily agreed.","Mu Zhixing was timid and fearful. It was her first time at the kindergarten. She was cute and had a soft and gentle nature. Even if bullied, she would not refuse others.","Fortunately, He Lingfeng protected her, and Teacher Tang also took special care of her, so she relaxed a bit.","Her nature became even softer.","She was like a tender and delicate snow fairy.","She was truly adorable.","Mu Zhixing made the fans in the live stream squeal in adoration: \"Such a cute baby.\"","\"She's really so obedient, she's my daughter.\"","\"The person above, last time you saw Nuonuo, you said the same thing. You've moved on so quickly?\"","\"Nuonuo is my little daughter, and this is my big daughter.\"","Mu Zhixing was good-looking and had a gentle nature. She would not refuse others, which was fortunate because the children at the Starry Sky Kindergarten were well-educated by Teacher Tang and none were particularly mischievous. In fact, they all wanted to get close to the beautiful Mu Zhixing.","But Mu Zhixing didn't like being too intimate with others, so she politely refused them.","...","The Starry Sky Kindergarten was very popular among mothers.","Some people in the neighborhood recognized her.","Previously, the incident of Mu Zhixing's biological parents fighting for custody of her caused quite a stir.","A busybody, after watching the live stream, went to knock on her mother's door, \"Look, this is your child.\"","In recent days, Mu Zhixing's biological mother had not been feeling comfortable at home.","She didn't understand why her husband was so angry after sending the child away.","Mu Zhixing was not even his biological daughter, and raising a child was costly.","But still, it felt strange without this little outlet for venting at home.","Even her own biological daughter's tantrums made her want to get angry.","Seeing her elder daughter happily playing with everyone on her phone, she suddenly felt angry, \"What are you looking at?\"","The neighbor beside her said, \"I can't believe your ex-husband cares so much. This is the Starry Sky Kindergarten, and a spot is worth tens of thousands!\"","The neighbor went on incessantly, \"My daughter wanted to enroll our child there for an interview before, but she wasn't selected. We were upset for many days. The tuition isn't high, and the head chef from Jiangbei Grand Restaurant cooks for the children. They eat better than we do three times a day!\"","The neighbor's daughter had thoroughly researched the kindergarten and kept going on about its advantages.","Mu Zhixing's biological mother grew suspicious, \"It's that good?\"","That couldn't be possible.","She knew what kind of person her ex-husband was.","He would never enroll their child in such a good kindergarten. There must be some trick involved.","After the neighbor left, Mu Zhixing's biological mother searched for information about this kindergarten.","As a result, the heated comments that were raised, buying kindergarten seats at high prices, gave me a jolt. The comments below said the highest price paid was already 80,000 for a seat.","I also heard comments saying how good this kindergarten is.","Sending Mu Zhixing there would be a complete waste.","Afterward, a thought crossed my mind, and I immediately went to the kindergarten to find Mu Zhixing.","The gatekeeper said, \"Who are you?\"","\"I'm her mother.\"","The gatekeeper had already heard about Mu Zhixing's family situation.","He then informed Teacher Tang about it.","Teacher Tang thought for a moment and said, \"Then let her in to talk to little Xing for a bit.\"","This child has a slight tendency toward autism.","It's said that it was caused by the family's influence. Currently, the education expert Weng Lan is most concerned about this child.","Since the consequences have already occurred, it's better to let the child meet her mother and untie the knot in her heart, which could also alleviate the baby's mental issues.","This way, she was brought to a small conference room.","Teacher Tang held Mu Zhixing's hand and said, \"If your mother says anything, just shout for the teacher!\"","\"Mm!\" The baby nodded.","Teacher Tang patted the child's head. How could a parent bear to mistreat such an adorable little one?","In the conference room, there were only the child's birth mother and Mu Zhixing.","Looking at Mu Zhixing's brand-name clothes, her birth mother felt some disdain. Such nice clothes, but are they really for her to wear?","The birth mother said, \"You should quit school right now and give up your seat for your sister.\"","Letting her attend such a good kindergarten is a complete waste.","The kindergarten her own daughter attends is not as good as this one, yet it's even more expensive. I don't know what stroke of luck this wretched girl had.","Mu Zhixing said, \"But I like it here!\"","\"You like it a lot, do you? Who do you think you are?\"","Mu Zhixing said, \"I won't change!\" Then, with a slap, her birth mother hit her in the mouth.","This was a common occurrence at home, so she didn't think much of it.","However, when the child cried here, Teacher Tang immediately rushed over, accompanied by Shen Wei.","The two of them immediately shielded the child. \"What are you doing? This is a kindergarten!\"","Shen Wei said, \"The injuries on the child have already been verified at the hospital. If you didn't want to come, that's fine, but to hit and scold her in front of the kindergarten. Do you think this is some kind of place?\"","\"I'm the child's birth mother!\" she said angrily.","Shen Wei said, \"No matter who you are, you should understand child abuse. In the future, the kindergarten will strictly prohibit the transfer of admission seats.\"","Mu Zhixing's birth mother said, \"Who are you? You think you can just say no transfer and there won't be any transfer?\"","Shen Wei said one sentence: \"I'm the principal of this kindergarten.\"","Mu Zhixing's birth mother was dumbfounded."]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Devil Exposed in the Sunlight","paragraphs":["There were many cameras in the kindergarten. They were all high-definition, no-blind-spot cameras provided by the system.","A video clip was posted online by someone. And a previous video clip had also been edited and posted online, causing a huge uproar instantly.","\"I've seen partiality, but never this much partiality.\"","\"If you hate this child so much, why did you give birth to them in the first place? Is that fair to the child?\"","\"Seeing this made me cry. I was also a child who was never favored when young.\"","\"They can heal themselves when they grow up, but a child really has no way to cope with this.\"","\"She really needs a lifetime to heal from this. Why would a birth mother be so cruel?\"","\"The poster above, you said she's the birth mother - I thought she was a stepmother.\"","Others commented all sorts of things.","All were cursing the cruel birth mother.","The child's birth mother could also see the video, and left a comment below saying she would sue them for invading her privacy.","But she was swarmed by the furious netizens and her account was deactivated.","Still unsatisfied, she secretly registered many small accounts. Whenever anyone praised how cute Mu Zhixing was, someone would make sarcastic remarks: \"Hmph, she's been a little slut since young, she'll only get worse as she grows up.\"","\"What a little bitch.\"","The kindergarten live streams were meant for people to watch the children and find healing. There were also streams from the kindergarten cafeteria.","Everyone was quite harmonious, until suddenly someone showed such malice towards the little children, instantly angering everyone.","\"We just love watching, if you don't like it then get lost.\"","\"How can you say such things about little kids who are only a few years old? I can't even imagine how miserable your own life must have been.\"","\"Can't people like this just go die?\"","Others found that the abusive accounts were newly registered, and their IP addresses matched the birth mother's previous account.","Even those who dug up the information could hardly believe it.","\"Shattered my worldview - the abusive comments were actually made by the child's birth mother.\"","\"Oh my god, this goes beyond the limits of what I can imagine. I really want to buy a train ticket and go settle things with this old hag in person.\"","The online commotion was heating up.","People in the residential community soon found out.","Someone spoke up: \"This child's mother and father have a poor relationship. They previously made a huge fuss over custody of the child. Apparently the child has always been bullied while with the birth mother.\"","\"The birth mother takes out her dissatisfaction with the child's father on the child instead. The stepfather treats the child better.\"","\"Oh my god, the birth mother is worse than the stepfather - this is just unacceptable.\"","\"It's a good thing there's this stepfather.\"","\"Yes, the stepfather is very good. Presentable and polite on a daily basis.\"","Soon the public anger towards the birth mother shifted to praising this stepfather instead.","Shen Wei was also closely monitoring the development of this incident.","Once she realized it had taken this turn, she knew there must be the stepfather's hand in this.","Trampling on his wife to elevate himself, this was truly a \"good man of the new era\"!","He was originally good at putting on a front, and now this incident had further gilded his image.","If Shen Wei hadn't intervened, he would have committed an atrocity against the child half a month later.","Although it was just an attempt and didn't succeed, the fact that he had such intentions means he could harm other little friends as well.","After all, in many child-related incidents, the perpetrator was someone close by.","This kind of scum could not be allowed to take on the guise of a good man. The public must know his true face.","So Shen Wei bought a hacking code suite from the system store. After extracting the information, it would automatically erase any traces. She also bought some untraceable small accounts, using a total of 1000 points.","All relevant information would be fed back to her.","What she saw was truly shocking - this scumbag even had a forum full of people like him who were deviants.","Shen Wei immediately compiled this information and anonymously sent it to major online influencers.","The online influencers first reported it to the police. To avoid spooking the culprit, they waited for the police to track down the website and server before exposing the matter.","Public opinion was in an uproar.","Children are tender flowers that need to be carefully nurtured.","Yet there were degenerates stretching their demonic hands towards these flowers of the nation.","His computer contained a large quantity of videos, pictures, and even chats where the implication was that in half a month's time, the deed would be done - the implication was clear.","Everyone was deeply shaken, for if such an incident really occurred, the consequences would be unimaginable.","The situation escalated too quickly - the child's stepfather hadn't realized what was happening yet.","Suddenly, his colleagues started looking at him strangely.","Some who were close to him sent him a link. When he clicked it, he went numb. It was all his private \"videos\" and chat logs.","Such things spread extremely quickly. Within five minutes, it had been forwarded over 20,000 times.","The stepfather didn't even request leave - a sense of panic overcame him. He hurried home.","But the police were already waiting at home. His computer had already been cracked by the technicians.","Soon after, he was taken to the police station.","His hands were even cuffed.","His daughter cried out, his wife said \"He's been wronged!\"","But it was no use.","After they took him away, a neighbor aunty came knocking, saying: \"It's a good thing Mu Zhixing left. Otherwise, how dreadful that would have been. You should divorce him quickly.\"","This kind of person, his outward demeanor was so upright, but inside he harbored unspeakable thoughts.","\"He's not that kind of person, those were just jokes!\" Mu Zhixing's birth mother said.","The aunty frowned: \"Who that's a good person would look at those things? They've crossed the moral bottom line.\"","\"This is a family matter, you don't need to butt in!\" She then pushed the aunty away.","The community group chats exploded, nobody wanted to live with such a person anymore.","They forced them to move away.","Some even threatened that if they didn't move, they would use all sorts of means to drive them out.","There were families with children in the community. What if this deviant set his sights on them? The thought was suffocating.","The more people pressured Mu Zhixing's birth mother, the stronger her emotions became: \"Since nothing happened to Mu Zhixing, you're all just nosy busybodies.\" She stood by him through this critical time. She gave herself goosebumps.","Especially in the live stream chat rooms that got wind of this drama.","Whenever they saw Mu Zhixing, their hearts were filled with pity: \"Thank you so much for Shen Wei bringing her to Starry Sky Kindergarten!\"","Everyone knew how high quality the teaching was at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Teacher Tang was so caring.","The child had never enjoyed a good life before, but coming here was like adding sweetness to her life.","Everyone wanted to donate money and support Mu Zhixing. Some even wanted to sponsor her.","But Shen Wei said there was no need.","However, public opinion was strong: \"Please, let us donate! We just want to do something for her, otherwise it's too heartbreaking for this child.\"","\"Let her know that she is loved, and the aunties online adore her.\"","Seeing these comments, Shen Wei said, \"Then you can send her some art supplies.\"","As soon as she said that, within a week, the kindergarten received over a thousand packages containing watercolor pens, crayons, markers, and all sorts of art supplies.","All the online fuss did not affect Mu Zhixing at all.","What Mu Zhixing enjoyed the most was watching Teacher Qi Zhong paint.","After observing for a while, she tried to draw with a pen herself.","When Teacher Qi Zhong finished painting, he noticed that this time Mu Zhixing was watching him paint.","He didn't disturb her, and quietly moved behind the little child.","When he saw the painting, he was stunned. Mu Zhixing had painted a very blue underwater world, with shells, pearls, and fish-shaped musical instruments.","The different shades of blue, deep and light, were intoxicating.","The colors were harmonious and unified, like a fairy tale kingdom.","He really liked this painting, with a child's boundless imagination and the beautiful clash of colors.","In the end, he took Mu Zhixing's painting.","After framing it, he sent it to his friend's art exhibition, and this painting was named \"Star.\"","The colors of this painting were truly harmonious.","The main color was a highly saturated Klein blue.","It was so beautiful that anyone entering the exhibition would be attracted by the bold use of color.","Although it wasn't painted by a famous artist and was just on loan for the exhibition,","it was the painting that held people's attention the longest, and some even tried to copy it on the spot.","Everyone in the art circle was asking about this work.","Others even wanted to borrow it for their exhibitions.","Soon, Qi Zhong's former teacher, who was a respected artist in the circle, contacted him: \"That 'Star' painting, was it sent by you?\"","He was the one who had supported Qi Zhong when he had run into trouble before.","But the impact was too bad, and the art world could not accept him anymore.","Although Qi Zhong had withdrawn from the circle in recent years, the teacher-student bond between them had continued.","Seeing his former protégé fall so low, the old artist's heart was pained.","Now, looking at this childlike painting again, he truly felt moved.","The greater the master, the more they tend to return to simplicity in their later years, just like Picasso. The paintings he made as a teenager were simply genius, but the more abstract his later works became.","The use of color in this \"Star\" painting was just comfortable.","Everyone had their own interpretation, which is the hallmark of an outstanding work of art.","Qi Zhong said, \"This was painted by a child, only six years old.\"","\"Ah?\" The old artist was also shocked. There were many artistic prodigies, but for a six-year-old child to create something like this was truly astonishing.","There was one thing that had been bothering Qi Zhong, keeping him up at night recently.","\"How do you nurture a prodigy?\" he asked his mentor.","The old artist said, \"Weren't you a prodigy yourself? Just let her follow the path you walked before! This child has a sense of aesthetics, and her future achievements will surely surpass yours and mine.\"","Qi Zhong fell silent.","Currently, there were two ways to nurture a prodigy. One was to start from the basics, but this could easily dampen the child's interest and stifle the boundless imagination in her ideas.","But this foundation was necessary; without it, one couldn't go far in the future.","The other way was to let her freely express herself, which was more likely to bring quick fame.","But fame gained quickly would also dissipate quickly.","In the end, what mattered was depth.","He was truly torn. Mu Zhixing was like an uncut jade.","Every stroke he made would impact the overall result, and he dared not take the risk.","So he specifically sought his mentor's advice.","The teacher said, \"She still needs to start from the basics.\"","\"But...\"","For her future development, the child must learn, and learn it extremely well.","Regardless of Da Vinci or Picasso, they all had exceptionally solid foundations.","\"To unleash boundless imagination, one needs sufficient basic skills to support that imagination.\" So: \"Go ahead and do it,\" the old artist said.","\"...\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: System Rewards","paragraphs":["\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully adopting Villain Number 2. The System rewards 1 million cash.\"","\"10,000 points, reward of 10 pounds of beef, 100 eggs, 10 pounds of fruit.\"","\"Mu Zhixing has successfully unlocked the painting talent, rewarding Shen Wei with 10,000 points.\"","\"Reward of 100 rare fruit seed blind boxes.\"","\"Mu Zhixing's painting exhibited for the first time, rewarding Shen Wei with 10,000 points.\"","\"Reward of 10 pounds of beef, 10 dozen eggs, 10 pounds of fruit...\"","The mechanical voice kept flashing in her mind. Shen Wei was dazed by the string of rewards.","Previously, she had been busy dealing with things, and the System forgot to reward her. Now that the dust had settled, the System rewards kept flashing.","With Mu Zhixing's paintings debuting and being recognized by artists, there were more rewards.","As a result, Shen Wei successfully cashed in more than 100,000 points from the painting prodigy.","Points were even more useful than money.","Shen Wei mastered the use of the points mall.","It was after Qi Zhong unlocked the mineral pigments that she discovered this.","It turned out the points mall could be used this way.","So every time, she would check the welfare discount area of the points mall.","Whenever fruits, vegetables, rice, flour, and oil were on sale, she would buy, buy, buy!","Products from the System were guaranteed to be of premium quality, with all the ingredients carefully selected by the System.","Some were stored in Shen Wei's 10-square-meter space.","The rest were taken out and stored in the storeroom of the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The fruits, vegetables, and meat provided by the System were of high quality, making the meals even more delicious.","Even the picky Chef Chen praised the fresh ingredients from here.","Chefs like them loved fresh ingredients the most.","Every time they cooked, the ingredients gave them so much inspiration.","They effortlessly turned the big pot of food into small-scale delicacies.","The young teaching assistants who ate the food didn't even want to diet anymore.","Not having another bite was a huge loss.","Foods like beef and shrimp didn't make them gain weight, so they ate without worries.","In the morning, Mu Zhixing attended classes with everyone else. She performed very well, and many teachers and classmates liked her.","In art class, she painted more beautifully than the others.","The teacher also praised her.","Mu Zhixing's face was always flushed red. As a child who had never been praised, she shyly retreated like a little snail when faced with kindness.","But she was always delighted to be praised.","In the class, only the outstanding students received a little red flower, or a little treasure could be rewarded for a great deed.","The little red flowers at the Starry Sky Kindergarten were incredibly powerful.","Collecting 30 of them allowed for a redemption.","The items redeemed were luxurious toys that couldn't be bought normally.","The toys looked almost real.","Especially the medical series, with X-rays, stethoscopes, and blood pressure monitors that were one-to-one replicas. Even Doctor Lu was amazed.","Whenever the children played a large-scale house game, the live stream audience would grow.","Many people were introduced to these toys through a popular book-sharing app and then came here for sightseeing and check-ins.","\"I'm here to gain some knowledge.\"","\"Children's toys can be made this realistic? Incredible!\"","Many people coveted these items.","Normally, they could only be played with at school. But if they were rewarded, they could take them home.","These high-end toys could sell for thousands of dollars online. Crucially, they were difficult to buy, with many imported from abroad. Direct shipping would take at least 30 days.","Apart from the Young Master of the Liu Family and Shao Dongdong, the children attending the Starry Sky Kindergarten were from ordinary families.","Their parents were willing to spend money on their children, but not nearly ten thousand dollars for a set of toys.","Therefore, these little red flowers were not only symbols of honor but also toy fragments.","They were extremely precious to every child.","Previously, a little child had their little red flower washed away by their mother after putting it in their pocket.","The little one cried for two days, heartbroken.","In the end, Shen Wei had to exchange the washed-up little red flower for a new one. Only then did the child stop crying.","Someone in the group explained the significance of the little red flowers to the children. All the parents became anxious.","Some even exaggerated, equating the kindergarten's little red flowers with property deeds and household registration documents. This showed how much they valued them.","Only one little red flower would be given out each day.","With so many students now, the competition was fierce, especially in the star class.","This time, Mu Zhixing received a little red flower for her painting and immediately gave it to Shen Wei.","Shen Wei hadn't expected this and said, \"Why are you giving it to me? This is yours. Keep it in your little box, and when you have enough, you can redeem them.\"","Mu Zhixing's face turned red as she said, \"I like Sister Shen Wei, and I want to give this to you.\"","She had been here for a while.","Even the families in the live stream felt that Mu Zhixing had changed a lot from her initial nervousness and timidity, evolving into a sunny child.","Shedding her previous suffering, she had transformed.","Mu Zhixing rarely spoke before, as she wasn't good at expressing herself.","But her intention touched Shen Wei's heart deeply.","Although young, Mu Zhixing's previous family life was complex, making her mature early.","She knew Shen Wei had saved her.","She didn't have anything valuable to give, so she gave Shen Wei the most precious thing for a child - the little red flower, which was hard to earn.","After Shen Wei refused twice and saw that Mu Zhixing was about to cry, she finally accepted it.","Once accepted, Mu Zhixing became happy and clung to Shen Wei.","Shen Wei hugged the painting prodigy, who snuggled up to her softly and sweetly.","The little girl was adorable.","After a while, she reluctantly said, \"I need to go paint!\" In the afternoon, she had to learn sketching from Qi Zhong.","At Qi Zhong's level, he usually taught advanced classes and rarely taught beginners.","But this time, he saw Mu Zhixing's talent.","So he personally started teaching her from drawing cylinders, spheres, and cubes.","He transformed from a kind teacher to a strict one.","Mu Zhixing was a little afraid of him.","So before each class, no matter how much she wanted to cuddle with Shen Wei, she would quietly say she had class in the afternoon. Although she loved being close to Shen Wei, the class made the child feel conflicted.","Shen Wei kissed her, and the little one let out a giggle before running off.","Shen Wei returned to the teachers' office and received a little red flower. Everyone gathered around and asked, \"Who gave it to you?\" Shen Wei said, \"Mu Zhixing gave it to me.\"","All the teachers and assistants gasped when they saw it.","They knew better than anyone the importance of these small red flowers to the children.","It was equivalent to offering a house in the adult world.","Teacher Tang had previously received three. Other teachers were full of enthusiasm, as they truly exchanged sincerity for sincerity, which the children were most able to sense.","Even those veteran preschool teachers felt that Starry Sky Kindergarten was great.","Whether it was the office atmosphere, the level of ease with the children, or the parents, it truly deserved to be called a divine job.","She did not aspire to possess the small red flowers herself. But seeing the children's pure love for their teachers, as a fellow teacher, she felt honored too."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Young Master Liu's Birthday Banquet","paragraphs":["The birthday of the young master of the Liu Family, Liu Chen, was approaching quickly.","When the butler came to fetch him, he took Liu Chen's hand and led him to Teacher Tang's office, saying there was something to discuss.","\"What's the matter?\" asked Teacher Tang.","Liu Chen was well-mannered and articulate in class, but at that moment he became shy and coyly told the butler, \"You tell her!\" as he acted coquettishly.","The butler looked at the young master in surprise, then said, \"It's like this, our young master is about to have his birthday! He wants to invite his classmates from Starry Sky Kindergarten to attend his birthday celebration.\"","The Liu Family was very powerful locally. Liu Chen was the only son of the third young master of the Liu Family.","For every child's birthday, they would book the largest hotel and hold a grand celebration lasting an entire day.","Liu Chen's birthday conveniently fell on a Saturday when his classmates had no school.","Teacher Tang said, \"Alright, I'll post it in our group chat and let everyone respond!\"","After posting, the parents of the classmates all eagerly responded, saying they would definitely attend.","\"Ah, that's wonderful!\"","\"Don't worry about our little money-guzzler.\"","\"Our child is delighted to attend kindergarten but cries when there's a holiday, wishing to go to school every day.\"","After settling the matter, Teacher Tang specifically informed Shen Wei.","Shen Wei said, \"Sure, I'm free that day, I'll bring the children along!\"","Since there would be so many children to look after.","Liu Chen was the young master of high society.","But his classmates all came from ordinary families, so when the Liu Family invited the children, they didn't intend to include the parents.","Because the Liu Family would take this opportunity to host a banquet and invite many social elites, they were afraid some parents might inadvertently disturb the distinguished guests.","Shen Wei's status was suitable.","With no parents attending, Teacher Tang thought, \"Then I'll go too!\"","Shen Wei was alone, so she might not be able to handle over twenty children by herself.","When the parents heard that Teacher Tang and Shen Wei would both be going, they felt very reassured.","On that day, when Liu Chen learned that everyone would attend, he jumped and skipped with joy.","Even the butler was amazed to see the young master so genuinely happy.","Previously, elite families emphasized elite education.","Children were taught from a young age to conceal their emotions, including mastering disciplines like calligraphy.","Exposing children to such things too early could extinguish their natural dispositions.","Among the elite, one would only see well-behaved, restrained children.","But after coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, the young master had become lively and cheerful.","After school each day, he would loudly recount all kinds of stories from his day during meals.","His parents had a business marriage without strong feelings, but now that the young master had become lively and cheerful, the parents' relationship had also improved.","The third young master of the Liu Family canceled a business banquet, and his wife skipped beauty treatments.","Instead, they took time out that day to accompany their son.","Unknowingly, the family's bond strengthened.","Liu Chen's happiness improved the overall atmosphere of the Liu Family compared to before.","Moreover, it was said that the third young master had dismissed all his mistresses.","He seemed reformed, even pleading with the lady of the house for a second child. Initially, Liu Chen's mother had intended to go their separate ways, perhaps even divorcing. Who could have imagined this reversal, with the third young master now pursuing his wife?","It made Liu Chen's mother's friends curious about what kind of wife-taming tactics she had used, as they wanted to try them too.","Indeed, children are the bond between parents.","For his birthday, Liu Chen's only request was to invite his classmates to attend his birthday celebration.","In the past, this would have clearly violated elite protocol.","But the couple agreed unanimously.","They even specifically consulted the grandfather of the Liu Family's grand residence.","Finally, everything was settled, and Liu Chen was overjoyed.","Early on Saturday morning, various luxury cars were parked outside the Auspicious Cloud Grand Hotel.","Everyone knew it was the birthday celebration for the young master of the Liu Family.","All children of similar ages from elite families were invited.","Local aristocratic families also attended, using this opportunity to strengthen connections and promote cooperation.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten obtained an invitation from elsewhere and made careful preparations, hoping to recruit a few elite children to enroll at their kindergarten!","At that moment, Liu Chen wore a green bowtie and a little suit, looking very dashing for a child of his age. He would greet everyone warmly and confidently.","His grandfather was extremely delighted.","Everyone complimented him: \"This young master is impressive, able to receive guests at such a young age. The Liu Family has a worthy successor!\"","\"The child's parents are truly exquisite beauties, and the child is outstanding too.\"","\"Indeed, if our child could be half as excellent, I would be content!\"","Everyone offered auspicious wishes, congratulating the young master.","The other elite children, dressed in high-end brand clothing, came to give him gifts.","These elite children, despite being only a few years old, had been carefully trained in etiquette. The grander the occasion, the more poised and elegant they appeared.","Even the principal of Noble Kindergarten was amazed.","Befitting the elite, they had strong foundations. If only she could recruit one or two, or even better, three families, it would be marvelous.","The renowned Noble Kindergarten was a minor figure that had to bow and scrape in high society.","Admissions had always been difficult, and with the addition of Starry Sky Kindergarten, it became even harder. They had opened a campus equestrian center this year and spent millions on advertising, incurring huge expenses. If they couldn't recruit more elite students, this year's board meeting would be challenging.","Noble Kindergarten made a great effort, hoping to enroll more students.","These elite children usually opted for private elite education at home, but children still needed playmates. In the past, she had persuaded many with this reasoning.","At that moment, the banquet hall opened, and a group of lively children arrived, drawing everyone's attention.","Each child carried toys like Transformers or Ultraman that boys particularly loved as gifts.","The children enthusiastically wished Liu Chen a happy birthday and sang the birthday song for him.","Unlike the poised elite children, these twenty-plus children immediately livened up the atmosphere.","It was evident that the elite children from the Liu Family were especially delighted to see these children.","Liu Chen pulled his friends' hands, eager to show them the new slide his grandfather had bought for him to play on.","[Liu Chen] was bouncing and jumping around, not like the well-groomed heir of a prestigious family. He had reverted to the demeanor of a typical five-year-old child.","The principal of the Noble Kindergarten turned her head and saw the newcomers. Her expression immediately darkened.","How dare they come here?","It was none other than Teacher Tang and Shen Wei from Starry Sky Kindergarten. She became wary."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Playing House","paragraphs":["Mu Zhixing gave Liu Chen a painting.","The painting depicted a blue planet, painted in oil colors with a beautiful, unique texture.","The bold and vivid colors delighted Liu Chen, who exclaimed, \"Thank you, I really love this one. I must hang it in our living room.\"","Of all the gifts he received, he loved this painting the most.","The Liu family had many antique paintings, and Liu Chen had been exposed to them since childhood. He had even taken art appreciation classes before, and was inexplicably drawn to Mu Zhixing's painting.","Moreover, every one of Mu Zhixing's paintings was acquired by Qi Zhong.","This was the first painting by Mu Zhixing that had escaped to the outside world, and Liu Chen was overjoyed.","Mu Zhixing blushed and said, \"I'm glad you like it!\"","She was a bit shy and retreated into Shen Wei's embrace after speaking.","The more people around, the shyer she became, only feeling a sense of security beside Shen Wei.","The young master of the Liu family exclaimed, \"I like it very, very, very, very much!\"","The Liu family explained that the group of children were from his kindergarten.","Shen Wei went over and spoke briefly with the Liu Family's Patriarch and Liu Chen's parents, then said, \"I'll take the kids to play over there.\"","After all, the family was hosting a banquet with various business dealings, and it wouldn't be appropriate for the children to disrupt.","The Liu Family's Patriarch held Shen Wei's hand and said, \"So you're the Shen Family's Girl. The kindergarten you run is truly remarkable. We can rest assured with the children under your care!\"","Liu Chen's parents also expressed their gratitude repeatedly.","This left some of the wealthy families in attendance astonished that the Liu family held the director of a kindergarten in such high regard.","Others dared not underestimate her either and instead sought to find out more about this Shen Wei's background.","The children present were all from the same class and had been with Shen Wei the longest, so they were well-behaved.","With a gesture from Shen Wei and Teacher Tang, the children came over to play.","This way, they wouldn't disturb the adults' socializing.","They played a game of house.","With Shen Wei and Teacher Tang supervising, they assigned various roles. This time, Liu Chen was the birthday boy, so he received special treatment and played the prince!","Kids love playing house, but it's no fun with too few people.","Teacher Tang had led them in this game a few times before.","Everyone was well-versed in the game, and each child embraced their role wholeheartedly.","There were beggars, a king, other princes, princesses, maids, and so on.","They played happily without making too much noise.","Other children were inevitably drawn in by the commotion.","These kids had never played such an elaborate game before.","Refined over generations, the quaint yet engaging storylines held great appeal for them.","They looked on eagerly, until one child, the Mining Industry's Golden Daughter, asked, \"Can I be the princess?\"","Liu Chen retorted, \"You can only be a maid!\"","\"Why's that?\" she protested.","Liu Chen held Mu Zhixing's hand and said, \"She's the little princess.\"","Expecting the Mining Industry's Golden Daughter to take offense at being denied, they were surprised when she simply said, \"Okay, I'll be a maid this time, but I have to be the princess next time!\"","With her participation, others wanted to join in as well, at least to have a role.","Shen Wei and Teacher Tang gladly assigned them characters.","At past birthday parties, the biggest headache had always been keeping the kids entertained.","Children had boundless energy, and if they ran around, it would be improper and awkward.","But today, many had finished discussing business and realized the children were remarkably quiet.","Looking closer, they saw the children playing house.","And a number of tycoons had gathered around them.","These tycoons usually disliked socializing.","Even if others tried to engage them in small talk, they might not respond, only inviting ridicule. Given their status here, if they appeared disinterested in being disturbed, no one would dare approach.","Yet now, instead of watching the business dealings unfold, these tycoons were utterly absorbed in the children's game of house.","Someone curiously asked a tycoon, \"What are you watching?\"","The tycoon shushed them, saying, \"They're already on the third act! Now the prince is hosting a grand banquet for the princess!\"","To recount such details, the tycoon must have been watching for quite some time.","While some considered flattering the tycoon, they couldn't fathom what was so fascinating about children playing house.","But after watching for a while, they realized it was truly entertaining.","The children understood the rules well.","Aristocratic daughters who were usually poised and graceful were now convincingly portraying villains, bringing their wicked characters to life.","Their acting skills would be top-notch even in the entertainment industry.","The others were equally genuine and immersive.","One child remained motionless while the others acted out the grand drama, with its various factions battling each other.","Someone nearby couldn't help but ask a tycoon, \"Why isn't that kid moving?\"","The tycoon replied, \"He's playing a tree.\"","The person had been observing the role assignments closely and could recount each character with ease.","This made everyone around burst into laughter.","Children were just so adorable and utterly healing.","They hadn't had enough when the kids took an intermission to eat little cakes!","As the children scattered, the boy playing the tree remained rooted in place. A tycoon approached, pinched his cheek, and ruffled his hair, asking, \"Why don't you go eat cake?\"","But the dedicated young actor scolded the tycoon, \"Don't touch my leaves!\"","The tycoon looked perplexed.","Those nearby understood and explained with a laugh, \"His hair represents the leaves.\"","Other attendees noticed the tycoons' interest in the children.","Someone pandered to their interest, saying, \"They're from Starry Sky Kindergarten, which even broadcasts live daily.\"","\"Really?\" the tycoon seemed intrigued.","The opportunist offered, \"Why don't I send you the link?\"","And just like that, by using Starry Sky Kindergarten as a conversation topic, they successfully added the tycoon on WeChat.","Others were utterly amazed.","The aristocratic kindergarten director was seething.","This was undoubtedly a grand ploy by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Using children's performances, their intentions were sinister.","Soon, the children returned to resume their performance.","By the end of this Starry Sky Kindergarten spectacle, who knows how many would become enamored with the kindergarten?","She had a bad feeling and wanted to sabotage their show.","But the adults were all seated around the children, and none of them dared to borrow her courage, so they waited patiently until everyone had finished playing house.","When they went over, they found that the jewelry queen Ye Qin, whom they had been wanting to chat with earlier, was now holding her only daughter and saying to Teacher Tang: \"Why didn't you let my Zihan be the princess?\"","\"How come she's only playing a maid?\"","She had been watching with great interest earlier, and the only thing she was dissatisfied with was that her daughter should have been the princess.","She had intended to fight for her daughter, but her daughter said from the side: \"Next time I'll be the princess, I've already told them!\"","Liu Chen said: \"Next time, let's play doctor instead of prince and princess.\"","The adults laughed on the side.","Little did they know that the children were having so much fun playing this game for the first time that not only did they not fuss, they even said: \"Call us next time too.\"","\"That's not until next year's birthday.\"","The little ones counted on their fingers and realized they had to wait a year. They immediately wanted to cry.","The parents consulted Teacher Tang about the requirements for enrolling at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This immediately made the Starry Sky Kindergarten principal clench her fists.","But Teacher Tang answered that Starry Sky Kindergarten was not enrolling students.","Even the elite kindergarten was taken aback, as these children's parents had a combined net worth of over a billion.","Even opening a separate class just for them would be worthwhile.","She desperately wanted what the other party had just refused her.","Although relieved, there was still an inexplicable sense of dissatisfaction in her heart.","She felt like she had fallen behind Starry Sky Kindergarten once again."]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Calligraphy Teacher Competes with Drawing Teacher for Students","paragraphs":["After the children finished their lunch, Shen Wei took them back.","The school bus driver had been waiting outside for a long time.","It wasn't until Teacher Tang handed over the last child to their parents that she could take a break.","After playing for much of the day, the little kids were exhausted, their rosy cheeks ready for a nap.","Mu Zhixing returned to the kindergarten with Shen Wei. On the way, Shen Wei even bought her an ice cream.","Mu Zhixing looked delighted: \"Is this really for me?\"","She could hardly believe it—an ice cream ball cost more than 30 yuan, something that had been reserved for her younger sister at home.","Now she had a whopping three scoops.","Seeing her look of utter delight, Shen Wei said, \"Yes, it's for you!\"","The little girl then took the first spoonful and said, \"For you.\"","Shen Wei was truly touched.","After tasting the rich, creamy strawberry milk flavor that melted smoothly in her mouth without a hint of ice crystals, she found it absolutely delicious.","Seeing her enjoy it, the little treasure happily dug into her ice cream.","Shen Wei stroked Mu Zhixing's cheek, finding it hard to imagine that such an adorable child could have such scum for parents.","Fortunately, that was all in the past. From now on, it would be a happy life.","Shen Wei asked Mu Zhixing, \"Did you have fun today?\"","The little girl nodded vigorously, truly overjoyed.","She had never played that game before.","And in the game, she was a princess—something she could have never imagined.","The two returned to the kindergarten. As it was a day off, there were no other children around.","He Lingfeng preferred tinkering with his computer in his room and didn't enjoy the playground activities.","So the vast slide, ball pit, and bouncy castle were all for Mu Zhixing's exclusive enjoyment.","After playing outside for a while, the little one scampered off to the art room.","But when she opened the door, she felt guilty—Qi Zhong was still there.","Though it was his day off, Qi Zhong found painting at home less comfortable than in the art room.","So, out of habit, he came to paint.","Seeing Mu Zhixing's flushed little face, showing how much fun she'd had, he said, \"Come paint.\"","Mu Zhixing replied, \"Sorry!\" She didn't know she was supposed to paint today. Otherwise, she wouldn't have played those other games.","Qi Zhong had taught students before, but none as young and well-behaved as her.","Though he wanted to put on a stern face, he couldn't bring himself to do it in front of such an adorable little treasure. \"No need to apologize.\"","So Qi Zhong set aside his own work and started teaching her to paint from the very beginning.","One thing that particularly delighted Qi Zhong was that she had a natural gift for 3D perspective.","The little one seemed to be born with it.","Though she could have moved on to more complex subjects for some of the simpler spheres, Qi Zhong heeded the advice of his mentor.","Lay a solid foundation—so he stubbornly made this painting prodigy do five more pieces before progressing to the next level of difficulty.","Although it meant working overtime, he did it willingly.","Each day, he would share his little apprentice's paintings on his social media feed.","His WeChat contacts were all prominent figures in the art world.","He hadn't posted anything on his feed for years, but now, showing off Mu Zhixing's work, he felt like a proud parent boasting about their child, unable to stop himself.","Even if others didn't want to see it, he insisted on showing off, unstoppable.","Many people liked the posts, commenting, \"She's really just a six-year-old? Her perspective is so accurate.\"","It was hard to imagine a child that age being able to sit still for that long.","Qi Zhong didn't explain. He just posted more frequently.","That earlier painting of the stars had been borrowed by a friend in the industry for an exhibition.","A collector even wanted to buy it for 100,000 yuan.","But Qi Zhong didn't sell it.","The painting held too much meaning—it was the child's very first work.","Of course, he would keep it as a treasured piece.","What was a measly 100,000 yuan? At his peak, that kind of money was nothing to him.","His little apprentice deserved better.","Qi Zhong had spent a remarkably fulfilling Saturday, only to find that the calligraphy teacher Wang Pei had arrived on Sunday as well.","Were they still eating takeout?","After getting used to the cooking of Chef Chen and Chef Liu, takeout felt almost inedible.","It was hard to imagine how he used to find it so tasty.","Qi Zhong said to Wang Pei, \"What are you doing here?\"","Wang Pei replied, \"I made plans with Mu Zhixing to come practice calligraphy.\"","Qi Zhong exclaimed, \"What? But she's supposed to be painting with me!\"","Painting and calligraphy were two sides of the same coin.","With her steady hands, she would excel at calligraphy as well.","Appreciating talent, Wang Pei had arranged to give her private calligraphy lessons every Sunday morning.","Qi Zhong immediately felt territorial: \"Listen, this student is mine.\"","He could let other students go, but Mu Zhixing was his to claim.","Teacher Wang Pei said, \"I'm not trying to compete with you. But why not let her learn? What's wrong with studying calligraphy?\"","Qi Zhong grumbled, \"Nothing's wrong with it!\"","Teacher Wang Pei continued, \"Then it's settled. I'm not trying to take her from you. I just want to teach her good calligraphy.\"","Qi Zhong gave him a look. \"Shen Wei said you have a way with words. Now I see what she meant.\"","Soon, the little girl arrived, having also eaten the meal ordered by Shen Wei. She sweetly called out, \"Teacher Wang Pei, Teacher Qi Zhong!\"","Qi Zhong gave Mu Zhixing a brooding look. \"Why did you make plans with him?\"","Being a people-pleaser by nature, Mu Zhixing grew anxious upon sensing Qi Zhong's displeasure. \"I...\"","Wang Pei interjected, \"It was my idea for her to practice calligraphy. Don't blame her.\"","The little one looked uncertain of what to do.","Wang Pei then gently suggested, \"Why don't you practice calligraphy with me first, then go paint with your other teacher?\"","\"Okay!\"","Qi Zhong shot Wang Pei an angry glare.","He had never understood the term \"green tea\" until now, when he was starting to get a sense of it.","But with Mu Zhixing present, he couldn't make a scene, as she was quite sensitive. He feared upsetting her.","Yet rage simmered within: You green tea snake, just wait—if you ever have a student, I'll snatch them too!!"]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: The Second Child Policy","paragraphs":["The Shao Family, where Shao Dongdong belonged, was not particularly prominent among the wealthy families in the city.","However, he was just a branch of the Shao Family of the Capital. The main family was a prominent noble household nationwide.","The currently popular instant messaging app was under their family's control.","Previously, Mrs. Shao was somewhat dissatisfied with her child attending the Starry Sky Kindergarten for internet celebrities.","Although the local noble kindergartens couldn't quite live up to the \"noble\" title,","they were still the top choice for the scions of wealthy families.","How could her own child have to participate in a live audition for a kindergarten?","However, this dissatisfaction was quickly dispelled.","Because her child performed exceptionally well, both in street dance and piano recitals,","earning rounds of applause.","The comment streams were filled with glowing praises, which the secretary had captured and sent to them.","After all, every parent had a desire to show off their child's talents.","Even children from prestigious families were pressured from a young age,","undergoing rigorous training from a tender age.","What her child could do was not really extraordinary in the strict sense.","It was just the first time they had received so much praise from the general public.","No wonder those from wealthy families enjoyed being internet celebrities and stars.","This overwhelming adoration was quite addictive.","Ever since Shao Dongdong started attending the Starry Sky Kindergarten,","several members of their family had become fans of the kindergarten's live stream.","Now there were seven classes on livestream, so they couldn't see their own child every day like before.","But the other children were also very adorable.","It was currently Sunday.","Shao Dongdong was running and playing in the family's large garden, soon sweating all over before returning home.","Although Shao Dongdong was gentle and polite in front of others,","he didn't act that way around his mother, running over and reaching out with his grimy little hands to hug her.","Mrs. Shao said with disdain, \"Look at you all sweaty and dirty, why don't you go take a bath?\"","But still embraced her child.","Seeing Shao Dongdong giggling, beads of sweat glistening on his flushed, rosy cheeks, full of life.","It was a world of difference from before.","Previously, the child was raised to be a proper heir, polite and suppressing his emotions,","not as close with his parents.","Compared to the past, Mrs. Shao much preferred her child now.","Whenever Shao Dongdong was happy, he would repeat, \"I love you, I love you!\"","Even the usually reserved Mrs. Shao, who had received elite education since childhood, would break into a smile upon hearing it.","She felt that no warm man in the world could compare to her son's little finger.","She suddenly understood why her husband had chosen the Starry Sky Kindergarten among all the others.","They were both victims of the rigid rules of wealthy families.","Unwilling for their son to tread the same path and live a childhood devoid of happiness.","Since their family was wealthy, even if they raised their child to be a wastrel, he would still enjoy a life of abundance.","Why deprive the child of joy?","\"Silly boy!\" She then wiped the sweat off Shao Dongdong's face.","The little rascal mischievously pounced into her embrace,","smearing sweat onto her expensive luxury coat, infuriating his mother: \"Do you know how much this coat costs? 100,000 yuan, you little brat!\"","Before his mother could finish scolding him,","his father's hearty laughter rang out: \"That 100,000 yuan is on me. As long as the child is happy!\"","Mrs. Shao then glanced at him and said, \"You just keep spoiling him.\"","His father then beckoned, \"Son.\"","Ever since attending the Starry Sky Kindergarten, the little one had become more lively and cheerful,","and his relationship with his parents had grown closer.","But he clearly preferred his mother more, subsequently hiding in her embrace with a smile.","Mrs. Shao looked somewhat pleased, pinching her son's cheeks: \"Go take a bath now, or mom will really get angry.\"","The little one could only say, \"Okay, make me some sweet and sour ribs later. Our school's sweet and sour ribs are the best.\"","\"Got it!\"","Only after his mother agreed did Shao Dongdong run back to his room to take a bath.","Mr. Shao said, \"The chefs at their kindergarten are really impressive!\"","The previous Liu Chef was already a renowned expert in the industry.","This Chef Chen was even more of a culinary legend among foodies.","It was no wonder the child was constantly thinking about food, with the Starry Sky Kindergarten being able to recruit these two masters to cook there.","Before sending his son to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, he had conducted a thorough investigation.","When he saw the kindergarten's faculty roster, even he was taken aback.","This Shen Wei was truly formidable,","able to gather so many industry giants in a small kindergarten.","It was no surprise that the Starry Sky Kindergarten could rival the noble kindergartens in such a short time.","Mrs. Shao scoffed, \"At this rate, he wouldn't want any weekends, wishing to go to school every day!\"","Previously, this child didn't like going to school, but now he couldn't get enough of it.","Mr. Shao remarked, \"No wonder, he didn't have many playmates before. After going to the Starry Sky Kindergarten and making so many friends, it's natural for him to linger and forget to return.\"","He then looked at his wife, \"Why don't we have another baby for him to play with?\"","Mrs. Shao's face flushed slightly, \"Dream on.\"","Then she glared at him and returned to her room.","Mr. Shao roared with laughter behind her.","A servant said, \"The madam is just shy. She's been taking folic acid supplements these days.\"","Mr. Shao smiled, \"We're one family. It's not good for one to enter without the other.\"","Looks like he, as the husband, would have to put in more effort, lest he disappoint his wife and child.","This Starry Sky Kindergarten had given him a lively and affectionate treasure.","He hoped the kindergarten could last for a long time.","When the time comes, their second child would also attend the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Indeed, before their second child was even conceived, the father had already made plans.","...","When Monday came around,","not only were the students brimming with enthusiasm,","but the faculty and staff were also energized upon returning to work.","Huddling together, they said, \"I cooked some dishes recently, but why did they taste so bad?\"","After getting used to the delicious food at the Starry Sky Kindergarten, their own cooking tasted bad, take-out was unappetizing, and eating out wasn't enjoyable either – their palates had become spoiled.","Several people didn't even eat breakfast, rushing to work and looking forward to a hearty lunch.","At that moment, the kitchen was bustling with activity.","The large steamer was filled with steaming rice.","It was clear that Liu Chef knew the habits of these people, as today he had specifically told the junior chef, \"Steam an extra half crate of rice.\"","Now they had experience, unlike before when they didn't know.","On Mondays, there wasn't enough food cooked, and he rushed around buying rice.","But they used the finest Wuchang rice.","Rice from other places couldn't match the fragrance of the rice here.","Come Monday, after repressing their appetites for a long time, even the young teaching assistant could eat three bowls of rice.","Chef Chen said from the side, \"Make a whole crate, it's better to have extra than not enough. Any leftovers can be made into fried rice with soy sauce next time.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Alright, steam another crate!\"","He then went to find Doctor Lu.","Ever since Shen Wei's parents were hospitalized, Doctor Lu had taken over the shopping duties.","Doctor Lu had never done it before and was flustered at first.","But a top student is a top student.","In just a few days, he had sorted everything out.","At this moment, Liu Chef came to him for one thing, \"Little Lu, order another 5,000 pounds of rice.\"","\"Ah? Didn't we just order 3,000 pounds?\" Doctor Lu said in disbelief.","Liu Chef said from the side, \"Hey, that's not enough, running a kindergarten isn't easy!\"","They went through rice, flour, and oil so quickly.","It's only because Shen Wei had deep pockets that they hadn't gone under yet. Just the food expenses alone could bankrupt an ordinary kindergarten.","Thinking of this, even Liu Chef couldn't help but sigh.","This was probably his last job before retirement.","He was just working this job to support himself in old age.","No one hoped for Shen Wei to make more money than him."]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Inside the Garden: Gossip","paragraphs":["Recently, Gu Qingyan has been working at the kindergarten.","During lunchtime, he sat next to Shen Wei.","He whispered to Shen Wei, \"Hey, have you noticed? It seems like Teacher Tang likes Li Yi.\"","Teacher Tang is an outstanding and well-known teacher.","All the children adore her.","Even in the industry, people admire Teacher Tang for her exceptional patience with children.","A child like Ning Fubao, if it weren't for her perseverance, he wouldn't have been able to attend school.","Now the little fellow is well-fed, warmly clothed, and as chubby as a little Buddha from a New Year's painting.","It's evident how much effort Teacher Tang has put into him.","Li Yi used to be a warrior king.","After being injured and retiring from the military, he's been staying at home as a 40-year-old bachelor.","Currently, he has a new prosthetic limb that makes him look no different from ordinary people.","And when he cleans up, that special kind of rugged handsomeness on his face is quite attractive.","Unlike Gu Qingyan's pretty-boy charm, Li Yi has a rough masculinity.","Recently, several parents picking up their children have been inquiring if Li Yi is single.","Back in his village, no girl was interested in him.","Additionally, over the years, he spent his money supporting his family and brothers, living a difficult life himself.","No one set their sights on him, and he remained single all along.","As for Teacher Tang, she previously had a well-matched fiancé.","However, before their wedding, her fiancé cheated on her, and she caught him.","She resolutely broke off the engagement.","Her parents even threatened her severely, telling her, \"Turn a blind eye and pretend there's a child.\"","In the end, Teacher Tang decisively called off the wedding.","But her parents treat her like the groom's own mother and still resent their daughter!","At the kindergarten, apart from a few veteran nursery teachers, the rest are single.","When Shen Wei encountered this gossip, she was also curious, \"Really?\"","Gu Qingyan's beautiful eyes sparkled with gossip, \"I've been observing for several days now! Every time during meals, it's Teacher Tang who packs a lunchbox and sends it over to Li Yi.\"","He's the gatekeeper, so someone needs to bring him food. Originally, it was Liu Chef who delivered it.","But somehow, this task fell into Teacher Tang's hands.","And the two of them keep chatting.","Shen Wei was a bit surprised.","Not that she was biased against Teacher Tang.","But Teacher Tang is around 10 years younger than Li Yi.","For now, only Gu Qingyan has noticed this, and since no one in the office is discussing it, she can pretend not to know.","Gu Qingyan, working here, was full of enthusiasm.","He even received a month's salary.","Taking two thousand yuan, this was the first paycheck Gu Qingyan earned after becoming an adult, and he was overjoyed.","He told Shen Wei, \"My parents said last time that it would be great if we could eat here every day!\"","Although they're close, he couldn't trouble others. It would be better if they opened a restaurant.","More than one person has said this to Shen Wei.","While Shen Wei was pondering, the mechanical voice in her head sounded again, \"The following new task is being issued.\"","\"Open a pop-up store with a kindergarten theme, featuring food, role-playing, and special interests and talents. Bring the excitement of a famous internet kindergarten to the people of the entire city.\"","Shen Wei's spirit was immediately lifted.","She liked this task.","Gu Qingyan was chattering endlessly beside her, but Shen Wei was startled by the sudden task issued by the system.","Seeing no response from her, Gu Qingyan felt a little dejected.","When Shen Wei came to her senses, she noticed Gu Qingyan's aggrieved expression.","Her eyes lit up.","This was the perfect opportunity to involve him, \"Can you help me with something?\"","\"Sure!\" Gu Qingyan agreed without even knowing what Shen Wei was talking about.","Shen Wei said softly, \"I'm planning to do a pop-up store themed around the Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","With the current curiosity surrounding the famous internet kindergarten, why not let everyone experience it firsthand?","\"Ah?\" Gu Qingyan's face lit up with excitement, his voice uncontrolled as everyone turned to look at him.","He then sat down, his cheeks flushed, barely containing his excitement, \"Really?\"","He knew better than anyone how famous this kindergarten was.","To be entrusted with such an important task, he was thrilled to the point of blushing, \"I... I... Can I do it?\"","\"Of course, but keep it a secret until it's successful.\"","Gu Qingyan nodded repeatedly, \"No worries, I'm great at keeping secrets.\"","Originally, the delicious meal in front of him would have him eating two or three more bowls.","But with this task on his mind, Gu Qingyan took only a couple of bites before eagerly wanting to return to the office with Shen Wei to discuss the details.","If he was this excited, it was hard to imagine how thrilled everyone would be if this event was announced publicly.","Shen Wei also took a quick bite before leaving with Gu Qingyan.","As soon as they left, Doctor Lu said to the teaching assistant Tang Xiaowan, \"Those two definitely have something going on.\"","What could it be other than... heh heh heh.","Previously, they had a highly publicized engagement.","The entire livestream knew about it.","Now, Gu Qingyan has left the vast Gu family businesses to work odd jobs at the kindergarten.","Everyone could see there was something more to it.","There must be something going on between them.","Shen Wei was completely unaware that many of her kindergarten colleagues were shipping her and Gu Qingyan as a couple.","...","At that moment, Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan reached an empty office.","Although the system only required a pop-up store, Shen Wei wanted to make it the best.","She envisioned it as a theme park like in a certain movie.","People could dine at the restaurant and also experience various special courses.","Shen Wei currently had 50 million yuan.","20 million was given by her father, and the rest was rewards from the system. She wanted to make it the absolute best.","The new location for the Starry Sky Kindergarten was chosen in the city center.","The new site was much better than the current kindergarten's location.","Originally, Shen Wei planned for this to be a pop-up store.","The most expensive part would be the renovation. Since they were renovating, it couldn't be wasted.","Shen Wei planned to decorate it like the kindergarten. After the pop-up ended, it would directly become a branch of the Starry Sky Kindergarten."]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Pop-up Store","paragraphs":["This plan, Shen Wei didn't tell anyone about.","Now Starry Sky Kindergarten was gaining fame, and many people wanted to enroll their kids.","But the old school district was already saturated.","If they recruited more students, it would get a bit cramped.","So Shen Wei had been refusing before.","But there were too many people asking.","It's better to be flexible than to hold back. And since the old team had more or less gotten used to the kindergarten's operations, she could consider opening a branch.","Originally, Shen Wei wanted to open a branch. At least one or two years later.","She didn't expect Starry Sky Kindergarten to develop faster than she imagined.","Now, people were watching every move Starry Sky Kindergarten made.","If they made a big fuss opening a second location, they were afraid competitors would cause trouble.","A pop-up store didn't have that concern. After the pop-up ended, they could smoothly open for business.","They would catch the competitors off guard.","Gu Qingyan was so excited.","Shen Wei took out her entire savings of 50 million yuan: \"Take this to use first, and if it's not enough, you can take out a bank loan!\"","Normally, opening a kindergarten doesn't require that much money.","But Shen Wei wanted to buy a plot of land plus an entire building in the city center. Buying such a large place in the city center, 50 million would barely be enough, and there was still the cost of renovation.","The renovation costs were also a big expense.","She had simply stumbled upon Starry Sky Kindergarten before.","Such good fortune is hard to come by.","Now, many people were familiar with Shen Wei's face.","If she were to make the arrangements, people would surely take advantage of her.","Gu Qingyan was very touched. He didn't expect Shen Wei to trust him so much.","\"Rest assured, I will not fail you.\"","Although Gu Qingyan had a lively and unrestrained personality, as a child of the Gu family, he had a high sensitivity for business from being immersed in it.","This pop-up store was the first time he was taking charge, and he was determined to give 200% effort.","After leaving the kindergarten, he used the Gu family's connections and quickly selected a location in the city center.","It was originally an unfinished building. Its location was very good, but in the earlier years, the developer had stalled it.","After building the structure, they wanted to hoard it and sell it at a high price.","So it had been left vacant.","Previously, many supermarkets wanted to buy it, but were scared off by the former developer's exorbitant asking price.","This time, Gu Qingyan went to negotiate in person.","The other party relied on the Gu family's strength.","Plus, after so much negotiation during this period, there were few buyers.","They were afraid that if they rejected him, they wouldn't know when the next buyer would come along.","They had originally bought it for 4 million yuan, plus the construction costs, totaling 10 million. Now they were asking for 30 million. Gu Qingyan negotiated it down to 25 million.","After signing, he immediately wired the payment.","Gu Qingyan had already found out in advance and brought in the same company that had renovated Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This renovation company was very ordinary.","But after Starry Sky became famous,","this renovation company also became popular.","Many people followed Starry Sky's style and had them replicate it 1:1.","This time, Gu Qingyan said he wanted the same renovation as Starry Sky. The renovation company thought it was just another copy.","However, they had renovated so many places before. This was the most luxurious one.","Starry Sky's style of renovation had already become like an assembly line for them.","Gu Qingyan's price was high, and his requirements were high too. The paint they used was all eco-friendly, specialized for children's rooms.","Seeing his urgency, the renovation company brought three renovation teams to work simultaneously. For such a large area, it still took them a month to finish!","After it was done, even the boss of the renovation team couldn't help but snap a few photos.","The more he looked, the more satisfied he was.","Shen Wei had found the right person in Gu Qingyan.","Between buying the building, registering it, and the renovation, the 50 million yuan was just enough.","Gu Qingyan's move was quite eye-catching too. Everyone wanted to know what he was up to.","After observing that it was a kindergarten, they lamented that the kindergarten track was really competitive this year.","Ever since the emergence of Starry Sky,","it was like opening the door to a fantasy world.","Many newcomers entered the industry.","But ordinary people gave up during the renovation stage.","The upfront investment for a kindergarten was really high.","Shen Qingqing and Su Zheng told Doctor Lu that they had invested several million yuan and hadn't even gotten the place set up yet.","Seeing this, those wealthy scions who just wanted to make quick money one by one abandoned the idea.","Rather than spending several million yuan to start a kindergarten without knowing when they could recoup their investment,","they might as well open a bar or shopping mall to make money faster.","Kindergartens were a high-end game.","...","After the renovation was complete,","Shen Wei looked at it many times.","It was a 1:1 replica of Starry Sky Kindergarten, and even larger.","The area was almost catching up to Noble Kindergarten.","Noble Kindergarten wasn't that big at first either. It had expanded slowly,","acquiring surrounding properties at great expense later on.","In comparison, although she spent more at the start, she avoided the hassle later on.","...","Starry Sky Kindergarten's short video followers exceeded 800,000.","Doctor Lu excitedly found Shen Wei: \"800,000, we should celebrate!\"","Previously, when Doctor Lu was working, he didn't have much time to go online.","After coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, he surfed the web at lightning speed.","He said some big influencers send out gifts when their follower count reaches a certain number.","Doctor Lu said: \"Why don't we draw a few people to come to the kindergarten for the buffet?\" This was the most popular suggestion.","Shen Wei said: \"No need, I already have an idea!\"","That evening, after the children were dismissed,","Shen Wei mysteriously called the school bus drivers to take everyone to the Starry Sky Kindergarten in the city center.","It was a complete 1:1 replica, even Liu Chef's little vegetable garden was there.","Everyone had an unbelievable thought in their minds.","Could it be what they were thinking?"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Announcement Sent Out","paragraphs":["Shen Wei said, \"The benefit for 800,000 fans is a pop-up themed experience of Starry Sky Kindergarten, allowing everyone to deeply experience a day in kindergarten.\"","Liu Chef smacked his lips and said, \"Young people's minds work quickly. That's a great idea, I think it will work.\"","Upon hearing about the pop-up experience, everyone else became excited too.","The kindergarten demographic is very unique, only those with a need would pay attention.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten has gone viral several times, and has many fans outside its circle.","More people are curious to know if Starry Sky Kindergarten is really as good as they say.","Especially the few young teaching assistants, since coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, their friend circles have been reposted on the school forum.","Everyone is discussing feverishly.","They are skeptical, not believing the kindergarten could be as good as the assistants claim.","Sometimes, the assistants even get angry. They really want to let the doubters experience it for themselves.","Those who have been there know just how good Starry Sky Kindergarten is - it's the industry's ceiling.","There are also some parents who constantly ask questions, immersing them would probably be more useful than teachers explaining ten times.","For young people, it's quite novel too.","There are many themed escape rooms, but not for kindergarten experiences.","People used to joke, \"Would 300-yuan-a-month big babies want to come too?\"","This is perfect timing.","Shen Wei said, \"Everyone has been working hard overtime recently. The overtime pay is 1,000 yuan per day.\"","Cheers erupted around her.","The ones working hardest were Chef Chen and Liu Chef.","Shen Wei promised that in addition to the 1,000 yuan per day, she would also give them a salary raise.","Especially for Chef Chen, his salary would be increased from 50,000 to 70,000 yuan.","After discussing with Liu Chef, he sighed in reflection.","Years ago, Liu Chef had worked himself to the bone for Jiangbei Grand Restaurant, only to receive a small severance pay in the end, without even caring for past feelings.","Only after meeting Shen Wei did he realize that any work that doesn't discuss money is thuggery.","Although Chef Chen hadn't worked much, from observing for so many years, he naturally knew the pains of employment.","He had often heard of various bosses not treating employees like human beings.","Now working at the kindergarten is so comfortable, not to mention that after such a short time, Shen Wei wants to give him a raise, and this raise is unprecedented in its magnitude.","Chef Chen had run restaurants before, so he wasn't short on money.","But this kind of recognition also touched him.","Chef Chen said, \"Leave the buffet to me.\" As soon as Chef Chen finished speaking, Liu Chef was stunned.","The master was serious this time.","What the other employees were most curious about was when Shen Wei would make the announcement.","Shen Wei said, \"Immediately.\"","The price Shen Wei set was 200 yuan for just the buffet.","Participating in the immersive extracurricular class would cost 400 yuan in total.","This price wasn't high for the city, but not low either.","Shen Wei wanted to limit it to around 100 people per session.","Then divide it into 6 classes, with Teacher Tang taking one class each, with full staff participation. The pop-up would run over the weekend for two days.","The most urgent issue now was the kitchen - since it's a buffet, there would need to be more dishes.","Not having enough manpower was a big problem.","Liu Chef said, \"I can find people.\"","After all, he had worked at Jiangbei Grand Restaurant for so many years. Although betrayed by his own disciple, he had taught more than just that one person over the years.","He only needed to call out, and those he had taught would come to help.","With the chef industry not doing well currently, and Shen Wei promising 1,000 yuan per person afterwards, Liu Chef was able to call over 40 people in an instant for this big job.","Chef Chen was eager to get to the kitchen, and upon entering, found it even bigger than Starry Sky Kindergarten's, definitely spacious enough for him to work his magic.","Shen Wei also called over Su Jun, who had previously tutored He Lingfeng, and asked him to find some reliable college students to help out as attendants.","Upon receiving Shen Wei's message, Su Jun readily agreed. Whether paid or not didn't matter, as long as they were fed.","With all preparations on Shen Wei's side ready, she then posted a video saying, \"There's a huge benefit for 800,000 fans, to be announced in an hour.\"","This message was quickly discovered by long-time fans, all wondering what kind of benefit it was, with such secrecy surrounding it.","\"Could it be they're inviting us over for a meal?\"","After waiting an hour, the time had arrived.","They immediately clicked in, and sure enough, there was an updated newest video.","This newest video hadn't even been watched yet, but there were already over 2,000 replies below it.","It had only been less than a minute.","Clicking in to watch, wow. It turned out to be the opening of a Starry Sky Kindergarten pop-up themed experience.","The buffet alone cost 200 yuan, while the buffet plus various art classes cost 400 yuan in total, with only 100 slots available!","Shen Wei had even posted the class schedule, including a piano class, a dance class, a calligraphy class, and an art class.","The teachers for these classes at Starry Sky Kindergarten had previously gone viral.","Their detailed resumes had all been dug up.","At the time, everyone was green with envy, saying how they wished they had such a good kindergarten when they were young.","After the announcement, comments immediately flooded in: \"How do we sign up?\"","\"A mere 400 yuan for teachers of this caliber, who usually charge 300 yuan for just one class? And there are four classes!\"","\"The 200 yuan for Starry Sky Kindergarten's buffet isn't much at all.\"","\"At Jiangbei Grand Restaurant, 200 yuan could only get you a plate of shredded potatoes and a small bowl of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall!\"","\"And this time, they'll even have the highly requested stir-fried beef tendon!\"","Shen Wei had previously worried that 400 yuan might be too much for everyone.","But it turned out her worries were unnecessary, as the responses were overwhelmingly positive.","\"Okay, I get it, you can delete that comment now.\"","\"Please let me know how to sign up?\"","\"I was just wondering what to do this weekend.\"","\"As expected of the kindergarten I'm a fan of, always keeping a low profile while achieving great things, who knew they'd even have a pop-up experience.\"","Parents whose children hadn't been accepted were green with envy.","Their fans had already calculated the costs.","Just the art classes alone were so valuable.","The monthly tuition they paid for their children was only 1,600 yuan per month.","How did their children not get accepted? They would have to go no matter what!","Parents were very interested in experiencing what their children learn in a day.","Art students were about to go crazy.","Someone had directly reposted it to their group.","The specialty teachers' skills were truly impressive.","To arrange a master class with instructors of their caliber, the minimum cost would be four figures.","Now, 400 yuan for four classes, plus a meal, what's the difference between that and getting it for free?","The fans had just left comments, and after a refresh, the number had already surpassed 10,000.","Originally, I was excited, thinking Starry Sky Kindergarten was offering a treat for the fans. But now my heart sank again.","Just 5 minutes and the comments had skyrocketed.","If things kept heating up for another hour or two, what would happen?","Suddenly, I worried if I could even get one of those 100 spots.","\"Not enough, not enough, would you dare offer 200 spots?\"","\"The previous commenter was too conservative, make it 500 spots.\"","\"Am I the only one who saw this? Is this a pop-up store? Pop-up stores usually last 7 days.\"","\"Thunderbolt on a clear day, the previous comment hit the nail on the head. With this level of heat, I'm afraid I won't be able to snag a ticket for 7 consecutive days. What do I do?\"","\"I plan to move in here. I'm afraid of missing any updates. What if Liu Chef secretly releases more tickets?\"","After hearing this, the others didn't dare leave, afraid of missing any news.","Teacher Tang's phone was ringing off the hook.","It wasn't just Teacher Tang, the assistants, employees, everyone was getting calls from friends and family for inside tickets.","Even Doctor Lu's colleagues at the hospital were paying attention to this, calling him several times.","Doctor Lu came to Shen Wei under pressure: \"100 spots are really not enough, can we increase the number?\"","Shen Wei said, \"Let me ask Liu Chef.\"","Everything else was fine, it was just the buffet that was a huge strain.","Seeing the fans' enthusiasm, Liu Chef said, \"I'll find some old acquaintances to help with the cooking.\"","Cut the crap, there was no shortage of helpers, the issue was lacking skilled chefs.","Anyone Liu Chef deemed worthy had to at least be an industry master, a judge for cooking competitions and the like.","For the kindergarten, Liu Chef was going all out.","After discussing with his master chef friends, Liu Chef said, \"500 people.\" That was the absolute limit the buffet could handle.","The main thing was, they didn't want to compromise the quality of the food. They couldn't just throw in any random dishes to make up the numbers.","Good food required meticulous preparation and intricate processes.","To take those painstakingly crafted gourmet dishes and serve them buffet-style was essentially a demotion.","After confirming multiple times, Shen Wei announced the addition of 500 more spots.","But the netizens were still unsatisfied.","\"Only 500 people, you're really underestimating us. Just look at the comments, there are already over 50,000 and still rising.\"","The netizens were shocked: \"Am I the only poor person here? I thought 400 yuan was no big deal, I planned to snag a spot! But now I realize I'm the only poor one!\"","The 400 yuan threshold didn't deter anyone at all.","How did everyone have so much money?","This is too much."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Returning to Kindergarten","paragraphs":["Everyone was focused on the issue of securing spots at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shortly after, a mini-program was launched on a short video platform.","All you had to do was go in and click to grab a ticket, pay, and then the ticket would be secured before entering your personal information.","After Shen Wei published the process, her fans exclaimed, \"Got it!\"","\"Launch it quickly!\"","\"Don't make me wait a second.\"","Shen Wei quickly launched it, and within three seconds, 500 tickets were snatched.","Several people angrily stated, \"I had just gotten to the payment page, but it froze for a bit. When I went back in, the tickets were gone.\"","\"I was sitting right on top of the router and still couldn't get a ticket.\"","\"Did anyone actually manage to get a ticket? There were only 500 of them.\"","\"Someone's gone crazy again. With only 500 tickets, there are too many wolves for too little meat.\"","\"Haha, I got one!\" They then showed a screenshot of their successful ticket grab.","\"Who would have known, folks? First pay to lock in the ticket, then fill out your info. So convenient! When I used to get tickets for shows, I had to log in with my personal info first before trying to grab tickets. That was such a hassle.\"","\"Wait, is it possible to transfer tickets? I'll pay 1000.\"","\"Don't be scalpers, please. I'm just a poor student and can't afford that much. I can only offer 1100.\"","\"You don't seem that poor either. How about this - I'll have my little cat do a back flip for you? Anyone selling at face value?\"","\"Not selling, not selling. I finally managed to snag a ticket, so I want to fully experience the food over there.\"","\"Looking forward to real reviews and feedback.\"","\"Lurking for updates.\"","More people kept repeatedly trying to persuade others to transfer their tickets.","Finally, Shen Wei came out and clarified that all 500 tickets had been registered within five minutes.","This meant the tickets were now tied to real identities and could no longer be transferred.","Those who managed to grab tickets this time were all fans from her live stream.","In a luxurious mansion, a beautiful lady was patting her chest, feeling the thrill.","For someone of her privileged background, she never had to scramble for things like Black Friday deals, concert tickets, or new seasonal luxury items, which brands would send her.","This was her first time competing for tickets.","Her brand new phone didn't freeze, allowing her to secure a ticket immediately. After registering her info, she realized that others hadn't been able to grab tickets.","A wave of joy, nervousness, and satisfaction washed over her, leaving her in a daze for a while.","The beautiful lady's two children were already in elementary school.","There were no toddlers at home who needed to attend kindergarten.","But she was a fan of Shen Wei's Starry Sky Kindergarten live stream, so she insisted on experiencing this event.","She then instructed her butler, \"Iron a set of sportswear for me to wear this Saturday.\"","\"Yes, madam!\" he respectfully replied.","The ticketing software this time was personally developed by He Lingfeng. Even at peak demand with 100,000 people rushing in simultaneously, it didn't crash - truly impressive.","Shen Wei heaped praise upon He Lingfeng, befitting of a system-certified genius. He was just too amazing.","The little protagonist's face turned bright red from the compliments.","\"If you need anything else, I can develop it for you next time,\" said the young boy, new to the world of computer science and finding everything novel, with much still to learn.","Shen Wei pinched the little villain's cheeks, finding him utterly adorable.","The 500 ticket holders were all added by the customer service team to new WeChat groups.","The group names ranged from Kindergarten Class 1 to Class 10.","50 people per class.","Each with a teacher and a teaching assistant assigned.","They then received the class schedules, menus, and other details.","Everything was meticulously prepared.","The group members went crazy praising Shen Wei, Teacher Tang, and the others.","They kept @'ing her in the group.","\"Finally meeting you in person!\"","\"I'm grinning like an idiot in my dorm room, and my roommates are asking what's going on.\"","\"I can go to kindergarten now.\"","\"The one above said what I've always wanted to say. A bit cringeworthy, but that's how I feel too.\"","Shen Wei asked if everyone wanted her to do a live stream, clarifying that it wasn't mandatory, and would depend on their preference. If more than 30% objected, she wouldn't do it.","After all, this was meant to be a relaxing experience, and not everyone might want to be on camera.","But the consensus was unanimous.","\"Do it, do it! We have to live stream so everyone can see I got a ticket.\"","\"You're shameless enough, I like that!\"","\"Agree to live stream.\"","\"Agree plus one.\"","\"Agree plus two.\"","Shen Wei shared the supplementary live stream agreement, which everyone confirmed with customer service.","There really weren't enough staff available at the moment, so the AI system would temporarily handle customer service duties.","As the most advanced AI, it could easily handle answering questions from 500 people simultaneously.","Once everything was settled, Shen Wei said, \"See you all at 8 PM this Saturday.\" She then shared the address of the new campus in the city center.","The fans who secured tickets either chatted in the class WeChat groups or couldn't resist boasting on the short video platform.","\"As an adult, being able to go back to kindergarten is like a dream come true. Though I can't be reborn, just experiencing it is incredibly novel.\"","\"What does it feel like to be treated like a baby? My heart is pounding. I feel all soft and mushy already.\"","\"Soft and mushy literature? I didn't even get a ticket, and now you're rubbing it in. Don't go too far!\"","Everyone was furious, but soon after, Shen Wei shared another video: \"There will be a live stream tomorrow, with ten windows open. You can choose to join Classes 1 through 10.\"","The fans went from disappointment to elation: \"Ahh, great!\"","Even if they couldn't be there in person, virtually touring the kindergarten was still appealing.","\"I knew Shen Wei wouldn't leave us hanging.\"","\"A live stream works too! I want to see what this kindergarten flash mob is all about.\"","For this event, Shen Wei had ten windows open on one client, made possible by the system's support and some code written by He Lingfeng.","As a web celebrity, Shen Wei had a dedicated short video platform customer service team and had applied for special authorization. The platform quickly granted it.","It was just an online live stream, but having ten windows open on a single port was a first, nearing the scale of a video platform.","This was a new experiment for the short video platform as well.","On that Saturday, those with tickets arrived early at the address shared in the group.","But they were left stunned upon arrival - when did this abandoned construction site in the city center turn into the new Starry Sky Kindergarten campus?","I used to pass by this place often. Such a prime location had been lying idle for so many years, a veritable landmark building in the city.","Little did I expect that in just two months without keeping an eye on it, this place has been transformed into something completely new.","The layout is identical to that of the Starry Sky Kindergarten. Today's visitors are all fans from the livestream.","At a glance, you can tell they even have a small vegetable garden outside, just like a kindergarten.","The color scheme matches that of a kindergarten as well.","Shen Wei leads the staff from the Starry Sky Kindergarten to welcome them here, except for those working in the kitchen.","Everyone already knows which class they belong to in advance. They go and find their \"kindergarten teacher\" one by one. At this moment, reliving their kindergarten days, they finally get a real sense of it."]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Ten Ports Simultaneously Live Broadcasting","paragraphs":["The live stream room soon opened.","Suddenly, 10 portals appeared.","Everyone had a bit of choice paralysis.","Out of habit, most chose Class 1. In no time, there were already 50,000 people in that class, while the other classes with lower popularity only had a few thousand people!","In the kindergarten, everyone started by playing games first.","After becoming familiar, they would do some other class learning activities.","Obviously, adults couldn't play the kind of games kids play, they couldn't just stack blocks or play with mud. So there were board games, mahjong machines, claw machines and racing games, as well as large-scale group role-playing games.","It was a bit like a high-end version of a murder mystery party game.","Class 1 chose a large group drama.","They chose a palace intrigue drama, but without an emperor.","There were concubines, maids, nannies, and eunuchs.","These kinds of large-scale role-playing games are more fun to watch others play.","When choosing roles at the beginning, there were already many laughs, with some boys choosing the role of a villainous concubine, cross-dressing as women. Every time they delivered a line, it was especially hilarious.","The eunuch roles were also highly sought after.","Especially the eunuchs in the concubine's palace.","Some people truly embodied the eunuch role of flattering and groveling before their masters with great realism.","The viewers in the live stream room were almost laughing themselves to death.","\"How much palace drama have they consumed to be able to act this vividly?\"","\"There are so many pretty girls, I want to go flirt with them.\"","\"The eunuchs are stealing the show, I told you to play a eunuch, not become an actual eunuch!\"","\"I've already secretly @'ed the palace drama director, hurry and get him a role. Our live stream's little eunuch must become famous.\"","\"Everyone is fighting for favor, they're cracking me up! There's not even an emperor, but this group is working so hard!\"","\"I can't imagine how relaxed I would be if I were among them.\"","\"My mouth that was laughing suddenly became stiff at the corners, you must have jinxed me. Not getting a ticket is my heartache.\"","\"These days the pressure is so high, who doesn't want to act out a drama to release some stress!\"","\"I really want to praise the Class 1 students, they're all so uninhibited, this kind of drama only looks good when people let loose.\"","\"Previously I was already laughing to death watching kids play house, now I realize the adult version is the true essence! A few more years of life experience really makes a difference.\"","\"I thought this was just a kindergarten program, but taking it to this level really puts a lot of pressure on other variety shows.\"","Basically, this big drama lasted for 4 hours.","When it ended, people still weren't satisfied.","Who hasn't had the dream of acting before! And in this environment, you don't have to be yourself, you just act.","Everyone was showing off their acting chops to each other!","After this session, everyone was truly refreshed and energized, with sweat on their foreheads.","It was too enjoyable.","Adults rarely get such an unrestrained environment.","After it ended, everyone could go eat.","The big drama allowed people to quickly become closer. It was more effective than any icebreaker game.","When they arrived at the buffet restaurant, Liu Chef had been waiting for a long time.","\"Eat whatever you want. Just don't waste food.\"","There were over 40 dishes on this side.","There were also some like salmon and steamed oysters that didn't require much cooking.","In the fruit area, even the high-end fruits were presented plate by plate.","The yogurts were the more expensive kinds sold at supermarkets.","Upon seeing Liu Chef, everyone said, \"Grandpa Liu.\"","Liu Chef's mouth twitched, as if he had countless things to say but held them back in his heart.","The people behind him mischievously followed along, also calling \"Grandpa Liu, Grandpa Liu\" nonstop.","The little kids really liked calling him that.","But Liu Chef had never been called grandpa by so many adults before.","He wanted to look in the mirror, unsure if he had aged a bit from overworking recently. Seeing a bald man in his thirties also calling him grandpa.","He was truly confused.","The viewers' mouths were even harder to contain than an AK.","In the buffet area, everyone rushed for the kindergarten menu!","Especially the famous sizzling beef tendon.","Sure enough, the first pot wasn't enough.","The second pot was gone too.","Then the third and fourth pots.","Many people's tables had a plate of sizzling beef tendon.","The soft and chewy texture mixed with the unique smoky aroma of the sizzling plate, it was so appetizing.","Everyone knows not to eat rice at a buffet. Otherwise, one bowl of rice fills you up and you can't eat anything else.","But with this bowl of savory, chewy, sizzling beef tendon, not having some rice would be doing the dish an injustice.","The moment the rice was scooped up, everyone was struck by the unique aroma of the high-quality rice!","No way, they're using such good rice.","Everyone eats rice every day, but this special rice fragrance was like a little mischievous spirit constantly burrowing into their noses! Paired with the sizzling beef tendon, just eat it.","It was so delicious.","After one bowl of rice, they still wanted a second bowl.","Their remaining rationality made them hold back, then they had a dozen oysters, two servings of the fattiest, most tender salmon belly.","Then they ate a plate of other small dishes, even the unassuming vegetable dishes were refreshingly crisp, not to mention the Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","The large lamb skewers not only exploded with juices when bitten, but also had a special milky aroma.","After one round, they were stuffed.","They had eaten their fill, but their mouths still weren't satisfied!","Was this the happiness of eating in a kindergarten?","It really made the viewers in the live stream room drool.","\"Sisters, I knew they would be like this, so I specially ordered some crayfish and duck dishes. But looking at the live stream, the crayfish in my hand doesn't seem as appetizing anymore.\"","\"Who knew? I almost choked on my saliva.\"","\"I just saw a girl secretly eat three bowls of rice by herself.\"","\"I'm willing to endure the pain of being overstuffed!\"","\"You say it like I'm not willing, the main thing is we couldn't get tickets.\"","\"How do we get tickets for the next one?\"","\"While you all try to get tickets, is anyone trying to get a man? I noticed the kindergarten security guard is so manly, he's so handsome I went weak in the knees.\"","\"Wow, wow! We're talking about food, and you're looking at handsome guys!\"","Everyone quickly rewound the live stream. Sure enough, they saw the security guard Li Yi in his uniform.","Although his clothes were ordinary, he wore them with such dashing style.","The traces of wind and sun on his face gave him a ruggedly handsome look that those who like this type could consider the ceiling.","Suddenly someone in the comments said, \"Hey, this is my husband's war buddy. He used to be a battle king in the army.\"","Hearing this, everyone added another filter to their perception. He seemed even more handsome.","\"I want to pick up and drop off the kindergarten kids!\"","\"The person above's scheming has already hit me in the face.\"","Li Yi has become much more energetic lately.","There are no ugly men, only lazy men.","Now that he has cleaned himself up, his composed and steadfast demeanor is truly captivating.","People didn't notice it before, but after taking a closer look, there's a feeling of discovering a hidden treasure.","\"Well, well, over a hundred thousand fans in the live stream room, and you've been hiding it all along, haven't you? If it weren't for our sisters' eagle eyes today, we wouldn't have found out!\""]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: Untitled","paragraphs":["People who recognized Li Yi from watching the live stream called her husband: \"Hey, didn't you say that your class monitor had been doing poorly after retiring from the army, but I just saw him working at a kid's livestreaming daycare!\"","\"Who?\"","\"Li Yi.\" She then sent a screenshot of the daycare.","The other person was a bit excited: \"That's really my class monitor.\"","After retiring, Li Yi's comrade-in-arms took over his family's business. He ran a marble trade and had arranged several reunions for his former comrades.","Many had been contacted, but this class monitor was nowhere to be found, though many said he wasn't doing well.","Adults fear this kind of thing.","Back in the squad, Li Yi was the leader.","If he was doing poorly, he wouldn't want his former brothers to see him that way.","But one of them had been taken care of by Li Yi when they were on sentry duty together, and they were close enough to sacrifice for each other.","Seeing his former class monitor working as a security guard at a daycare, standing at standard attention with one of his legs being a prosthetic, was truly heartbreaking.","Touched to the core, he immediately posted in the comrades' group chat, saying they should get together.","That group had a unique quality - normally no one would say a word, but whenever there was a reunion or something, it would suddenly become active.","\"I just saw our old class monitor Li Yi!\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Is it true or not?\"","Suddenly a bunch of people exploded out.","Then the comrade sent his wife's screenshot.","\"Seeing our old class monitor working as a security guard for others, I really feel bad.\"","\"As long as our old class monitor is willing, I'm happy to hire him as my manager!\"","\"Ah, you know our old class monitor's stubborn temper, he definitely wouldn't agree!\"","\"Let's arrange a dinner!\"","\"Sure! I'll contact him right away.\"","\"Hey you rabbit rascal, you had his contact info but hid it from me, watching me search for so many years.\"","\"It's not that I didn't tell you, it's that our old class monitor hasn't been doing too well. There's been a bunch of messy stuff with his family.\"","\"Tell us quickly!\"","\"It's like this...\"","...","At the daycare's live stream, all the cameras were also focused on the self-service dining hall.","In an uncrowded corner, Teacher Tang brought a lunch box to Li Yi.","In fact, Li Yi wasn't picky about food and would eat anything.","But Teacher Tang was a considerate person who could find the dishes he liked!","Teacher Tang said: \"How's it going? Tired today?\"","It was hard to imagine that Teacher Tang, who was so much younger than him, would actually take more initiative as a woman.","Li Yi had been a bachelor for so many years. Seeing such an outstanding woman approach him, he wasn't unmoved.","But he still wasn't prepared.","Seeing Teacher Tang struggling to make conversation, Li Yi's heart softened, and then a pang of bitterness surged into his chest and spread throughout his body.","Li Yi said: \"Don't bother with me anymore! With your qualities, you could find someone better than me just by randomly picking someone off the street!\"","He didn't have much money now, had a prosthetic leg, and was old - wouldn't that just hold the young lady back?","Teacher Tang said: \"Why?\"","Although Teacher Tang wasn't a traditional beauty, she had an elegant air about her.","Plus, she was always around little kids, which gave her a soft radiance that many younger people couldn't match.","\"I'm not worthy.\"","Teacher Tang said: \"There's no such thing as worthy or not. If you don't dislike me, can we give it a try?\"","By marriage age standards, Teacher Tang wasn't exactly young anymore either.","She had already lost hope for marriage and didn't want to try anymore.","She felt it wouldn't be so bad to remain single for life.","But the last time her former employer came looking for trouble, it was Li Yi who came to protect her.","She didn't know how, but he had touched her heart.","After getting to know him better, she found that although Li Yi seemed cold on the outside, he was actually very soft and considerate toward his own people.","The more she paid attention, the more her feelings changed.","Originally, the two of them hadn't broached the unspoken yet! But Li Yi's direct guy comment put their vague intimate feelings out in the open.","Li Yi wasn't one to beat around the bush, so he said: \"My situation is quite complicated.\" Then he told her about his family situation.","He had cut ties with his family.","He had paid 100,000 yuan to buy out his image rights at the daycare, and after a few months' salary, he spent nearly 200,000 yuan on his prosthetic leg.","This set was a specially customized bionic prosthetic that could be used for life and looked very lifelike and comfortable.","Now when he walked, there were no signs that he had a prosthetic.","Just like a normal person.","But he had no money, no house, no car.","He really didn't dare to pursue a relationship.","Teacher Tang said: \"It's okay.\"","Li Yi didn't expect that even saying all that wouldn't scare Teacher Tang away.","He wasn't heartless either. Faced with such a woman he was interested in repeatedly making advances towards him, it would be rude to refuse again.","Thinking it over, Li Yi said: \"Then let's give it a try. If it doesn't work out, I'll respect your decision at any time.\"","Teacher Tang nodded, and in the security room, they both blushed.","Though they were both quite mature in age, they were unusually pure.","Li Yi's phone soon rang - someone had added him to the comrades' group chat, and everyone was now @-ing him.","Teacher Tang had just confirmed her relationship with Li Yi, her heart still pounding. Seeing this, she said: \"You're busy, find me again when you're free.\" Then she hurriedly left.","Li Yi stared at Teacher Tang's back until she was out of sight before noticing his constantly buzzing phone.","\"Old class monitor, we miss you so much!\"","\"You're so cruel, abandoning us brothers like this.\"","\"How come we lost contact as soon as you were discharged?\"","\"Let's have a barbecue tonight!\"","\"Get together, get together.\" Everyone was making arrangements.","Someone said that they had only just learned what kind of life their class monitor had been living before. It really angered the whole group.","The people speaking at the moment weren't Li Yi's closest buddies.","The two who admired Warrior King Li Yi the most were having a private chat.","Their former warrior king had been bullied by his own family.","They didn't have the money to treat the injury to his leg, and all the money was taken by his younger brother and sister-in-law to build a house. In the end, they even forced him to leave.","After the people in the group chat finished speaking, many comrades cried.","Little Zhang and Little Li immediately headed out by car! They wanted to teach Li Yi's ungrateful younger brother a lesson.","If the class monitor had said this earlier, they absolutely wouldn't have let that ungrateful guy remain arrogant for so long.","Li Yi's level of bravery back then was famous throughout the whole region.","Everyone thought he would definitely serve in the military for life, until an accident cost him one of his legs.","But no matter what, they couldn't let such a stalwart man be bullied like that.","One of them was the owner of a marble factory, while the other was the general agent for a luxury brand.","These two were considered prominent figures in the local area.","Without connections, it wouldn't be easy to run into them at a banquet.","At that moment, the two of them were fuming with anger, rushing to Li Yi's old home.","After a two-hour drive, they finally arrived at this urban village.","It was hard to imagine that such a dilapidated and filthy place still existed in their city.","Many people had built extensions over their courtyards.","Just so they could get more compensation during demolition.","The houses looked dark and damp, exuding an oppressive atmosphere. So during the day, when there was nothing to do, everyone would gather by their doorways to chat.","Seeing their fancy car drive by, many people turned their heads.","Then they saw it stop in front of Li Yi's home.","When they got out of the car, dressed in branded clothes that even a non-connoisseur could tell were expensive.","The branded clothes were crisp, with a special sheen to the fabric.","The crowd couldn't help but ask, \"Who are you looking for?\"","\"I'm looking for Li Yi.\"","The people around them looked puzzled, as Li Yi had left home for half a year now.","Soon, a woman from Li's family came out and said, \"Why are you looking for my uncle?\" She was his sister-in-law.","\"I'm his war buddy. I came to let him know that this area is no longer being demolished. He shouldn't stay here any longer.\" They had inquired about this information beforehand.","They knew Li Yi's brother was a greedy and incompetent person, just waiting for the demolition so he could get rich.","They struck the snake's lair, aiming for his weak spot from the very first move.","His sister-in-law's face immediately changed: \"What do you mean it's not being demolished? What would a young person like you know?\"","For the sake of getting more land, they had even bought the front and back courtyards, waiting for the demolition to get a huge sum of money.","Because of rumors about the demolition, the prices were not cheap. Those dilapidated old houses cost three to five hundred thousand yuan each.","They had poured all their savings into it, and his sister-in-law had even borrowed over three hundred thousand yuan from her parents. Now they were saying it wouldn't be demolished, wasn't that just scamming them?","Little Zhang said, \"If you don't believe me, go find out for yourself.\"","The surrounding neighbors immediately erupted in an uproar: \"Ah!\"","They had all built illegal extensions, pouring a lot of money into it.","When Li Yi's brother arrived, he said, \"My brother isn't home, you can tell me whatever it is.\"","\"Where did your brother go?\"","\"To work out of town.\"","\"He has a lame leg, where can he work? Why don't you go work?\"","His brother, feeling humiliated, angrily retorted, \"He's a cripple, it's not bad that someone would even hire him! How can you compare him to me?\"","These two guys were just looking to start trouble. After being soldiers for so many years, they had bad tempers. Seeing his brother still daring to talk back, they immediately got physical.","These two were ruffians. The first thing they did was punch him in the face, sending blood gushing from his nose.","The two targeted areas that were painful but not seriously injurious.","His sister-in-law was dumbstruck, and the surrounding people didn't dare intervene seeing how vicious these two were. It wasn't until Li Yi's father came out and brought people over that they stopped.","Li Yi's brother said he would call the police.","In the end, the police came to mediate, and the two men compensated Li Yi's brother five thousand yuan.","Although they paid five thousand yuan, beating that kid until he cried for his dad felt so satisfying.","After they left, everyone panicked and started inquiring around.","They thought these two were fooling Li's family, but who knew they were telling the truth?","If their area wasn't included in the demolition plan, didn't that mean their investment of hundreds of thousands of yuan had gone down the drain?","The surrounding neighbors were also furious! They pointed fingers at Li's family: \"It's all your fault for driving Li Yi away. Li Yi's warrior king buddies are so powerful, having access to this kind of inside information. If we had known earlier, maybe we wouldn't have spent so much money.\"","Now their dreams of becoming millionaires had shattered.","Every family was gloomy and depressed.","Li's family was the most unfortunate, still owing three hundred thousand yuan.","If only they hadn't fallen out with Li Yi.","His warrior king buddies were so impressive. With a little help from them, their family's situation would definitely be better than it is now.","But now, it was too late to say anything.","After Li Yi left, they didn't even have his phone number, let alone a way to contact him.","After the two men returned, they actively found their old Platoon Leader to admit their mistake. They recounted everything they had done. \"You can blame me and scold me, I accept it, but I can't let my brother be bullied.\"","Li Yi never expected that even after so many years since being discharged, there would still be people standing up for him.","Although touched, he still scolded the two with harsh words: \"Do you know that if it had been more serious and left a record, your children would never be able to take the civil service exam again? Was it worth it for such a trivial matter?\"","\"It was worth it!\"","\"Say that again and I'll slap your mouth crooked. Reflect properly. Don't be so reckless again, understood?\"","Despite being reprimanded, the two had red eyes, as their old Platoon Leader still cared about them.","\"Sorry, we were wrong. It won't happen again.\"","\"Don't be angry, Platoon Leader. We didn't beat your nephew, right?\"","Li Yi snorted, then said, \"Let's have a reunion tonight, old soldiers' barbecue.\"","\"Okay!\" The two immediately cheered up."]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: The Success of Classmates is Heart-Wrenching","paragraphs":["Live streaming from a kindergarten, the buffet made everyone drool with hunger.","Netizens couldn't help but exclaim: \"I hope all buffets follow this standard.\"","\"Indeed, can't this restaurant stay open permanently?\" Everyone was eating ravenously, truly captivated.","After finishing the meal, there was over an hour for a stroll.","Enough time for everyone to take the opportunity to tour the kindergarten grounds, as the landscaping here was excellent.","Many people were visiting Starry Sky Kindergarten for the first time, only now realizing how wonderful it is.","In the afternoon came the special skills classes.","The first was a dance class.","The teacher led everyone to stand in front of the barre, doing basic stretches.","Several dance art students were among them.","For the same movements, they could kick their legs to 180 degrees. They could do splits in all directions. But the others lacked flexibility.","Their legs hurt just from being raised, and any added pressure brought a bittersweet ache.","Yet after stretching, the whole body felt relaxed.","In one class, the dance teacher taught them a short combination.","Though only two eight-counts long, when the teacher performed it, it was a sight to behold.","The difficulty was low, manageable even for amateurs. Watching in the mirror as everyone progressed from clumsy to proficient, this trial class alone ignited a love for dance.","Those few professional arts students, however, performed it only passably.","Though their movements were standard, for some reason, it lacked a certain feeling.","The dance teacher carefully guided them from the side.","After one class working on these few dance moves, everyone could clearly see the art students dancing with more grace than before.","These few dance students were thrilled by the end of the class.","As dance students in this country, they are highly driven.","Mastering the movements is within their abilities. But conveying beauty is ever-changing. This is something the teacher can't fully impart—it requires intuition.","Yet after studying for so many years, they didn't want to fall short in this regard.","Previously, these students had attended master classes and training camps, but with little effect.","Now here, seeing this dance teacher, they realized what they had been lacking was precisely the teacher's forte.","He had already fused life into dance—each of his movements held special charm.","Watching over a video stream was one thing, but witnessing it live was awe-inspiring.","He had attained a state of sublime artistry.","His guidance, coupled with his eloquent demonstrations, was truly eye-opening.","Though only a glimmer of dance sensibility, it made these few art students see new hope.","When it was time for the next class, these dance students were reluctant to leave.","They didn't want painting, calligraphy, or music classes—they wished to exchange them all for more dance.","They wanted to build upon the subtle insight gained today.","The dance teacher, aware of their desire, didn't chase them away.","They attended three more consecutive classes. Thinking all dance was taught the same, they unexpectedly received four different combinations.","A true bargain.","The four combinations focused on breathing, rhythm, sensibility, and expression respectively—precisely the areas they lacked.","After class, they even performed the routine they had prepared for over a year for their arts exams.","Receiving the dance teacher's free guidance, they felt so grateful, wanting to send him a cash gift.","But the dance teacher politely refused.","He didn't plan to do arts exam training anymore, as he rather enjoyed the kindergarten atmosphere and working with children and dancing.","This feeling deeply affected the others as well.","Afterwards, these few students deeply bowed to the dance teacher to express their excitement and gratitude.","The netizens were stunned.","\"The progress is truly immense. I want to learn dance too.\"","\"One's own failures are indeed regrettable, but a classmate's success is even more heartbreaking!\"","\"Just a few classes to achieve this kind of result, oh my goodness, I can't wait, I need to buy tickets right now.\"","\"I'm also an art student, with my exam coming up soon, could you take a look at me?\"","After dance class came painting class, using oil pastels.","They have a unique texture, and oil pastel paintings look soft and adorable. Students could choose a favorite piece to copy, and take their finished work home.","This was more interesting than DIY studios at malls, and the teacher was highly experienced.","Some painted Van Gogh's Sunflowers.","Others painted Monet's Water Lilies.","Not only was there a teacher, but also a six-year-old assistant teacher, Mu Zhixing.","The ladies especially adored her.","\"Sweetie, how do you paint this part?\"","A few ladies turned to putty in her hands whenever they saw her!","The little girl took the brush and made a few strokes. The ladies were just joking around, wanting her to interact more.","But those two brushstrokes instantly became the finishing touches that brought everything together.","The colors, initially dark and gloomy, suddenly became vibrant and lively.","The person was quite surprised: \"Is this the painting I worked on before? I can't believe it if I hadn't seen it with my own eyes.\"","The live stream viewers were equally stunned: \"Those two brushstrokes alone are enough to stump art students for three years.\"","\"I never thought about using those colors to revise the painting. The little girl is so talented.\"","\"What little girl? That's clearly my outstanding little sister.\"","The others felt so envious, having expected just a class but not getting to bask in the little assistant's radiance.","And Mu Zhixing was truly adorable.","One art class ended, followed by a calligraphy class where the calligraphy teacher also asked Mu Zhixing to assist.","Mu Zhixing was a people-pleaser and wouldn't refuse anyone.","Plus, the calligraphy teacher had always been kind to her, so she obediently went over to guide the others in writing.","The calligraphy teacher was skilled but socially anxious around strangers, coincidentally like Mu Zhixing as well.","Adding to that, the two were both quite attractive.","This led to the whole class teasing them mercilessly. The live stream was even more unrestrained with the flirtatious comments flying.","Understandably though—they were just so adorable together! Who could resist?"]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Boasters and Realists","paragraphs":["Musical instruments are very difficult to learn.","Song Panpan's violin and piano - the audience still didn't know how she would teach this class.","Learning music, starting from the staff notation?","Just thinking about it seemed dull and tasteless.","But after the other classes today, this one was just a bonus in the package.","As soon as she entered the classroom, Song Panpan was already there waiting for everyone.","She wore a white long dress. Very gentle and elegant, when the audience saw her, their voices softened.","After everyone arrived, she performed 'Canon' and 'Castle in the Sky' with her violin and piano respectively.","Many people had never heard a live music performance before.","The violin's plaintive and sorrowful tone, the piano's solid and mellow sound, truly allowed them to feel the profound impact on their souls brought by these notes.","Listening live was much more intense than listening online. No wonder they say music can soothe the heart.","When a piece ended, many people spontaneously applauded.","It started with just one or two people clapping, but soon the applause merged together.","Afterwards, Song Panpan officially began her music class.","Contrary to everyone's guesses, in this one class, she didn't plan to teach piano or violin basics.","Instead, she played accompaniment on the piano while the \"students\" present sang songs.","All were well-known popular hits and some traditional oldies.","Soon, the singing voices intertwined. They could even request songs live.","These people immediately became exhilarated.","Relaxed and relieved of stress.","Online fans complained: \"This day's schedule is too packed. I really want to go there and sing.\"","\"Having a professional teacher accompany them, isn't this the treatment only superstars get?\"","\"I originally thought the 400 yuan ticket for one event was a bit expensive. But with the singing session added, I can't hold back anymore. I need tickets! I must show off my singing, in my BGM, no one can beat me!\"","\"These attendees must be a group of hidden talents. A mass chorus, with high and low vocal parts and harmonies.\"","Viewers in the live stream were stunned: \"What's with the urge to wave their hands wildly? Now all they need is a glow stick.\"","\"Oh my god, open mics.\"","\"I told you there were masters in the crowd, but you didn't believe me.\"","\"Want to sing, throat's itching, if not then let's go to a KTV with some friends tonight.\"","\"Too bad when we go to KTV to sing, it's only with accompaniment tracks, not like their piano accompaniment.\"","\"Can they hold a few more sessions? I really want to go.\"","By the end of the day, the live stream had over 200,000 concurrent viewers. Many had been watching since morning.","Fans spammed the comments: \"I originally just wanted to see what my roommate was watching, but after clicking in I never left, even my food delivery was bought by someone else.\"","\"Is this the happiness 400 yuan can buy?\"","After the live stream ended, everyone's desire deepened. They hadn't had enough, how could it be over?","With all that pent-up energy and nowhere to expend it, they all flooded the official account's comments in force. In a huge movement, demanding tickets for the next session, they couldn't wait any longer.","...","After the day ended, Shen Wei sent out the service red envelopes to everyone.","All the teachers had been on duty for 5 consecutive days, today's intensity was especially high, they were truly exhausted. But everyone was still very happy!","Especially Teacher Tang and the others, as preschool teachers, they never expected to cross over into this role.","These teachers all spoke gently and softly. Those attending guests had no resistance against them.","\"Now I finally understand why my child loves the preschool teachers so much. It's really hard not to love them.\"","\"For a moment I felt like I became a baby, an urge to act spoiled, what's going on?\"","\"Me too...\"","Shen Wei originally planned a 2-day pop-up shop, but later felt it was too inhumane.","Because after 2 consecutive days of the pop-up, they still had to work for 5 more days afterwards.","Thinking it over, she told everyone in the comments: They would rest tomorrow.","When they received this news while the hype was still high, fans were like they'd been struck by a thunderbolt on a clear day.","\"No way, I thought two days on the weekend might not be enough, but I never imagined it would end after just one day, this is too much.\"","\"So those who grabbed tickets earlier got a limited edition, huh? If I had known, I should've begged my roommate desperately to transfer his ticket to me.\"","\"I'm a peasant dog, I just want to ask everyone, do pop-up shops really end that quickly, just one day?\"","\"Replying to the above, at least seven days to half a month.\"","\"Actually I understand the employees are really tired. But understanding is one thing, you can't be this cruel, riling up my excitement and then saying you're not doing it anymore?\"","\"Then tell us a specific date you can reopen.\"","Shen Wei's official account currently had 800,000 fans. There were 400,000 comments, many people leaving more than 10 comments at once until the platform prompted them to take a break.","Shen Wei couldn't pay attention to the online messages for now, as the system rewards kept popping up:","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully opening a pop-up shop, earning 20,000 points.\"","\"Reward of 2 million yuan.\"","\"Reward of 1,000 cans of canned meat.\"","\"Reward of 20 grams of seed loot boxes.\"","\"Reward of 100 jin of vegetables and fruits.\"","Shen Wei had invested all her money into the pop-up shop, so this 2 million yuan was a timely rain for her.","But this time, the fans' outrage affected the system.","While giving rewards, the system issued a new task.","\"Please have Shen Wei hold a pop-up shop for 15 consecutive days, and recruit the following personnel.\"","\"20 janitors, 20 security guards. 20 kitchen staff.\"","\"One manager.\"","\"One street dance teacher.\"","\"One theater performance teacher.\"","\"One singing teacher.\"","Shen Wei's mouth twitched.","For the manager candidate this time, the system surprisingly showed a familiar name - Su Jun.","He was He Lingfeng's mentor.","This time he also came to help.","For cleaning and maintaining order.","At this moment, Su Jun was talking to his dormmates.","They had visited a kindergarten once, and ended up being completely charmed.","The aroma of the food, they were still savoring it.","\"Did you used to eat this well before?\"","Su Jun nodded in a particularly punchable way: \"You haven't seen my little disciple yet this time, next time I'll let you see what a real scholar is!\"","Before, when he was teaching He Lingfeng, the pressure was particularly high.","He had to prepare lesson plans every day until very late.","After he didn't have to teach anymore, he felt much more relaxed. However, after that experience, whenever he went to teach other children, he always felt a sense of incompleteness.","Although the teacher-student relationship only lasted for less than a month, He Lingfeng left a deep impression on him.","Most of his classmates had listened to him lecture before, so for a student to make him reminisce like this, that person must have been no ordinary individual.","It's just that in the past, everyone thought he was just bragging.","College students tend to exaggerate and boast a bit, which is normal.","But after having a meal with him this time, they immediately changed their perception of him.","This guy is not one to brag, he's a realist.","\"Great, then next time I must experience this genius you speak of.\"","He said it casually, but he was still very excited. This time, Su Jun introduced his past classmates, which is a very normal thing to do when getting to know someone.","But after going once and opening the red envelope with the payment for services, there was 1,000 yuan. He was truly excited beyond words. It was truly a massive sum.","Su Jun saw their excited, flushed faces and calmly said, \"Then next time I'll call you again.\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: The System is the Real Tyrant","paragraphs":["Su Jun's roommate and other classmates were desperately trying to please him.","It was satisfying yet tiring.","Other people suggested going out to buy some barbecue for dinner.","Su Jun was alone in the room.","After entering university, he had taken on quite a few odd jobs.","He had gradually taken on many tasks. But he found that he still preferred a busier life.","When he was busy, time flew by.","At that moment, when the phone rang, he initially didn't want to answer it.","But when he picked up the phone and saw that it was Shen Wei calling, he jumped off the bed and answered immediately, \"What's up, boss?\"","Shen Wei said, \"I want to hire a manager. Are you available?\"","Su Jun was overjoyed as if struck by a halo of light, \"I'm available!\" He agreed without even discussing the salary and benefits.","He scratched his head, \"But I don't know if I can do the job well.\"","Shen Wei said, \"No problem. We've worked together so many times.\"","Su Jun grinned foolishly, \"If you say I can do it, then I can!\"","After hanging up, Shen Wei added him on WeChat and sent the salary and benefits - a monthly salary of 20,000 yuan and a 100,000 yuan image buyout.","Su Jun was overjoyed.","He instantly transformed from a poor college student to a wealthy one.","Shen Wei found the cleaning staff through an agency partnership.","Any issues could be communicated and addressed with the agency, and the prices were reasonable.","The 20 kitchen staff were helped by Liu Chef.","Shen Wei offered higher than market rates, and finding jobs was difficult now.","As the Northern Hotel had closed down, when Shen Wei started hiring, applications flooded in.","In the eyes of their chef peers, having Liu Chef and Chef Chen personally lead the kitchen was an immense honor that even the most arrogant chefs couldn't match.","As for the security staff, Shen Wei initially planned to speak with the gatekeeper.","But Li Yi had retired from the military quite early.","And he had been through some troubles later, so he didn't interact much with others.","Shen Wei didn't want to add to his troubles, and as she was wondering what to do, she suddenly thought of someone.","The bodyguard of the young master of the Liu family.","He was the only paying customer at the kindergarten.","He was an old acquaintance of the kindergarten.","Not only did he eat well at the kindergarten, but he also slept well and successfully gained 40 pounds. However, his security skills remained undiminished, and he successfully kept his job.","Before resuming duty, he pleaded with Liu Chef to keep his dining privilege even if he was no longer a bodyguard.","Liu Chef agreed.","The bodyguard paid for his meals, which was no loss for Chef Liu, as the bodyguard's stomach seemed bottomless.","Others could eat one bowl, but he could eat a whole pot.","Shen Wei called him.","The bodyguard initially thought he had done something wrong and answered, \"What's wrong?\"","Shen Wei explained her need, \"Can you arrange 20 security personnel for the pop-up store? They'll be responsible for security checks and patrols.\"","The bodyguard asked, \"What are the salary and benefits?\"","Shen Wei told him.","That evening, the bodyguard brought over the list of personnel and their resumes.","His security company specialized in providing security for the upper class.","Those selected had to be over 185 cm tall.","They had undergone various emergency security training programs.","Not only were they skilled, but they were also good-looking and around 20 years old.","The bodyguard had been there for a long time and had eaten many of Liu Chef's dishes and snacks.","As a token of gratitude, he selected only handsome young men this time.","Tough yet gentle.","All of them with long legs.","Shen Wei was satisfied and agreed immediately.","With a large number of people hired, Shen Wei gave everyone a day off.","However, public outrage was so high that she could only post a video explanation.","Otherwise, the netizens would have flipped the roof.","Even Doctor Lu and Weng Lan kept messaging, asking how to respond.","Not only was the official account under siege, but they were also receiving repeated private messages.","Shen Wei said, \"I'll post a video later.\"","At the moment, she had another task - to have Teacher Tang recruit some kindergarten teachers.","It would be much easier to get recommendations from acquaintances than to interview individually.","Teacher Tang agreed, feeling grateful to Shen Wei.","Currently, as the chief teacher at Starry Sky Kindergarten, she faced two main issues: parents asking when they would enroll students, and peers asking for referrals!","By entrusting her with this recommendation task, Shen Wei showed her trust.","Moreover, successful referrals would earn her a recommendation fee.","But she would scrutinize both character and professional competence.","...","At that moment, Shen Wei also posted a video explaining, \"I'm really sorry, we were underprepared this time! We didn't expect such enthusiasm from everyone!\"","\"Our pop-up store will be open for at least half a month, but we need some time to hire staff. As soon as we make progress, we'll let you know immediately.\"","The netizens felt relieved seeing Shen Wei's message, \"Oh, it doesn't matter when it opens, as long as it does.\"","They had initially wanted to pressure Shen Wei's team to open faster, but without staff, even a skilled wife couldn't cook without rice.","\"Starry Sky Kindergarten really underestimated its appeal.\"","\"Exactly, not to mention 500 tickets per day, even 5,000 would sell out.\"","\"I really want to go, it sounds so fun!\"","\"I've already seen people looking for scalped tickets online. It won't be long before similar places start opening.\"","\"Then go ahead, I'll wait for Starry Sky Kindergarten. One less competitor, yay.\"","\"Why should you be the only one at Starry Sky?\"","Shen Wei's video seemed to have reassured everyone.","The System then started showering rewards, \"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully finding a 20-person security team. Reward: 50,000 points.\"","\"Reward: 5 million yuan.\"","\"Reward: 50 pounds of deep-sea shrimp.\"","\"Reward: 50 pounds of premium vegetables.\"","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for finding a 20-person cleaning team. Reward: 50,000 points, 5 million yuan.\"","...","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for finding a 20-person kitchen staff team. Reward: 50,000 points, 5 million yuan.\"","...","Shen Wei realized that the System was the true big boss.","With the recent shortage, the 15 million yuan plus the previous 2 million yuan had all been arranged.","Shen Wei suddenly felt wealthy again."]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Street Dance Teacher","paragraphs":["In the street dance practice room, there was a young man who kept dancing along with the music.","It was lunchtime, and the spacious practice room was occupied only by him, repeatedly practicing the dance moves to a song he must have rehearsed countless times.","This was the song for his debut.","The moves had become second nature to him.","As soon as the music played, no matter what he was doing, he could accurately execute the next rhythm.","Soon, the door of the practice room opened.","The person who came in was also a member of their boy group.","His suitcase was left outside the dance studio.","Seeing Qi Yuan still dancing, his groupmate sighed.","At this point, Qi Yuan was exhausted.","When he saw the visitor, Qi Yuan stopped, too: \"When are you leaving?\" His tone was flat.","But his groupmate could sense a tinge of reluctance in his flat tone.","\"Today.\"","This was a rare opportunity, with the boss currently at the company.","They used to be aspiring idols, but they never hit it big, and online searches for them were scarce.","Previously, they were popular in a talent show, and every entertainment company wanted to launch some boy or girl group.","Anyway, there was no cost to signing them, so they trained them at the company for a while before sending them to various talent show stages.","But in recent years, talent shows have frequently flopped.","The hype isn't as high as it used to be.","So there was a backlog of trainees at the lower levels.","Some could afford to pay the termination fee and leave.","But those like them who couldn't afford it had been there for four or five years.","The company spent a hundred thousand yuan to have industry professionals create a debut song for them.","Hoping to give it a try, if they succeeded, they'd make a comeback, and if not, it was just a hundred thousand yuan.","These guys were genuinely happy when they received the debut notice.","They practiced this song over and over again.","It was ingrained in their bones by then.","After their debut, they became a flop with no job offers.","They were also getting older, with only a few dozen fans.","One of the main members was even more active in the fan group than the admin, but still couldn't revive the dwindling group.","It was evident that persisting further was pointless.","Moreover, at this age, these young men faced certain pressures in life.","There was no way to stave off real life with vague dreams.","Originally, they would have had to pay a sum to terminate their contracts.","But the new boss was quite benevolent.","He promised that they could terminate their contracts for free as long as they didn't continue in the entertainment industry.","Taking advantage of this, many had already terminated their contracts.","Now they didn't need to pay anything to terminate, and they were free agents - how great!","So, seven or eight of their group members had left, leaving only him behind.","The entertainment world can sometimes be quite complex.","For those who aren't popular, it's pitch black, as if they'll never see the light.","Qi Yuan let out an \"oh\" sound.","Then he continued practicing the dance moves.","His groupmate didn't expect him to be so stubbornly persistent, saying, \"Qi Yuan, accept reality!\"","They had argued before, but they were still friends. They were no longer young, and they had no chance of becoming popular again.","\"We're not the young kids we were 5 years ago. Our age, physical strength, and creative abilities are no longer up to par. Don't persist.\"","His words were like a knife, cutting open Qi Yuan's heart.","At that moment, Qi Yuan collapsed onto the dance studio floor.","As the bright ceiling light stung his eyes, he used one hand to shield them.","But his groupmate clearly saw the tear streaks on his face.","The groupmate said, \"After I leave, I plan to open a street dance studio. You're the best dancer among us. Do you want to join as a partner or something?\"","Qi Yuan said, \"No, I've already been contacted by another workplace.\"","His groupmate was surprised, \"What workplace is it, so secretive? I asked you before, but you never said.\"","Qi Yuan said, \"A kindergarten, to teach them dance.\"","His groupmate didn't approve, \"Why a kindergarten? Your skill level is so high.\"","Qi Yuan said, \"Starry Sky Kindergarten.\" He had accidentally come across it before.","After discovering it, he had been following it for a while and noticed that this kindergarten kept making headlines.","Upon hearing this, his groupmate said, \"I wish you success.\"","Then he nodded.","After his groupmate left, Qi Yuan wiped his eyes and went upstairs to sign the resignation contract and a non-compete agreement.","He knew that once he signed this contract, it would be difficult for him to return to the entertainment industry.","But did it matter? He was virtually unknown in the entertainment industry anyway.","Afterward, he went to sign up at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The final street dance performance was truly spectacular.","Although Wu Feng was also a dance teacher, he taught classical dance.","Street dance was a different genre.","Qi Yuan's timing and musical phrasing during the dance were very accurate, and his facial expressions were well-managed.","He was simply dazzling, like a seasoned idol performing a fan meeting.","Despite being alone, he radiated brilliance as he stood there.","Shen Wei was also delighted and immediately signed a contract with him for a monthly salary of 20,000 yuan, plus a 100,000 yuan contract for the rights to his image and likeness.","She also told him that he would receive two referral bonuses as part of the benefits package.","Qi Yuan thanked her.","He had been an unknown for so long that these terms sounded glamorous.","In reality, he had to pay out of his own pocket for all the trendy clothes.","He didn't have much money.","This job was the first time he felt the joy of earning money.","...","The drama teacher Shen Wei hired was the professional Ms. Meng Zhi from a theater academy.","When she arrived, even Doctor Lu didn't believe it, \"Is this for real? She's a TV personality!\"","There was a performance-focused reality show previously, and Ms. Meng Zhi served as the mentor for the female contestants, interacting with celebrities.","To have her come as a performance instructor at a kindergarten was too extravagant.","During Doctor Lu's sick leave, she had binge-watched that entire reality show.","To have Ms. Meng Zhi here was truly shocking.","Shen Wei didn't expect her to accept the invitation either.","Evidently, the people at Starry Sky Kindergarten weren't the only ones confused.","Even Ms. Meng Zhi's colleagues were perplexed to see her, asking, \"Why are you going to teach at a kindergarten?\"","Meng Zhi said, \"To make money.\"","Last year, she had earned a fortune.","After her previous exposure on the performance reality show, she had made a lot of money from various training institutions.","This year, training institutions were being cracked down on.","The performance reality shows had lost their popularity.","All she had left was her meager university salary.","Meng Zhi had just received an invitation from Starry Sky Kindergarten. She immediately accepted it. The salary and benefits offered were not bad - $2,000 per month, with red envelopes (bonuses) for overtime work.","Everyone was puzzled as to why Meng Zhi, who clearly did not lack money with her mansion, luxury cars, and everything else, would take a job at a kindergarten.","But Meng Zhi did not explain. To her, money was never too much.","Her first $100,000 came from taking on all kinds of jobs, big and small, and saving up diligently.","She didn't discriminate when it came to making money.","An invitation from anyone was a recognition of her talents.","Moreover, she particularly enjoyed the sound of money hitting her account.","She even felt comfortable with the smell of cash.","After Shen Wei added her on WeChat, she sent Meng Zhi some outstanding clips from their drama troupe's performances.","Meng Zhi watched them whenever she was free.","She was soon exhilarated, slapping her thigh in excitement.","\"What talented seedlings!\" she exclaimed, her eyes shining.","So it was true that masters were among the masses.","Although these performers had not received professional guidance, they threw themselves wholeheartedly into their roles.","While Meng Zhi had initially come for the money, she now found an additional source of interest and enjoyment."]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Snatching Tickets to Mars","paragraphs":["The singing teacher hired by Starry Sky Kindergarten was a blind person.","God closed a door for him, but opened a window.","Although his appearance was ordinary, his voice was like heavenly melody.","Clear and pure.","His singing videos went viral online.","Despite having high popularity, he didn't earn any money from them.","He also wasn't too familiar with some short video trends,","Including live streaming for rewards, and audience interaction.","With this traffic but no money, at most he could participate in some small shows.","But they only covered his travel expenses, plus a meager service fee.","This time when he received a call from Shen Wei, he was overjoyed.","He readily agreed, as he had never earned so much money before.","He immediately boasted to his mother, even though he was 30 years old, speaking like a child.","\"Mom, I'm really making money this time! Someone invited me to be a music teacher.\"","His mother wiped away tears, suppressing her sobs, and said in a high-pitched tone: \"Wonderful, I knew my son would make it!\"","For a family with a disabled member, the ones who suffer the most are the relatives.","Fortunately, the times have caught up with him, and opportunities have found him.","This is the best job for him, since he can't do anything but sing.","On the phone, he carefully made a request: \"Can my mother accompany me!\"","In the long darkness, his mother has been his crutch.","As long as she's by his side, he feels safe.","Shen Wei agreed.","Even though it was already late at night, the blind Zhang Song was still picking out clothes for work.","He even lost sleep that night, very nervous, afraid it would affect his voice.","The next day after waking up, he sang a few notes, still sounding great, and only then did he feel relieved.","After Shen Wei had hired all the staff,","She rearranged the class schedule.","And immediately reported this good news to her online followers.","Next, she would release tickets for 15 consecutive days all at once, but she was considering if she should restrict people who had attended before.","But everyone strongly objected.","\"Why not? I didn't perform well before, but now I want to try again!\"","After thinking it over, Shen Wei decided to remove that restriction.","Those who had attended before knew how valuable these tickets were.","Not only did they try to get them themselves, but they also asked colleagues and friends to help, increasing their chances.","Other fans treated it like a battle.","Those who had gotten tickets before were speed demons.","With them joining in, the difficulty of getting tickets increased.","Even before the ticket release time was announced, scalpers had already started selling tickets at high prices.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's pop-up store was booming.","People in the industry sneered: \"A kindergarten not minding its own business. Opening some pop-up store, clearly just a money-grabbing trick.\"","Finally, they found a flaw with Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Seeing the pop-up store's popularity, they found a new direction.","It would be better if they focused solely on the pop-up store, and stopped running the kindergarten.","Many kindergartens shared this sentiment.","They thought they could stir up trouble again like last time.","Little did they know that as soon as this topic came up, Starry Sky Kindergarten's fans attacked.","\"Not minding their business? They're too focused on their business, okay? If it weren't for ensuring normal classes for the kids, they wouldn't have to close the pop-up store.\"","\"They're mocking this too? What did Starry Sky Kindergarten do to offend them?\"","\"Why is everyone targeting them?\"","\"Who else but their former competitors?\"","\"Sometimes I really want to advise those competitors, you have endless energy, why don't you just focus on running your own kindergartens well? Why are you always obsessing over others? Have you done your own jobs properly?\"","\"Sister upstairs speaks my mind.\"","\"Since you can talk, say more!\"","Having gone through several online battles, Starry Sky Kindergarten's fans were now sharp-tongued, and others quickly retreated.","Shen Wei wasn't affected at all. She launched a mini-program where people could choose dates. All 15 sessions were released together.","This way, everyone would have a higher chance of getting tickets.","Since not everyone would be going for the same session, it would disperse the crowds.","Last time, tickets sold out in three seconds.","This time, it took 23 seconds to complete.","\"Wow, I finally got tickets for Starry Sky Kindergarten, so happy!\"","\"The date I got is a workday, what should I do? I plan to take a day off. If my boss asks, I'll say I have a stomachache.\"","\"I was thinking the same, which date did you get?\"","After the last live broadcast, many people said they would buy costumes and do styling this time.","They had already started team building in the comments.","Some even made plans for hair and makeup styling.","The others who didn't get tickets were furious: \"Why couldn't I get tickets again?\"","\"I initially went for the 5th session, but didn't get it, so I quickly exited and tried for the 6th session, but missed it by a second and couldn't get that one either. Then I exited and tried for the 7th session. Again, I just missed it. Oh my god, does anyone feel sorry for me?\"","\"The sister upstairs describing 'seven in seven out' must be talking about you. In such a short time, I was already frantic just trying for one session, how did you keep going in and out like that?\"","\"I got tickets, haha!\"","\"Quick, beat up the one bragging.\"","\"I successfully got tickets for two sessions. I attended the first one, and at that time I was a bit shy and didn't let loose. That eunuch was sitting right next to me. Now I got tickets again, and I declare, the famous palace eunuch must bear my name.\"","\"Brother, everyone else is fighting to be a consort, but you guys are all going for eunuchs? Doesn't anyone want to be a guard?\"","\"Of course it has to be a eunuch, more screen time.\"","\"Well, well, someone's ambitious.\"","\"Hey, did you hear? The person who played the eunuch last time has caught the attention of a web series director!\"","\"Brothers, the next rising eunuch star will be me.\"","\"Nonsense, it's clearly me.\"","\"I already bought eunuch costumes.\"","\"Wow, a serious spender.\"","\"No tickets left? Just watch the live stream then, this one seems like it'll be really exciting.\"","\"Don't say that, it's precisely because it's so exciting that I want to go even more.\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Treatment for Picky Eating","paragraphs":["Old Master Jiang has recently lost his appetite.","He hasn't eaten much for many consecutive days, and his family can see him growing thinner, which makes his children and grandchildren worried.","Old Master Jiang is an open-minded and easygoing person who gets along well with his children and grandchildren, which is rare among the upper class.","After he got older, his families took turns to invite him over and take care of him.","Knowing that the Old Master loves to eat, they always ask the chefs to cook delicacies for him.","All kinds of delicious food have been served without interruption, from local street snacks to popular restaurant dishes.","They even ordered dishes from other cities and had them air-couriered.","The family chef is hired with a high salary.","Recently, Old Master Jiang's appetite has been poor. But he forces himself to eat a few bites to avoid worrying his children too much.","He has never been a good actor, so his forced eating only makes his children and grandchildren more anxious.","They want to make sure Old Master Jiang eats well.","Old Master Jiang waved his hand and said, \"Enough, I know you all are being filial.\"","\"My father's generation didn't live long lives, and I've already lived past sixty. Don't worry, life and death are dictated by fate, and fortune is in the hands of Heaven.\"","His words made everyone present cry.","Older Son of Jiang Family said, \"Dad, what are you saying?\"","Second Son of Jiang Family said, \"Don't say that.\"","Older Son's Wife said, \"You'll definitely be able to live to 80 steadily.\"","Older Grandson said, \"80 is too little, Grandpa can at least live to 120.\"","This childish remark made Old Master Jiang laugh, \"If I live to 120, won't I be a monster?\"","Little Kid said, \"I don't care, I just want Grandpa to live to 120.\"","Old Master Jiang laughed and said, \"Okay, I'll listen to the kid!\" He forced himself to eat a few bites and then went out for a walk.","The two families of sons were left in the living room, sighing, \"The chef won't work, we need to change another one.\"","Older Son's Wife said, \"We've changed 10 chefs this month already, and the agency is starting to complain. If we keep this up, we might get blacklisted by the agency.\"","\"Then we'll increase the salary, I'm sure...\"","\"Does Old Master have some hidden worries?\" Younger Son's Wife suggested.","Older Son suddenly remembered, \"Oh, I'll call our sister overseas now.\"","He then immediately called the overseas number.","It was daytime where they were, but it was midnight for the recipient.","Younger Sister Jiang picked up the phone, sounding sleepy with a nasal voice, \"What's up?\"","\"You should come back, Dad misses you.\"","\"Oh...okay...\" There was silence on the other end before she agreed.","An hour later, she called back, \"I've bought the plane ticket, Brother, now tell me what's going on?\"","Younger Sister Jiang had obtained permanent residency overseas and hadn't been back for over 10 years.","Suddenly hearing that Dad missed her, she became alert.","Her brother didn't expect his call to wake her from sleep due to the time difference.","But since she had bought the ticket, he had to explain, \"Dad hasn't been eating well these days. We've changed about 10 chefs at home.\"","As for Old Master Jiang's dejected words, he didn't mention them to his sister.","But his sister became anxious, \"I'll go back and cook for Dad myself!\" She started to cry over the phone.","Finally, her sister-in-law took over the call.","\"I've told you before that your brother is unreliable and only says scary things. It's nothing serious, Sister, don't worry. We have everything under control here. Old Master Jiang might just be feeling a bit low.\"","\"He definitely doesn't have any major health issues. We get annual check-ups!\"","Hearing this, Younger Sister Jiang overseas finally felt relieved.","\"Okay, Sister-in-law, I'm reassured with you there. I have to take a 12-hour flight back. Don't tell Dad, I want to surprise him.\"","\"Of course we won't tell him. Get a first-class ticket, don't torture yourself. Your brother will reimburse you.\"","Her return ticket wouldn't be cheap, especially since it's last minute. And she had to transit once.","Sitting on a plane for so long would be quite uncomfortable.","After hanging up, Younger Son's Wife said, \"Do you think it's because the Chef from Yuhui Restaurant resigned that's affecting Dad?\"","\"It's possible.\"","Old Master Jiang didn't have many hobbies. He had already handed over his business. His children and grandchildren were all doing well. In his old age, he enjoyed eating.","A few years ago, he still went restaurant-hopping with some old friends and was in good spirits.","But after having some bad experiences, he only frequented a few places.","His favorite was Yuhui Restaurant.","However, after the chef there left, Old Master Jiang said the food quality had dropped off a cliff.","Although they had eaten there once after that, and it didn't seem as exaggerated as Old Master Jiang described.","It had only been a month or two since that incident, but Old Master Jiang had lost his appetite and was visibly losing weight in his cheeks.","Older Son of Jiang Family said, \"Let's find out where this chef went and invite him back. If he opened a restaurant elsewhere, we'll buy a property there and take Dad on a vacation.\"","Money wasn't the issue; the main thing was their one and only dad.","As they were discussing this, suddenly Nini, the older daughter of Second Son of Jiang Family, exclaimed from the sofa, \"Mom, I got tickets to the flash sale at Starry Sky Kindergarten!\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten is currently a popular place.","Second Son's Wife said, \"Nini, I heard their buffet is particularly delicious. Why don't you give it to Grandpa? Mom will reward you with a Lego set.\"","Nini pouted, \"But I got these tickets with great difficulty.\"","\"Good girl, Grandma has a set of amber bracelets you like. Grandma will give them to you.\"","Only then did the little girl agree.","Old Master Jiang's loss of appetite has become the biggest issue in the family now.","Many people are truly worried about it.","Even the aunt living overseas is flying back from thousands of miles away.","As a younger generation, Nini also has to take care of her grandfather.","When Old Master Jiang returned, everyone suggested he go to the kindergarten to relax and try their buffet.","Old Master Jiang was furious, blowing his beard, \"You're really treating me like a child! The old Jiang patriarch going to a kindergarten to compete with kids for food? I won't do such a thing!\"","It did sound quite embarrassing.","Nini said, \"But it's the food made by Chef Chen.\"","As soon as Old Master Jiang heard that, he immediately asked, \"The Chef Chen from the private kitchen?\"","He had eaten Chef Chen's food when he was young, but that was over ten or twenty years ago.","He felt that Chef Chen's culinary skills were indeed superb, just that his temper was a bit big.","But how could Old Master Jiang not believe that Chef Chen could handle the buffet?","His granddaughter Nini saw his attitude soften a bit: \"That's right, and there's also Liu Chef, the head chef at Jiangbei Grand Restaurant!\"","\"I've heard about this!\" Foodies had passed it around, saying that Liu Chef took in a useless apprentice, tsk tsk tsk, what a waste of Liu Chef's talent.","After Jiangbei Grand Restaurant fired Liu Chef, the hotel went out of business within a few months.","Many foodie friends of Old Master Jiang's joined him in cursing Liu Chef's apprentice: \"He had only learned for a few years and thought he could take over the kitchen, not even considering if he had the skills for it.\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: Don't lose face for the sake of eating","paragraphs":["Old Master Jiang was a bit interested.","His granddaughter continued to persuade Grandpa beside him: \"This is a pop-up store, not a kindergarten, but it's in the form of a kindergarten, with classes and everything!\"","Old Master Jiang said, \"Enough, I'm too old for that. I'll just go to the buffet.\"","\"Okay, I've grabbed a spot for tomorrow!\"","Old Master Jiang said he was reluctant, but behind his back, he boasted to his friend: \"Hey, the kids are filial, they grabbed a spot for me to eat at the kindergarten!\"","The old friend mocked him as if it were something: \"Hey, you're going to eat at a kindergarten, you're really funny.\"","Old Master Jiang knew he would say that: \"Are you going or not? If you want to go, we can go together, but you'll need to get a ticket, this one is from my granddaughter!\"","The friend wasn't a picky person either, said okay, then hung up and asked someone to get a ticket.","Twenty minutes later, when he called Old Master Jiang back, he was completely stunned.","The 400 yuan ticket had been scalped to 4,000 yuan.","Crucially, they were still unavailable.","Old Master Jiang was surprised after hearing this: \"The spots are that valuable?\"","Afterward, the old master laughed: \"Then you can just watch me eat.\"","The friend angrily retorted: \"Where can I watch you!\"","Old Master Jiang said, \"There will be a live stream, you'll be able to see me on it. This is youngsters' stuff. You're OUT.\"","\"Who cares about watching you, I'm hanging up, just hearing your voice is annoying!\" the friend said.","The next day, the Jiang family all sat in front of the TV waiting to cast the screen.","They mainly wanted to see the buffet restaurant event.","Old Master Jiang's friend said he wouldn't watch, but he also had someone turn on his phone early.","Sure enough, as soon as it opened, they saw Old Master Jiang.","He was the oldest one at the pop-up store, very conspicuous.","Even those streaming in the live chat room didn't expect there to be elderly fans, calling him grandpa one after another in the comments.","The older son of the Jiang family shared the live stream link with his sister who was returning to the country.","According to the time, she should be in the air now.","She was on a flight with internet access in first class.","The younger sister also opened the link.","While everyone else was engaged in group activities, only the old master had found the buffet restaurant and was happily feasting in front of the camera.","He first got two large braised pork ribs.","Then he rolled himself a small roasted duck bun.","He also stewed beef brisket with tomatoes and had a large bowl of rice.","After finishing, he started taking a little bit from each dish and stacking them into a small mountain.","He hadn't had an appetite recently, but here it was like his taste buds had opened up, and he was simply eating with glee.","Old Master Jiang's friend, seeing him eat like this, kept swallowing his saliva, thinking what was this old man eating that smelled so good?","He only regretted the phone couldn't transmit the aroma.","He knew better than anyone how picky Old Master Jiang was about food.","Why was he eating so deliciously?","At the Jiang family home, everyone was stunned.","Was this really their Old Master Jiang who would stop after taking two bites, having to force himself to take two more bites for the sake of the children?","His current appetite was almost comparable to a young man's.","Everyone looked at the elder son Jiang together: \"Dad really doesn't have any illness, he's just picky about food.\"","At this moment, the younger sister was frantically attacking her elder brother: \"This is what you called Dad not being able to eat for days and nights.\"","She rushed back in a hurry, and after getting on the plane, her eyes were swollen from crying.","Seeing the link her brother sent, she opened it and saw her dad.","He didn't even have table manners anymore, shamelessly showing off. It made her look like an old gossip.","The elder son of the Jiang family laughed awkwardly and said, \"No matter what, it's good that Dad can eat.\" There was some embarrassment, as this food therapy was too effective.","After the old master had eaten his fill, Chef Liu couldn't help but come over and advise that a person of his age can't eat too much!","It was only then that the old master reluctantly finished what was on his plate. But he still stayed and walked around a bit.","Seeing that the kindergarten also had a small vegetable garden, he curiously gazed at it for a while. He secretly resolved to remove all the flowers and plants from the villa and plant vegetables instead.","The blue sky and green fields were truly relaxing.","Although he hadn't been here long, he felt a sense of comfort and decompression.","The kindergarten's landscaping was excellent, and he couldn't get enough of strolling through it.","When he came out, the Jiang family had all come to pick him up.","His son and daughter-in-law looked at him with remorseful expressions.","The old master felt an unusual sense of embarrassment.","\"Dad, was it really that delicious?\"","Old Master Jiang's eyes lit up, and if asked about this, he wouldn't be tired at all.","Not only were there masters like Chef Chen and Chef Liu.","Even the dry-fried cauliflower was crisper, fresher, and sweeter than he had ever tasted.","The braised pork ribs, he could tell with one bite, were made by Zhou Shanhe, the President of the Culinary Association.","There were several other people, mentioning them would shock even the local foodies.","These culinary masters had gathered at the kindergarten for a team building event.","He was fortunate to have experienced it.","At this moment, he also became interested in this kindergarten he had never understood before, and opened up to see other programs.","Especially at lunchtime.","Everyone ate even more extravagantly than he did.","He smiled, having already tasted such delicacies.","But for those in the comments who hadn't, they were starving: \"Please, please open a restaurant, this kindergarten tantalizes me eight hundred times a day.\"","\"A 300-month-old baby also wants to go eat.\"","300 months, Old Master Jiang counted on his fingers, and finally said, \"A 600-month-old baby also wants to go eat.\"","He posted a comment, then happily shared his experiences with his friend.","The Starry Sky Kindergarten lived up to its reputation, with true masters indeed.","\"You really ate Chef Chen's cooking?\"","\"I did, his skills haven't diminished over the years.\"","His friend was drooling: \"Can our friendship of fifty or sixty years help me get a ticket?\"","Old Master Jiang said, \"It's not that I won't give you a ticket, it's that I can't get one either. Why don't you go comment in the chat as a 600-month-old baby wanting to eat too.\"","\"Oh, what are you saying, so embarrassing. Do I have to be shameless for food?\"","\"That's called the will of the people can't be defied. Previously, this Starry Sky Kindergarten only opened as a pop-up store for one day before it was going to shut down, but it was only because of the strong opposition from everyone that it was stopped,\" Old Master Jiang said, having been aggressively reading up on the kindergarten's news since leaving the store.","His friend was half-believing, half-doubting: \"Really?\"","But he still didn't feel comfortable doing it himself, so in the end, he hired 10 college students to frantically comment as 600-month-old babies also wanting to go eat.","Not only did it not attract official attention, but they were also mocked for playing with the meme.","Old Master Jiang was overjoyed. When he returned home, he saw his granddaughter who was abroad had red eyes from crying, and she looked at him resentfully, \"Dad, you have a good appetite, why did you scare us like that?\"","Old Master Jiang's face immediately turned embarrassed: \"Heh heh. It's all because of your elder brother, he spread rumors for no reason!\"","The older son of the Jiang family felt awkward.","However, the old master was also delighted to see his daughter: \"Stay here for a few more days this time.\"","Then he told his children: \"Help me keep a close eye on the tickets for the Starry Sky Kindergarten buffet, they are being snatched up fast.\"","\"Is it really that delicious?\" It could make someone who hasn't eaten well for over a month eat heartily.","And it's a buffet, too. No high-tech involved.","The old master immediately said, \"This could be the biggest team-building event in the culinary world.\"","Everyone was surprised.","Those highly respected elders in the culinary world are now all focused on training their disciples at home.","They can gain both fame and fortune, so who would still open a restaurant? They've already become ancestor masters.","To be able to eat their food again is truly exciting.","But the 15 pop-up event tickets have already sold out.","Now the only way is to buy them from others at a high price.","If you miss this event, who knows when the next one will be.","Many people who got tickets are willing to take time off just to attend.","They are not willing to give up such a good ticket.","No amount of money can buy it.","So under the Jiang family's aggressive efforts to acquire tickets, the price was driven up to 10,000 yuan per ticket.","Unfortunately, there were no takers, despite the high price."]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Pop-up Store Adds Elective Courses","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's flash store training classes became popular.","Professor Liu was also eager to join.","In the morning, Shen Wei asked if she could give him and Professor Gao two classes - one on advanced mathematics and another on computer science.","They had previously seen rave reviews online.","And everyone still craved more.","Professor Liu hadn't felt such enthusiasm in a long time.","Deep down, he still wanted to be a teacher.","Although he had taken on He Lingfeng as a disciple, it was far from enough.","Now with this opportunity, what if people genuinely enjoyed it?","He didn't want to trouble Shen Wei.","Knowing that Shen Wei's business was entertainment, he said, \"I can offer these as elective courses. Those interested can attend, and if not, it's fine.\"","\"We'll sort it out once inside the park. I'll just post a notice, no need for any live streaming.\"","He feared too few people would show up, which would be embarrassing.","Shen Wei agreed.","Professor Liu excitedly shared the good news with Professor Gao.","Professor Gao scoffed, \"If you want to teach, universities across the country would love to have you. Why stoop to this level?\"","Professor Liu said, \"You don't understand!\"","He had put on some weight while staying here.","There were few things he could do, except teach.","He wanted to contribute his part.","Moreover, at his age, he had already submitted his resignation this year, agreeing to stop teaching advanced math at the university after next year.","Seeing Professor Gao making sarcastic remarks, Professor Liu said, \"Aren't you supposed to chair some academic conference? Why did you buy a house here?\"","Professor Gao smiled awkwardly, \"Anyone can chair it. I can't leave now. He Lingfeng is at a critical learning stage, and his coding skills need further refinement. I can't abandon the child and let him down.\"","Professor Liu chuckled, hearing his righteous tone. After being old friends for so many years, who didn't know whom? Wasn't he just trying to stay and continue enjoying the good life here? He even bought a house for this reason.","Professor Gao asked cautiously, \"How did you find out?\"","He had just paid for the house.","Professor Liu said, \"Because the realtor you found was my student. I bought a house through him too.\"","Professor Gao laughed, \"Let's not point fingers at each other.\"","...","A student was studying at home, door closed.","Only the sound of a pen scratching across paper could be heard from inside the room.","Outside, the parents were sighing with worry. The father lowered his voice, \"How long has Xiaowei been studying?\"","\"Four hours now,\" the mother wiped her tears. \"If I had known, I wouldn't have put so much pressure on him.\"","Both parents were teachers.","Their child had grown up in a competitive environment and had always been outstanding.","In the second year of high school, he had already secured a university admission.","He no longer needed to attend school, so he studied at home.","He would go through an entire pen every day.","Previously, the parents had been overjoyed at their child's love for learning and would boast about it to anyone they met.","But recently, the internet kept showing videos of parents driving their children insane with pressure.","Suddenly, the parents became wary.","The extreme cases in those videos resembled their son a little.","The more they thought about it, the more afraid they became. They would constantly interrupt their son, telling him to stop studying and go out for a change of scenery!","Little did they know, this interruption and prohibition from studying only incited a hidden anger within their son.","After consulting a psychologist, it became evident that their son was exhibiting obsessive tendencies.","The parents became even more anxious.","What should they do?","\"Let the child go out and find friends to play with.\"","Upon hearing this, the parents froze.","What friends did their child have?","He had skipped a grade in elementary school and another in middle school. By the second year of high school, he had secured university admission.","He spent such a short time in each class that the more they thought about it, the more they realized their son was part of the high-risk group, exhibiting extreme emotions.","Finally, the father suggested, \"Qianqian managed to get a spot, didn't she? They said it's for a celebrity store where she can perform and relax. I think that sounds good.\"","Qianqian was their nephew's daughter, a year older than their son but a poor student.","She was warm and outgoing.","Now they realized that as long as a child is physically and mentally healthy, nothing else matters much.","They told Qianqian and not only gave her a thousand yuan but also promised to buy her a new outfit from the mall, allowing her to choose any brand she wanted.","Qianqian was a student, and the spot she got was on a weekday.","She was in her third year of high school, and even if she took a sick leave, the school would need to communicate with her parents.","When her mother found out, she strictly prohibited it and refused to allow her to go.","After receiving so many gifts from her uncle, Qianqian decided not to go.","The couple persuaded their way into getting the spot, knocked on their son's door, and asked him to go out and have fun.","Sing, perform, and stretch - anything as long as he left his study area.","Their son had seen their worries these past few days.","Sometimes, he really wanted to mock them, not knowing what kind of child they wanted - a qualified one?","If the child doesn't study, the parents aren't happy. But if he loves studying, that's not good either.","He felt genuinely angry.","He was currently working on a challenging Olympic math competition problem.","Being forced to leave this problem made him develop a dislike for this unfamiliar activity.","On the second day when he arrived at the kindergarten, he found everything uninteresting.","It was in stark contrast to the happiness of others.","Activities like painting, music, calligraphy, and dance didn't interest him. As for performing, he was at a rebellious age and didn't want to act, let alone live stream it.","At that moment, many people were finding their classes, and he noticed the bulletin board.","He quickly wanted to rub his eyes – what did he see?","There were elective courses in mathematics and computer science.","His initial lack of enthusiasm suddenly turned into excitement.","Math was his strongest subject, and computer science was his intended major in university.","It was practically tailored for him.","Following the signboard, he went to the large classroom.","Quite a few people, around twenty or so, had come to attend the class.","He was the youngest among them.","The others were mostly university students.","He could overhear the conversation next to him: \"Back in school, I never wanted to study. But now that I'm out, being able to take an advanced math class feels too high-level!\"","\"True!\"","This time when Professor Liu taught the class, he was pleasantly surprised that the number of people exceeded his expectations.","Also coming in with him was He Lingfeng.","Others clicked their tongues in wonder, a kid studying this? Could he even understand it?","There were no cameras in the classroom, so He Lingfeng didn't need to hide his skill.","After a while, his performance made people click their tongues in amazement.","Because they were ruthlessly crushed.","The speed at which the child solved problems, and the clarity of his thinking, was unprecedented.","Those who could come to learn advanced mathematics were already considered little geniuses.","They originally came thinking they would bully the weak. But it turned out that they were the weaklings.","Although the high school students admitted through the early admission program were also bullied by the child, they found it extremely satisfying.","Professor Liu's course was excellent. He delved deep yet explained simply, and could provide at least two solution approaches for each problem.","Following his pace of teaching was exhilarating."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: World Evolution Didn't Notify Me","paragraphs":["After this math session ended, He Lingfeng gained an affectionate new nickname, \"Little Brother\".","\"Little Brother, can you show me how you did this?\"","At first, everyone tried to stump him.","But He Lingfeng was incredibly skilled, able to quickly explain the solution process for any problem.","He was a disciple of Professor Liu and Professor Gao.","Plus, he had undergone a transformation by taking online courses on the forum during this time.","Even the top students admitted defeat and brought him math olympiad problems they couldn't solve.","Some olympiad problems were challenging. He Lingfeng took more time on those, but still solved them within ten minutes.","After seeing the solutions, the top students eagerly studied the thought process and steps, thinking, \"So that's how it's done, you're incredible.\"","He Lingfeng was clearly accustomed to praise, replying \"Thank you\" in a somewhat aloof tone.","But with his handsome looks and cool demeanor, he came across as truly adorable.","\"Are you attending the computer class next period?\" asked a top student.","\"Yes.\"","\"Great, I'll be there too.\"","At that moment, no one knew what would happen next.","They used the break to go for a stroll, marveling aloud, \"Is this really just a kindergarten?\"","After a while, class started again.","He Lingfeng took the podium and lectured everyone.","Not just the top students, but everyone was dumbfounded.","As Professor Gao's disciple, He Lingfeng easily taught the introductory computer class.","When the class ended, everyone rushed to the kindergarten's official comment section to share their thoughts.","\"Folks, I attended Starry Sky Kindergarten and seems to have unlocked some hidden content.\"","People quickly asked what happened.","With a grave tone, someone explained, \"In addition to the usual classes, there are two hidden ones - advanced math and computer science, taught by absolute experts. One of the teachers...\"","They didn't know how to describe it.","Had the world encountered a glitch?","Or did human evolution just forget to notify them?","A child teaching university-level courses seemed inexplicably surreal.","Fans begged, \"Tell us quickly!\"","But that person just left them hanging after building up the suspense.","Not cool.","\"What's this hidden content? Spill it or I won't sleep tonight!\"","Someone else commented under the post, \"A five-year-old taught us computer science.\"","But when the truth came out, no one believed it.","\"Someone escort this madman out.\"","\"The world is in disrepair, so kids are patching it up?\"","\"Hey, why don't you believe me? I'm telling the truth.\"","\"Believing you is the real madness.\"","...","After the online flash store went viral, many people did come specifically for those few teachers.","In the painting class, Qi Zhongyi unexpectedly saw an old acquaintance.","Ten years ago, they attended a painting training camp together.","Back then, he rose to fame, but Wang Heng nearly got expelled.","Over the years, Wang Heng applied to various art schools but failed the entrance exams repeatedly.","He did have some talent - he could color-match accurately after just a glance, replicating scenes up to 80% faithfully. But his creative ability was poor.","In the local art scene, Wang Heng was somewhat renowned.","Many well-meaning teachers advised him to give up and leave this field.","Art requires immense natural talent. Qi Zhongyi was considered a prodigy, but Mu Zhixing's talents surpassed even his.","For ordinary people, it's extremely difficult to improve after reaching a certain level.","But Wang Heng persisted for a very long time.","Rarely seeing his old friend, Qi Zhongyi asked Mu Zhixing to watch the classroom while he met Wang Heng outside.","\"How have you been all these years?\"","\"Same old,\" said Wang Heng. He then made his request, \"Could I become your student?\"","It's traditional to take an art master in painting. If the incident hadn't happened, Qi Zhongyi would undoubtedly be a renowned young painter now.","The incident tarnished his reputation but didn't erase his artistic achievements.","Unable to create original works, Wang Heng was rejected by many masters.","If he could study under Qi Zhongyi, it would be his last hope.","Qi Zhongyi replied, \"I can accept you, but my reputation in the art world isn't good. As my student, you'll also face great difficulties and likely become just a craftsman. Are you still willing?\"","A derogatory term for assembly-line artists in the industry.","\"Yes, I'm willing.\"","Qi Zhongyi immediately called Mu Zhixing over. \"She is your senior fellow disciple.\"","As he said, taking a master is traditional, and seniority isn't based on age.","Wang Heng was surprised. \"She's your child?\"","Qi Zhongyi blushed. \"Don't talk nonsense, I'm still single. She's my beloved disciple.\" Ever since meeting Mu Zhixing, his social media was filled with her artworks.","Wang Heng addressed her as \"Senior Sister\", then said, \"I have a son older than her. If they'll attend the same primary school in the future, could he look out for her?\"","\"She's in the Bright Virtue Primary School district.\"","\"That's great.\"","Qi Zhongyi urged, \"Bring your son to meet her!\"","Qi Zhongyi knew Mu Zhixing was timid and eager to please others.","If she were bullied, that would be terrible.","When Wang Heng mentioned his son, he became concerned.","Wang Heng immediately called his wife to bring their son over.","His son Wang Dan, around seven or eight years old, was a mischievous brat.","According to Wang Heng, the boy often got into fights and had beaten up fourth-graders despite only being in first grade.","Qi Zhongyi's eyes lit up hearing this.","Good, the boy knew how to fight!","When Wang Dan arrived and saw Mu Zhixing, he said, \"Who's this little potato?\"","Wang Heng promptly rapped his son's head. \"Watch your mouth! She's your senior martial arts sister.\"","\"Senior martial what? I'm shocked!\"","\"She's my senior fellow disciple, so naturally your senior martial arts sister. She'll attend primary school next year, so you must protect her and not let anyone bully your senior.\"","At seven or eight years old, the boy was familiar with internet novels about martial arts sects. His face turned beet red upon realizing what \"senior martial arts sister\" meant. This little potato looked so soft and frail.","It would be so embarrassing to call her that at school.","He stubbornly refused to say it.","But his father kept insisting, \"Just say it, and I'll buy you a kids' meal afterwards.\"","The kids' meal was indeed quite appealing to Wang Dan. He glanced around to make sure no one was looking.","Then, rather reluctantly, he called out: \"Senior Master.\"","Mu Zhixing felt embarrassed too.","Qi Zhongyi, standing nearby, said: \"He's calling you.\"","Mu Zhixing responded with a faint \"Mm,\" his voice barely louder than a mosquito's buzz.","Afterwards, he went off somewhere.","A little while later, he returned with several packets of snacks for the young boy.","The boy's eyes were filled with surprise—inside were potato chips and chocolate, every child's favorite treats.","There were also two packs of spicy strips, the premium kind from the supermarket, costing 3.50 yuan each.","At his school gate, they only sold the 50-cent ones. \"Are these for me?\" he asked.","\"Mm-hmm!\"","In a gesture of reciprocation, Wang Dan immediately thumped his chest with a resounding thud: \"From now on, I'll protect you.\"","Qi Zhongyi, watching from the side, felt very gratified. Not only had he taken on a disciple, but he'd also found a little bodyguard for his beloved pupil. Wasn't this a double blessing?"]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: From Unconventional to Conventional","paragraphs":["Recently, Xiao Yu started paying attention to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She was incredibly lucky and managed to snag two tickets for their pop-up store.","When she came out, many people were wailing that they couldn't get any tickets.","She was utterly shocked, thinking it was quite easy to get them.","As a result, many people offered to buy the tickets at high prices, and she felt a bit regretful.","If only she had bought a couple more tickets, she could have used two for herself and her best friend, and sold the other two, making a nice profit.","This time, she had bought the tickets for herself and her best friend!","Her best friend was a die-hard fan of the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Upon learning that Xiao Yu had secured the tickets, she let out a piercing shriek: \"I tried so many times but couldn't get any. You're truly a lucky goddess.\"","Then her best friend excitedly suggested, \"Why don't we buy some costumes? Or get our hair and makeup done? We could act out a play!\"","Ordinary people might not have much exposure to drama clubs, but everyone has a dream of acting.","If there wasn't an opportunity before, they had to seize this chance and prepare properly!","Her best friend's enthusiasm was fully ignited: \"Aren't you a screenwriter? Do you know anyone in the theater troupe? Can we borrow a couple of period costumes?\"","Xiao Yu said, \"We don't know if it's a modern or historical play yet. How can we choose the costumes?\"","\"Who cares? Last time, I saw that little eunuch actor playing a zombie in a horror flick. He was hilarious. The main point is being adaptable in different roles.\"","\"I don't know,\" said Xiao Yu. \"I have social anxiety. If we dress up in weird costumes, I'll get nervous.\"","Her best friend seemed a bit deflated. \"Oh, okay. Then let's just book makeup artists. I'll check online to see which studio has the best makeup artists.\"","\"Sounds good!\" Xiao Yu replied.","Her best friend added, \"Quick, let's register our identities.\"","\"I said I got the tickets for you, so they're for you. I won't sell them.\"","Her best friend smiled awkwardly. \"It's just that these tickets are so hot right now. I'll treat you to meals and makeup appointments from now on.\"","On the day of the event, the two arrived at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Many people were incredibly enthusiastic. This ordinary pop-up store was treated like a Halloween party.","Lots of people came dressed up in costumes.","Online comments read: \"These people are too extra.\"","\"Watch out for those cosplaying as celebrities. They might get sued.\"","\"How did so many people get tickets? I didn't get a single one!\"","\"Good thing there's a livestream.\"","Xiao Yu and her best friend headed straight to the livestream stage for their first performance.","They had reviewed past videos and knew that once they were assigned roles, the rest would depend on their own improvisation.","The main goal was to have fun and entertain themselves.","But upon arrival, they were surprised to see that even Mr. Meng Zhi, a renowned acting coach, was there.","They instantly realized this event was no ordinary occasion.","Not only did Mr. Meng Zhi provide simple acting techniques, but he also led them through exercises to unleash their natural talents.","This time, they were given a script.","As a screenwriter herself, Xiao Yu found the script to be highly professional when she opened it. Each person had their own lines.","Not just Xiao Yu and her best friend were stunned, but the online comments were equally baffled: \"What's going on? This grassroots event suddenly turned into a full-blown production?\"","\"Shen Wei's wealth must be unfathomable.\"","\"I've seen this acting coach on variety shows before. How did they manage to bring him to the kindergarten? Is this the kind of service 400 yuan can buy?\"","\"I want to go too, I want to go too, I want to go... I'll say it a million times, I want to go too.\"","\"When we took the acting exam, we hired this coach. A single training session cost at least four figures!\"","\"This is probably the only chance for ordinary people to perform, right?\"","The online comments were dripping with sarcasm.","No one expected Shen Wei to hire a coach of such a high caliber for them.","With a script in hand, the performance was entirely different. Each person had a chance to be in the spotlight. And because they were not professionals, their lines were delivered with local accents, making it even more hilarious.","After the performance ended, everyone felt a sense of unfulfilled longing, as if they had accomplished something extraordinary. A feeling of great achievement washed over them.","After the morning session, they rushed to the cafeteria.","Acting was truly exhausting. Upon arriving at the cafeteria, they were overwhelmed with happiness and didn't know what to eat.","Every dish seemed incredibly delicious.","Her best friend had previously mentioned dieting and focused on the vegetable dishes. But it didn't take long before she succumbed to temptation.","Mustard shrimp balls? Eat them!","Charcoal-grilled steaks? Eat them!","Garlic noodles? Eat them!","She attacked the food like she hadn't eaten for days.","Xiao Yu said, \"Slow down. Overeating is bad for your stomach.\"","Yet, she wasn't any better than her best friend.","Every dish was immensely satisfying, a true feast for the taste buds.","It was an astonishing sight.","The others were the same. They initially intended to record a short video to share, but at most, they only took a few photos!","Everyone was too focused on eating to do anything else.","They were afraid of missing a single bite.","After lunch, there were four more classes in the afternoon.","Whether it was painting, calligraphy, dancing, or singing, the day was incredibly fulfilling.","By the end, Xiao Yu and her best friend held hands, feeling happier than they had in a long time as office workers.","Though they hadn't consumed any alcohol, they felt slightly intoxicated, their mouths curved into smiles.","\"How was it? This place is great, isn't it?\" her best friend remarked.","\"Awesome. Let's come here every week,\" Xiao Yu suggested.","\"We can't. This pop-up store is closing soon,\" her best friend said.","\"Ah!\" Xiao Yu felt unsatisfied.","After returning home, sitting in front of her computer, she wrote an 800-word review.","She poured out her entire journey and emotions.","As a professional screenwriter, her writing skills were exceptional.","In an instant, her previously unpopular online novel gained 2,000 new followers due to this review.","The only downside was that the script for the livestreamed performance wasn't great.","Unable to resist, she took the 40-episode TV series she had just finished writing and had a bold idea.","She wanted to submit it to Shen Wei.","Using a pseudonym, she added Shen Wei as a contact.","She explained her intentions.","Shen Wei asked her to send over the storyline and synopsis for the first three episodes.","After a while, Shen Wei agreed to buy it, offering a generous price of 20,000 yuan per episode, totaling 800,000 yuan for the 40 episodes, to be paid in full upfront.","For Xiao Yu, this was truly amazing.","Production companies would typically offer more, but the payment would be split into installments. Sometimes they would even default on the payments, making contracts useless.","Overjoyed, she sent over her other seven completed scripts as well. These were her labors of love that she wouldn't have parted with under normal circumstances.","If not for the incredible experience she had just enjoyed, she wouldn't have been willing to let them go.","Shen Wei bought six more books, leaving one for her to revise before publishing.","In the past, after signing the contract, a few million was quickly deposited into her account.","Xiao Yu rarely encountered Shen Wei. Upon seeing her, she couldn't help but ask the question that was on her mind: \"Are you still running the pop-up store?\"","This time receiving the scripts gave her a bit of a mental boost.","Shen Wei said, \"Let's see how it goes.\"","She didn't outright say she wouldn't open it. Xiao Yu was a little happy.","Shen Wei was also in a difficult situation now. Her pop-up store was even more popular than the Starry Sky Kindergarten. If she said she was closing it now, the whole city wouldn't agree."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Big Brother on the List","paragraphs":["Many people were afraid that Shen Wei didn't have money, but in reality, an investment tycoon gave Shen Wei 50 million yuan at once.","And this relationship was established through Shen Wei's father.","Recently, after a few treatments, Shen Wei's father has gotten much better.","The doctor advised him to take good care of his health and not overexert himself.","He has been discharged from the hospital.","But Shen Wei doesn't allow him to come to the kindergarten.","The kindergarten is chaotic and worrisome.","So his father can only get his fix by watching Shen Wei's livestreams every day. Recently, when he received a call from the investment tycoon, Shen Wei's father was dazed and couldn't believe that the tycoon would call him.","He was still in shock after hanging up the call.","The industries that this investment tycoon had ventured into were diverse and varied.","Whether it was electronics, medical supplies, or stocks, he had projects in all of them.","It was the first time he had heard of someone casually giving 50 million yuan just like that.","Just like a top celebrity.","The tycoon felt that the kindergarten Shen Wei was running was quite impressive. So he wanted to give some money?","Shen Wei's father relayed this to Shen Wei, and he was still in shock.","Shen Wei didn't expect that someone would give so much money for no reason.","She asked: \"Does he have any requests?\"","Shen Wei's father said: \"He said the pop-up store was great, but he couldn't get tickets!\"","\"Oh, I understand!\" There were about 10 days left of the pop-up store.","As a token of appreciation for the 50 million yuan, Shen Wei directly gave him ten tickets.","Shen Wei knew this investment tycoon.","Previously, during Liu Chen's birthday, this tycoon paid close attention throughout.","Apparently, he was also a fan of the livestream. Over the past few days, he had cumulatively donated hundreds of thousands in the livestream.","The tycoon was truly wealthy. It was heard that Shen Wei was spending her own money to organize events.","He immediately supplemented a large sum.","Regardless, he was not short on money.","This time, the tycoon obtained these ten tickets through his investment and connections.","He had wanted to flaunt them multiple times but was afraid others would ask for tickets.","So he kept five for himself. He gave the remaining few to his business partners. Previously, Old Master Jiang had sought tickets at a high price. He gave two to him. The remaining ones were given to some other partners.","While everyone was longing for tickets and feeling envious, the tycoon's tickets came like timely rain.","Many people remarked that the tycoon lived up to his reputation and indeed had connections.","But there are no walls without cracks. Someone anonymously stated online that a tycoon had donated 50 million yuan and obtained ten tickets.","Netizens were shocked!","That's equivalent to 5 million yuan per ticket?","Is this the difference between them and the wealthy?","So everyone initiated an online poll to \"Find the Tycoon\".","This boosted interactivity even more.","The investment tycoon rarely appeared on shows.","Except for people in the industry, others wouldn't be able to recognize him.","The tycoon heard about this news and purposefully changed out of his haute couture outfit, wearing ordinary clothes instead. He looked just like an average middle-aged man.","With so many eyes online, no one was able to identify him.","Mainly because no one could have imagined that this unassuming man was the one who casually donated 50 million yuan.","Although this online \"Find the Tycoon\" event didn't locate the real tycoon, it allowed netizens to uncover many secrets.","\"Oh my god, is that my boss? At this moment, he's playing a treacherous traitor. He acts so realistically.\"","\"No way, I've already screenshot and sent it to the work group. My colleagues are all laughing to death.\"","\"Wait a minute, I might be in trouble because my boss's boss @'ed my boss in the group saying, 'Aren't you on a business trip?'\"","\"Hahaha. It's you again, you little brat. You're going to get extra work when you're back!\"","\"Whether I get extra work or not doesn't matter. I'm more afraid of losing my job.\"","\"I saw the host Lili earlier. She actually took time off from work to not livestream. I thought something had happened, but she's here having a great time instead.\"","\"Classmates, isn't that the second son of the jewelry tycoon? He's grinning like an idiot right now. His refined, elegant image has completely shattered.\"","\"I really can't connect his current self to his usual image. It's hilarious.\"","\"And there's my colleague. I'm so salty. He didn't tell us he got tickets these past few days. Turns out he went out to play. Our friendship as colleagues is broken. We can't be buddies anymore.\"","\"Oh my god, he was so patient. If it were me, I would have posted a ton of Moments the moment I got the tickets.\"","\"Does anyone have a screen recording? I want to cut out his clip.\"","\"The Dream Tycoon always screen records. You can camp him. As long as you follow him and DM him, he can provide you with the watermark-free version.\"","\"Who could be more miserable than me? I was one of the first to camp the livestream as an old fan. Then, many people became fans because of my recommendations, and several of them got tickets. But I didn't get any. Now I'm foolishly watching those familiar faces having fun. Why did everyone else get tickets except me?\"","\"Your hand speed isn't good enough. You need more practice. I have a buddy with insane hand speed. Whenever I try to get concert tickets, I ask him for help, and he always succeeds.\"","\"To the person above, I want to ask: Does your friend need more friends?\"","This sentence was copied and spread like crazy, making the original person too embarrassed to show their face again.","The tycoon was having a great time, eating happily.","There were also various singing and calligraphy practice sessions.","He had practiced calligraphy for many years. Under the guidance of the teachers here, he gained deeper insights, resulting in vigorous and powerful strokes.","His family was wealthy. In the past, no matter what occasion he attended, due to his status, he was treated with deference.","It was actually quite boring.","This was a rare opportunity to relax.","No one here recognized him.","It was truly relieving.","He regretted giving out some of the tickets.","But he still had four tickets left. He decided not to give any to anyone else this time and keep them all for himself.","So he went a second time, and then a third time.","During the first three times, no one recognized him.","But by the fourth time, some of the longtime fans from the livestream noticed something amiss: \"Isn't this person... he looks so familiar to me.\"","\"He was there the last two times too, right?\"","\"Really? I didn't notice.\"","\"Yeah, he's here.\"","\"Could he be the hand speed genius?\"","\"Wait, has anyone noticed a point?\"","\"What?\"","\"There was also a tycoon who donated 50 million yuan.\"","Originally, everyone was trying to find the tycoon. But then they became engrossed in the event and uncovered many people sneaking out to play.","The remaining people were just laughing at that, forgetting about the original purpose.","Now they were suddenly reminded of it.","So, a big shot who tipped 50 million actually dressed so down-to-earth?","All his clothes combined cost less than 200 yuan.","So people online found out what he was wearing and suddenly that outfit sold out everywhere.","\"Although I'm not that rich, I can wear the same outfit as the rich guy!\"","When the investment tycoon came back after a day out,","His driver was waiting for him outside.","At this moment, the driver said, \"Boss, your identity has been exposed.\"","Then he showed the posts that people had compiled.","The investment tycoon laughed, \"If I can be recognized like this, then no need to act tomorrow.\"","So for the remaining two times, he wore haute couture outfits.","But no one recognized him, \"The boss didn't show up?\"","In their minds, the boss was already a simple and humble person, never imagining that one's appearance depends on clothes.","At that moment, the boss was standing there, but no one noticed him."]}]);
